(982253, 112189, 12268, '<td valign="top">would have scored this higher if i could see more of it. why did u resize it so small? quality too small @ 150?</td>', 'would have scored this higher if i could see more of it. why did u resize it so small? quality too small @ 150?', '2004-11-01 00:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
