(982262, 117272, 16648, '<td valign="top">perhaps crop the left side just a tad more tro remove the front edge of the arched entrance. something needs to be in th epic to draw our attention...perhaps a red ball or ??</td>', 'perhaps crop the left side just a tad more tro remove the front edge of the arched entrance. something needs to be in th epic to draw our attention...perhaps a red ball or ??', '2004-11-01 00:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
