(982485, 117222, 21714, '<td valign="top">This image looks very soft - looks like it was taken from behind a dirty window. Does even look like it''s a small area of a much larger image. Also, there''s a grey line on the left of the frame, which can be avoided with cropping that bit out. To make this one better, perhaps you could try using Unshark Mask (if using Photoshop) or any other tool in any other software designed to sharpen the image.  <br/>I am still wondering why you didn''t get rid of that grey line! :) Best of luck.</td>', 'This image looks very soft - looks like it was taken from behind a dirty window. Does even look like it''s a small area of a much larger image. Also, there''s a grey line on the left of the frame, which can be avoided with cropping that bit out. To make this one better, perhaps you could try using Unshark Mask (if using Photoshop) or any other tool in any other software designed to sharpen the image.  I am still wondering why you didn''t get rid of that grey line! :) Best of luck.', '2004-11-01 03:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(982486, 117296, 21714, '<td valign="top">Part of the image has a lot of digital noise, perhaps taken at a higher ISO setting or, brightened up to get details from rather dark area. But what''s bothering me is not the noise (or grain)  at all, but it''s the part of the image that''s looking rather soft. Looks like parts of the image were smudged or blurred and other parts left intact. Whatever it is, it''s not very pleasing. <br/>If getting rid of the grain was the intention, you could try using a software like NeatImage or any other.</td>', 'Part of the image has a lot of digital noise, perhaps taken at a higher ISO setting or, brightened up to get details from rather dark area. But what''s bothering me is not the noise (or grain)  at all, but it''s the part of the image that''s looking rather soft. Looks like parts of the image were smudged or blurred and other parts left intact. Whatever it is, it''s not very pleasing. If getting rid of the grain was the intention, you could try using a software like NeatImage or any other.', '2004-11-01 03:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(982487, 116915, 21714, '<td valign="top">Grrrrrreat capture!! I love the positioning, colour of the sky in the background and the lovely whites on the birds. Very well done. Excellent work.</td>', 'Grrrrrreat capture!! I love the positioning, colour of the sky in the background and the lovely whites on the birds. Very well done. Excellent work.', '2004-11-01 03:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(982492, 114484, 21714, '<td valign="top">Love the concept and how you have achieved to create the atmosphere with the window light and the model + the tight space. I really like the posture of the model and the control of exposure. It''s a beautiful image that tells a story. It makes you think and feel. It makes you want to know what''s going through her head. <br/>The only bit, being rather picky here, I would change (if I could) would be the shape of the tree in the background :) <br/>Excellent work. All the best.</td>', 'Love the concept and how you have achieved to create the atmosphere with the window light and the model + the tight space. I really like the posture of the model and the control of exposure. It''s a beautiful image that tells a story. It makes you think and feel. It makes you want to know what''s going through her head. The only bit, being rather picky here, I would change (if I could) would be the shape of the tree in the background :) Excellent work. All the best.', '2004-11-01 03:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(982494, 114972, 28097, '<td valign="top">a lovely macro, musta been a tough one to take</td>', 'a lovely macro, musta been a tough one to take', '2004-11-01 03:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(982497, 114933, 21714, '<td valign="top">Really love the treatment you have given to this image. It brings out a rather complicated character. Love the detail and the tones. If I really want to suggest anything, it would that I would like to see a hint more of detail/colour on her arm (to seperate it from the dress and make it a wee bit easy on the eye).<br/>Great work. Well done.</td>', 'Really love the treatment you have given to this image. It brings out a rather complicated character. Love the detail and the tones. If I really want to suggest anything, it would that I would like to see a hint more of detail/colour on her arm (to seperate it from the dress and make it a wee bit easy on the eye).Great work. Well done.', '2004-11-01 04:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(982500, 113172, 21714, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colours and a great composition. Water looks a bit unrealistic but it compliments the the colour and fine detail on the leaves. It''s absolutely gorgeous. Excellent work. All the best.</td>', 'Wonderful colours and a great composition. Water looks a bit unrealistic but it compliments the the colour and fine detail on the leaves. It''s absolutely gorgeous. Excellent work. All the best.', '2004-11-01 04:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(982502, 111583, 21714, '<td valign="top">Very strong composition. Love the way you have framed it and the message here. It''s a very powerful image. Very well done. All the best.</td>', 'Very strong composition. Love the way you have framed it and the message here. It''s a very powerful image. Very well done. All the best.', '2004-11-01 04:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(982503, 116882, 21714, '<td valign="top">This is really cool and funny. Love the way you have framed it. The detail is amazing too. <br/>Great shot. Well done.</td>', 'This is really cool and funny. Love the way you have framed it. The detail is amazing too. Great shot. Well done.', '2004-11-01 04:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(982506, 116455, 21714, '<td valign="top">This is one weird and wonderful image. Makes we wonder how you did the middle glass.  Very cool. Great illusion. Best of luck.</td>', 'This is one weird and wonderful image. Makes we wonder how you did the middle glass.  Very cool. Great illusion. Best of luck.', '2004-11-01 04:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(982507, 109506, 21714, '<td valign="top">Great timing, focus, detail and compositon. It''s almost scary even knowing that they are designed for this. Very well done. All the best.</td>', 'Great timing, focus, detail and compositon. It''s almost scary even knowing that they are designed for this. Very well done. All the best.', '2004-11-01 04:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(982509, 113684, 21714, '<td valign="top">Amazing B&amp;W. Beutiful scenery and you have made the best of it. The whole image flows nicely and it''s finely balanced with shapes and tones. Excellent work.</td>', 'Amazing B&W. Beutiful scenery and you have made the best of it. The whole image flows nicely and it''s finely balanced with shapes and tones. Excellent work.', '2004-11-01 04:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(982514, 114199, 21714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image with great detail and nice tones.  I think it would have been even better if you had figured a way to avoid the hand holding the child. Now it does look a bit like someone is making the child do it, instead of the child''s in his curious state trying it.</td>', 'Beautiful image with great detail and nice tones.  I think it would have been even better if you had figured a way to avoid the hand holding the child. Now it does look a bit like someone is making the child do it, instead of the child''s in his curious state trying it.', '2004-11-01 04:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(982515, 117180, 24459, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and very sensual.  Well done</td>', 'Beautiful and very sensual.  Well done', '2004-11-01 04:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(982516, 117283, 21714, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Love the composition, detail, his expression and the tonality of the image. Beutifully done. All the best.</td>', 'Great capture. Love the composition, detail, his expression and the tonality of the image. Beutifully done. All the best.', '2004-11-01 04:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(982517, 117079, 24459, '<td valign="top">This is the essence of portrait. I love everything about it. Composition, dof, colours. And of course the model is very nice too.<br/>A well deserved 10</td>', 'This is the essence of portrait. I love everything about it. Composition, dof, colours. And of course the model is very nice too.A well deserved 10', '2004-11-01 04:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(982520, 115482, 21714, '<td valign="top">Just amazing!! Absolutely gorgeous! Love the way how you have framed the image with the background looking like this patch of dark blue and the sky behind it. The person walking up on the right isn''t too clear in this small version, but I am sure it adds to the image as well.<br/>( I just wish that little greyish looking cloud wasn''t there :))<br/> Excellent work. All the best.</td>', 'Just amazing!! Absolutely gorgeous! Love the way how you have framed the image with the background looking like this patch of dark blue and the sky behind it. The person walking up on the right isn''t too clear in this small version, but I am sure it adds to the image as well.( I just wish that little greyish looking cloud wasn''t there :)) Excellent work. All the best.', '2004-11-01 04:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(982530, 114145, 28347, '<td valign="top">The composition of complex subjects is usually quite difficult to attain. I think a slightly tighter frame could help. Maybe cropping a bit so that there isn''t as much of the stems in middle. It will be difficult to balance the left part of the frame though.<br/> <br/>The exposure is brilliant. Especially the fact that the background actually has color, and isn''t a washed out grey. Is that the sun? I suspect it isn''t, but I have no clue.</td>', 'The composition of complex subjects is usually quite difficult to attain. I think a slightly tighter frame could help. Maybe cropping a bit so that there isn''t as much of the stems in middle. It will be difficult to balance the left part of the frame though. The exposure is brilliant. Especially the fact that the background actually has color, and isn''t a washed out grey. Is that the sun? I suspect it isn''t, but I have no clue.', '2004-11-01 04:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(982531, 111575, 28347, '<td valign="top">The contrasts of colors and textures is very nice in this image. The composition is very clever in capturing all of them appropriately, except, perhaps for the little blotch of soil on the bottom right, which sort of bothers the water. Perhaps if the camera was a few inches higher, a better compromise could be reached.<br/> <br/>The lighting is really nice. It looks a bit sharp for an overcast day, falling very directionally. Maybe I just don''t see enough of these in real life, but I think it really makes the picture stand out.</td>', 'The contrasts of colors and textures is very nice in this image. The composition is very clever in capturing all of them appropriately, except, perhaps for the little blotch of soil on the bottom right, which sort of bothers the water. Perhaps if the camera was a few inches higher, a better compromise could be reached. The lighting is really nice. It looks a bit sharp for an overcast day, falling very directionally. Maybe I just don''t see enough of these in real life, but I think it really makes the picture stand out.', '2004-11-01 04:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(982536, 117242, 28347, '<td valign="top">I think the photo is a little off balance. Showing less of the floor on the bottom could have helped that, you know, with the law of thirds and all that. Furthermore I think that the floor is an interesting texture, but that the sky, especially on the top is more so, and would have liked to see more of it.<br/> <br/>I think a yellow/blue polarizer could have helped make a bit more contrast between the sky and the roof, but perhaps that would have ruined the color of the stone. Could have been interesting to see what it would have done.</td>', 'I think the photo is a little off balance. Showing less of the floor on the bottom could have helped that, you know, with the law of thirds and all that. Furthermore I think that the floor is an interesting texture, but that the sky, especially on the top is more so, and would have liked to see more of it. I think a yellow/blue polarizer could have helped make a bit more contrast between the sky and the roof, but perhaps that would have ruined the color of the stone. Could have been interesting to see what it would have done.', '2004-11-01 05:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(982541, 115885, 28347, '<td valign="top">I think either a little bit more or a little bit less depth of field would have helped here. The ears are just out of focus, but most of the face isn''t. This creates a sort schizm, where the nose, mouth and eyes are in focus, but some of the hair, the rim of the hat, the cheek fuzz are. Those parts are more like the neck, suite and ears, not a part of the face, in my humble opinion. Thus the lack of focus on the ears seems like an error. If the ears were in focus, or only the core of the face was, then i think it would be more consistent.<br/> <br/>Aside from that, I wonder if you used some sort of light reflection, or whether this is just plain sunlight.</td>', 'I think either a little bit more or a little bit less depth of field would have helped here. The ears are just out of focus, but most of the face isn''t. This creates a sort schizm, where the nose, mouth and eyes are in focus, but some of the hair, the rim of the hat, the cheek fuzz are. Those parts are more like the neck, suite and ears, not a part of the face, in my humble opinion. Thus the lack of focus on the ears seems like an error. If the ears were in focus, or only the core of the face was, then i think it would be more consistent. Aside from that, I wonder if you used some sort of light reflection, or whether this is just plain sunlight.', '2004-11-01 05:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(982543, 116455, 28097, '<td valign="top">This is beautifull , absolutely ... clever and very well executed.. thumbs up</td>', 'This is beautifull , absolutely ... clever and very well executed.. thumbs up', '2004-11-01 05:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(982545, 116182, 28347, '<td valign="top">The colors that reflect are stunning, and the subjects are interesting, but I think there are too many of them. The leaf and crud on the bottom right, for example, could be a picture of it''s own right, especially with the way the mucky stuff sort of cuts chunks off the bars. It''s a nice interaction between the earthy brown and rocky white versus the more accurate blue sky and metal fence.<br/> <br/>The sunlit reflection and the needles could be also a separate image, without the rest of the subjects. If that were the case, a slightly higher exposure should be in order, to make the needles more appearant, but this might have washed out the yellows. Dunno.</td>', 'The colors that reflect are stunning, and the subjects are interesting, but I think there are too many of them. The leaf and crud on the bottom right, for example, could be a picture of it''s own right, especially with the way the mucky stuff sort of cuts chunks off the bars. It''s a nice interaction between the earthy brown and rocky white versus the more accurate blue sky and metal fence. The sunlit reflection and the needles could be also a separate image, without the rest of the subjects. If that were the case, a slightly higher exposure should be in order, to make the needles more appearant, but this might have washed out the yellows. Dunno.', '2004-11-01 05:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(982546, 116881, 12131, '<td valign="top">That is gorgeous.  Why is it things that are so desolate and dark can be so appealing?  Beautiful colors and mood.</td>', 'That is gorgeous.  Why is it things that are so desolate and dark can be so appealing?  Beautiful colors and mood.', '2004-11-01 05:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(982548, 117035, 12131, '<td valign="top">Yeah, the guy or thing in the middle is odd enough to almost seem normal.  Good choice.  That definitely is October.</td>', 'Yeah, the guy or thing in the middle is odd enough to almost seem normal.  Good choice.  That definitely is October.', '2004-11-01 05:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(982550, 117160, 28347, '<td valign="top">The textures are really amazing! I''ve never been able to get water to look this good when not in real life.... ;-)<br/> <br/>My eye keeps looking for the bigger clouds though. It''s deceiving that the clouds we see on the top are really only the second, smaller reflection. I also think it''s a bit of a shame that the trees, which are quite plain, take up so much of the frame. With more sky, the trees would seem more like silouhettes, (especially on the right), than a barrier. Maybe with a slightly wider lens, and a vertical orientation, the detail of the water could have been captured, but more of the sky would have been preserved too.</td>', 'The textures are really amazing! I''ve never been able to get water to look this good when not in real life.... ;-) My eye keeps looking for the bigger clouds though. It''s deceiving that the clouds we see on the top are really only the second, smaller reflection. I also think it''s a bit of a shame that the trees, which are quite plain, take up so much of the frame. With more sky, the trees would seem more like silouhettes, (especially on the right), than a barrier. Maybe with a slightly wider lens, and a vertical orientation, the detail of the water could have been captured, but more of the sky would have been preserved too.', '2004-11-01 05:16:08.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(982551, 115117, 12131, '<td valign="top">Can you send those clouds down my way? They are so majestic.  I like the barn and the rustic feel to everything.</td>', 'Can you send those clouds down my way? They are so majestic.  I like the barn and the rustic feel to everything.', '2004-11-01 05:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(982557, 110898, 12131, '<td valign="top">Love the gangsta look to the guy and the colors of red on black.  One thing that seems a little at odds is the bottom right corner where it seems oddly overexposed and then shaded.  Still, I love their faces and her hair especially.  7</td>', 'Love the gangsta look to the guy and the colors of red on black.  One thing that seems a little at odds is the bottom right corner where it seems oddly overexposed and then shaded.  Still, I love their faces and her hair especially.  7', '2004-11-01 05:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(982559, 115949, 12131, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame it''s not an evergreen, it''s tall enough to serve for Christmas.  Amazing amount of fall on one tree.  Thats going to leave such a pile of leaves, I can just imagine playing hide and seek in them.</td>', 'It''s a shame it''s not an evergreen, it''s tall enough to serve for Christmas.  Amazing amount of fall on one tree.  Thats going to leave such a pile of leaves, I can just imagine playing hide and seek in them.', '2004-11-01 05:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(982563, 117069, 12131, '<td valign="top">It''s the way anyone not superman would fly.  What a stunt! A little blurry but that may be because it''s in action.  Pretty clear around Mr. Dare Devil though.</td>', 'It''s the way anyone not superman would fly.  What a stunt! A little blurry but that may be because it''s in action.  Pretty clear around Mr. Dare Devil though.', '2004-11-01 05:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(982564, 111806, 24613, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!  What a pretty model!  May have been a little better with more background (IMO), but still good stuff! 8</td>', 'Excellent shot!  What a pretty model!  May have been a little better with more background (IMO), but still good stuff! 8', '2004-11-01 05:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(982565, 111806, 12131, '<td valign="top">Such innocent worriless happiness.  Love her eyes. 7</td>', 'Such innocent worriless happiness.  Love her eyes. 7', '2004-11-01 05:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(982566, 116930, 24613, '<td valign="top">This looks like a little house on a model railroad layout!  Love the colors - great focus.  It all works so well.  Nice job! 9</td>', 'This looks like a little house on a model railroad layout!  Love the colors - great focus.  It all works so well.  Nice job! 9', '2004-11-01 05:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(982567, 117128, 12131, '<td valign="top">Do you ever wonder if perhaps despite way their face is shaped, they are actually bent double laughing?  Oddly I could see that.  Great catch either way.</td>', 'Do you ever wonder if perhaps despite way their face is shaped, they are actually bent double laughing?  Oddly I could see that.  Great catch either way.', '2004-11-01 05:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(982568, 109241, 12131, '<td valign="top">Oh, that''s got to be one of the best.  How absolutely adorable!</td>', 'Oh, that''s got to be one of the best.  How absolutely adorable!', '2004-11-01 05:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(982569, 114687, 24613, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!  Love the way you stopped the motion.  The title is great (put a smile on my face).  Very good work!  8</td>', 'Excellent shot!  Love the way you stopped the motion.  The title is great (put a smile on my face).  Very good work!  8', '2004-11-01 05:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(982572, 114428, 24613, '<td valign="top">A breath-taking shot.  The color is vivid - makes me wish I was there.  Good work! 7</td>', 'A breath-taking shot.  The color is vivid - makes me wish I was there.  Good work! 7', '2004-11-01 05:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(982587, 112988, 6458, '<td valign="top">Damn. This is good, but it was *so* close to being great. I love the blurred cruise ship. That really provides a focal point and a sense of dynamism to this shot, but it''s so lost right now. Crop it just above the buildings, and you''ll see what I mean.</td>', 'Damn. This is good, but it was *so* close to being great. I love the blurred cruise ship. That really provides a focal point and a sense of dynamism to this shot, but it''s so lost right now. Crop it just above the buildings, and you''ll see what I mean.', '2004-11-01 05:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(982592, 117210, 25735, '<td valign="top">Good image congratulation.</td>', 'Good image congratulation.', '2004-11-01 06:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(982594, 116930, 17492, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous use of DOF.</td>', 'Gorgeous use of DOF.', '2004-11-01 06:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
