(982622, 115938, 19982, '<td valign="top">I think the composition here struggles for focus...  not just camera focus, but a focus on what the eye should land on.</td>', 'I think the composition here struggles for focus...  not just camera focus, but a focus on what the eye should land on.', '2004-11-01 06:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(982623, 114670, 19982, '<td valign="top">That''s a whole lot of muscle!  I like the overhead lighting.  The wall behind him is just a little distracting.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'That''s a whole lot of muscle!  I like the overhead lighting.  The wall behind him is just a little distracting.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-01 06:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(982624, 117137, 19982, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here.  It could benefit from a single "main subject".  Such as one larger leaf, or one whose color had changed more dramatically than the others, or one which was more surrounded by sky.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I like the idea here.  It could benefit from a single "main subject".  Such as one larger leaf, or one whose color had changed more dramatically than the others, or one which was more surrounded by sky.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-01 06:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(982630, 114428, 19982, '<td valign="top">I like the panoramic crop and the lines across the image created by the clouds.  The blues in the sky are awesome, but I find myself wishing the mountains had just a bit more emphasis.  Good job.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I like the panoramic crop and the lines across the image created by the clouds.  The blues in the sky are awesome, but I find myself wishing the mountains had just a bit more emphasis.  Good job.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-01 06:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(982642, 115733, 20150, '<td valign="top">The one small problem I have with this picture is that the waterline is not level, if you rotated this picture just a bit to the right and made the waterline level I think I would have scored this a point higher.</td>', 'The one small problem I have with this picture is that the waterline is not level, if you rotated this picture just a bit to the right and made the waterline level I think I would have scored this a point higher.', '2004-11-01 06:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(982643, 117079, 8643, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait but perhaps a tighter crop?</td>', 'Lovely portrait but perhaps a tighter crop?', '2004-11-01 06:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(982644, 114876, 17492, '<td valign="top">Tad over-sharpened for my tastes.</td>', 'Tad over-sharpened for my tastes.', '2004-11-01 06:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(982647, 117093, 20150, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in the water and how you did not place the bird in the center.  Great compisition.  I give you an 8.</td>', 'I love the colors in the water and how you did not place the bird in the center.  Great compisition.  I give you an 8.', '2004-11-01 06:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(982654, 112366, 20150, '<td valign="top">I like the color of this photo and that ray of sun adds so much to the photo.  Nice picture.</td>', 'I like the color of this photo and that ray of sun adds so much to the photo.  Nice picture.', '2004-11-01 07:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(982656, 116999, 20150, '<td valign="top">Exceleent use of black and white, I think if you rotated it just a tad to the right I would have liked it a little more.  Rotating it would make it just look look a little more level.</td>', 'Exceleent use of black and white, I think if you rotated it just a tad to the right I would have liked it a little more.  Rotating it would make it just look look a little more level.', '2004-11-01 07:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
