(982661, 113615, 28803, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the simple elegance of the subject and composition. It''s a wonderful picture.</td>', 'I love the colors and the simple elegance of the subject and composition. It''s a wonderful picture.', '2004-11-01 07:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(982664, 116751, 4482, '<td valign="top">HAHAHAHAHAHAHA!!!!  You dared!!! Good boy!!! Just for tha 10!!!</td>', 'HAHAHAHAHAHAHA!!!!  You dared!!! Good boy!!! Just for tha 10!!!', '2004-11-01 07:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(982667, 109482, 2344, '<td valign="top">This is adorable but there are a few things I dont like about it. I think the pose would be 100% better than it already is if we could see the baby''s face. Also you oversharpened your image. Look at the way the edges seem to glow.. that''s a surefire way to tell if you oversharpened or not. It''s still a very nice picture!</td>', 'This is adorable but there are a few things I dont like about it. I think the pose would be 100% better than it already is if we could see the baby''s face. Also you oversharpened your image. Look at the way the edges seem to glow.. that''s a surefire way to tell if you oversharpened or not. It''s still a very nice picture!', '2004-11-01 07:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(982671, 109482, 20150, '<td valign="top">It looks like the little guy is telling the bear a secret, that makes this a little different than the other photos I have seen similar to this.  Nice photo.</td>', 'It looks like the little guy is telling the bear a secret, that makes this a little different than the other photos I have seen similar to this.  Nice photo.', '2004-11-01 07:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
