(982711, 113079, 28708, '<td valign="top">I love this picture because of my fancy for military aircraft. Great shot. It can be difficult getting good pictures when you are at the mercy of the pre-planned flight pattern of the pilot (assuming this is from an airshow). I like the reflection of the burn on the horizontal stabilizers.</td>', 'I love this picture because of my fancy for military aircraft. Great shot. It can be difficult getting good pictures when you are at the mercy of the pre-planned flight pattern of the pilot (assuming this is from an airshow). I like the reflection of the burn on the horizontal stabilizers.', '2004-11-01 08:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(982713, 110898, 27482, '<td valign="top">I really really really don´t like the cheezy "shadow in the corners" effect but if I try and look past that it´s a nice portrait of a bride and groom, not bad at all but her expression could have been better.</td>', 'I really really really don´t like the cheezy "shadow in the corners" effect but if I try and look past that it´s a nice portrait of a bride and groom, not bad at all but her expression could have been better.', '2004-11-01 08:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(982717, 115997, 23729, '<td valign="top">Lacks contrast and crisp focus</td>', 'Lacks contrast and crisp focus', '2004-11-01 08:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(982720, 116075, 2764, '<td valign="top">Exquisite bee picture - the reflections on his wings are especially nice - great contrast of textures, soft flower petals, fuzzy bee, shiny wings.  perfect DOF</td>', 'Exquisite bee picture - the reflections on his wings are especially nice - great contrast of textures, soft flower petals, fuzzy bee, shiny wings.  perfect DOF', '2004-11-01 08:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(982723, 117092, 2764, '<td valign="top">What a sunset!  I especially like how the water is so finely textured and horizontal while the clouds look like rippling waves.  The pattern of the sky lloks like a magnified version of the pattern of the water surface.</td>', 'What a sunset!  I especially like how the water is so finely textured and horizontal while the clouds look like rippling waves.  The pattern of the sky lloks like a magnified version of the pattern of the water surface.', '2004-11-01 08:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
