(982730, 114933, 23729, '<td valign="top">Nice hair :)</td>', 'Nice hair :)', '2004-11-01 08:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(982734, 117248, 2764, '<td valign="top">Lovely flower - looks like a text book image.  As a photo the contrating textures are nice, detaied center, soft petals, fat leaves - increasing in size.  The composition, however, isnt very interesting.  It is slightly off center but no enough so to make use of anything on the right of the image, in fact it seems to draw attention to the flaw on the tip of a leaf.  the leading lines all lead out of the picture and nothing clearly leads back in.  I think if this were cropped dead cdnterthe outward lines of the flower would be better balanced by the inward lines of the leaves.</td>', 'Lovely flower - looks like a text book image.  As a photo the contrating textures are nice, detaied center, soft petals, fat leaves - increasing in size.  The composition, however, isnt very interesting.  It is slightly off center but no enough so to make use of anything on the right of the image, in fact it seems to draw attention to the flaw on the tip of a leaf.  the leading lines all lead out of the picture and nothing clearly leads back in.  I think if this were cropped dead cdnterthe outward lines of the flower would be better balanced by the inward lines of the leaves.', '2004-11-01 08:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(982736, 117209, 23729, '<td valign="top">Fun picture!</td>', 'Fun picture!', '2004-11-01 08:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(982737, 116876, 26500, '<td valign="top">Very clever and nice use of silhouettes.</td>', 'Very clever and nice use of silhouettes.', '2004-11-01 08:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(982738, 116838, 23729, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic.  The mist in the middle ground makes this work.</td>', 'Very dramatic.  The mist in the middle ground makes this work.', '2004-11-01 08:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(982739, 111701, 23729, '<td valign="top">That''s the friendliest looking bug I''ve ever seen</td>', 'That''s the friendliest looking bug I''ve ever seen', '2004-11-01 08:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(982740, 115928, 2764, '<td valign="top">Geat interaction between the main characters!  some nice use of lines, the X of the chains, the halters.  the arm leading to the horse, the nose leading to the man.  However the image is washed out looking (a job for photoshop to fix) and there are too many distracting elelments.  A tighter crop could eleminate the railing at the bottom - too bad the other horse was in the way as the backgound lights are sort of interesting.The white blob in the middle is very distracting.</td>', 'Geat interaction between the main characters!  some nice use of lines, the X of the chains, the halters.  the arm leading to the horse, the nose leading to the man.  However the image is washed out looking (a job for photoshop to fix) and there are too many distracting elelments.  A tighter crop could eleminate the railing at the bottom - too bad the other horse was in the way as the backgound lights are sort of interesting.The white blob in the middle is very distracting.', '2004-11-01 08:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(982743, 117079, 19959, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait..</td>', 'Very nice portrait..', '2004-11-01 08:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(982744, 114508, 23729, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, this almost works... it bugs me that the blue and red crayons are a little mis-aligned.</td>', 'Nice idea, this almost works... it bugs me that the blue and red crayons are a little mis-aligned.', '2004-11-01 08:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(982747, 112103, 19959, '<td valign="top">Maybe a slightly longer exposure would have improved this. I like this shot a great deal though.</td>', 'Maybe a slightly longer exposure would have improved this. I like this shot a great deal though.', '2004-11-01 08:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(982749, 116776, 19959, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, the subject may have benefitted from a position on a ''third'' rather than so centraly to improve impact.</td>', 'This is a great shot, the subject may have benefitted from a position on a ''third'' rather than so centraly to improve impact.', '2004-11-01 08:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(982750, 116814, 19959, '<td valign="top">Very good.</td>', 'Very good.', '2004-11-01 08:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(982758, 113523, 7485, '<td valign="top">The glistening skin of the shoulder, neck, and fingers is excellent, but there''s something weird going on with the back of the hand. Both the alien blurry texture and the unnatural shadow boundary of the hand detract a lot from an otherwise superb photo - 5</td>', 'The glistening skin of the shoulder, neck, and fingers is excellent, but there''s something weird going on with the back of the hand. Both the alien blurry texture and the unnatural shadow boundary of the hand detract a lot from an otherwise superb photo - 5', '2004-11-01 08:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(982760, 115846, 26756, '<td valign="top">Interesting and beautiful sky.  The yellows, browns and greens of the foreground are a nice match with the cool blues and grays of the sky.  Nice image.</td>', 'Interesting and beautiful sky.  The yellows, browns and greens of the foreground are a nice match with the cool blues and grays of the sky.  Nice image.', '2004-11-01 08:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(982766, 117241, 26756, '<td valign="top">I like this effort but I think the color and lighting is a little flat.  I also would have maybe chosen a different position to shoot from so that the foreground is a bit more interesting, maybe another beautiful cactus or other plant.  That patch of dirt to me takes a bit away from the beautiful landscape.  I like the fact that you chose a small aperture so everything is in the same level of focus.</td>', 'I like this effort but I think the color and lighting is a little flat.  I also would have maybe chosen a different position to shoot from so that the foreground is a bit more interesting, maybe another beautiful cactus or other plant.  That patch of dirt to me takes a bit away from the beautiful landscape.  I like the fact that you chose a small aperture so everything is in the same level of focus.', '2004-11-01 08:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(982769, 117079, 23729, '<td valign="top">I like it, except for the redness around her lower eyelids</td>', 'I like it, except for the redness around her lower eyelids', '2004-11-01 08:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
