(982774, 114045, 27482, '<td valign="top">Great shot, good colours.  Only thing that could make it better would have been a sunset/sunrise sky, but that is it.</td>', 'Great shot, good colours.  Only thing that could make it better would have been a sunset/sunrise sky, but that is it.', '2004-11-01 08:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
