(982778, 117323, 3724, '<td valign="top">The  window lighting is really good...... neat soft skin. Superior composition - angle of the arm and angle of the window sill together draw the eye toward the face and reflection .  I would have considered cropping tighter and minimized exposure under the arm.</td>', 'The  window lighting is really good...... neat soft skin. Superior composition - angle of the arm and angle of the window sill together draw the eye toward the face and reflection .  I would have considered cropping tighter and minimized exposure under the arm.', '2004-11-01 08:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(982781, 113369, 22781, '<td valign="top">When I clicket the thumbnail I was thinking: Again a sunset...<br/>But this is realy beautifull!<br/>I like i like i like</td>', 'When I clicket the thumbnail I was thinking: Again a sunset...But this is realy beautifull!I like i like i like', '2004-11-01 09:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
