(982794, 117160, 26756, '<td valign="top">Beautiful mood and tone with this picture.  The reflection in the foreground is really nice.  It adds some interest as a starting point to lead your eyes around the photo.  Nice.</td>', 'Beautiful mood and tone with this picture.  The reflection in the foreground is really nice.  It adds some interest as a starting point to lead your eyes around the photo.  Nice.', '2004-11-01 09:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(982795, 117108, 26756, '<td valign="top">Even though it''s busy, I like the netting because it''s a bit unusual.  Typically pictures like this are of geese standing on a grassy shore next to the lake, so you chose something different.  The lighting to me is a bit harsh.  I think the direct sun hurts this photo just a bit.</td>', 'Even though it''s busy, I like the netting because it''s a bit unusual.  Typically pictures like this are of geese standing on a grassy shore next to the lake, so you chose something different.  The lighting to me is a bit harsh.  I think the direct sun hurts this photo just a bit.', '2004-11-01 09:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(982798, 117021, 26756, '<td valign="top">Great flight capture.  I love how one has the wings down and the other up.  Very soft colors and a dream-like look to it from the fog.  Focus could have been sharper but that might have required a small miracle.</td>', 'Great flight capture.  I love how one has the wings down and the other up.  Very soft colors and a dream-like look to it from the fog.  Focus could have been sharper but that might have required a small miracle.', '2004-11-01 09:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(982801, 117097, 16493, '<td valign="top">catlight too low, should be higher up, IMO.</td>', 'catlight too low, should be higher up, IMO.', '2004-11-01 09:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(982805, 117222, 27482, '<td valign="top">I am hoping this image is somehow a mistake, perhaps you downsampled it too much when making it this size but the quality of the image is horrible, soft, full of artefacts and noise also, it looks like it´s taken with a cellular phone with a camera.<br/> <br/>Anyway, it would probably be a great shot if it weren´t of this poor quality but I cant help but give it a 1.</td>', 'I am hoping this image is somehow a mistake, perhaps you downsampled it too much when making it this size but the quality of the image is horrible, soft, full of artefacts and noise also, it looks like it´s taken with a cellular phone with a camera. Anyway, it would probably be a great shot if it weren´t of this poor quality but I cant help but give it a 1.', '2004-11-01 09:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
