(982883, 116711, 1827, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve captured the gull in  the sun, but the sun is just too bright for my taste.  I also like the reflection of the sun on the rail at the bottom of the photo - this is the main point of interest in the image for me.  The building on the left is a distraction IMO. 5, just-married</td>', 'I like how you''ve captured the gull in  the sun, but the sun is just too bright for my taste.  I also like the reflection of the sun on the rail at the bottom of the photo - this is the main point of interest in the image for me.  The building on the left is a distraction IMO. 5, just-married', '2004-11-01 10:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(982884, 117180, 18028, '<td valign="top">Duuuude.....I so love this shot.</td>', 'Duuuude.....I so love this shot.', '2004-11-01 10:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(982885, 116384, 22748, '<td valign="top">A good picture, but I don''t see the association with Halloween...? Her left cheek is a but overexposed, perhaps.</td>', 'A good picture, but I don''t see the association with Halloween...? Her left cheek is a but overexposed, perhaps.', '2004-11-01 10:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(982887, 117137, 22748, '<td valign="top">Very sharp, nice image.</td>', 'Very sharp, nice image.', '2004-11-01 10:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(982888, 116447, 6008, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a little too much rock in the image. Cropping it at the points at which it connects to the sides of the image so that the diagonal line goes from bottom corner to top corner would make it more dynamic and reduce the amount of rock. The moon doesnt really stand out more than just a white blob - it is hard to expose both foreground and moon in what appears to be very harsh lighting conditions. There also appears to be some compression artifacts and the image looks oversharpened.</td>', 'There seems to be a little too much rock in the image. Cropping it at the points at which it connects to the sides of the image so that the diagonal line goes from bottom corner to top corner would make it more dynamic and reduce the amount of rock. The moon doesnt really stand out more than just a white blob - it is hard to expose both foreground and moon in what appears to be very harsh lighting conditions. There also appears to be some compression artifacts and the image looks oversharpened.', '2004-11-01 10:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(982889, 112103, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice. Good use of slow shutter speed to smooth the water out.</td>', 'Nice. Good use of slow shutter speed to smooth the water out.', '2004-11-01 10:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(982890, 116372, 22748, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! Fabulous colors! I love the ''glow'' feeling of the image. The best so far.</td>', 'Gorgeous! Fabulous colors! I love the ''glow'' feeling of the image. The best so far.', '2004-11-01 10:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(982892, 114989, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wow, gorgeous. Creative and great color and detail.</td>', 'Wow, gorgeous. Creative and great color and detail.', '2004-11-01 10:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(982893, 117283, 1827, '<td valign="top">A little too much green I think, but just beautiful framing. 6, just-married</td>', 'A little too much green I think, but just beautiful framing. 6, just-married', '2004-11-01 10:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(982894, 116785, 22748, '<td valign="top">Creative and interesting.</td>', 'Creative and interesting.', '2004-11-01 10:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(982895, 117165, 28347, '<td valign="top">Her left shoulder is distracting... Too bad it didn''t make it.<br/> <br/>I also think this photograph could really benefit from a more cinematic aspect ratio - if you crop a lot of the sky, and a tiny bit off the bottom, the eye would jump to the beautifuldetails, like the way the pole, then the small building and then the house reflect, the gradients in the water, the light on the frontmost rock, the folds of the shirt, and so forth.</td>', 'Her left shoulder is distracting... Too bad it didn''t make it. I also think this photograph could really benefit from a more cinematic aspect ratio - if you crop a lot of the sky, and a tiny bit off the bottom, the eye would jump to the beautifuldetails, like the way the pole, then the small building and then the house reflect, the gradients in the water, the light on the frontmost rock, the folds of the shirt, and so forth.', '2004-11-01 10:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(982899, 117069, 6008, '<td valign="top">I recently saw a display just like this one - crazy I say! I like the placement of the plane and how the contrail of smoke suggests it came zooming in from the lower left corner. The plane is fairly sharp and you''ve managed to capture some motion in the propellers. The guy tops it all off with the red costume that makes it stand out greatly - he looks like a hood ornament. You can almost make out the details in his face. Good capture.</td>', 'I recently saw a display just like this one - crazy I say! I like the placement of the plane and how the contrail of smoke suggests it came zooming in from the lower left corner. The plane is fairly sharp and you''ve managed to capture some motion in the propellers. The guy tops it all off with the red costume that makes it stand out greatly - he looks like a hood ornament. You can almost make out the details in his face. Good capture.', '2004-11-01 10:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(982900, 116187, 23729, '<td valign="top">AKA the "Mother-in-Law Beetle"    Nice shot</td>', 'AKA the "Mother-in-Law Beetle"    Nice shot', '2004-11-01 10:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(982901, 116004, 28347, '<td valign="top">What''s in the background? Just a city? And if so, is it the only light source, reflecting off the clouds? If that is the case, how long an exposure did it take to get that without losing depth of field?<br/> <br/>It''s a gorgeous image!</td>', 'What''s in the background? Just a city? And if so, is it the only light source, reflecting off the clouds? If that is the case, how long an exposure did it take to get that without losing depth of field? It''s a gorgeous image!', '2004-11-01 10:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(982902, 111102, 1827, '<td valign="top">Very nice color.  The DOF seems just a bit too tight, blurring already just beyond the eye.  Also, the placement of the catchlight in the eye causes a problem for me.  I realize it may be hard to get the bird in the perfect position right down to the catchlights, so this isn''t meant really as criticism - more as explanation of my experience with the photo. 6, just-married</td>', 'Very nice color.  The DOF seems just a bit too tight, blurring already just beyond the eye.  Also, the placement of the catchlight in the eye causes a problem for me.  I realize it may be hard to get the bird in the perfect position right down to the catchlights, so this isn''t meant really as criticism - more as explanation of my experience with the photo. 6, just-married', '2004-11-01 10:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(982904, 116833, 22537, '<td valign="top">This turned out very well.</td>', 'This turned out very well.', '2004-11-01 10:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(982909, 117316, 1827, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed.  Beautiful girl.  Well done in the face of what appears to be some intense sunlight judging by the highlight on the nose.  6, just-married</td>', 'Nicely framed.  Beautiful girl.  Well done in the face of what appears to be some intense sunlight judging by the highlight on the nose.  6, just-married', '2004-11-01 10:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(982910, 117274, 22537, '<td valign="top">I''m waiting for a unicorn to hop into the picture. 7</td>', 'I''m waiting for a unicorn to hop into the picture. 7', '2004-11-01 10:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(982911, 115251, 6008, '<td valign="top">There is a little too much dark areas in the image and it is also lacking a central focal point. The sky also looks blown out. Only suggestions I can make would be to shoot away from the sun in a different location. Perhaps moving more towards the lake and getting reflections instead of large clumps of dark treeline.</td>', 'There is a little too much dark areas in the image and it is also lacking a central focal point. The sky also looks blown out. Only suggestions I can make would be to shoot away from the sun in a different location. Perhaps moving more towards the lake and getting reflections instead of large clumps of dark treeline.', '2004-11-01 10:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(982913, 117002, 28347, '<td valign="top">I think the angle strips a bit of detail from the windows - the window sills are very deep. This makes it seem like a very tall building, despite the fact that no wide-angle distortion is used, and the frame is horizontal. It''s like one of those pictures of new york sky scrapers, making a face at the sun.<br/> <br/>I really like the sharpness of the edges, and the textures, and the colors are simply brilliant.<br/> <br/>Good show!</td>', 'I think the angle strips a bit of detail from the windows - the window sills are very deep. This makes it seem like a very tall building, despite the fact that no wide-angle distortion is used, and the frame is horizontal. It''s like one of those pictures of new york sky scrapers, making a face at the sun. I really like the sharpness of the edges, and the textures, and the colors are simply brilliant. Good show!', '2004-11-01 10:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(982915, 116930, 10151, '<td valign="top">This looks like a model...where is this. Great colors! Great scene!!</td>', 'This looks like a model...where is this. Great colors! Great scene!!', '2004-11-01 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(982916, 113684, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very stunning b/w photo. Feels nicely balanced overall but I think it could use a just a bit less water to help increase emphasis on the mountain and sky. Clouds appear to be blown out in a couple of areas.</td>', 'Very stunning b/w photo. Feels nicely balanced overall but I think it could use a just a bit less water to help increase emphasis on the mountain and sky. Clouds appear to be blown out in a couple of areas.', '2004-11-01 10:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(982918, 113564, 28347, '<td valign="top">Stunning...</td>', 'Stunning...', '2004-11-01 10:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(982920, 115678, 10080, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!</td>', 'Beautiful shot!', '2004-11-01 10:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(982921, 111641, 22537, '<td valign="top">Cccccool shot! Well balanced and sharp. 8</td>', 'Cccccool shot! Well balanced and sharp. 8', '2004-11-01 10:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(982922, 117091, 8054, '<td valign="top">There must be a very sad story behind this. Would have liked to see the dates better as I cannot make out the complete year of birth but I presume that he was young considering there''s a stuffed animal on the post. Nice use of thirds.</td>', 'There must be a very sad story behind this. Would have liked to see the dates better as I cannot make out the complete year of birth but I presume that he was young considering there''s a stuffed animal on the post. Nice use of thirds.', '2004-11-01 10:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(982925, 117143, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good position of the horizon line, although I''d be tempted to crop out some of the sky down to the start of the clouds so the emphasis is more on the land and waves.  Nice use of near, middle, far elements. The lighting seems a little harsh and as such the image falls a little flat for me. Looks like a great location, though.</td>', 'Good position of the horizon line, although I''d be tempted to crop out some of the sky down to the start of the clouds so the emphasis is more on the land and waves.  Nice use of near, middle, far elements. The lighting seems a little harsh and as such the image falls a little flat for me. Looks like a great location, though.', '2004-11-01 10:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(982927, 111701, 10080, '<td valign="top">Too cool!!! Great shot!</td>', 'Too cool!!! Great shot!', '2004-11-01 10:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(982929, 116187, 6624, '<td valign="top">that is a fantastic creature (and I have to say how does it work?)  and a little over-lit<br/>the warmth of the ''fur'' balances that but it still could stand to be warmer overall</td>', 'that is a fantastic creature (and I have to say how does it work?)  and a little over-litthe warmth of the ''fur'' balances that but it still could stand to be warmer overall', '2004-11-01 10:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(982934, 117150, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good coloration, depth of field, composition. I like how you''ve established the environment for the statue. It''s certainly an image I would expect to see used in travel guides or the like. It makes a great stock image, and I dont mean that in a bad way. The only thing I dislike is the grass shaft in the lower left corner and the out of focus branch near the head.</td>', 'Good coloration, depth of field, composition. I like how you''ve established the environment for the statue. It''s certainly an image I would expect to see used in travel guides or the like. It makes a great stock image, and I dont mean that in a bad way. The only thing I dislike is the grass shaft in the lower left corner and the out of focus branch near the head.', '2004-11-01 10:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(982936, 117272, 6624, '<td valign="top">This is wonderfully inviting - it is over-lit on the left, to keep the foreground(?),  but the overall effect is compelling (would a crop at the bottom balance out the light?</td>', 'This is wonderfully inviting - it is over-lit on the left, to keep the foreground(?),  but the overall effect is compelling (would a crop at the bottom balance out the light?', '2004-11-01 10:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(982940, 109482, 6624, '<td valign="top">This says volumes about childhood - it is charming, touching and not overly sweet<br/>congratulations on a fine image</td>', 'This says volumes about childhood - it is charming, touching and not overly sweetcongratulations on a fine image', '2004-11-01 10:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(982941, 109315, 10080, '<td valign="top">All I can say is WOW!</td>', 'All I can say is WOW!', '2004-11-01 10:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
