(982990, 113523, 28347, '<td valign="top">The blurriness of the back of the hand is not natural, right? I think it''s slightly overdone.</td>', 'The blurriness of the back of the hand is not natural, right? I think it''s slightly overdone.', '2004-11-01 11:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
