(983006, 116155, 20662, '<td valign="top">Very pretty -- Did you try it by cropping out the mountains in the foreground? Seeing just the pastel mountains would be wonderful. The foreground catches and hold your eye.</td>', 'Very pretty -- Did you try it by cropping out the mountains in the foreground? Seeing just the pastel mountains would be wonderful. The foreground catches and hold your eye.', '2004-11-01 11:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(983007, 114559, 1827, '<td valign="top">Cute.  I wish the white were a bit whiter.  Still, nice humorous entry. 5, just-married</td>', 'Cute.  I wish the white were a bit whiter.  Still, nice humorous entry. 5, just-married', '2004-11-01 11:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(983011, 110958, 20662, '<td valign="top">Your photo is tipping to the right</td>', 'Your photo is tipping to the right', '2004-11-01 11:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(983015, 116837, 20662, '<td valign="top">Gotta love a redhead!</td>', 'Gotta love a redhead!', '2004-11-01 11:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(983016, 115027, 1827, '<td valign="top">What a very pretty portrait of a beautiful girl.  If I were the girl, I''d be very happy to have this.  I''m so glad that you didn''t neat image away her face''s texture.  And I love that you caught her hands in motion.  Really just beautiful. Going in my favs. 9, just-married</td>', 'What a very pretty portrait of a beautiful girl.  If I were the girl, I''d be very happy to have this.  I''m so glad that you didn''t neat image away her face''s texture.  And I love that you caught her hands in motion.  Really just beautiful. Going in my favs. 9, just-married', '2004-11-01 11:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(983017, 116190, 18403, '<td valign="top">I can almost feel the cold damp air! 8</td>', 'I can almost feel the cold damp air! 8', '2004-11-01 11:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(983030, 115259, 6008, '<td valign="top">It looks like your subject was a little too close to the background as the texture/creases in the sheet has become part of the image. Having your subject step farther way and also separately light the background may have helped isolate it more. The closeness factor can also be seen with the shadows on the lower left and around the hair from the flash. The yellow of the flower looks either too bright or oversaturated. I know some people say it''s best to have the subject look away from the camera but I think in this particular case having him look directly at the camera may have made him more engaging with the viewer, he''s a clown after all and that''s what they do. On a totally non-related to your image opinion - clowns are evil!</td>', 'It looks like your subject was a little too close to the background as the texture/creases in the sheet has become part of the image. Having your subject step farther way and also separately light the background may have helped isolate it more. The closeness factor can also be seen with the shadows on the lower left and around the hair from the flash. The yellow of the flower looks either too bright or oversaturated. I know some people say it''s best to have the subject look away from the camera but I think in this particular case having him look directly at the camera may have made him more engaging with the viewer, he''s a clown after all and that''s what they do. On a totally non-related to your image opinion - clowns are evil!', '2004-11-01 11:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(983035, 117128, 1827, '<td valign="top">He clearly doesn''t want his picture taken.  The focus is perfect for me.  The framing is what prevents me from marking his higher.  I fell it''s a bit awkward to have him in the bottom of the frame like that.  If you were going for a centered composition, he needs to be up considerably higher so that his eyes arrest the center of the frame.  I think a square crop would work nicely here. 5, just-married</td>', 'He clearly doesn''t want his picture taken.  The focus is perfect for me.  The framing is what prevents me from marking his higher.  I fell it''s a bit awkward to have him in the bottom of the frame like that.  If you were going for a centered composition, he needs to be up considerably higher so that his eyes arrest the center of the frame.  I think a square crop would work nicely here. 5, just-married', '2004-11-01 11:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(983038, 117069, 1827, '<td valign="top">Well, this photo won my double take award!  Nicely framed, and a nice image.  Competition was steep in this challenge. 6, just-married</td>', 'Well, this photo won my double take award!  Nicely framed, and a nice image.  Competition was steep in this challenge. 6, just-married', '2004-11-01 11:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(983041, 109506, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, sharpness, depth of field, and composition.  The details in the fur and hands are great and I love the baby tail curled around the adult''s tail. The only thing I can see to improve the shot is to be able to see more of the baby''s head.</td>', 'Good lighting, sharpness, depth of field, and composition.  The details in the fur and hands are great and I love the baby tail curled around the adult''s tail. The only thing I can see to improve the shot is to be able to see more of the baby''s head.', '2004-11-01 11:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(983043, 114487, 5354, '<td valign="top">I''m sure theres a cat in this photo somewhere ....</td>', 'I''m sure theres a cat in this photo somewhere ....', '2004-11-01 11:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(983044, 117060, 10151, '<td valign="top">My goodness!! That is just crazy!!</td>', 'My goodness!! That is just crazy!!', '2004-11-01 11:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(983049, 117302, 8054, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the composition of this with all the distracting objects in the background and the two different colors of carpet. The papers also are overexposed.</td>', 'Not sure I like the composition of this with all the distracting objects in the background and the two different colors of carpet. The papers also are overexposed.', '2004-11-01 11:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(983052, 116408, 8054, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait study. Nice soft details of the dress and her skin. I like how her hair flows downward past her shoulders and barely touches her. Lighting is also very good and emphasizes the tone of her skin well. 10</td>', 'Excellent portrait study. Nice soft details of the dress and her skin. I like how her hair flows downward past her shoulders and barely touches her. Lighting is also very good and emphasizes the tone of her skin well. 10', '2004-11-01 11:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(983057, 111997, 10390, '<td valign="top">Good photo, but I think it would have worked better as a duotone image.</td>', 'Good photo, but I think it would have worked better as a duotone image.', '2004-11-01 11:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(983059, 115310, 8054, '<td valign="top">Vedry clean and crisp lines. The stop action of the fluid flowing out the of the bottle is very good and detailed. My main concern is with the white space above the bottle. I think that should have been cropped right up to the bottle. Excellent otherwise. 9</td>', 'Vedry clean and crisp lines. The stop action of the fluid flowing out the of the bottle is very good and detailed. My main concern is with the white space above the bottle. I think that should have been cropped right up to the bottle. Excellent otherwise. 9', '2004-11-01 11:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(983060, 110125, 5354, '<td valign="top">Shame there''s a person brushing thier hair in the corner - if she''s a model then she needs to be doing something interesting, if she is not then you should have waited or asked her to move out of frame.</td>', 'Shame there''s a person brushing thier hair in the corner - if she''s a model then she needs to be doing something interesting, if she is not then you should have waited or asked her to move out of frame.', '2004-11-01 11:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(983063, 115199, 8054, '<td valign="top">Ducks are too centered. They could use some negative space in front of them and maybe above. Sharp details of the feathers and of the water.</td>', 'Ducks are too centered. They could use some negative space in front of them and maybe above. Sharp details of the feathers and of the water.', '2004-11-01 11:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(983064, 109315, 22392, '<td valign="top">beautiful!! I love the eerie atmoshpere, the promise of either a beautiful day or the threat of a storm coming up.</td>', 'beautiful!! I love the eerie atmoshpere, the promise of either a beautiful day or the threat of a storm coming up.', '2004-11-01 11:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(983067, 111102, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp details of the feathers and beak. Contrast seems a bit flat or maybe feathers under the beak are really that light.</td>', 'Nice sharp details of the feathers and beak. Contrast seems a bit flat or maybe feathers under the beak are really that light.', '2004-11-01 11:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(983072, 117228, 7969, '<td valign="top">horizon needs to be straightened, otherwise nice shot.</td>', 'horizon needs to be straightened, otherwise nice shot.', '2004-11-01 11:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(983078, 117288, 20577, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Great detail!</td>', 'Very nice! Great detail!', '2004-11-01 11:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(983080, 117069, 20577, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.</td>', 'Very nice capture.', '2004-11-01 11:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(983085, 116621, 7969, '<td valign="top">gorgeous shot, something simple and beautiful.  Well done</td>', 'gorgeous shot, something simple and beautiful.  Well done', '2004-11-01 11:37:33.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(983089, 116930, 20577, '<td valign="top">This almost looks fake... like a model.. very nice.</td>', 'This almost looks fake... like a model.. very nice.', '2004-11-01 11:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(983094, 116801, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good colors and reflection. Looks almost like a painting. I would have loved to have seen a timeless person leaning over or walking across the bridge just to give it a Thomas Kinkade-like feel to it, although it''s good as is.</td>', 'Good colors and reflection. Looks almost like a painting. I would have loved to have seen a timeless person leaning over or walking across the bridge just to give it a Thomas Kinkade-like feel to it, although it''s good as is.', '2004-11-01 11:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(983099, 116488, 6008, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, the colors blend really well and the golden wheat stalks with the blue of the sky compliment each other nicely. The layers of field, mountains, sky also works extremely well. Very nice shot.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, the colors blend really well and the golden wheat stalks with the blue of the sky compliment each other nicely. The layers of field, mountains, sky also works extremely well. Very nice shot.', '2004-11-01 11:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(983100, 117228, 3724, '<td valign="top">great observation of gathering birds - and impressive landscape too.  I like the look of it cropped without the sky....</td>', 'great observation of gathering birds - and impressive landscape too.  I like the look of it cropped without the sky....', '2004-11-01 11:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(983101, 115212, 15982, '<td valign="top">LOL!!! Cool picture!</td>', 'LOL!!! Cool picture!', '2004-11-01 11:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(983104, 114487, 3724, '<td valign="top">.......profile of a cat shows clearly....  good and interesting composition.</td>', '.......profile of a cat shows clearly....  good and interesting composition.', '2004-11-01 11:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(983105, 111641, 2764, '<td valign="top">Hoar frost? the leaf is great, the light coming through it is beasutiful, not so sure about the ground under it - looks like astroturf.</td>', 'Hoar frost? the leaf is great, the light coming through it is beasutiful, not so sure about the ground under it - looks like astroturf.', '2004-11-01 11:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(983110, 109482, 20577, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is one of the greatest pictures I have ever seen. Hope people don''t voote you down because it is so "cute". Once again, a very touching photo. 10</td>', 'Wow. This is one of the greatest pictures I have ever seen. Hope people don''t voote you down because it is so "cute". Once again, a very touching photo. 10', '2004-11-01 11:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(983111, 116410, 6008, '<td valign="top">I dont know much about portraits so my opinions are completely personal preference. I like that you filled the entire frame with the frame. The hair and scarf do a good job of being a natural frame. Her expression seems natural and warm and comes across as genuine. There are no distracting shadows and the lighting is soft yet warm. Her eyes seem a little soft and dark - a little editing work and I think it would really raise the level of the portrait as the eyes seem to be one of the  main focal points.</td>', 'I dont know much about portraits so my opinions are completely personal preference. I like that you filled the entire frame with the frame. The hair and scarf do a good job of being a natural frame. Her expression seems natural and warm and comes across as genuine. There are no distracting shadows and the lighting is soft yet warm. Her eyes seem a little soft and dark - a little editing work and I think it would really raise the level of the portrait as the eyes seem to be one of the  main focal points.', '2004-11-01 11:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(983114, 113564, 2764, '<td valign="top">looks like fire - the houses and tres below are not compositionally interesting though.</td>', 'looks like fire - the houses and tres below are not compositionally interesting though.', '2004-11-01 11:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(983118, 115054, 2764, '<td valign="top">Sensual pink - the petals on the right get chaotic and te composition suffers - how about a tighter crop on the left?</td>', 'Sensual pink - the petals on the right get chaotic and te composition suffers - how about a tighter crop on the left?', '2004-11-01 11:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(983120, 115958, 3724, '<td valign="top">...... excellent subject, beautiful natural mix of yellow paint &amp; rust.  Effective big sky and landscape with lots of room around the plow is great.</td>', '...... excellent subject, beautiful natural mix of yellow paint & rust.  Effective big sky and landscape with lots of room around the plow is great.', '2004-11-01 11:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(983122, 114484, 20577, '<td valign="top">This has a grigrigirl feel to it. I really like it.</td>', 'This has a grigrigirl feel to it. I really like it.', '2004-11-01 11:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
