(983239, 112988, 7969, '<td valign="top">Cliche perhaps, but very well done.  Great light and sharpness!</td>', 'Cliche perhaps, but very well done.  Great light and sharpness!', '2004-11-01 12:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(983246, 116820, 23729, '<td valign="top">So far my only ''10'' vote.... very dramatic</td>', 'So far my only ''10'' vote.... very dramatic', '2004-11-01 12:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(983251, 116820, 2223, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!! 10</td>', 'Beautiful!! 10', '2004-11-01 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(983256, 114432, 3080, '<td valign="top">What is this?  Looks like a road at night maybe?  focus seems really soft and the lighting is so low I can''t really make anything out.  The date stamp is very distracting.  Doesn''t add to the photo in any way.  Generally people turn those off for taking quality photos.  Would you sell this photo with that stamp on there?  Probably not.</td>', 'What is this?  Looks like a road at night maybe?  focus seems really soft and the lighting is so low I can''t really make anything out.  The date stamp is very distracting.  Doesn''t add to the photo in any way.  Generally people turn those off for taking quality photos.  Would you sell this photo with that stamp on there?  Probably not.', '2004-11-01 12:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(983257, 115940, 2752, '<td valign="top">Great depth,very crisp,well composed and the cloud bank in front of the mountains gives me the feeling of being right there.  Good job.</td>', 'Great depth,very crisp,well composed and the cloud bank in front of the mountains gives me the feeling of being right there.  Good job.', '2004-11-01 12:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(983261, 114431, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately different.  I love the background.  The slight reflections of the flames on the wall look nice.  Fire is hard to perfect, but I think you did a nice job.  I also like the random blue throughout the photo.  nice. ~Heather~</td>', 'Definately different.  I love the background.  The slight reflections of the flames on the wall look nice.  Fire is hard to perfect, but I think you did a nice job.  I also like the random blue throughout the photo.  nice. ~Heather~', '2004-11-01 12:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(983263, 113541, 23312, '<td valign="top">Nice effect - conveys "alone" very well.</td>', 'Nice effect - conveys "alone" very well.', '2004-11-01 12:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(983265, 116372, 23729, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful scene!  Like a fairy tale.  Stunning shot.  10+<br/>I especially like the contrast between the intensity of the read leaves and the whispy green of the leaves still on the trees.</td>', 'What a beautiful scene!  Like a fairy tale.  Stunning shot.  10+I especially like the contrast between the intensity of the read leaves and the whispy green of the leaves still on the trees.', '2004-11-01 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(983267, 109951, 24846, '<td valign="top">Love the color blends .</td>', 'Love the color blends .', '2004-11-01 12:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(983269, 116835, 23312, '<td valign="top">Very vibrant colors!</td>', 'Very vibrant colors!', '2004-11-01 12:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(983278, 111476, 24846, '<td valign="top">Neat shot of a lost structure in the cell phone age. Ifirst tought a smudge on my svreen but its a cloud. The lines of the pole add a structural quality that I like. High marks here.</td>', 'Neat shot of a lost structure in the cell phone age. Ifirst tought a smudge on my svreen but its a cloud. The lines of the pole add a structural quality that I like. High marks here.', '2004-11-01 12:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(983282, 109142, 23729, '<td valign="top">This is pretty funny.... or maybe it''s just me... but it looks like the bird is scratching it''s head as if it''s thinking, "Now where did I leave my wallet?"</td>', 'This is pretty funny.... or maybe it''s just me... but it looks like the bird is scratching it''s head as if it''s thinking, "Now where did I leave my wallet?"', '2004-11-01 12:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(983284, 113838, 24846, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Love the fruit with pumpkin instead of the traditional squashes and corn.<br/>High mark...</td>', 'Beautiful! Love the fruit with pumpkin instead of the traditional squashes and corn.High mark...', '2004-11-01 12:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(983285, 117283, 6008, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of energy in this shot. The tones are good, nice isolation, a little bright on the hat but I think it blends well with the darker tones of the shot that it is not distracting at all. The diagonal line of the body is good too. A technically good shot but overall it''s the energy and sense of fun and enjoyment that comes across. Good shot!<br/> <br/>On a side note, this was my 1000th comment!</td>', 'There is a lot of energy in this shot. The tones are good, nice isolation, a little bright on the hat but I think it blends well with the darker tones of the shot that it is not distracting at all. The diagonal line of the body is good too. A technically good shot but overall it''s the energy and sense of fun and enjoyment that comes across. Good shot! On a side note, this was my 1000th comment!', '2004-11-01 12:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
