(983936, 113914, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great idea and well executed. The colors match pretty well, especially the lips and cheeks with some of the red tones. That the person is looking into the lens gives a feeling of connection, imho good.<br/></td>', 'Great idea and well executed. The colors match pretty well, especially the lips and cheeks with some of the red tones. That the person is looking into the lens gives a feeling of connection, imho good.', '2004-11-01 17:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(983938, 113783, 280, '<td valign="top">Looks a little soft on the hoves, maybe a slightly faster shutter would have helped. Also some water splashing up would have really topped this off for me, but you have captured the motion of the horse well, so I geuss I can''t have everything. Good Luck</td>', 'Looks a little soft on the hoves, maybe a slightly faster shutter would have helped. Also some water splashing up would have really topped this off for me, but you have captured the motion of the horse well, so I geuss I can''t have everything. Good Luck', '2004-11-01 17:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(983941, 116206, 27293, '<td valign="top">The excellent composition saves this shot from being very mediocre. Not sure about the focus on the nose, if you have a version with focus on the eyes it would be interesting to compare the two. 8.</td>', 'The excellent composition saves this shot from being very mediocre. Not sure about the focus on the nose, if you have a version with focus on the eyes it would be interesting to compare the two. 8.', '2004-11-01 17:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(983944, 115212, 3032, '<td valign="top">The title says it all. :)<br/>The look on the face can only give you a feeling of joy, that''s a great feeling = job well done.</td>', 'The title says it all. :)The look on the face can only give you a feeling of joy, that''s a great feeling = job well done.', '2004-11-01 17:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(983947, 114199, 280, '<td valign="top">Nice use of sepia, thirds, DOF  and  very cute shot, defiantly one for the family album. However I  don''t like the line in the background by the childs head, it''s not straight and perhaps a sheet could have been used to give a neater background?</td>', 'Nice use of sepia, thirds, DOF  and  very cute shot, defiantly one for the family album. However I  don''t like the line in the background by the childs head, it''s not straight and perhaps a sheet could have been used to give a neater background?', '2004-11-01 17:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(983953, 111365, 280, '<td valign="top">Nice textures however the sand to the left of the tree looks a liitle too dark and draws my eye way from the focal point.</td>', 'Nice textures however the sand to the left of the tree looks a liitle too dark and draws my eye way from the focal point.', '2004-11-01 17:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(983957, 117191, 280, '<td valign="top">Not keen on the composition here, I don''t think that the top of the rings should have been cropped.</td>', 'Not keen on the composition here, I don''t think that the top of the rings should have been cropped.', '2004-11-01 17:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(983959, 109332, 3032, '<td valign="top">Somehow the image is very alive, it seems my brain tries to keep focussing and the subject in the middle is moving back and forth. That''s a cool effect.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Somehow the image is very alive, it seems my brain tries to keep focussing and the subject in the middle is moving back and forth. That''s a cool effect. ', '2004-11-01 17:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(983960, 116926, 280, '<td valign="top">The view across the lake looks stunning and the foreground seems relatively dull in comparison to me, just find myself wishing I could see more of the view!</td>', 'The view across the lake looks stunning and the foreground seems relatively dull in comparison to me, just find myself wishing I could see more of the view!', '2004-11-01 17:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(983962, 116340, 3032, '<td valign="top">The technique of multi-image-compositions (even if only one image is used), is not used enough @ dpc imho.<br/>Nice effect and a good photo.</td>', 'The technique of multi-image-compositions (even if only one image is used), is not used enough @ dpc imho.Nice effect and a good photo.', '2004-11-01 17:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(983965, 113541, 280, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred a less central composition and the faded effect seems a little over done.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred a less central composition and the faded effect seems a little over done.', '2004-11-01 17:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(983970, 114394, 26756, '<td valign="top">Forza Roma, Forza Lupi</td>', 'Forza Roma, Forza Lupi', '2004-11-01 18:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(983972, 112238, 280, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, although I would have preferred the subject to be a little closer to the left hand side of the frame, as it is he seems to be facing out of the photograph a little.<br/></td>', 'Great portrait, although I would have preferred the subject to be a little closer to the left hand side of the frame, as it is he seems to be facing out of the photograph a little.', '2004-11-01 18:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(983978, 117079, 280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait! Nicely focused on the eyes, very captivating!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Beautiful portrait! Nicely focused on the eyes, very captivating! ', '2004-11-01 18:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(983982, 117316, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. The composition is excellent with the lines of the face and hair and the placement of the eyes. The girl has a look of joy on her face and the positive mood that that creates is enhanced by the colorful painting on her face. <br/>The saturation seems to be a little bit towards warm pink giving the photo and even warmer mood (in a good way).</td>', 'Great portrait. The composition is excellent with the lines of the face and hair and the placement of the eyes. The girl has a look of joy on her face and the positive mood that that creates is enhanced by the colorful painting on her face. The saturation seems to be a little bit towards warm pink giving the photo and even warmer mood (in a good way).', '2004-11-01 18:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(983984, 117092, 16965, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!!!</td>', 'Beautiful!!!!', '2004-11-01 18:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(983986, 117180, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the composition with those lines of fur leading down to the face. The lighting &amp; exposure is good, toning a bit cool but not unpleasant. The colors of all objects in the photo are in good balance.</td>', 'I like the composition with those lines of fur leading down to the face. The lighting & exposure is good, toning a bit cool but not unpleasant. The colors of all objects in the photo are in good balance.', '2004-11-01 18:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(984002, 117295, 3087, '<td valign="top">My first thought was "oh my god what''s happened to that kid''s hand?" before I realised it must be someone else''s. I think this isn''t perhaps the best time to take a picture of this cutey at her best - the sunburn pink doesn''t do anything for her and her expression is no doubt one of concentration and staying still to be painted but I bet she looks more beautiful when she''s smiling. The red material and uneven background doesn''t add anything either. Not an instrically bad picture but one that likely holds more interest for those who know her than for strangers.</td>', 'My first thought was "oh my god what''s happened to that kid''s hand?" before I realised it must be someone else''s. I think this isn''t perhaps the best time to take a picture of this cutey at her best - the sunburn pink doesn''t do anything for her and her expression is no doubt one of concentration and staying still to be painted but I bet she looks more beautiful when she''s smiling. The red material and uneven background doesn''t add anything either. Not an instrically bad picture but one that likely holds more interest for those who know her than for strangers.', '2004-11-01 18:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(984006, 117202, 3087, '<td valign="top">Well you KNOW I have a weakness for these animals and this one is a fine specimen. The golden light really shows his fur off to it''s best advantage and I like how the autumn foliage on the ground complements the colours in his mane. In terms of pose I don''t think this is particularly striking as his mouth is somewhat obscured by grass and leaves and there''s no eye contact or action to draw us in.</td>', 'Well you KNOW I have a weakness for these animals and this one is a fine specimen. The golden light really shows his fur off to it''s best advantage and I like how the autumn foliage on the ground complements the colours in his mane. In terms of pose I don''t think this is particularly striking as his mouth is somewhat obscured by grass and leaves and there''s no eye contact or action to draw us in.', '2004-11-01 18:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(984009, 114806, 15207, '<td valign="top">It''s going ot be so hard to comment on even a fraction of challenge entries - and this is only the second one I''ve seen - but I just had to say this is absoluely striking. A beautiful, dramatic, rich image. I love it. 10</td>', 'It''s going ot be so hard to comment on even a fraction of challenge entries - and this is only the second one I''ve seen - but I just had to say this is absoluely striking. A beautiful, dramatic, rich image. I love it. 10', '2004-11-01 18:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(984010, 116338, 9780, '<td valign="top">Sureal landscape!</td>', 'Sureal landscape!', '2004-11-01 18:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(984014, 114432, 20941, '<td valign="top">really looks lonely, next time leave the time stamp off, nice job!</td>', 'really looks lonely, next time leave the time stamp off, nice job!', '2004-11-01 18:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(984015, 114393, 9780, '<td valign="top">This is??? :)</td>', 'This is??? :)', '2004-11-01 18:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(984026, 111248, 9780, '<td valign="top">I think this pic would be cooler  if it would be vertical becouse you cut out the top of the trees this way. Nice coolers thoug! 7<br/></td>', 'I think this pic would be cooler  if it would be vertical becouse you cut out the top of the trees this way. Nice coolers thoug! 7', '2004-11-01 18:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(984036, 116629, 9780, '<td valign="top">WWWWWWWWWWWWWWWOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOWWWWWWWWWWWWW Man I love this pic.. how in hell did you manage to catsh the constelation and so clear without let the light spoil it? did you you the "finger" tecnique? :)<br/></td>', 'WWWWWWWWWWWWWWWOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOWWWWWWWWWWWWW Man I love this pic.. how in hell did you manage to catsh the constelation and so clear without let the light spoil it? did you you the "finger" tecnique? :)', '2004-11-01 18:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
