(984072, 115724, 6624, '<td valign="top">this is a lovely abstract - the "puzzle" shapes and the color work well together</td>', 'this is a lovely abstract - the "puzzle" shapes and the color work well together', '2004-11-01 18:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(984080, 116340, 10390, '<td valign="top">Outstanding photo, I think you will score some points for the border, but also you will loose them again because of the border.  I would have liked to see it just with a typical border without the two lines in the middle that makes three pictures out of one.  It would have worked better as a whole imo.  I think this will not be disqualified, but some people will propably request a DQ for it, I''m not one of them.  Good luck with this brave attempt that doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Outstanding photo, I think you will score some points for the border, but also you will loose them again because of the border.  I would have liked to see it just with a typical border without the two lines in the middle that makes three pictures out of one.  It would have worked better as a whole imo.  I think this will not be disqualified, but some people will propably request a DQ for it, I''m not one of them.  Good luck with this brave attempt that doesn''t work for me.', '2004-11-01 18:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(984105, 116312, 9780, '<td valign="top">This is just like an adwertise for lifeinsurance..... :) 9</td>', 'This is just like an adwertise for lifeinsurance..... :) 9', '2004-11-01 18:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(984106, 114145, 10390, '<td valign="top">Very nice, it would have improved if you would have cloned out the flare, at least the yellow dot that I find a bit distracting. Outherwise I like this photo very much.</td>', 'Very nice, it would have improved if you would have cloned out the flare, at least the yellow dot that I find a bit distracting. Outherwise I like this photo very much.', '2004-11-01 18:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(984111, 117092, 9780, '<td valign="top">Nice! colores are sureal. You are lucky to live there!</td>', 'Nice! colores are sureal. You are lucky to live there!', '2004-11-01 18:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(984120, 117242, 9780, '<td valign="top">Like the lines in this picture. Lot of lines. Nice collor treatment..... sharpnes could have been tan more.... 9+</td>', 'Like the lines in this picture. Lot of lines. Nice collor treatment..... sharpnes could have been tan more.... 9+', '2004-11-01 19:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(984122, 117253, 10263, '<td valign="top">I like the brides pose. I would like to see a less busy background and some lighting on the couple''s faces.</td>', 'I like the brides pose. I would like to see a less busy background and some lighting on the couple''s faces.', '2004-11-01 19:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(984124, 116816, 10390, '<td valign="top">Great colors, but a composition like this doesn''t work very often.  What I mean is the middle line between the sky and the earth.  In this case I would suggest to let the sky be 2/3 of the photo and then have less of the uninteresting foreground in the frame, you should have pointed the camera a little bit more upwards.  I''m not saying it''s a bad photo, just pointing out what would improve it imho.</td>', 'Great colors, but a composition like this doesn''t work very often.  What I mean is the middle line between the sky and the earth.  In this case I would suggest to let the sky be 2/3 of the photo and then have less of the uninteresting foreground in the frame, you should have pointed the camera a little bit more upwards.  I''m not saying it''s a bad photo, just pointing out what would improve it imho.', '2004-11-01 19:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(984127, 116860, 10263, '<td valign="top">I love the colors of the sky. You really need to straighten up that horizon though. There is a great tutorial on how to do that here on DPC.</td>', 'I love the colors of the sky. You really need to straighten up that horizon though. There is a great tutorial on how to do that here on DPC.', '2004-11-01 19:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(984129, 117286, 9780, '<td valign="top">how long did it take to train here :) Nice macro.... maybe setup could have been diffrend but I knoew how difficult this houseflys can be.... ;)</td>', 'how long did it take to train here :) Nice macro.... maybe setup could have been diffrend but I knoew how difficult this houseflys can be.... ;)', '2004-11-01 19:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
