(984194, 117207, 3575, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, not quite sure what to do with this one. It''s a wonderful image, It would make a great wall hanging but I don''t know where your photography lets off and your PS work begins. Photographic talent or just digital talent.</td>', 'Hmmm, not quite sure what to do with this one. It''s a wonderful image, It would make a great wall hanging but I don''t know where your photography lets off and your PS work begins. Photographic talent or just digital talent.', '2004-11-01 19:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
