(984207, 114560, 1368, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and composition :D very cool!</td>', 'Great lighting and composition :D very cool!', '2004-11-01 19:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(984208, 116579, 1368, '<td valign="top">Amazing mountains and amazing sky!</td>', 'Amazing mountains and amazing sky!', '2004-11-01 19:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(984212, 112366, 3575, '<td valign="top">Now you''re talkin''. Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful!  The bird adds balance to a bottom heavy photo, well done. Although I love this, I would like to see more light on the buildings, just a little, so that I don''t have to strain to see the details. Thanks!</td>', 'Now you''re talkin''. Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful!  The bird adds balance to a bottom heavy photo, well done. Although I love this, I would like to see more light on the buildings, just a little, so that I don''t have to strain to see the details. Thanks!', '2004-11-01 19:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(984218, 117092, 3575, '<td valign="top">OMG. I''ll have to get a print of this. I''m a Norwegian, first gen American and my parents would just love this. The incredible texture in the sky is unbelievable! Thanks for capturing such a breathtaking image and sharing it with us. Love it.</td>', 'OMG. I''ll have to get a print of this. I''m a Norwegian, first gen American and my parents would just love this. The incredible texture in the sky is unbelievable! Thanks for capturing such a breathtaking image and sharing it with us. Love it.', '2004-11-01 19:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(984221, 117079, 26316, '<td valign="top">beautiful?</td>', 'beautiful?', '2004-11-01 19:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(984222, 116285, 15207, '<td valign="top">Great photos like this are going to make it impossible for me to get through all the photos in this challenge without spending countless hours writing feedback. This just takes my breath away. I love the drama here. I love the colours, I love the composition. It''s pitch perfect 10.</td>', 'Great photos like this are going to make it impossible for me to get through all the photos in this challenge without spending countless hours writing feedback. This just takes my breath away. I love the drama here. I love the colours, I love the composition. It''s pitch perfect 10.', '2004-11-01 19:31:16.000000', NULL, 1);
