(984803, 112418, 25464, '<td valign="top">While the colors are amazing.  This one seems a bit overdone.  The shadow across the field leads the eye off the page.</td>', 'While the colors are amazing.  This one seems a bit overdone.  The shadow across the field leads the eye off the page.', '2004-11-01 22:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
