(984806, 114082, 25464, '<td valign="top">Beautiful misty effect.  Maybe a little too much.   This shot seems to be filled with lovely details that are a little lost in the soup.  Still nice. 7.</td>', 'Beautiful misty effect.  Maybe a little too much.   This shot seems to be filled with lovely details that are a little lost in the soup.  Still nice. 7.', '2004-11-01 22:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
