(984869, 115310, 22975, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of the photo and the complexity of the glass.  They work together harmoniously.  :)  9</td>', 'I love the simplicity of the photo and the complexity of the glass.  They work together harmoniously.  :)  9', '2004-11-01 23:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
