(984871, 116408, 22975, '<td valign="top">One of my four highest-scoring portraits.  Lovely skin tones... and the pose is beautiful.  What a lovely photo!!  9</td>', 'One of my four highest-scoring portraits.  Lovely skin tones... and the pose is beautiful.  What a lovely photo!!  9', '2004-11-01 23:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(984874, 116546, 24846, '<td valign="top">Love the crop with each wingtip in a corner, nice color and light...</td>', 'Love the crop with each wingtip in a corner, nice color and light...', '2004-11-01 23:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(984875, 116307, 15511, '<td valign="top">Is this the best you could do?</td>', 'Is this the best you could do?', '2004-11-01 23:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(984876, 117180, 22975, '<td valign="top">9  If you''re not a professional photographer, you need to seriously think about changing careers.  This is an unbelievable portrait.  Oh, remember what I said about a 9?  Well, I lied.  I just changed my  mind.  10.  :)</td>', '9  If you''re not a professional photographer, you need to seriously think about changing careers.  This is an unbelievable portrait.  Oh, remember what I said about a 9?  Well, I lied.  I just changed my  mind.  10.  :)', '2004-11-01 23:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(984878, 113294, 22975, '<td valign="top">Fabulous use of primary colors, leading lines, rule of thirds... you just covered all your bases, didn''t you!  Technically and compositionally a great shot!  Bumping you to an 8.</td>', 'Fabulous use of primary colors, leading lines, rule of thirds... you just covered all your bases, didn''t you!  Technically and compositionally a great shot!  Bumping you to an 8.', '2004-11-01 23:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(984908, 117060, 28841, '<td valign="top">just amazing......</td>', 'just amazing......', '2004-11-01 23:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(984918, 117142, 10419, '<td valign="top">The cobweb is beautiful with the beads of water. The spider looks so huge. I am terrified of spiders, but this photo is amazing.</td>', 'The cobweb is beautiful with the beads of water. The spider looks so huge. I am terrified of spiders, but this photo is amazing.', '2004-11-01 23:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(984920, 116340, 10419, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful photo. I would have voted higher if it were not for the split. I know you were going for artsy look, but here, the photo is so good that it didn''t really needed it.</td>', 'What a beautiful photo. I would have voted higher if it were not for the split. I know you were going for artsy look, but here, the photo is so good that it didn''t really needed it.', '2004-11-01 23:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(984939, 116408, 2373, '<td valign="top">absolutaly great lighting. studio lighting or photoshop editing? Either way she looks awsome. 9 kevin</td>', 'absolutaly great lighting. studio lighting or photoshop editing? Either way she looks awsome. 9 kevin', '2004-11-02 00:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(984940, 116832, 25464, '<td valign="top">too out of focus for a macro of this nature IMO.</td>', 'too out of focus for a macro of this nature IMO.', '2004-11-02 00:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(984941, 117286, 25464, '<td valign="top">A very detailed well focused shot with no appeal.</td>', 'A very detailed well focused shot with no appeal.', '2004-11-02 00:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(984945, 114432, 25464, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this is.</td>', 'Not sure what this is.', '2004-11-02 00:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(984947, 116307, 25464, '<td valign="top">too small.  out of focus.</td>', 'too small.  out of focus.', '2004-11-02 00:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(984952, 117191, 25464, '<td valign="top">The photo should be about a happy occassion but the lighting makes it seem ominous.  The composition is off with the ring going out of frame, and the dead leaf petal are conveying the same feeling described previously.  Keep trying.</td>', 'The photo should be about a happy occassion but the lighting makes it seem ominous.  The composition is off with the ring going out of frame, and the dead leaf petal are conveying the same feeling described previously.  Keep trying.', '2004-11-02 00:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(984953, 116004, 2373, '<td valign="top">when I look at this shot it makes me feel that it was well thouth out. well done. and well timed. The shot is made even better by breaking many of the "rules". I.E. the subject is not in sharp focus yet some other areas are. I could go on and on and give some ideas for small improvement but this is your artwork and it was well donel    9    Kevin</td>', 'when I look at this shot it makes me feel that it was well thouth out. well done. and well timed. The shot is made even better by breaking many of the "rules". I.E. the subject is not in sharp focus yet some other areas are. I could go on and on and give some ideas for small improvement but this is your artwork and it was well donel    9    Kevin', '2004-11-02 00:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(984954, 117091, 25464, '<td valign="top">This seems VERY personal, sad, disturbing, not very appealing.</td>', 'This seems VERY personal, sad, disturbing, not very appealing.', '2004-11-02 00:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(984957, 114851, 25464, '<td valign="top">Too out of focus.  Should talk him into the calendar challenge.  He has the santa thing working.  Keep trying.</td>', 'Too out of focus.  Should talk him into the calendar challenge.  He has the santa thing working.  Keep trying.', '2004-11-02 00:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(984959, 117326, 25464, '<td valign="top">flash is way to harsh.  no appeal.</td>', 'flash is way to harsh.  no appeal.', '2004-11-02 00:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(984960, 115998, 2373, '<td valign="top">very pretty girl nice crisp clear shot. not such and interesting background. to mush distractions taking away from the beutiful modle. 6 kevin</td>', 'very pretty girl nice crisp clear shot. not such and interesting background. to mush distractions taking away from the beutiful modle. 6 kevin', '2004-11-02 00:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(984961, 116386, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is not a largely appealing subject matter.  Framing is interesting.  Lighting is a little dark.  Keep trying.</td>', 'This is not a largely appealing subject matter.  Framing is interesting.  Lighting is a little dark.  Keep trying.', '2004-11-02 00:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
