(985028, 116747, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I love the tone and feel here.  Personally, I feel there''s too much negative space, and capping that off, there seems to be some fench colored poles back there that are distracting.  You might consider later cropping just below the bottom of the one on the right.</td>', 'Great shot.  I love the tone and feel here.  Personally, I feel there''s too much negative space, and capping that off, there seems to be some fench colored poles back there that are distracting.  You might consider later cropping just below the bottom of the one on the right.', '2004-11-02 01:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(985031, 117296, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work -- it has a wonderful painterly quality.  Good composition as well!</td>', 'Beautiful work -- it has a wonderful painterly quality.  Good composition as well!', '2004-11-02 01:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(985033, 115260, 12253, '<td valign="top">Neat subject!  The vignetting here is distracting to me however, as is the dominance of the foreground mushroom which is not the focal point.  I do like the warm tones of the mushrooms in the sweet spot!</td>', 'Neat subject!  The vignetting here is distracting to me however, as is the dominance of the foreground mushroom which is not the focal point.  I do like the warm tones of the mushrooms in the sweet spot!', '2004-11-02 01:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(985038, 112844, 16241, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2004-11-02 01:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(985040, 117128, 24486, '<td valign="top">I can see this with a yellow border around it &amp; the words National Geographic there too. The timing &amp; DOF are just amazing. 10. I just cant fault it.</td>', 'I can see this with a yellow border around it & the words National Geographic there too. The timing & DOF are just amazing. 10. I just cant fault it.', '2004-11-02 01:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(985042, 116124, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice feely photo</td>', 'nice feely photo', '2004-11-02 01:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(985043, 117295, 23560, '<td valign="top">6. It''s a good photo. Focus and capture are good. Overall, though, the subject matter doesn''t call out to me. She seems rather bored, too.</td>', '6. It''s a good photo. Focus and capture are good. Overall, though, the subject matter doesn''t call out to me. She seems rather bored, too.', '2004-11-02 01:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
