(985045, 115114, 23560, '<td valign="top">6. This is a good shot and unique. I like the landscape. But you had a tough choice here. All the empty sky takes away from the pic in my opinion but at the same time i can tell you wanted that flag in frame. Personally, I''d rather see more of the landscape. Nice shot though.</td>', '6. This is a good shot and unique. I like the landscape. But you had a tough choice here. All the empty sky takes away from the pic in my opinion but at the same time i can tell you wanted that flag in frame. Personally, I''d rather see more of the landscape. Nice shot though.', '2004-11-02 01:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(985049, 113711, 22781, '<td valign="top">I still need to learn how to make those nice stars from lights.<br/>I''t realy a centered composition. I think it could be more interesting with something else going on in the shot.<br/>Still nice (6)</td>', 'I still need to learn how to make those nice stars from lights.I''t realy a centered composition. I think it could be more interesting with something else going on in the shot.Still nice (6)', '2004-11-02 01:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(985051, 114930, 16241, '<td valign="top">very unusual</td>', 'very unusual', '2004-11-02 01:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(985052, 117296, 23560, '<td valign="top">6. Right off the bat, the photo looks very noisy. Very, very noisy. I might even suggest NeatImage on this one. But it''s a beautiful pic and almost looks like a painting. Very artsy and I like artsy. Good work. It''s a shame your camera''s noise threw a curveball into the score.</td>', '6. Right off the bat, the photo looks very noisy. Very, very noisy. I might even suggest NeatImage on this one. But it''s a beautiful pic and almost looks like a painting. Very artsy and I like artsy. Good work. It''s a shame your camera''s noise threw a curveball into the score.', '2004-11-02 01:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(985053, 116447, 22781, '<td valign="top">Nice b/w conversion. The only problem I see is that your subject (the moon) is not very clear, would have liked it with a more clear moon in it. Still nice.</td>', 'Nice b/w conversion. The only problem I see is that your subject (the moon) is not very clear, would have liked it with a more clear moon in it. Still nice.', '2004-11-02 01:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(985054, 116340, 24486, '<td valign="top">I love the colour tones in this image &amp; the three panels help make this one of those images that  stand out in the crowd.  A very cool  effect. Good luck with this.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-20 16:29:44.</i></td>', 'I love the colour tones in this image & the three panels help make this one of those images that  stand out in the crowd.  A very cool  effect. Good luck with this.', '2004-11-02 01:40:51.000000', '2004-11-20 16:29:44.000000', 1),
(985057, 115958, 23560, '<td valign="top">8. Fantastic photo! Great composition and the colors are so vivid. Very nice work indced.</td>', '8. Fantastic photo! Great composition and the colors are so vivid. Very nice work indced.', '2004-11-02 01:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(985059, 115420, 22781, '<td valign="top">There''s just a bit to much going on here in this photo for my taste. I mean there is not one subject that takes the attention.</td>', 'There''s just a bit to much going on here in this photo for my taste. I mean there is not one subject that takes the attention.', '2004-11-02 01:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
