(985061, 114431, 22781, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see a bit bigger photo. Now its difficult to see what''s going on.</td>', 'I would have liked to see a bit bigger photo. Now its difficult to see what''s going on.', '2004-11-02 01:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(985063, 111396, 23560, '<td valign="top">4. The image and composition you were shooting for just doesn''t work for me. The blades of grass on the lower left simply distract me from the focus which I believe to be the splash according to the title. Also, putting the splash closer to the rule of 3rds might have helped ease the issue of negative space a bit.</td>', '4. The image and composition you were shooting for just doesn''t work for me. The blades of grass on the lower left simply distract me from the focus which I believe to be the splash according to the title. Also, putting the splash closer to the rule of 3rds might have helped ease the issue of negative space a bit.', '2004-11-02 01:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(985064, 117295, 22781, '<td valign="top">Sweet, but (don''t kill me) I think that this is more of a family picture then a Challenge picture.</td>', 'Sweet, but (don''t kill me) I think that this is more of a family picture then a Challenge picture.', '2004-11-02 01:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(985066, 117108, 22781, '<td valign="top">Nice, never seen geese like that.<br/>Composition could be better I guess</td>', 'Nice, never seen geese like that.Composition could be better I guess', '2004-11-02 01:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(985069, 115130, 23560, '<td valign="top">I''m normally annoyed at bugs n flowers. There''s soooo many entries like that and it''s a big risk of being cliche. But this image does a great job. I can easily see this being published professionally. Colors, composition, bg and overall focus are on point. 8.</td>', 'I''m normally annoyed at bugs n flowers. There''s soooo many entries like that and it''s a big risk of being cliche. But this image does a great job. I can easily see this being published professionally. Colors, composition, bg and overall focus are on point. 8.', '2004-11-02 01:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(985070, 112988, 23560, '<td valign="top">Well shot. I would personally rather see more of the water than the sky. But I''m a water lover so go figure. Nice capture. 7.</td>', 'Well shot. I would personally rather see more of the water than the sky. But I''m a water lover so go figure. Nice capture. 7.', '2004-11-02 01:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(985071, 117315, 16241, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2004-11-02 01:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(985073, 114933, 16241, '<td valign="top">this is spunky, funky and fun!</td>', 'this is spunky, funky and fun!', '2004-11-02 01:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(985075, 117202, 23560, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but  I feel the subject matter is a tad dull. Maybe next time you can poke it in the eye and run while snappin'' pics :) Just kidding. Good focus and exposure. 5.</td>', 'Sorry, but  I feel the subject matter is a tad dull. Maybe next time you can poke it in the eye and run while snappin'' pics :) Just kidding. Good focus and exposure. 5.', '2004-11-02 01:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(985078, 113079, 23560, '<td valign="top">This was clearly a difficult shot to get. Good job on getting it in focus and in such fine detail. 7.</td>', 'This was clearly a difficult shot to get. Good job on getting it in focus and in such fine detail. 7.', '2004-11-02 01:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(985079, 117010, 22781, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, nice composition, nice make-up<br/>How did you do that with the smoke</td>', 'Nice idea, nice composition, nice make-upHow did you do that with the smoke', '2004-11-02 01:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(985080, 115514, 23560, '<td valign="top">This is a great pic. It''s a bit top-heavy in terms of composition but that''s ok. Colors are vivid and focus is great. 7.</td>', 'This is a great pic. It''s a bit top-heavy in terms of composition but that''s ok. Colors are vivid and focus is great. 7.', '2004-11-02 01:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(985081, 116751, 23560, '<td valign="top">Oh man...these little guys leave "surprises" in every corner of your house!  The photo is fun and the execution is great. A solid 7.</td>', 'Oh man...these little guys leave "surprises" in every corner of your house!  The photo is fun and the execution is great. A solid 7.', '2004-11-02 01:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(985082, 116428, 23560, '<td valign="top">First things first. Your horizon is not level. A leveled horizon helps "solidify" the pic. Next is the issue of composition. You have an extremely busy left side and a plain right side. Sometimes you can pull this off with strong negative space but I don''t feel it works too well in this one because the negative space is very busy, or rather, choppy. I really like what''s going on at the pier. I wish I could see more detail on the wet dock, etc. Focus and exposure are good. 5.</td>', 'First things first. Your horizon is not level. A leveled horizon helps "solidify" the pic. Next is the issue of composition. You have an extremely busy left side and a plain right side. Sometimes you can pull this off with strong negative space but I don''t feel it works too well in this one because the negative space is very busy, or rather, choppy. I really like what''s going on at the pier. I wish I could see more detail on the wet dock, etc. Focus and exposure are good. 5.', '2004-11-02 01:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(985084, 116860, 23560, '<td valign="top">I tend to really like pensive lonely shots like this. And this is superb. Focus, colors and overall mood are there. My only concern is the fishing rod. When my eyes follow it, it leads me right off the photo instead of ''into'' it. Also, the fact he''s facing something off-photo kinda throws me off. That aside, it''s a solid 7 for now. Had he been on the right I could safely guess an 8.</td>', 'I tend to really like pensive lonely shots like this. And this is superb. Focus, colors and overall mood are there. My only concern is the fishing rod. When my eyes follow it, it leads me right off the photo instead of ''into'' it. Also, the fact he''s facing something off-photo kinda throws me off. That aside, it''s a solid 7 for now. Had he been on the right I could safely guess an 8.', '2004-11-02 01:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(985087, 117142, 23560, '<td valign="top">Difficult exposure shot indeed. You have some blown out whites on the lower right and a dark space on the left. The subject is nice and in-focus but that white spot is really distracting. 6.</td>', 'Difficult exposure shot indeed. You have some blown out whites on the lower right and a dark space on the left. The subject is nice and in-focus but that white spot is really distracting. 6.', '2004-11-02 02:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(985089, 116426, 23560, '<td valign="top">I like it! B&amp;W treatment is superb and the subject catches my eye. Sharpening a bit more may help. 7.</td>', 'I like it! B&W treatment is superb and the subject catches my eye. Sharpening a bit more may help. 7.', '2004-11-02 02:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(985090, 109315, 27593, '<td valign="top">I love this</td>', 'I love this', '2004-11-02 02:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(985091, 117069, 23560, '<td valign="top">Ok, I''m confused. Is this real or a plastic model? The guy looks very plastic and fake as does the plane. Regardless, it''s a great pic. 7.</td>', 'Ok, I''m confused. Is this real or a plastic model? The guy looks very plastic and fake as does the plane. Regardless, it''s a great pic. 7.', '2004-11-02 02:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(985093, 117109, 23560, '<td valign="top">Ok, this is a fine photo. The faded colors also work and I appreciate where you''re going with it. Here''s my concern. Judging by the title it seems the focus is the rose BUT that white area in the upper right is really confusing me. I can''t tell that it is. And the fact I can''t tell what it is only makes me look at it longer. This, in turn, detracts from the rose. Make sense? And the lower right looks almost like a sky. Which further confuses me because it looks like a studio shot. Anyways, it''s a nice shot just a tad confusing. 6.</td>', 'Ok, this is a fine photo. The faded colors also work and I appreciate where you''re going with it. Here''s my concern. Judging by the title it seems the focus is the rose BUT that white area in the upper right is really confusing me. I can''t tell that it is. And the fact I can''t tell what it is only makes me look at it longer. This, in turn, detracts from the rose. Make sense? And the lower right looks almost like a sky. Which further confuses me because it looks like a studio shot. Anyways, it''s a nice shot just a tad confusing. 6.', '2004-11-02 02:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(985094, 110961, 23560, '<td valign="top">Great exposure and moment. I''m not too hot about the wood but these animals are testy and any good pic you can get is worth it. 6.</td>', 'Great exposure and moment. I''m not too hot about the wood but these animals are testy and any good pic you can get is worth it. 6.', '2004-11-02 02:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(985095, 116926, 22781, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this more without the boats and the shed (just my opinion)</td>', 'I would have liked this more without the boats and the shed (just my opinion)', '2004-11-02 02:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(985096, 115911, 23560, '<td valign="top">Nice studio shot. I''m seeing some strong green tones though. Not sure if it''s my monitor or the pic. You may want to test it out on another monitor to be sure. As for the subject, good expression, great teeth :) and wonderful focus. Way to go. 7.</td>', 'Nice studio shot. I''m seeing some strong green tones though. Not sure if it''s my monitor or the pic. You may want to test it out on another monitor to be sure. As for the subject, good expression, great teeth :) and wonderful focus. Way to go. 7.', '2004-11-02 02:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(985097, 114775, 23560, '<td valign="top">A nice photo. Not exactly a jaw-dropper but well composed and cropped. A solid 6.</td>', 'A nice photo. Not exactly a jaw-dropper but well composed and cropped. A solid 6.', '2004-11-02 02:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(985098, 116384, 10867, '<td valign="top">This image has a lot of charm, but quite a bit of the child''s face is overly hot--probably because of the use of flash.</td>', 'This image has a lot of charm, but quite a bit of the child''s face is overly hot--probably because of the use of flash.', '2004-11-02 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(985099, 111963, 23560, '<td valign="top">This is a superb shot. Subject is leading into the frame, focus is hot and composition is strong. I especially like the way the subject almost blends into the wood. Nice touch. 8.</td>', 'This is a superb shot. Subject is leading into the frame, focus is hot and composition is strong. I especially like the way the subject almost blends into the wood. Nice touch. 8.', '2004-11-02 02:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(985100, 116878, 23560, '<td valign="top">The subject matter is a tad boring. It''s dead center and not holding my attention. The focus is grea though as are the colors. 5.</td>', 'The subject matter is a tad boring. It''s dead center and not holding my attention. The focus is grea though as are the colors. 5.', '2004-11-02 02:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(985101, 116887, 10867, '<td valign="top">I know that it was probably unavoidable, but the background is distractingly busy.</td>', 'I know that it was probably unavoidable, but the background is distractingly busy.', '2004-11-02 02:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(985102, 117196, 23560, '<td valign="top">The candle light seems a bit blown out. I almost need to squint to look right at it. I would recommend shooting faster at a higher ISO or dropping the exposure a tad. I like where you were going though. 5.</td>', 'The candle light seems a bit blown out. I almost need to squint to look right at it. I would recommend shooting faster at a higher ISO or dropping the exposure a tad. I like where you were going though. 5.', '2004-11-02 02:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(985104, 111476, 10867, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image.  Unfortunately, it needs to be rotated just a little bit CCW to straighten the verticals.</td>', 'Very interesting image.  Unfortunately, it needs to be rotated just a little bit CCW to straighten the verticals.', '2004-11-02 02:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(985105, 117198, 23560, '<td valign="top">I''d rather see an artsy inverted pic like this anytime over a boring dead-on statue pic. Good work. 6.</td>', 'I''d rather see an artsy inverted pic like this anytime over a boring dead-on statue pic. Good work. 6.', '2004-11-02 02:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(985107, 116632, 23560, '<td valign="top">The image seems a little blown out on the lower right. The camera may have been fooled by that bright light. It''s an interesting pic though. Nice road for sure. 5.</td>', 'The image seems a little blown out on the lower right. The camera may have been fooled by that bright light. It''s an interesting pic though. Nice road for sure. 5.', '2004-11-02 02:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(985108, 115678, 23560, '<td valign="top">Superb. Colors are on point, the mountains in the background are on point and focus is a winner throughout. I''m really glad you shot at a high aperture. I would hate to lose those mountains. A solid 8.</td>', 'Superb. Colors are on point, the mountains in the background are on point and focus is a winner throughout. I''m really glad you shot at a high aperture. I would hate to lose those mountains. A solid 8.', '2004-11-02 02:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(985109, 115126, 23560, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. But the leaves seem either over-sharpened or over-saturated. 6.</td>', 'I like the idea. But the leaves seem either over-sharpened or over-saturated. 6.', '2004-11-02 02:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(985110, 114755, 23560, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. Definitely unique. I''m glad I didn''t take this photo. I''d have a hell of a tough time figuring out the proper crop. There''s just so many possibilities. Kudos on a job well done. 7.</td>', 'This is a great shot. Definitely unique. I''m glad I didn''t take this photo. I''d have a hell of a tough time figuring out the proper crop. There''s just so many possibilities. Kudos on a job well done. 7.', '2004-11-02 02:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(985111, 115949, 23560, '<td valign="top">Great tree and sky. Colors are phenomenal. If only there wasn''t a house back there to make it feel so snapshot-ish. If it was just the tree and sky, I''d say a solid 8. With the house and background though, it''s more of a 6. I think you can study more angles and ideas by crawling into that tree and getting funky. Lots of potential here.</td>', 'Great tree and sky. Colors are phenomenal. If only there wasn''t a house back there to make it feel so snapshot-ish. If it was just the tree and sky, I''d say a solid 8. With the house and background though, it''s more of a 6. I think you can study more angles and ideas by crawling into that tree and getting funky. Lots of potential here.', '2004-11-02 02:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(985112, 109241, 23560, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and classic studio shot. and the frame is ok. 8.</td>', 'Beautiful and classic studio shot. and the frame is ok. 8.', '2004-11-02 02:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(985113, 115251, 23560, '<td valign="top">Ok, here''s the deal. This was a priceless moment, but your camera screwed up. It overexposed and completely blew out the sky in the upper right. If you had a neutral gradient filter, you could have avoided this. On the bright side, the shot has class and potential and  focus is on point. It''s just those blown out highllights that hurt. Good attempt. 5</td>', 'Ok, here''s the deal. This was a priceless moment, but your camera screwed up. It overexposed and completely blew out the sky in the upper right. If you had a neutral gradient filter, you could have avoided this. On the bright side, the shot has class and potential and  focus is on point. It''s just those blown out highllights that hurt. Good attempt. 5', '2004-11-02 02:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(985114, 112493, 23560, '<td valign="top">You have a really good photo here. As if the color wasn''t enought, all the lines (the floor and door) all converge on this precious girl and her expression. Way to go. 9.</td>', 'You have a really good photo here. As if the color wasn''t enought, all the lines (the floor and door) all converge on this precious girl and her expression. Way to go. 9.', '2004-11-02 02:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(985115, 112061, 23560, '<td valign="top">You did everything within your power to capture the best photo possible. Focus is strong, colors are nice. The clouds, though, distract me a bit. Not much you can do about that though. If there''s ever a storm, run out there again. You''ll probably catch some phenomenal landscape action. 6.</td>', 'You did everything within your power to capture the best photo possible. Focus is strong, colors are nice. The clouds, though, distract me a bit. Not much you can do about that though. If there''s ever a storm, run out there again. You''ll probably catch some phenomenal landscape action. 6.', '2004-11-02 02:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(985116, 117282, 23560, '<td valign="top">Those whites are wayyy too white. I''m having a hard time looking at this image without squiting. Good composition and focus though. I also like the accents the leaves provide. 6.</td>', 'Those whites are wayyy too white. I''m having a hard time looking at this image without squiting. Good composition and focus though. I also like the accents the leaves provide. 6.', '2004-11-02 02:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(985117, 116933, 23560, '<td valign="top">Love the pic, hate the fact there''s a political message. I''m going to pretend that poster isn''t there. That being said, you got a great pic. I think there''s a bit too much grass in the foreground. Focus is sharp and colors are sweet. 6.</td>', 'Love the pic, hate the fact there''s a political message. I''m going to pretend that poster isn''t there. That being said, you got a great pic. I think there''s a bit too much grass in the foreground. Focus is sharp and colors are sweet. 6.', '2004-11-02 02:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(985120, 116960, 23560, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft and cropping the left side would help. 5.</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft and cropping the left side would help. 5.', '2004-11-02 02:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(985121, 113564, 23560, '<td valign="top">Nice sky and colors. 5</td>', 'Nice sky and colors. 5', '2004-11-02 02:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(985123, 116016, 23560, '<td valign="top">Excellent everything. There isn''t anything to recommend. Looks great :) 8.</td>', 'Excellent everything. There isn''t anything to recommend. Looks great :) 8.', '2004-11-02 02:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(985132, 116625, 23560, '<td valign="top">Great night exposure. The horizon doesn''t seem level though. It seems a bit high on the right. My only real concern is that the image is a bit busier on the left compared to the right. More lights n such. 7.</td>', 'Great night exposure. The horizon doesn''t seem level though. It seems a bit high on the right. My only real concern is that the image is a bit busier on the left compared to the right. More lights n such. 7.', '2004-11-02 02:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(985136, 117128, 23560, '<td valign="top">This was a tough shot. I can tell by that perfect focus and powerful bokeh. 8.</td>', 'This was a tough shot. I can tell by that perfect focus and powerful bokeh. 8.', '2004-11-02 02:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(985137, 109340, 23560, '<td valign="top">Love it. Not much more to say.  I don''t think the border was necessary. It''s a strong enough composition to carry itself. 7.</td>', 'Love it. Not much more to say.  I don''t think the border was necessary. It''s a strong enough composition to carry itself. 7.', '2004-11-02 02:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(985139, 113480, 23560, '<td valign="top">What a striking photograph. I absolutely love the composition and simplicity of it. 9.</td>', 'What a striking photograph. I absolutely love the composition and simplicity of it. 9.', '2004-11-02 02:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(985141, 116791, 23560, '<td valign="top">I honestly don''t think studio portraits get any better than this. I really hope you''re doing this for a living. 9.</td>', 'I honestly don''t think studio portraits get any better than this. I really hope you''re doing this for a living. 9.', '2004-11-02 02:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(985142, 113838, 23560, '<td valign="top">I really like this studio shot. The only thing that bugs me a bit is the front shadow on the pumpkin. I think a different llighting angle could have produced some crazy detail and form. Nice work. 7.</td>', 'I really like this studio shot. The only thing that bugs me a bit is the front shadow on the pumpkin. I think a different llighting angle could have produced some crazy detail and form. Nice work. 7.', '2004-11-02 02:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(985144, 114806, 23560, '<td valign="top">Man...this is art, not photography. Absolutely brilliant work. I can''t even recommend any upgrades or tips. This is hot! WOW! 9.</td>', 'Man...this is art, not photography. Absolutely brilliant work. I can''t even recommend any upgrades or tips. This is hot! WOW! 9.', '2004-11-02 02:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(985145, 116938, 22781, '<td valign="top">The sky is quite bland. Well composed otherwise and they are lovely windmills.</td>', 'The sky is quite bland. Well composed otherwise and they are lovely windmills.', '2004-11-02 02:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(985146, 111308, 23560, '<td valign="top">The only thing that bugs me is the title. The photo itself is beautiful. The expression says a lot more than "lazy monkey". It says "why can''t i climb a real tree?" The fact this makes me actually feel something is testament to a great photo. Congrats. 7</td>', 'The only thing that bugs me is the title. The photo itself is beautiful. The expression says a lot more than "lazy monkey". It says "why can''t i climb a real tree?" The fact this makes me actually feel something is testament to a great photo. Congrats. 7', '2004-11-02 03:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
