(985174, 116426, 22781, '<td valign="top">Great b/w conversion. I need to master that...</td>', 'Great b/w conversion. I need to master that...', '2004-11-02 03:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(985176, 117328, 22781, '<td valign="top">Whooo I chased butterflies in the summer and lost 5 kilo''s. Still didn''t get anything near to this! Great.</td>', 'Whooo I chased butterflies in the summer and lost 5 kilo''s. Still didn''t get anything near to this! Great.', '2004-11-02 03:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(985178, 115724, 23560, '<td valign="top">this is cool, strange and well, cool again at the same time. looking at this is kinda like looking at clouds. i see a face and all kinds of other objects. A great idea, execution and use of color. 8.</td>', 'this is cool, strange and well, cool again at the same time. looking at this is kinda like looking at clouds. i see a face and all kinds of other objects. A great idea, execution and use of color. 8.', '2004-11-02 03:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(985179, 115482, 22781, '<td valign="top">This is a real pearl! almost looks unreal. Great color!</td>', 'This is a real pearl! almost looks unreal. Great color!', '2004-11-02 03:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(985180, 116625, 22781, '<td valign="top">Cant tell you anything bad about this, so I wont.<br/>Like it!</td>', 'Cant tell you anything bad about this, so I wont.Like it!', '2004-11-02 03:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(985183, 116455, 23560, '<td valign="top">You''ve got yourself a winner here. I love the splashing of the water more than any other single element. The focus left me with a papercut :) ouch! 9.</td>', 'You''ve got yourself a winner here. I love the splashing of the water more than any other single element. The focus left me with a papercut :) ouch! 9.', '2004-11-02 03:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(985185, 116832, 26023, '<td valign="top">Great subject. Just a little out of focus tho</td>', 'Great subject. Just a little out of focus tho', '2004-11-02 03:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(985186, 116605, 23560, '<td valign="top">The lines in this image are all converging like a huge V right into, well, nothing. It''s a nice photo but compositionally challenged. 6</td>', 'The lines in this image are all converging like a huge V right into, well, nothing. It''s a nice photo but compositionally challenged. 6', '2004-11-02 03:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(985187, 113172, 26023, '<td valign="top">beautiful picture!!</td>', 'beautiful picture!!', '2004-11-02 03:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(985189, 112382, 22781, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, maybe could have done with just a little bit more light. still a 7</td>', 'Great portrait, maybe could have done with just a little bit more light. still a 7', '2004-11-02 03:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(985190, 115797, 26023, '<td valign="top">Great capture here. Feels like I can reach out and touch the subject</td>', 'Great capture here. Feels like I can reach out and touch the subject', '2004-11-02 03:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(985193, 113173, 23560, '<td valign="top">Very intelligent use of the triangle in your composition. I''m torn between liking and hating this image. It''s simple...but is it too simple? Hmmm. The sky is nice, but would a nice sunset help? I''m not sure. As is, it''s a solid 6 in my book. A bit more saturation on the green might help. Nice exposure btw.</td>', 'Very intelligent use of the triangle in your composition. I''m torn between liking and hating this image. It''s simple...but is it too simple? Hmmm. The sky is nice, but would a nice sunset help? I''m not sure. As is, it''s a solid 6 in my book. A bit more saturation on the green might help. Nice exposure btw.', '2004-11-02 03:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(985194, 111396, 26023, '<td valign="top">Im not understanding this pic. I hope after the challenge you can tell me what it is.</td>', 'Im not understanding this pic. I hope after the challenge you can tell me what it is.', '2004-11-02 03:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(985195, 117051, 23560, '<td valign="top">I feel like the tree just clobbered my view. It''s like stepping out onto a pristine balcony with an awesome oceanview *but* there''s a telephone pole right in front of ya. I''m definitely not feeling the composition here though the colors are rather lovely. 5.</td>', 'I feel like the tree just clobbered my view. It''s like stepping out onto a pristine balcony with an awesome oceanview *but* there''s a telephone pole right in front of ya. I''m definitely not feeling the composition here though the colors are rather lovely. 5.', '2004-11-02 03:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(985196, 116740, 26023, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower. Don''t see how you could improve on it, but it just doesn''t catch my eye</td>', 'Beautiful flower. Don''t see how you could improve on it, but it just doesn''t catch my eye', '2004-11-02 03:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(985198, 112366, 23560, '<td valign="top">This is brilliant. This can easily pass as a book cover or poster. I mean a *real* poster. Simply beautiful and the use of a duotone color is great. The contrasty feel is so appropriate. Way to go! 8.</td>', 'This is brilliant. This can easily pass as a book cover or poster. I mean a *real* poster. Simply beautiful and the use of a duotone color is great. The contrasty feel is so appropriate. Way to go! 8.', '2004-11-02 03:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(985199, 116655, 26023, '<td valign="top">Excellent Photo!! I rate this as one of the top pics in the challenge</td>', 'Excellent Photo!! I rate this as one of the top pics in the challenge', '2004-11-02 03:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(985201, 110958, 26023, '<td valign="top">Love the antique feel of this photo  excellent choice!</td>', 'Love the antique feel of this photo  excellent choice!', '2004-11-02 03:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(985202, 112103, 23560, '<td valign="top">You clearly thought this photo through before taking the pic. You''re aware of composition and placement. The shot came out fantastic, btw. My only concern is that the photo doesn''t have much color except for the limited fungus here and there. As a result, I feel it may look a tad better in B&amp;W. That''s about it. Everything else is on point. 8.</td>', 'You clearly thought this photo through before taking the pic. You''re aware of composition and placement. The shot came out fantastic, btw. My only concern is that the photo doesn''t have much color except for the limited fungus here and there. As a result, I feel it may look a tad better in B&W. That''s about it. Everything else is on point. 8.', '2004-11-02 03:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(985203, 113615, 26023, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. great choice!</td>', 'Beautiful colors. great choice!', '2004-11-02 03:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(985205, 116407, 23560, '<td valign="top">This is a great pic, but not a very flattering portrait ;) Why? Well, the guy seems a bit nervous with the gun...almost a bit insecure. Frankly, if he was pointing that gun at me, I''d be more worried for you :) But in all seriousness, you were able to capture an awkward and rare moment. That''s a good thing in photography :) Keep it up. 7.</td>', 'This is a great pic, but not a very flattering portrait ;) Why? Well, the guy seems a bit nervous with the gun...almost a bit insecure. Frankly, if he was pointing that gun at me, I''d be more worried for you :) But in all seriousness, you were able to capture an awkward and rare moment. That''s a good thing in photography :) Keep it up. 7.', '2004-11-02 03:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(985206, 117303, 23560, '<td valign="top">I like this. Looks like a big question mark. ;) 6.</td>', 'I like this. Looks like a big question mark. ;) 6.', '2004-11-02 03:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(985208, 111806, 23560, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I''m picking up on some ''shy vibes'' here though. Anyways, the shot and focus is good. I wouldn''t mind seeing more shadows, though. It seems very mid-toned and a tad flat throughout. 6.</td>', 'Great shot. I''m picking up on some ''shy vibes'' here though. Anyways, the shot and focus is good. I wouldn''t mind seeing more shadows, though. It seems very mid-toned and a tad flat throughout. 6.', '2004-11-02 03:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(985209, 113523, 23560, '<td valign="top">Great shot but whats going on with the upper hand? Why is it so smooth compared to the rest of this rough image? That alone is very distracting though the pic and lighting is great. 7.</td>', 'Great shot but whats going on with the upper hand? Why is it so smooth compared to the rest of this rough image? That alone is very distracting though the pic and lighting is great. 7.', '2004-11-02 03:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(985211, 116590, 23560, '<td valign="top">Ok, this is a wonderful shot! Especially if it really is Hawaii. My only concern is related to cropping. I would like to see a crop that begins at the left black tire and cuts right before the rocks on the right. This will push the image into portrait mode and really push the viewers eye into the center where focus should be. Right now, there''s too many elements that are distracting me. Great pic though and aloha! 7.</td>', 'Ok, this is a wonderful shot! Especially if it really is Hawaii. My only concern is related to cropping. I would like to see a crop that begins at the left black tire and cuts right before the rocks on the right. This will push the image into portrait mode and really push the viewers eye into the center where focus should be. Right now, there''s too many elements that are distracting me. Great pic though and aloha! 7.', '2004-11-02 03:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(985212, 110365, 23560, '<td valign="top">Masterful pose and idea. The idea seems a bit soft, but they may have very well been done on purpose considering the nature of the shoot (wedding). Great work! I''d love to see more of this gallery. 8.</td>', 'Masterful pose and idea. The idea seems a bit soft, but they may have very well been done on purpose considering the nature of the shoot (wedding). Great work! I''d love to see more of this gallery. 8.', '2004-11-02 03:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(985213, 115507, 23560, '<td valign="top">Unlike some of the other children''s photos in this challenge, this one reallly calls out to me. The expression is priceless. Only one thing. I recently learned that focus should always be placed on the eye closest to the lens. But then again, this works too. Just a thought. 7.</td>', 'Unlike some of the other children''s photos in this challenge, this one reallly calls out to me. The expression is priceless. Only one thing. I recently learned that focus should always be placed on the eye closest to the lens. But then again, this works too. Just a thought. 7.', '2004-11-02 03:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(985214, 110958, 23560, '<td valign="top">That foreground tire is killing me. You can easily capture the entire mood without it in my opinion. I like the sepia tone and the roughness to the image. 6.</td>', 'That foreground tire is killing me. You can easily capture the entire mood without it in my opinion. I like the sepia tone and the roughness to the image. 6.', '2004-11-02 03:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(985215, 116004, 23560, '<td valign="top">One of the golden rules of photography says your subject should always move into the image. Here he is clearly pushing my eye right off the frame. Yes, rules were meant to be broken, but here I just can''t justify it. I feel a landscape mode shot with his feet included would line everything up a whole lot better and make the image more ''complete''. 5.</td>', 'One of the golden rules of photography says your subject should always move into the image. Here he is clearly pushing my eye right off the frame. Yes, rules were meant to be broken, but here I just can''t justify it. I feel a landscape mode shot with his feet included would line everything up a whole lot better and make the image more ''complete''. 5.', '2004-11-02 03:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(985217, 112471, 23560, '<td valign="top">Wow, this shot is worthy of praise. It was especially interesting because the image loaded from top to bottom slowly and the eyes just jumped out at me. Great idea and execution. 7.</td>', 'Wow, this shot is worthy of praise. It was especially interesting because the image loaded from top to bottom slowly and the eyes just jumped out at me. Great idea and execution. 7.', '2004-11-02 03:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(985220, 116312, 23560, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait shot.Truly crisp and your use of available light was masterful. Poses are natural and flowing well. My only concern lies in the cropping of the hands. I think a crop at the mid-forearm may help. 7.</td>', 'Excellent portrait shot.Truly crisp and your use of available light was masterful. Poses are natural and flowing well. My only concern lies in the cropping of the hands. I think a crop at the mid-forearm may help. 7.', '2004-11-02 03:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(985224, 114428, 23560, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape and capture but, it is a bit dull to look at. A early morning or late evening shot could easily remedy that. 6.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape and capture but, it is a bit dull to look at. A early morning or late evening shot could easily remedy that. 6.', '2004-11-02 04:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(985225, 112948, 16970, '<td valign="top">Great shot.....  Maybe you should have been closer to the table though ;)  Great shot.  I wish I was there looks like a great scene. (10)</td>', 'Great shot.....  Maybe you should have been closer to the table though ;)  Great shot.  I wish I was there looks like a great scene. (10)', '2004-11-02 04:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(985232, 114687, 20608, '<td valign="top">not an easy one to catch... well done</td>', 'not an easy one to catch... well done', '2004-11-02 04:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
