(985251, 116605, 20608, '<td valign="top">looks dark, could be my monitor through.</td>', 'looks dark, could be my monitor through.', '2004-11-02 04:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(985252, 117288, 16266, '<td valign="top">very intense.. and am curious if you burned the background to isolated the couger.. it looks a little bit that way.. since there are three light spots in the background that happen to be the exact same distance from the couger.. meaning you used a brush of some sort.. anyhow.. despite the isolation that could have been done better, there is great tones in the couger and great detail.  nice image.</td>', 'very intense.. and am curious if you burned the background to isolated the couger.. it looks a little bit that way.. since there are three light spots in the background that happen to be the exact same distance from the couger.. meaning you used a brush of some sort.. anyhow.. despite the isolation that could have been done better, there is great tones in the couger and great detail.  nice image.', '2004-11-02 04:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(985253, 112418, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice color and sharpenss... nice placement of the horizon as well.</td>', 'nice color and sharpenss... nice placement of the horizon as well.', '2004-11-02 04:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(985254, 115490, 20608, '<td valign="top">nice colour and a mean looking bug... is it you i wonder (the bug specialist)</td>', 'nice colour and a mean looking bug... is it you i wonder (the bug specialist)', '2004-11-02 04:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(985255, 116338, 16266, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  Perhaps a little too busy with the couds.. but perhaps they reflect the mountains and dunes.. .. there are a lot of layers.. but i think perhaps 1 too many...  nice image though</td>', 'Interesting image.  Perhaps a little too busy with the couds.. but perhaps they reflect the mountains and dunes.. .. there are a lot of layers.. but i think perhaps 1 too many...  nice image though', '2004-11-02 04:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(985256, 117079, 20608, '<td valign="top">nice portrait of a pretty lady</td>', 'nice portrait of a pretty lady', '2004-11-02 04:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(985257, 115976, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice contrast and i really like the windows in the background.  i think they make this image work really well.  I am confused about what the object in the middle bottom part of the image is... whatever it is, it is obviously not too important to the image (since the viewer is unclear as to what it is... perhaps an arm though).. I think it is a bit too bright there... or too much light is reflected off of it, compared to the very subtle face and window.  otherwise nice image.</td>', 'nice contrast and i really like the windows in the background.  i think they make this image work really well.  I am confused about what the object in the middle bottom part of the image is... whatever it is, it is obviously not too important to the image (since the viewer is unclear as to what it is... perhaps an arm though).. I think it is a bit too bright there... or too much light is reflected off of it, compared to the very subtle face and window.  otherwise nice image.', '2004-11-02 04:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(985259, 117209, 16266, '<td valign="top">well..... interesting.. i''ll give you that.  it makes me think of a peacok... i think the cropping on the chin is a little tight.  nice expression thought.. perhaps a little softer  lighting would have been good.</td>', 'well..... interesting.. i''ll give you that.  it makes me think of a peacok... i think the cropping on the chin is a little tight.  nice expression thought.. perhaps a little softer  lighting would have been good.', '2004-11-02 04:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(985261, 117103, 20608, '<td valign="top">Birds of prey always look so menacing, wonderfull capture and sharpness</td>', 'Birds of prey always look so menacing, wonderfull capture and sharpness', '2004-11-02 04:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(985262, 111701, 16266, '<td valign="top">nice macro... bugs seem to have such great expressions sometimes.</td>', 'nice macro... bugs seem to have such great expressions sometimes.', '2004-11-02 04:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(985263, 116814, 16266, '<td valign="top">This looks like a picture from a 1980''s calender.. with really strong yellows and oranges.  hmm yeah.. nice scenic...</td>', 'This looks like a picture from a 1980''s calender.. with really strong yellows and oranges.  hmm yeah.. nice scenic...', '2004-11-02 04:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(985265, 115846, 16266, '<td valign="top">well... after just parusing through heida''s portfolio... i would guess that this is another one of hers, or someone inspired by her.... in any case... yeah.. strong image.  I really like the wheat, and the large space given to the sky in the image.</td>', 'well... after just parusing through heida''s portfolio... i would guess that this is another one of hers, or someone inspired by her.... in any case... yeah.. strong image.  I really like the wheat, and the large space given to the sky in the image.', '2004-11-02 04:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(985266, 114432, 20608, '<td valign="top">interesting idea but i think voters wont get the message, i could be wrong. the date being on the pic really screws it up too. I just think about the day i left home and got on the train to the city and was just staring from the window it looked like this but as a photo for an Oct study i think you could of done better. good luck anyway</td>', 'interesting idea but i think voters wont get the message, i could be wrong. the date being on the pic really screws it up too. I just think about the day i left home and got on the train to the city and was just staring from the window it looked like this but as a photo for an Oct study i think you could of done better. good luck anyway', '2004-11-02 04:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(985267, 117210, 20608, '<td valign="top">this has some pull i like it</td>', 'this has some pull i like it', '2004-11-02 04:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(985268, 117286, 20608, '<td valign="top">you must have a damn good macro for this shot and im sure the fly is a gonna too. great focus, colour, so far this is my choice for gold...its in the fly you see.</td>', 'you must have a damn good macro for this shot and im sure the fly is a gonna too. great focus, colour, so far this is my choice for gold...its in the fly you see.', '2004-11-02 04:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
