(985383, 109227, 2553, '<td valign="top">Oh, I love the color, it''s beautiful, and I really like the silhouette look.  I''m not entirely crazy about the nearly dead center composition, and I also feel like the ballon needs a little "breathing room" at the top.  Overall, a nice shot though.</td>', 'Oh, I love the color, it''s beautiful, and I really like the silhouette look.  I''m not entirely crazy about the nearly dead center composition, and I also feel like the ballon needs a little "breathing room" at the top.  Overall, a nice shot though.', '2004-11-02 06:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(985393, 114933, 2553, '<td valign="top">I originally scored this an 8, but am back to look at it again, and am upping it to a 9.  I just love the look of this.  The duotone suits it quite well, as does the  high-key look, and, amazingly, it manages to convey BOTH the feel of an old-fashioned photograph AND that of a modern photograph.  What the heck, might as well make it a 10, the more I look at it, the more I like it.  Stunning model BTW.</td>', 'I originally scored this an 8, but am back to look at it again, and am upping it to a 9.  I just love the look of this.  The duotone suits it quite well, as does the  high-key look, and, amazingly, it manages to convey BOTH the feel of an old-fashioned photograph AND that of a modern photograph.  What the heck, might as well make it a 10, the more I look at it, the more I like it.  Stunning model BTW.', '2004-11-02 06:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(985396, 110365, 2553, '<td valign="top">A stunning and unusual bridal study.  B&amp;W is perfect for it, especially considering the complexity of the ornate doors (or window).  Beautifully done!</td>', 'A stunning and unusual bridal study.  B&W is perfect for it, especially considering the complexity of the ornate doors (or window).  Beautifully done!', '2004-11-02 06:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(985397, 117236, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent capture of a nice subject. I think the shot would look better with a bit more contrast and/or saturation, but it still looks good as it is. Nice job.</td>', 'This is an excellent capture of a nice subject. I think the shot would look better with a bit more contrast and/or saturation, but it still looks good as it is. Nice job.', '2004-11-02 07:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(985398, 116190, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  Love the color and the composition.  This will be a welcome addition to my foggy favorites.</td>', 'Wonderful!  Love the color and the composition.  This will be a welcome addition to my foggy favorites.', '2004-11-02 07:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(985402, 117295, 24128, '<td valign="top">nice picture, great expression but in my opinion it seems to be missing something - perhaps it would be better with a telephone pole somewhere in the upper-right area of the photo ;)</td>', 'nice picture, great expression but in my opinion it seems to be missing something - perhaps it would be better with a telephone pole somewhere in the upper-right area of the photo ;)', '2004-11-02 07:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(985410, 113838, 25355, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting, but I think the jar or canister or whatever it is should have been lighter in colour.</td>', 'Interesting lighting, but I think the jar or canister or whatever it is should have been lighter in colour.', '2004-11-02 07:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(985428, 117214, 2553, '<td valign="top">What an amazing shot.  This is something that I have often tried to capture, but have never had a shot come close to this.  I am anxious to see if you did some dodging/burning to create a more powerful feel.  Whatever you did, it works!</td>', 'What an amazing shot.  This is something that I have often tried to capture, but have never had a shot come close to this.  I am anxious to see if you did some dodging/burning to create a more powerful feel.  Whatever you did, it works!', '2004-11-02 07:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(985431, 111701, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what it is about this photo that makes me laugh, but every time I look at it, I do.  The dof works well here to really give the head and front legs the impact to carry the shot.  I really like the very faint lines in the background as well - I think they may have been unintentional, but they lend added interest to the composition.  Great shot.</td>', 'I''m not sure what it is about this photo that makes me laugh, but every time I look at it, I do.  The dof works well here to really give the head and front legs the impact to carry the shot.  I really like the very faint lines in the background as well - I think they may have been unintentional, but they lend added interest to the composition.  Great shot.', '2004-11-02 07:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(985432, 116756, 7889, '<td valign="top">Good photo - but If you had cropped it around the face only it would have been a great photo..</td>', 'Good photo - but If you had cropped it around the face only it would have been a great photo..', '2004-11-02 07:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(985433, 116590, 27482, '<td valign="top">Good shot but the sky ruins it, it´s noisy and overexposed in several places and just looks plain unnatural.</td>', 'Good shot but the sky ruins it, it´s noisy and overexposed in several places and just looks plain unnatural.', '2004-11-02 07:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(985435, 109506, 2553, '<td valign="top">Great catch on this shot!  The only thing that would have made this shot any better, would be to have been able to see the baby''s face.</td>', 'Great catch on this shot!  The only thing that would have made this shot any better, would be to have been able to see the baby''s face.', '2004-11-02 07:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(985437, 114806, 2553, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot a lot, and though I like the dark "feel"  of it, it is almost too dark, with all of the elements of the photo kind of blending together. I would like to have seen the tree have a bit more power in the composition.</td>', 'I really like this shot a lot, and though I like the dark "feel"  of it, it is almost too dark, with all of the elements of the photo kind of blending together. I would like to have seen the tree have a bit more power in the composition.', '2004-11-02 07:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(985438, 117207, 2553, '<td valign="top">It''s the color tone, and the contrast of the elegance of the bird against the backdrop of the "blocky-looking" buildings that intrigues me about this shot.  At first glance, I wasn''t sure about it, but the more I look at it, the more it "grows" on me.  A very unique perspective.</td>', 'It''s the color tone, and the contrast of the elegance of the bird against the backdrop of the "blocky-looking" buildings that intrigues me about this shot.  At first glance, I wasn''t sure about it, but the more I look at it, the more it "grows" on me.  A very unique perspective.', '2004-11-02 07:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(985440, 116643, 2553, '<td valign="top">Though I wish the gentleman had on something other than white (makes the shot feel a bit unbalanced to me), this is a most adorable shot.  The looks on their faces is wonderful, and the lighting and composition for this is great.</td>', 'Though I wish the gentleman had on something other than white (makes the shot feel a bit unbalanced to me), this is a most adorable shot.  The looks on their faces is wonderful, and the lighting and composition for this is great.', '2004-11-02 07:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(985442, 114082, 2553, '<td valign="top">Back for another look at this shot - it has a very "painterly" feel to, and the fog gives it such a mysterious look.  I like the balance of the composition, and the fact that even though it is color, it almost looks like a hand-tinted black and white.  This isn''t one of those "drop-dead wow" shots, but it is one that the more you look at it, the more questions you have about what you see.  Definitely a story there.</td>', 'Back for another look at this shot - it has a very "painterly" feel to, and the fog gives it such a mysterious look.  I like the balance of the composition, and the fact that even though it is color, it almost looks like a hand-tinted black and white.  This isn''t one of those "drop-dead wow" shots, but it is one that the more you look at it, the more questions you have about what you see.  Definitely a story there.', '2004-11-02 07:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(985444, 115199, 2553, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot, with the most stunning patterns captured in the water! I could look at this all day.</td>', 'A wonderful shot, with the most stunning patterns captured in the water! I could look at this all day.', '2004-11-02 07:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
