(985542, 117060, 27482, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Fantastic sky.  It´s just too bad the traffic sign and lightposts are there in the way, I know this church very well so I know there is nothing you can do about it but get closer and use a wider angle lens (and therefore get more distortion wich is also bad)<br/> <br/>All in all one of the very best shots I have ever seen of Hallgrímskirkja, I gave it a 9.</td>', 'Awesome!  Fantastic sky.  It´s just too bad the traffic sign and lightposts are there in the way, I know this church very well so I know there is nothing you can do about it but get closer and use a wider angle lens (and therefore get more distortion wich is also bad) All in all one of the very best shots I have ever seen of Hallgrímskirkja, I gave it a 9.', '2004-11-02 08:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
