(985591, 109951, 27293, '<td valign="top">I think a wider lens should have been used for this shot. As it is, something is pretty unbalanced about the composition. Otherwise, i love this.8.</td>', 'I think a wider lens should have been used for this shot. As it is, something is pretty unbalanced about the composition. Otherwise, i love this.8.', '2004-11-02 09:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(985596, 116960, 27293, '<td valign="top">If the photo was actually telling some kind of a story about these guys, show them doing something other than posing (the left 2) and being bored (the right 2), it may have been a good picture. As it is, it is probably ok for the family album... As far as technical part, the frame seems a little too tight for the characters, and i definitely don''t like the feet cut off at the bottom. On the bright side, these gus are all characters, no doubt. Especially like the girl with orange hair and the guy next to her. Sorry... 5.</td>', 'If the photo was actually telling some kind of a story about these guys, show them doing something other than posing (the left 2) and being bored (the right 2), it may have been a good picture. As it is, it is probably ok for the family album... As far as technical part, the frame seems a little too tight for the characters, and i definitely don''t like the feet cut off at the bottom. On the bright side, these gus are all characters, no doubt. Especially like the girl with orange hair and the guy next to her. Sorry... 5.', '2004-11-02 09:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(985606, 117323, 27293, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model, pretty expressive. I would move the camera more to the right, making sure what looks like a street light is not there. It''s a nice reflection, but i think more of the frame space should be given to the lady herself, rather than to her reflection. Perhaps using a shallower dof would make the portrait a little softer and more appealing too, but it would help blur the too-distinct buildings on the background... To sum it up, i like the picture, but purely technical shortcomings undermine its appeal. 7.</td>', 'Beautiful model, pretty expressive. I would move the camera more to the right, making sure what looks like a street light is not there. It''s a nice reflection, but i think more of the frame space should be given to the lady herself, rather than to her reflection. Perhaps using a shallower dof would make the portrait a little softer and more appealing too, but it would help blur the too-distinct buildings on the background... To sum it up, i like the picture, but purely technical shortcomings undermine its appeal. 7.', '2004-11-02 10:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(985608, 115117, 6870, '<td valign="top">Tones, colors and exposure are so very nice here. You might want to put your sky on a different layer to burn it, then your burning won''t leach over onto the hills. Very good work. 8</td>', 'Tones, colors and exposure are so very nice here. You might want to put your sky on a different layer to burn it, then your burning won''t leach over onto the hills. Very good work. 8', '2004-11-02 10:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
