(985902, 114849, 22781, '<td valign="top">Great colors. Did you burn the sky? It looks like a real overcast day, but then again the sun is shining on the tree..<br/>If you don''t score that well I guess it''s because of so many autumn color entry''s in this challenge (and I like them all) :)<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Great colors. Did you burn the sky? It looks like a real overcast day, but then again the sun is shining on the tree..If you don''t score that well I guess it''s because of so many autumn color entry''s in this challenge (and I like them all) :)Good luck!', '2004-11-02 12:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
