(985923, 117214, 28643, '<td valign="top">nice picture...i love the light and dark shadows...i would like to see it exposed a little more so the greens and yellows show better but a nice visual effect</td>', 'nice picture...i love the light and dark shadows...i would like to see it exposed a little more so the greens and yellows show better but a nice visual effect', '2004-11-02 12:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
