(985940, 116938, 28643, '<td valign="top">nice photo....would like to see it a bit warmer in tone...so the bronze and yellows of the ground cover is brighter...also if the blades of the front mill were turned to a more vertical position would allow you to fully see the further windmill completely.  Still a great shot that brought back memories of when I lived in Holland in Nieuwegein...and our trips up along the polder farms in the north...</td>', 'nice photo....would like to see it a bit warmer in tone...so the bronze and yellows of the ground cover is brighter...also if the blades of the front mill were turned to a more vertical position would allow you to fully see the further windmill completely.  Still a great shot that brought back memories of when I lived in Holland in Nieuwegein...and our trips up along the polder farms in the north...', '2004-11-02 12:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(985941, 117180, 28643, '<td valign="top">nice picture...great tone...beautiful model.  I would have included the top of her head and not cropped it out.  nice shot</td>', 'nice picture...great tone...beautiful model.  I would have included the top of her head and not cropped it out.  nice shot', '2004-11-02 12:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
