(986051, 114876, 22781, '<td valign="top">Whoooaaah this is simply stunning, what is this picture doing here between the 6''s? I guess I clicked wrong while voting.. Great that I see it again while commenting, will bump you to a 9.<br/>Great colors, very nice composition.<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Whoooaaah this is simply stunning, what is this picture doing here between the 6''s? I guess I clicked wrong while voting.. Great that I see it again while commenting, will bump you to a 9.Great colors, very nice composition.Good luck.', '2004-11-02 13:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(986054, 116668, 22781, '<td valign="top">I realy like the catchlight in the eyes.</td>', 'I realy like the catchlight in the eyes.', '2004-11-02 13:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(986074, 117115, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like this technique (the photography, not the thing around her neck) a lot. :)<br/>Well done. The black of the iron/leather gives the shot some punch and so do her eyes btw.<br/> <br/>There is one tiny "problem" imho:<br/>The furry bits are connected with a very fine fabric. Because of the lighting its exposure is on the limit of the visible dynamic range scale. So at first I thought that she had a strange skin on her belly. Especially at the right side it wrinkles a lot giving the skin a strange appearance at first. She really has to stretch those clothes a bit. Oh wait, she can''t.... :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'I like this technique (the photography, not the thing around her neck) a lot. :)Well done. The black of the iron/leather gives the shot some punch and so do her eyes btw. There is one tiny "problem" imho:The furry bits are connected with a very fine fabric. Because of the lighting its exposure is on the limit of the visible dynamic range scale. So at first I thought that she had a strange skin on her belly. Especially at the right side it wrinkles a lot giving the skin a strange appearance at first. She really has to stretch those clothes a bit. Oh wait, she can''t.... :) ', '2004-11-02 13:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(986075, 117157, 22781, '<td valign="top">oohh another old truck...<br/>Looks a bit depressing, nobody caring about this good old truck, now calling it a piece of junk after it worked so hard for years...<br/>Great pic.</td>', 'oohh another old truck...Looks a bit depressing, nobody caring about this good old truck, now calling it a piece of junk after it worked so hard for years...Great pic.', '2004-11-02 13:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(986080, 116408, 3032, '<td valign="top">It''s a really good portrait, but I am a bit uncertain about the balance between the dark left and the brighter right background. Perhaps a tighter crop might balance it out more.<br/>I love the way the dress fades away into the shadows.</td>', 'It''s a really good portrait, but I am a bit uncertain about the balance between the dark left and the brighter right background. Perhaps a tighter crop might balance it out more.I love the way the dress fades away into the shadows.', '2004-11-02 13:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(986081, 115514, 22781, '<td valign="top">Great color, Great contrast. The thing is that there are so many autumn pictures in this challenge that i am afraid you''ll suffer. No wories, I like it.</td>', 'Great color, Great contrast. The thing is that there are so many autumn pictures in this challenge that i am afraid you''ll suffer. No wories, I like it.', '2004-11-02 13:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(986082, 116930, 18080, '<td valign="top">10 minutes i have been looking at this shot and i can''t make up my mind wether this is a real scene or a model. I am going to look really silly if it is real, but it does have the look of a model. Well done whatever. I like it a lot<br/>9<br/>good luck<br/> <br/>Kev</td>', '10 minutes i have been looking at this shot and i can''t make up my mind wether this is a real scene or a model. I am going to look really silly if it is real, but it does have the look of a model. Well done whatever. I like it a lot9good luck Kev', '2004-11-02 13:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(986084, 117213, 22781, '<td valign="top">Children see beauty in the little things. Great capture.</td>', 'Children see beauty in the little things. Great capture.', '2004-11-02 13:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(986086, 112229, 22781, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, a bit small to realy enjoy, what strange wrinkled leaves it has. Funny.</td>', 'Nice photo, a bit small to realy enjoy, what strange wrinkled leaves it has. Funny.', '2004-11-02 13:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(986088, 113892, 22781, '<td valign="top">Nice color in the sky, but there are parts that are blown out and the foreground could have used a bit of light maybe. Good luck</td>', 'Nice color in the sky, but there are parts that are blown out and the foreground could have used a bit of light maybe. Good luck', '2004-11-02 13:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(986089, 111365, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great mood, toning and good idea to use the fallen tree/plant, it makes the image work.<br/>The horizon might be better a bit lower, not rule of thirds lower but just a little bit more away from the middle.</td>', 'Great mood, toning and good idea to use the fallen tree/plant, it makes the image work.The horizon might be better a bit lower, not rule of thirds lower but just a little bit more away from the middle.', '2004-11-02 13:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(986092, 116348, 3032, '<td valign="top">It is basically a very simple object, but the color, sharpness, lighting, composition and dof with a nice bokeh make it a very strong photograph. Well done.</td>', 'It is basically a very simple object, but the color, sharpness, lighting, composition and dof with a nice bokeh make it a very strong photograph. Well done.', '2004-11-02 13:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(986097, 117288, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the focus&amp; dof combined with the composition and capture of the expression. The viewer (me) seems to be able to get real close and personal with the big cat. The expressions shows a kind of "I am checking you out dude, if I don''t like what I see you will be in trouble."<br/>The dark background focussus all the attention on the face and so enhances that feeling even more.<br/>Great portrait.</td>', 'I like the focus& dof combined with the composition and capture of the expression. The viewer (me) seems to be able to get real close and personal with the big cat. The expressions shows a kind of "I am checking you out dude, if I don''t like what I see you will be in trouble."The dark background focussus all the attention on the face and so enhances that feeling even more.Great portrait.', '2004-11-02 13:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(986104, 112366, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like it how the water in front leeds me into the town. The bird in the sky makes it worth it to use so much sky. I also like the mood set with the bright sky and dark town foreground + the reflection. Toning is ok.</td>', 'I like it how the water in front leeds me into the town. The bird in the sky makes it worth it to use so much sky. I also like the mood set with the bright sky and dark town foreground + the reflection. Toning is ok.', '2004-11-02 13:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(986106, 117222, 280, '<td valign="top">Nice view but lacks contrast and focus.</td>', 'Nice view but lacks contrast and focus.', '2004-11-02 13:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(986111, 115678, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great colors, love it how the flows of the foreground go into the hazy but still colorful hills in the background. The line from the right, that is lit by the sun and goes int the frame as a triangle brings the live to this photo. Nice work.</td>', 'Great colors, love it how the flows of the foreground go into the hazy but still colorful hills in the background. The line from the right, that is lit by the sun and goes int the frame as a triangle brings the live to this photo. Nice work.', '2004-11-02 13:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(986115, 113838, 3032, '<td valign="top">Classical portraiture of fruit. Natural yet warm colors with nice lighting. <br/>The composition of the fruits and the jar of honey (?) is pretty good.<br/>The only flaws are the reflections on the oranges and the honey jar. I am not saying there should be no reflection at all, but I think one would be better. But I am nitpicking now. Well done.</td>', 'Classical portraiture of fruit. Natural yet warm colors with nice lighting. The composition of the fruits and the jar of honey (?) is pretty good.The only flaws are the reflections on the oranges and the honey jar. I am not saying there should be no reflection at all, but I think one would be better. But I am nitpicking now. Well done.', '2004-11-02 13:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(986116, 110365, 280, '<td valign="top">Stunning photograph! The perspective ever so slightly off, but appart from that I cant fault it.</td>', 'Stunning photograph! The perspective ever so slightly off, but appart from that I cant fault it.', '2004-11-02 13:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(986119, 115482, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice work with those lines, bright parts and shadow parts. Keeping the skyline of the mountains in the background adds a lot of depth to the scene.</td>', 'Nice work with those lines, bright parts and shadow parts. Keeping the skyline of the mountains in the background adds a lot of depth to the scene.', '2004-11-02 13:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(986120, 117158, 280, '<td valign="top">The trees look ever so slightly washed out, but I love how the reflection looks more vivid than the real thing.</td>', 'The trees look ever so slightly washed out, but I love how the reflection looks more vivid than the real thing.', '2004-11-02 13:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(986127, 117303, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great effect from shooting at this angle. I was at first puzzled about what I was looking at, but it is quite obvious once you see it. The angle makes it very interesting.</td>', 'Great effect from shooting at this angle. I was at first puzzled about what I was looking at, but it is quite obvious once you see it. The angle makes it very interesting.', '2004-11-02 13:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(986132, 116340, 280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape and nicely presented. 9</td>', 'Beautiful landscape and nicely presented. 9', '2004-11-02 13:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(986140, 113537, 3032, '<td valign="top">Even without the Bobby, this is soooo England. :) <br/>The clothing of the woman is what makes me say that.<br/> <br/>It is a great shot for an article in a paper. There are people in it who stand out, the signs tell what it is about and the police being there gives the feeling that it is a protest with and edge, if you know what I mean. So, great journalism. ;)</td>', 'Even without the Bobby, this is soooo England. :) The clothing of the woman is what makes me say that. It is a great shot for an article in a paper. There are people in it who stand out, the signs tell what it is about and the police being there gives the feeling that it is a protest with and edge, if you know what I mean. So, great journalism. ;)', '2004-11-02 13:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(986144, 116643, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I like the composition a lot and the exposure is very good. Over the years this are great shots to look at again and feel the joy of the moment again. Good work.</td>', 'Great photo. I like the composition a lot and the exposure is very good. Over the years this are great shots to look at again and feel the joy of the moment again. Good work.', '2004-11-02 13:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(986147, 112326, 280, '<td valign="top">The little fella looks a little shocked maybe you shouldn''t have used such a bright flash! ;-) Would have gone with a little more contrast myself, but still a great shot for the family album!</td>', 'The little fella looks a little shocked maybe you shouldn''t have used such a bright flash! ;-) Would have gone with a little more contrast myself, but still a great shot for the family album!', '2004-11-02 13:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(986162, 111183, 22781, '<td valign="top">Auch, what happened here.<br/>This looks realy scary.. Did someone walk over it when it broke?</td>', 'Auch, what happened here.This looks realy scary.. Did someone walk over it when it broke?', '2004-11-02 14:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
