(986204, 116410, 22781, '<td valign="top">She has a sweet face, but I see some problems.<br/>Stay with me here, I''m not a pro but learned something along the way and I am trying to help you.<br/>If I am wrong just PM me and you can call me names :)<br/> <br/>My eyes go imidiatly to her nose, and I think that''s not a good thing.<br/>I think you could have used a different focal lenght.<br/>If you stand further away from your model and zoom in this would be better.(hard to explain why in just a few words, if you like to know PM me)<br/>And try to focus on the eyes.</td>', 'She has a sweet face, but I see some problems.Stay with me here, I''m not a pro but learned something along the way and I am trying to help you.If I am wrong just PM me and you can call me names :) My eyes go imidiatly to her nose, and I think that''s not a good thing.I think you could have used a different focal lenght.If you stand further away from your model and zoom in this would be better.(hard to explain why in just a few words, if you like to know PM me)And try to focus on the eyes.', '2004-11-02 14:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
