(986388, 111396, 28742, '<td valign="top">Intersting shot. If it was a little sharper and more of the grass in the foreground would be better imho.</td>', 'Intersting shot. If it was a little sharper and more of the grass in the foreground would be better imho.', '2004-11-02 15:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
