(986404, 111365, 22781, '<td valign="top">I see a frog in the clouds...<br/>Great sky, and why am I the only one that doesnt know how to do a good b/w conversion...</td>', 'I see a frog in the clouds...Great sky, and why am I the only one that doesnt know how to do a good b/w conversion...', '2004-11-02 15:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(986406, 111806, 15207, '<td valign="top">A great capture of expression and personality. It''s a great candid shot. I find sometimes using negative space can really allow a portrait to jump out at you - adding a bit more blank space (maybe with a shallow depth of field) to the left - this allows a bit of movement in the image and balances the composition a bit more. The "rule of thirds" - putting the subject to one/third of an image can really work sometimes (it''s not a steadfast rule) but would apply really well to htis image.</td>', 'A great capture of expression and personality. It''s a great candid shot. I find sometimes using negative space can really allow a portrait to jump out at you - adding a bit more blank space (maybe with a shallow depth of field) to the left - this allows a bit of movement in the image and balances the composition a bit more. The "rule of thirds" - putting the subject to one/third of an image can really work sometimes (it''s not a steadfast rule) but would apply really well to htis image.', '2004-11-02 15:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(986407, 115886, 28742, '<td valign="top">"Help Me, Help Me"  ;-)   Nice closeup.</td>', '"Help Me, Help Me"  ;-)   Nice closeup.', '2004-11-02 15:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(986409, 117165, 15207, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting in this. I also love the way you''ve composed it into something original and unique. I like the way you''ve used rule of thirds here. I also love the expression. you turned a beautiful scenic into something whimsical - really well done. -9</td>', 'I really like the lighting in this. I also love the way you''ve composed it into something original and unique. I like the way you''ve used rule of thirds here. I also love the expression. you turned a beautiful scenic into something whimsical - really well done. -9', '2004-11-02 15:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(986411, 115912, 22781, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best butterfly pics I''ve seen.<br/>I chased butterflies with my camera and know how extremly difficult it is and how fast they are, that is why I like this so much!</td>', 'This is one of the best butterfly pics I''ve seen.I chased butterflies with my camera and know how extremly difficult it is and how fast they are, that is why I like this so much!', '2004-11-02 15:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
