(986548, 117328, 26756, '<td valign="top">I like the color and softeness of the flowers to the left, and also the light on the very edges of the wings.  Nice job.</td>', 'I like the color and softeness of the flowers to the left, and also the light on the very edges of the wings.  Nice job.', '2004-11-02 16:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
