(986565, 113172, 24642, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and great balance of forms.  This is one of my highest rated photographs for the challenge.  The wet / dry parts of the leaves really add interesting nuances.  I also like the way you have cropped the photo and chosen to divide the water by letting the leaves go beyond the border.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and great balance of forms.  This is one of my highest rated photographs for the challenge.  The wet / dry parts of the leaves really add interesting nuances.  I also like the way you have cropped the photo and chosen to divide the water by letting the leaves go beyond the border.', '2004-11-02 17:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(986575, 116791, 16739, '<td valign="top">very nice  7 came back and bumped you up  8</td>', 'very nice  7 came back and bumped you up  8', '2004-11-02 17:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
