(986947, 115678, 20899, '<td valign="top">WOW ! This is magnificent...very beautiful view......</td>', 'WOW ! This is magnificent...very beautiful view......', '2004-11-02 19:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(986948, 116925, 20779, '<td valign="top">Looks like you were trying some new perspectives and compositions - which is great with architecture. I think I might have just focused on the building and the lighting to keep a cleaner look. Just a suggestion.</td>', 'Looks like you were trying some new perspectives and compositions - which is great with architecture. I think I might have just focused on the building and the lighting to keep a cleaner look. Just a suggestion.', '2004-11-02 19:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
