(986951, 114199, 20779, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and tones. A shame the hand is showing in the picture. Terific DOF, also.</td>', 'Great lighting and tones. A shame the hand is showing in the picture. Terific DOF, also.', '2004-11-02 19:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(986954, 115420, 20779, '<td valign="top">I can see you enjoy the same type of scene that I do often. The only thing I might fault here is that my eyes don''t seem to really have  a final place to "focus".</td>', 'I can see you enjoy the same type of scene that I do often. The only thing I might fault here is that my eyes don''t seem to really have  a final place to "focus".', '2004-11-02 19:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(986958, 117197, 20779, '<td valign="top">Must have taken quite a lot of waiting to capture this little guy. If you can take more of these, I would try to catch him in "flight" and try to avoid the plastic feeder as much as posiible in the frame. He''s adorable.</td>', 'Must have taken quite a lot of waiting to capture this little guy. If you can take more of these, I would try to catch him in "flight" and try to avoid the plastic feeder as much as posiible in the frame. He''s adorable.', '2004-11-02 19:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(986963, 116028, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful glow lighting the roof. I think that there is bit too much unlit portion to make it ideal, but very nice use of the rule-of-thirds and the sky.</td>', 'Beautiful glow lighting the roof. I think that there is bit too much unlit portion to make it ideal, but very nice use of the rule-of-thirds and the sky.', '2004-11-02 19:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
