(987323, 116590, 11800, '<td valign="top">Cheery colors for such a desolate shot. Interesting framing. Not a bad picture at all.  Sad to think that one of the most beautiful places in the world is treated with such disrespect by it''s inhabitants.</td>', 'Cheery colors for such a desolate shot. Interesting framing. Not a bad picture at all.  Sad to think that one of the most beautiful places in the world is treated with such disrespect by it''s inhabitants.', '2004-11-02 22:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
