(987405, 117079, 19982, '<td valign="top">I love how "up close and personal" this photo gets.  And the detail in her eyes, her eye lashes, even her mouth is all just perfect.  I''m a little undecided about the lower part of the picture, but still find the photo overall to be a strong contender for a top finish.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I love how "up close and personal" this photo gets.  And the detail in her eyes, her eye lashes, even her mouth is all just perfect.  I''m a little undecided about the lower part of the picture, but still find the photo overall to be a strong contender for a top finish.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-02 23:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
