(987537, 114848, 2764, '<td valign="top">whats wrong here?  well, for one that bar accross the center- it isnt very attractive, it blocks the kid and it should be rotated to be straight if it has to be there.  The flash gives an unpleasant light.  the leg on the right is very strange.  The angle is practically a crotch shot,  so what if you rotate the bar to be parellel to the border and then crop the image right along the bar?  that excludes the hands and the other foot and leaves her face, her beautifuk eyes and the red fabric which has very nice lines and colors, the green matches her eyes.  you would also eliminate some of the glare from the flash.  Infortunately a picture is only as good as its worst element, not its best.</td>', 'whats wrong here?  well, for one that bar accross the center- it isnt very attractive, it blocks the kid and it should be rotated to be straight if it has to be there.  The flash gives an unpleasant light.  the leg on the right is very strange.  The angle is practically a crotch shot,  so what if you rotate the bar to be parellel to the border and then crop the image right along the bar?  that excludes the hands and the other foot and leaves her face, her beautifuk eyes and the red fabric which has very nice lines and colors, the green matches her eyes.  you would also eliminate some of the glare from the flash.  Infortunately a picture is only as good as its worst element, not its best.', '2004-11-03 00:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(987568, 117207, 7485, '<td valign="top">The silhouette of the raptor is so powerful it would work against a variety of backgrounds. I think your choice of a paint-effect background works, but some will undoubtedly think it''s too heavily processed.</td>', 'The silhouette of the raptor is so powerful it would work against a variety of backgrounds. I think your choice of a paint-effect background works, but some will undoubtedly think it''s too heavily processed.', '2004-11-03 00:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
