(988046, 117160, 22781, '<td valign="top">Great colors, but it seems that there are just to many with the same idea in this challenge, after the 7th sunset nature picture they all look the same...<br/>I would love to see some more light in the trees...<br/>Good picture all in all, just seen to many..<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Great colors, but it seems that there are just to many with the same idea in this challenge, after the 7th sunset nature picture they all look the same...I would love to see some more light in the trees...Good picture all in all, just seen to many..Good luck!', '2004-11-03 05:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(988047, 116307, 22781, '<td valign="top">I think you have a great idea, the problem with this photo only is that it will score low here on DPC.<br/>There''s just too much rubbish in this photo to be apreciated by the masses.<br/>If you shoot for yourself or for your own "fan-base" it''s ok. But here at DPC, if you would like to "score" there are some things that you must and must not do.<br/>No: artsy pictures, pets, dificult to understand photo''s, deeper meaning.<br/>Yes: Oversaturated, burned sky''s, landscapes with sunset oversaturated with burned sky''s)<br/>I know i know, but it''s realy true...</td>', 'I think you have a great idea, the problem with this photo only is that it will score low here on DPC.There''s just too much rubbish in this photo to be apreciated by the masses.If you shoot for yourself or for your own "fan-base" it''s ok. But here at DPC, if you would like to "score" there are some things that you must and must not do.No: artsy pictures, pets, dificult to understand photo''s, deeper meaning.Yes: Oversaturated, burned sky''s, landscapes with sunset oversaturated with burned sky''s)I know i know, but it''s realy true...', '2004-11-03 05:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
