(988108, 116632, 19982, '<td valign="top">I know this is an artistic thing but, for me it is, perhaps, just "too much yellow".  It''s like the photo is screaming at me.  I wonder if a simple hue/sat change towards a little more red might have made this image better?  Also, I think adding a person walking along the road would have added a strong element to the image, giving the eye something to focus on.   Plus, such an addition could have had contrasting colors which could have balanced the rest of the color... just a thought.</td>', 'I know this is an artistic thing but, for me it is, perhaps, just "too much yellow".  It''s like the photo is screaming at me.  I wonder if a simple hue/sat change towards a little more red might have made this image better?  Also, I think adding a person walking along the road would have added a strong element to the image, giving the eye something to focus on.   Plus, such an addition could have had contrasting colors which could have balanced the rest of the color... just a thought.', '2004-11-03 06:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
