(988208, 115667, 8125, '<td valign="top">I really like everything about this picture except the lighting.  It''s the hardest part of studio photography and something I wish I had a better grasp of doing myself.  In this shot the lighting is too harsh, mainly on the man, but in just a few spots on the woman.  This may be doubled by the shine - although I think that''s a fantastic addition to this type of pose.  <br/> <br/>His right foot (the one arched up) almost looks unnatural and deliberate.  <br/> <br/>Very nice studio work with these 2 though, they make great models!</td>', 'I really like everything about this picture except the lighting.  It''s the hardest part of studio photography and something I wish I had a better grasp of doing myself.  In this shot the lighting is too harsh, mainly on the man, but in just a few spots on the woman.  This may be doubled by the shine - although I think that''s a fantastic addition to this type of pose.   His right foot (the one arched up) almost looks unnatural and deliberate.   Very nice studio work with these 2 though, they make great models!', '2004-11-03 08:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
