(988224, 116840, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot of the car... I find myself wishing I couldn''t see the pavement below it though - it takes away that showroom, car magazine look.</td>', 'This is a nice shot of the car... I find myself wishing I couldn''t see the pavement below it though - it takes away that showroom, car magazine look.', '2004-11-03 08:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
