(988239, 113230, 22781, '<td valign="top">Nice, so many seagulls on the beach.. didn''t the fly away when you came?</td>', 'Nice, so many seagulls on the beach.. didn''t the fly away when you came?', '2004-11-03 08:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(988240, 116407, 11800, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice.</td>', 'The colors are nice.', '2004-11-03 08:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(988241, 112493, 22781, '<td valign="top">Sweet, nice composition...</td>', 'Sweet, nice composition...', '2004-11-03 08:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(988242, 117210, 22781, '<td valign="top">Could do with some sharpening... Nice composition</td>', 'Could do with some sharpening... Nice composition', '2004-11-03 08:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(988243, 116837, 8125, '<td valign="top">Great title and great shot!  Lighting, composition, color and pose is good.... very nice work!</td>', 'Great title and great shot!  Lighting, composition, color and pose is good.... very nice work!', '2004-11-03 08:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(988244, 116884, 11800, '<td valign="top">The burned out background helps isolate your subject nicely.</td>', 'The burned out background helps isolate your subject nicely.', '2004-11-03 08:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(988245, 117169, 22781, '<td valign="top">Nice, but slightly out of focus.</td>', 'Nice, but slightly out of focus.', '2004-11-03 08:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(988246, 113541, 8125, '<td valign="top">For some reason this reminds of something right out of Blair Witch Project.  I like the tone and grain effect you used...</td>', 'For some reason this reminds of something right out of Blair Witch Project.  I like the tone and grain effect you used...', '2004-11-03 08:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(988247, 113375, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the softness and the subdued colors. Elegantly understated.</td>', 'I like the softness and the subdued colors. Elegantly understated.', '2004-11-03 08:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(988249, 115968, 8125, '<td valign="top">I love photographing animals... the best part for me is capturing an emotion or expression ... which you have done very well in this shot!</td>', 'I love photographing animals... the best part for me is capturing an emotion or expression ... which you have done very well in this shot!', '2004-11-03 08:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(988251, 117274, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice. It almost looks like the forest is on fire. Good complementary colors.</td>', 'Nice. It almost looks like the forest is on fire. Good complementary colors.', '2004-11-03 08:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(988252, 116742, 8125, '<td valign="top">The railing makes this image look more like a tourist snapshot...</td>', 'The railing makes this image look more like a tourist snapshot...', '2004-11-03 08:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(988253, 116124, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  The fog gives the image a very surreal effect.  Nice work!</td>', 'This is a great shot.  The fog gives the image a very surreal effect.  Nice work!', '2004-11-03 08:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(988254, 116372, 8125, '<td valign="top">Great color and it looks like you had a perfect setting for a great reflection.  I like the processing effect you used... would love to know what it is.  It gives a soft, almost painted look.</td>', 'Great color and it looks like you had a perfect setting for a great reflection.  I like the processing effect you used... would love to know what it is.  It gives a soft, almost painted look.', '2004-11-03 08:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(988256, 110954, 8125, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad this image is so small... it could score higher based on what I see here.  I can''t tell much about it at this size though...</td>', 'It''s too bad this image is so small... it could score higher based on what I see here.  I can''t tell much about it at this size though...', '2004-11-03 08:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(988271, 111476, 8125, '<td valign="top">This almost seems like it should be on a book cover or something.  I''m picturing a Dean Koontz or Steven King novel.</td>', 'This almost seems like it should be on a book cover or something.  I''m picturing a Dean Koontz or Steven King novel.', '2004-11-03 08:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(988272, 113838, 8125, '<td valign="top">Very nice still life!!  I like the color, composition, lighting... great job!!!!</td>', 'Very nice still life!!  I like the color, composition, lighting... great job!!!!', '2004-11-03 08:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(988277, 117033, 8125, '<td valign="top">Excellent baby shot!!!</td>', 'Excellent baby shot!!!', '2004-11-03 08:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(988288, 116820, 8125, '<td valign="top">This reminds of an image straight out of Lord of The Rings...  there is so much going on this shot... between the clouds, the break in the clouds and the smoke below...  very nice.</td>', 'This reminds of an image straight out of Lord of The Rings...  there is so much going on this shot... between the clouds, the break in the clouds and the smoke below...  very nice.', '2004-11-03 08:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(988292, 114388, 8125, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro!!!  The colors are good in this photo... the purple and yellow really offset each other, although it seems the colors are maybe just a bit muted... like it was overcast or dusk.</td>', 'Excellent macro!!!  The colors are good in this photo... the purple and yellow really offset each other, although it seems the colors are maybe just a bit muted... like it was overcast or dusk.', '2004-11-03 08:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(988294, 109241, 8125, '<td valign="top">Absolutely adorable!  My only pick... is that it looks like you lose a bit of focus going up the ridge of the nose... otherwise - terrific.</td>', 'Absolutely adorable!  My only pick... is that it looks like you lose a bit of focus going up the ridge of the nose... otherwise - terrific.', '2004-11-03 08:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(988316, 111308, 21714, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I like the angle you have chosen and the moment you have captured. Looks almost like s/he is leaning against the frame itself. Also like the way how the colours of background and the subject are finely balanced.  All the best.</td>', 'Great shot. I like the angle you have chosen and the moment you have captured. Looks almost like s/he is leaning against the frame itself. Also like the way how the colours of background and the subject are finely balanced.  All the best.', '2004-11-03 08:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(988322, 116488, 21714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful saturated colours. It does look slightly heavy on the left - bit of a tilt I think.<br/>Nice capture. <br/></td>', 'Beautiful saturated colours. It does look slightly heavy on the left - bit of a tilt I think.Nice capture. ', '2004-11-03 08:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(988326, 114930, 24846, '<td valign="top">There''s a small algae pond near that my kids love to toss stones in. I like how the algae slopes (rim of the volcano) in around the splash. Great color, love the touch of red plant and bit of grass rightback of splas. The algae could have easily been over or under saturated, but you made it right on.  Great study...</td>', 'There''s a small algae pond near that my kids love to toss stones in. I like how the algae slopes (rim of the volcano) in around the splash. Great color, love the touch of red plant and bit of grass rightback of splas. The algae could have easily been over or under saturated, but you made it right on.  Great study...', '2004-11-03 09:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(988329, 115892, 21714, '<td valign="top">That''s a great looking sky. Love those colours. It creates a lot of depth in the image.  I don''t find the other elements in the image except for the fountain too interesting. Maybe it''s the angle or perhaps the scene itself.  I think whoever designed this place was mad to have those things going around the fountain :) <br/></td>', 'That''s a great looking sky. Love those colours. It creates a lot of depth in the image.  I don''t find the other elements in the image except for the fountain too interesting. Maybe it''s the angle or perhaps the scene itself.  I think whoever designed this place was mad to have those things going around the fountain :) ', '2004-11-03 09:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(988384, 115885, 2764, '<td valign="top">Great old face - composition of the photo is bland</td>', 'Great old face - composition of the photo is bland', '2004-11-03 09:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(988387, 111725, 2764, '<td valign="top">OOohhh beautiful lines - I''s like more field and ess sky.</td>', 'OOohhh beautiful lines - I''s like more field and ess sky.', '2004-11-03 09:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(988392, 116667, 2764, '<td valign="top">Elegant and very precise - does it need more contrast of did you want it slightly grey?  I think I like it grey - the diamond shape in the middle is my favot=rite.</td>', 'Elegant and very precise - does it need more contrast of did you want it slightly grey?  I think I like it grey - the diamond shape in the middle is my favot=rite.', '2004-11-03 09:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
