(988814, 117097, 12332, '<td valign="top">I can''t help drawing a comparison to the popular National Geographic photo of the Afghani girl.  Without that comparison, your picture would rate better with me.  It''s a bit inconsistent to have her with a burqa-like shawl and lip gloss and streaked hair.  The catch lights are kinda big.  A fine portrait if not for such strong resemblance to the NG pic.</td>', 'I can''t help drawing a comparison to the popular National Geographic photo of the Afghani girl.  Without that comparison, your picture would rate better with me.  It''s a bit inconsistent to have her with a burqa-like shawl and lip gloss and streaked hair.  The catch lights are kinda big.  A fine portrait if not for such strong resemblance to the NG pic.', '2004-11-03 12:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
