(988887, 109315, 25873, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning image.  The only reason I didn''t score it higher is because it looks over-processed.  It looks like there was so much USM used that white edges appeared around the mills, giving them a more ghostly effect.  The effect in itself is cool, but the overall image gives the impression of animation, which, I feel, detracts in this case. (7)</td>', 'This is a stunning image.  The only reason I didn''t score it higher is because it looks over-processed.  It looks like there was so much USM used that white edges appeared around the mills, giving them a more ghostly effect.  The effect in itself is cool, but the overall image gives the impression of animation, which, I feel, detracts in this case. (7)', '2004-11-03 12:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
