(988950, 117115, 14012, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done! The high-key effect with the contrast of the shackles work well. It looks like there is a slight sepia tint which I really like. I would love to see an explanation of the setup and editing process you used.</td>', 'Very nicely done! The high-key effect with the contrast of the shackles work well. It looks like there is a slight sepia tint which I really like. I would love to see an explanation of the setup and editing process you used.', '2004-11-03 13:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(988959, 114239, 24911, '<td valign="top">Too busy. What is the subject?</td>', 'Too busy. What is the subject?', '2004-11-03 13:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(988960, 117176, 14012, '<td valign="top">couple things I would have done. compose so the road is coming into the frame in the bottom left corner and going through the frame more. Also, the horizon is tilted a bit and should be moved on to the 1/3 line. Other than that, the focus, color, and subject are all good. Good luck.</td>', 'couple things I would have done. compose so the road is coming into the frame in the bottom left corner and going through the frame more. Also, the horizon is tilted a bit and should be moved on to the 1/3 line. Other than that, the focus, color, and subject are all good. Good luck.', '2004-11-03 13:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(988963, 115196, 24911, '<td valign="top">Good use of DOF. Great colors.</td>', 'Good use of DOF. Great colors.', '2004-11-03 13:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(988967, 115846, 14012, '<td valign="top">Obviously burned like crazy, and pushed the saturation, but I like it. Very nice contract between the strong colors and the dark clouds. Good luck.</td>', 'Obviously burned like crazy, and pushed the saturation, but I like it. Very nice contract between the strong colors and the dark clouds. Good luck.', '2004-11-03 13:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(988971, 115027, 14012, '<td valign="top">I wish the front hand was in focus and there were obvious catchlights in the eyes. Otherwise a good portrait. Good luck.</td>', 'I wish the front hand was in focus and there were obvious catchlights in the eyes. Otherwise a good portrait. Good luck.', '2004-11-03 13:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(988973, 116881, 14012, '<td valign="top">Looks a little oversaturated. Did you try burning the sky? Looks like there are some streaks there.</td>', 'Looks a little oversaturated. Did you try burning the sky? Looks like there are some streaks there.', '2004-11-03 13:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(988978, 114508, 14012, '<td valign="top">cute idea. the lighting is a litle harsh, particularly on the green crayon. There also appear to be dust spots (white dots) that could have been cleaned out with the Healing Brush. Good luck.</td>', 'cute idea. the lighting is a litle harsh, particularly on the green crayon. There also appear to be dust spots (white dots) that could have been cleaned out with the Healing Brush. Good luck.', '2004-11-03 13:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(988979, 112370, 14012, '<td valign="top">pretty colors. The horizon is slightly tilted and really shouldn''t be centered, IMHO.</td>', 'pretty colors. The horizon is slightly tilted and really shouldn''t be centered, IMHO.', '2004-11-03 13:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(988982, 117158, 14012, '<td valign="top">color is a little flat. bringing the Brightness down to about -5 would probably help a lot.</td>', 'color is a little flat. bringing the Brightness down to about -5 would probably help a lot.', '2004-11-03 13:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(988987, 111396, 14012, '<td valign="top">the grass on the left ruins this shot. You really should have cloned it out.</td>', 'the grass on the left ruins this shot. You really should have cloned it out.', '2004-11-03 13:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(988995, 109482, 6667, '<td valign="top">I was so hoping this one came up for my review before time ran out (I''m o a dial up modem).  Nicely done.  My only comment is a little to brigh for my taste.  I would have liked to see more contrast.  But you still get a high mark here. BOL</td>', 'I was so hoping this one came up for my review before time ran out (I''m o a dial up modem).  Nicely done.  My only comment is a little to brigh for my taste.  I would have liked to see more contrast.  But you still get a high mark here. BOL', '2004-11-03 13:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(989007, 109839, 6667, '<td valign="top">Is this a relative to "Children of Heaven"  By the way, wasn''t that tiled reserved for the Emperor only?  I love the rich, deep contrast of the black and white.  I wish mom''s face was more in view and his shoe.  But still the sharpness and richness make this a very intriguing photo. 7  BOL .</td>', 'Is this a relative to "Children of Heaven"  By the way, wasn''t that tiled reserved for the Emperor only?  I love the rich, deep contrast of the black and white.  I wish mom''s face was more in view and his shoe.  But still the sharpness and richness make this a very intriguing photo. 7  BOL .', '2004-11-03 13:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(989013, 114842, 24065, '<td valign="top">This is a very sweet photo.  The young girl appears to be totally engrossed in what she''s doing rather than trying to pose for the camera.  Two areas in which I see room for improvement: there appears to be a green cast to the color, and cropping it a little closer on the right.  The cropping is just a matter of taste, but I definitely would have scored it higher if the colors had been better adjusted.</td>', 'This is a very sweet photo.  The young girl appears to be totally engrossed in what she''s doing rather than trying to pose for the camera.  Two areas in which I see room for improvement: there appears to be a green cast to the color, and cropping it a little closer on the right.  The cropping is just a matter of taste, but I definitely would have scored it higher if the colors had been better adjusted.', '2004-11-03 13:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(989015, 109315, 14012, '<td valign="top">interesting shot. looks like you oversharpened a bit though, as I can see halos.</td>', 'interesting shot. looks like you oversharpened a bit though, as I can see halos.', '2004-11-03 13:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(989016, 114560, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot... very intense.  You have successfully relayed the power that is a part of heavy metal music.  This also makes a great black and white... great shot :) = 10</td>', 'This is a great shot... very intense.  You have successfully relayed the power that is a part of heavy metal music.  This also makes a great black and white... great shot :) = 10', '2004-11-03 13:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(989017, 117303, 6667, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Love the simplicity of color , light, and shadows. 7  BOL</td>', 'Nicely done.  Love the simplicity of color , light, and shadows. 7  BOL', '2004-11-03 13:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(989018, 114791, 14012, '<td valign="top">best I''ve seen yet.</td>', 'best I''ve seen yet.', '2004-11-03 13:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(989019, 115137, 24065, '<td valign="top">I did not rate your photo low, but I just wanted to comment on 2 things that kept me from giving it high marks.  First, I was so grossed out by the subject of the photo I didn''t look at it long enough to tell whether it was good or bad.  Secondly, you had already posted this in the forums -- I thought submissions were to be anonymous.  And before you blast me with a PM, remember that I can always come back and lower my vote some more ;)</td>', 'I did not rate your photo low, but I just wanted to comment on 2 things that kept me from giving it high marks.  First, I was so grossed out by the subject of the photo I didn''t look at it long enough to tell whether it was good or bad.  Secondly, you had already posted this in the forums -- I thought submissions were to be anonymous.  And before you blast me with a PM, remember that I can always come back and lower my vote some more ;)', '2004-11-03 13:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(989022, 117042, 14012, '<td valign="top">I would have spent time cleaning / editing the quarter.</td>', 'I would have spent time cleaning / editing the quarter.', '2004-11-03 13:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(989024, 116170, 24065, '<td valign="top">Just a couple of opinions that kept me from voting this cute little fellow higher:  first, I understand that the grainy look enhances some photos -- I didn''t think it helped this one; second, while the rule-of-thirds is just a guideline I think putting his eyes on the upper third would have helped the composition.</td>', 'Just a couple of opinions that kept me from voting this cute little fellow higher:  first, I understand that the grainy look enhances some photos -- I didn''t think it helped this one; second, while the rule-of-thirds is just a guideline I think putting his eyes on the upper third would have helped the composition.', '2004-11-03 13:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(989026, 115705, 24065, '<td valign="top">This looks like a beautiful place to take photos.  A couple of things that would have caused me to score this higher: an angle that didn''t include that huge light, and more color.  I think it''s the lack of color or contrast in colors that makes it appear a little flat.  Hope the feedback is helpful. :)</td>', 'This looks like a beautiful place to take photos.  A couple of things that would have caused me to score this higher: an angle that didn''t include that huge light, and more color.  I think it''s the lack of color or contrast in colors that makes it appear a little flat.  Hope the feedback is helpful. :)', '2004-11-03 13:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(989033, 112471, 6667, '<td valign="top">This is the third of such a picture I''ve seen of this facility.  Where and what is it?  I love the portrait in the corner  but it needs to be in line with the horizin.  Somewhat over exposed.  BOL</td>', 'This is the third of such a picture I''ve seen of this facility.  Where and what is it?  I love the portrait in the corner  but it needs to be in line with the horizin.  Somewhat over exposed.  BOL', '2004-11-03 14:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(989034, 116832, 24065, '<td valign="top">The colors are very nice, but it appears to be a little out of focus.  That''s something that''s giving me some problems, too.  Here''s hoping we can both improve in that area.  :)</td>', 'The colors are very nice, but it appears to be a little out of focus.  That''s something that''s giving me some problems, too.  Here''s hoping we can both improve in that area.  :)', '2004-11-03 14:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(989039, 111788, 24065, '<td valign="top">The colors are beautiful.  The subject is very appropriate for the October Free Study.  It seems to lack something in the composition, tho.  Wish I knew more myself so I could give you a suggestion.   :)</td>', 'The colors are beautiful.  The subject is very appropriate for the October Free Study.  It seems to lack something in the composition, tho.  Wish I knew more myself so I could give you a suggestion.   :)', '2004-11-03 14:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(989043, 112229, 24065, '<td valign="top">What an interesting flower!  The colors are beautiful and the exposure is good -- the whites aren''t blown out, which is what I tend to do.  I would have scored it higher if the focus had been a little sharper and if it had been cropped so the yellow center was placed by the rule of thirds.  I know it''s just a guideline, but I think it would have added interest to this photo.  :)</td>', 'What an interesting flower!  The colors are beautiful and the exposure is good -- the whites aren''t blown out, which is what I tend to do.  I would have scored it higher if the focus had been a little sharper and if it had been cropped so the yellow center was placed by the rule of thirds.  I know it''s just a guideline, but I think it would have added interest to this photo.  :)', '2004-11-03 14:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(989045, 111744, 24065, '<td valign="top">The composition and colors are beautiful.  In my humble opinion, I think we should have been placed a little closer to the leaves.</td>', 'The composition and colors are beautiful.  In my humble opinion, I think we should have been placed a little closer to the leaves.', '2004-11-03 14:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(989047, 117286, 6667, '<td valign="top">You''ll need to find that fly again fo r this weeks Macro challenge!!  nicely done.  Ooops.  Forgot no bugs or flowers. BOL</td>', 'You''ll need to find that fly again fo r this weeks Macro challenge!!  nicely done.  Ooops.  Forgot no bugs or flowers. BOL', '2004-11-03 14:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(989048, 117222, 24065, '<td valign="top">The colors look beautiful.  In my humble opinion this was not the photo for a foggy day.  Don''t get me wrong -- I like foggy photos -- even entered one myself, just think it muted the beautiful colors here, tho. :)</td>', 'The colors look beautiful.  In my humble opinion this was not the photo for a foggy day.  Don''t get me wrong -- I like foggy photos -- even entered one myself, just think it muted the beautiful colors here, tho. :)', '2004-11-03 14:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(989049, 115724, 6667, '<td valign="top">Unique. Very, unique use of the glass, colors, and water.  Excellent variation on a theme.</td>', 'Unique. Very, unique use of the glass, colors, and water.  Excellent variation on a theme.', '2004-11-03 14:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(989058, 116696, 24911, '<td valign="top">A perfect shot. hreat colors. Good composition. I wonder what they were looking at (: 10</td>', 'A perfect shot. hreat colors. Good composition. I wonder what they were looking at (: 10', '2004-11-03 14:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(989060, 117213, 6667, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful.  She is certianly up against some pretty stiff competition!  9 BOL</td>', 'Simply beautiful.  She is certianly up against some pretty stiff competition!  9 BOL', '2004-11-03 14:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(989066, 116699, 24065, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dog.  I hope to see more photos of him in the futuer.  I would offer 2 suggestions for this one:  first, the focus appears to be a little soft (this is something I''m still struggling with myself!) and second, I think placing his eyes by the rule of thirds would have helped the composition (I know it''s a guideline and is not appropriate in all cases, but still think it would have helped here.)  :)</td>', 'Beautiful dog.  I hope to see more photos of him in the futuer.  I would offer 2 suggestions for this one:  first, the focus appears to be a little soft (this is something I''m still struggling with myself!) and second, I think placing his eyes by the rule of thirds would have helped the composition (I know it''s a guideline and is not appropriate in all cases, but still think it would have helped here.)  :)', '2004-11-03 14:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(989067, 116335, 24911, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Love the B&amp;W for this shot. Interesting subject. 8.</td>', 'Great composition. Love the B&W for this shot. Interesting subject. 8.', '2004-11-03 14:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(989077, 113880, 24065, '<td valign="top">The horses are beautiful and the colors are nice.  I would like to offer a few suggestions, if I may:  cropp more off the bottom so that gray thing doesn''t show, cloan/clone (sp?) out the poles in the back and blur the background some.  Hope this is helpful  :)</td>', 'The horses are beautiful and the colors are nice.  I would like to offer a few suggestions, if I may:  cropp more off the bottom so that gray thing doesn''t show, cloan/clone (sp?) out the poles in the back and blur the background some.  Hope this is helpful  :)', '2004-11-03 14:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(989081, 112326, 24065, '<td valign="top">The focus is good and your subject is exceptional!  I''m afraid the cluttered background may hurt your score.  I like the b&amp;w :)</td>', 'The focus is good and your subject is exceptional!  I''m afraid the cluttered background may hurt your score.  I like the b&w :)', '2004-11-03 14:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
