(989095, 112870, 24065, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.  I''m very new to photography so hope you get comments from those more experienced, but I think some diffused lighting would have helped here and also a closer crop at the bottom and right, placing the bee on the lower right third cross-hairs.  :)  Hope these remarks are helpful.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.  I''m very new to photography so hope you get comments from those more experienced, but I think some diffused lighting would have helped here and also a closer crop at the bottom and right, placing the bee on the lower right third cross-hairs.  :)  Hope these remarks are helpful.', '2004-11-03 14:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
