(989196, 117315, 10263, '<td valign="top">She has beautiful eyes. I like the dreamy expression on her face.</td>', 'She has beautiful eyes. I like the dreamy expression on her face.', '2004-11-03 15:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(989201, 114291, 24065, '<td valign="top">The composition is very nice.  Two things which I fear might lower the scores on this one are the noise -- which may have been intentional, and if so I apologize for not realizing that -- and the soft focus.</td>', 'The composition is very nice.  Two things which I fear might lower the scores on this one are the noise -- which may have been intentional, and if so I apologize for not realizing that -- and the soft focus.', '2004-11-03 15:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(989203, 117126, 24065, '<td valign="top">interesting subject -- nice tone</td>', 'interesting subject -- nice tone', '2004-11-03 15:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(989205, 113799, 10263, '<td valign="top">Hmm Counting Crows? I like the smoothness of the water. I would prefer more color I think. I looks like black and white.... but not quite.</td>', 'Hmm Counting Crows? I like the smoothness of the water. I would prefer more color I think. I looks like black and white.... but not quite.', '2004-11-03 15:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(989206, 117178, 28457, '<td valign="top">I''m looking to this photo after a day''s work and feeling relaxed already. great photo.</td>', 'I''m looking to this photo after a day''s work and feeling relaxed already. great photo.', '2004-11-03 15:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(989209, 116056, 24065, '<td valign="top">I love cats!  Just an opinion, but I think the bar across the center of the photo might hurt the scores.  Cropping just below it would have made a nice composition.</td>', 'I love cats!  Just an opinion, but I think the bar across the center of the photo might hurt the scores.  Cropping just below it would have made a nice composition.', '2004-11-03 15:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(989215, 115927, 24065, '<td valign="top">I wish I knew enought about photography to offer you some concrete suggestions here, but I don''t.  I know the photo looks a little cloudy and the feathers on the right side are a little blown out, but can''t tell you what to do to prevent that in the future.  Maybe someone with more experience can help :)</td>', 'I wish I knew enought about photography to offer you some concrete suggestions here, but I don''t.  I know the photo looks a little cloudy and the feathers on the right side are a little blown out, but can''t tell you what to do to prevent that in the future.  Maybe someone with more experience can help :)', '2004-11-03 15:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(989218, 117060, 28457, '<td valign="top">great colors almost feels like i''m there. congratulations !!!</td>', 'great colors almost feels like i''m there. congratulations !!!', '2004-11-03 15:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(989226, 115885, 10263, '<td valign="top">He has a wonderful face. I like the beard stubble :) I don''t care for how his collar fades into the border and I would have prefered a little more space above his hat. Emotive.. makes me smile.. and want to listen to his stories of "how it was back in his time" :)</td>', 'He has a wonderful face. I like the beard stubble :) I don''t care for how his collar fades into the border and I would have prefered a little more space above his hat. Emotive.. makes me smile.. and want to listen to his stories of "how it was back in his time" :)', '2004-11-03 15:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(989227, 111246, 24065, '<td valign="top">I know how difficult it is to photograph butterflies and moths.  However, I do think the focus is a little soft here on the moth, and it also appears that a flash was used which caused some harsh shadows.  Finally, while I know that some subjects should be centered, it doesn''t appear to work in this photo.  I did NOT give you a low score, but just wanted to offer these ideas for the future.  :)</td>', 'I know how difficult it is to photograph butterflies and moths.  However, I do think the focus is a little soft here on the moth, and it also appears that a flash was used which caused some harsh shadows.  Finally, while I know that some subjects should be centered, it doesn''t appear to work in this photo.  I did NOT give you a low score, but just wanted to offer these ideas for the future.  :)', '2004-11-03 15:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(989229, 117093, 28457, '<td valign="top">Amazing reflection.</td>', 'Amazing reflection.', '2004-11-03 15:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(989230, 116740, 24911, '<td valign="top">A nice macro. good use of DOF. BUT, IMHO - a boring subject, and nothing special about the composition.</td>', 'A nice macro. good use of DOF. BUT, IMHO - a boring subject, and nothing special about the composition.', '2004-11-03 15:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(989231, 117092, 28457, '<td valign="top">looks like hand made, great color</td>', 'looks like hand made, great color', '2004-11-03 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(989233, 117079, 28457, '<td valign="top">simply beautiful, congratulations</td>', 'simply beautiful, congratulations', '2004-11-03 15:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(989235, 116340, 24911, '<td valign="top">A great colors. The frame adds interesting aspect. Nicely done. Upgrading from 8 to 10.</td>', 'A great colors. The frame adds interesting aspect. Nicely done. Upgrading from 8 to 10.', '2004-11-03 15:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(989237, 112844, 24911, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. Interesting. good composition. I only wish we could see more of his face. upgrading from 8 to 9.</td>', 'I love this shot. Interesting. good composition. I only wish we could see more of his face. upgrading from 8 to 9.', '2004-11-03 15:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
