(989322, 116535, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is nice. It would be fantastic with a little light on the light house so we could see some detail. The sky is gorgeous.</td>', 'This is nice. It would be fantastic with a little light on the light house so we could see some detail. The sky is gorgeous.', '2004-11-03 15:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(989325, 114560, 22781, '<td valign="top">Nice, would have like to see his face, but still very nice</td>', 'Nice, would have like to see his face, but still very nice', '2004-11-03 15:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(989327, 116372, 22781, '<td valign="top">Great colors, I''m only not to shure about the dreamy look...</td>', 'Great colors, I''m only not to shure about the dreamy look...', '2004-11-03 15:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(989328, 116094, 10263, '<td valign="top">Definately has a WOW impact. The two colors of the sky are amazing.</td>', 'Definately has a WOW impact. The two colors of the sky are amazing.', '2004-11-03 15:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(989329, 116490, 22781, '<td valign="top">They look so sweet, but I guess they bite.....<br/></td>', 'They look so sweet, but I guess they bite.....', '2004-11-03 15:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(989330, 116860, 22781, '<td valign="top">Nice, the colors of the sky and the sand realy go together...<br/>I would have croppe it a bit different...</td>', 'Nice, the colors of the sky and the sand realy go together...I would have croppe it a bit different...', '2004-11-03 15:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(989331, 116317, 10263, '<td valign="top">Should be on a calendar. Love the colors. Not crazy about the frame though.</td>', 'Should be on a calendar. Love the colors. Not crazy about the frame though.', '2004-11-03 15:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(989332, 116621, 22781, '<td valign="top">I''m asking myself what this is...<br/>Give a nice effect</td>', 'I''m asking myself what this is...Give a nice effect', '2004-11-03 15:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(989334, 114755, 22781, '<td valign="top">The light in the clouds is realy interesting enough.. The people in the picture distract...</td>', 'The light in the clouds is realy interesting enough.. The people in the picture distract...', '2004-11-03 16:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(989335, 117085, 22781, '<td valign="top">This is realy a great photo, and I wonder where this is taken...</td>', 'This is realy a great photo, and I wonder where this is taken...', '2004-11-03 16:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(989336, 115705, 23251, '<td valign="top">All the poles and the small size takes a lot away from this photo.</td>', 'All the poles and the small size takes a lot away from this photo.', '2004-11-03 16:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(989337, 117137, 22781, '<td valign="top">Oh no, not more autumn colors....<br/>Just kidding, but there are a lot of these photo''s in the contest and that is why you lose interest in them, seen so many...</td>', 'Oh no, not more autumn colors....Just kidding, but there are a lot of these photo''s in the contest and that is why you lose interest in them, seen so many...', '2004-11-03 16:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(989346, 116844, 22781, '<td valign="top">I am sure I have seen a similar shot somewhere around here, but cant remember where...</td>', 'I am sure I have seen a similar shot somewhere around here, but cant remember where...', '2004-11-03 16:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(989347, 113480, 23251, '<td valign="top">I think brightness of the border lowers the impact that the flowers should have.  Even if it was a gray border that would help IMHO.</td>', 'I think brightness of the border lowers the impact that the flowers should have.  Even if it was a gray border that would help IMHO.', '2004-11-03 16:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(989349, 116335, 22781, '<td valign="top">Could have used just a bit more dof to get the left piece in focus...</td>', 'Could have used just a bit more dof to get the left piece in focus...', '2004-11-03 16:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(989388, 109315, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''m having a hard time figuring this photo out.  The sky almost looks like it was selectively duotoned, but the grass looks so very green that it makes it look like two different photos layered together.The windmills and grasses appear oversharpened.  I love the look of the sky, with the beautiful sun rays coming down, and I love the windmills, but the photo just doesn''t look cohesive to me.</td>', 'I''m having a hard time figuring this photo out.  The sky almost looks like it was selectively duotoned, but the grass looks so very green that it makes it look like two different photos layered together.The windmills and grasses appear oversharpened.  I love the look of the sky, with the beautiful sun rays coming down, and I love the windmills, but the photo just doesn''t look cohesive to me.', '2004-11-03 16:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(989391, 116624, 2553, '<td valign="top">What a lovely shot!  Would have been great for the calendar challenge wouldn''t it?<br/>An idyllic scene, good composition and color, lighting was perfect for you, and I love what you did with the falls.  9</td>', 'What a lovely shot!  Would have been great for the calendar challenge wouldn''t it?An idyllic scene, good composition and color, lighting was perfect for you, and I love what you did with the falls.  9', '2004-11-03 16:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(989393, 115185, 6008, '<td valign="top">How totally funny, I can totally see this turning into one of those images that gets sent around to everyone with a funny caption. You certainly captured it at the right moment and although there are thousands of squirrel pictures out there this stands out as one of the unique ones.</td>', 'How totally funny, I can totally see this turning into one of those images that gets sent around to everyone with a funny caption. You certainly captured it at the right moment and although there are thousands of squirrel pictures out there this stands out as one of the unique ones.', '2004-11-03 16:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(989396, 117283, 2553, '<td valign="top">A fairly powerful shot.  Great color, clarity and composition.</td>', 'A fairly powerful shot.  Great color, clarity and composition.', '2004-11-03 16:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(989398, 113375, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good placement with interesting bokeh. I''m going to guess the lightness of the image was deliberate but my personal opinion is it seems a little too light and would have preferred some more contrast.</td>', 'Good placement with interesting bokeh. I''m going to guess the lightness of the image was deliberate but my personal opinion is it seems a little too light and would have preferred some more contrast.', '2004-11-03 16:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(989401, 117214, 14614, '<td valign="top">Your use of light is amazing.  This photo gives me the feeling of surprise -- like when walking in the forest an strumbling onto a scene that takes ones breathe away.  One of my ribbon picks in this challenge so full of great shots.  BOL</td>', 'Your use of light is amazing.  This photo gives me the feeling of surprise -- like when walking in the forest an strumbling onto a scene that takes ones breathe away.  One of my ribbon picks in this challenge so full of great shots.  BOL', '2004-11-03 16:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(989404, 115968, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of black and white for this.  Though the sharp focus on the grasses tend to draw my eye away from the lioness'' face a bit, I really like the shot.</td>', 'I like the choice of black and white for this.  Though the sharp focus on the grasses tend to draw my eye away from the lioness'' face a bit, I really like the shot.', '2004-11-03 16:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(989405, 116882, 14614, '<td valign="top">A tickle of a shot -- makes me smile to view it.  One of my favorites this challenge</td>', 'A tickle of a shot -- makes me smile to view it.  One of my favorites this challenge', '2004-11-03 16:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(989409, 115998, 6008, '<td valign="top">The pose, lighting, and skin tones look good. The eyes look maybe a tad soft. I like that you''ve included some environment to set a mood although I find my head tilting ever so slightly to the right to straighten up the staircase.</td>', 'The pose, lighting, and skin tones look good. The eyes look maybe a tad soft. I like that you''ve included some environment to set a mood although I find my head tilting ever so slightly to the right to straighten up the staircase.', '2004-11-03 16:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(989411, 115251, 18403, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but blown out highlights in the clouds are distracting.</td>', 'Nice composition but blown out highlights in the clouds are distracting.', '2004-11-03 16:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(989412, 117079, 14614, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait.  You and your model have conspired to create a captivating and engaging photo.  Thanks.  One of my ribbon picks in this challenge filled with great shots.  BOL</td>', 'Wonderful portrait.  You and your model have conspired to create a captivating and engaging photo.  Thanks.  One of my ribbon picks in this challenge filled with great shots.  BOL', '2004-11-03 16:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(989414, 116926, 6008, '<td valign="top">A nicely layered image with foreground, middleground, and background elements. The colors are nice and vivid and yet it does have a slightly dark feel. The water is fairly still with a good reflection to give a tranquil feel. A very peaceful image, I like it.</td>', 'A nicely layered image with foreground, middleground, and background elements. The colors are nice and vivid and yet it does have a slightly dark feel. The water is fairly still with a good reflection to give a tranquil feel. A very peaceful image, I like it.', '2004-11-03 16:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(989416, 111476, 14614, '<td valign="top">Something so serene yet lonely in your shot.  Your use of light and composition creates an excellent mood.  One of my ribbon picks in the challenge filled with great photos.  BOL</td>', 'Something so serene yet lonely in your shot.  Your use of light and composition creates an excellent mood.  One of my ribbon picks in the challenge filled with great photos.  BOL', '2004-11-03 16:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(989421, 114806, 14614, '<td valign="top">strong compositional elements you''ve used here -- quite effectively create a sombre mood.  One of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'strong compositional elements you''ve used here -- quite effectively create a sombre mood.  One of my favorites in this challenge.', '2004-11-03 16:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(989423, 115573, 6008, '<td valign="top">Aha! I remember this from the action thread. You''ve certainly captured the feeling of flight and did an excellent job at stopping the action while still implying plenty of it. The guy contrasts well with the stormy background to give an almost 3d feeling to the image. The white shirt seems to have a yellow cast to it and it''s bordering on being blown out in places too. It certainly works as an action shot.</td>', 'Aha! I remember this from the action thread. You''ve certainly captured the feeling of flight and did an excellent job at stopping the action while still implying plenty of it. The guy contrasts well with the stormy background to give an almost 3d feeling to the image. The white shirt seems to have a yellow cast to it and it''s bordering on being blown out in places too. It certainly works as an action shot.', '2004-11-03 16:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(989443, 115940, 327, '<td valign="top">Looks mystical. Really nice.</td>', 'Looks mystical. Really nice.', '2004-11-03 17:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(989449, 117256, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonder what the joke was? LOL Very unique.</td>', 'Wonder what the joke was? LOL Very unique.', '2004-11-03 17:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(989452, 114199, 22533, '<td valign="top">Would have been awesome if you could have gotten him without the hands holding him up, but otherwise an excellent shot!  Great focus and DOF.</td>', 'Would have been awesome if you could have gotten him without the hands holding him up, but otherwise an excellent shot!  Great focus and DOF.', '2004-11-03 17:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(989453, 116627, 22533, '<td valign="top">Too dark.</td>', 'Too dark.', '2004-11-03 17:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
