(989744, 110954, 3575, '<td valign="top">This is one of the better autumn color compositions. I''m sure you had a good reason for loading such a small image. I hope your original is larger so that you can print it because it is beautiful.</td>', 'This is one of the better autumn color compositions. I''m sure you had a good reason for loading such a small image. I hope your original is larger so that you can print it because it is beautiful.', '2004-11-03 18:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(989748, 113294, 18191, '<td valign="top">Hey...<br/>Nice colors here and good deatil. A couple of problems that I notice witht the image are "jaggies" that are appearing throughout the image. I am not sure if this is done by oversharpening, resampling, or cloning but they are unnatural. Also, it is slightly conspicuous that there was cloning done to the left side of the ladybug on the yellow but great macro with an interesting subject.</td>', 'Hey...Nice colors here and good deatil. A couple of problems that I notice witht the image are "jaggies" that are appearing throughout the image. I am not sure if this is done by oversharpening, resampling, or cloning but they are unnatural. Also, it is slightly conspicuous that there was cloning done to the left side of the ladybug on the yellow but great macro with an interesting subject.', '2004-11-03 18:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(989753, 117227, 18191, '<td valign="top">I like the use of a long shutter speed here. I also like the use of perspective. It is a pretty unteresting shot and I like it overall. One problem that I am coming across is the blown out highlights on the right side of the far end of the tunnel. These could have been cloned our or burnt slightly to make them less noticeable. Other than that, this is an image that I enjoy viewing.</td>', 'I like the use of a long shutter speed here. I also like the use of perspective. It is a pretty unteresting shot and I like it overall. One problem that I am coming across is the blown out highlights on the right side of the far end of the tunnel. These could have been cloned our or burnt slightly to make them less noticeable. Other than that, this is an image that I enjoy viewing.', '2004-11-03 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(989754, 109482, 3575, '<td valign="top">What a charming and heartwarming image! I love that you have their backs turned to the camera. Beautifully lit. I love it. It''s a treasure! 10</td>', 'What a charming and heartwarming image! I love that you have their backs turned to the camera. Beautifully lit. I love it. It''s a treasure! 10', '2004-11-03 19:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(989756, 116884, 18191, '<td valign="top">The first thing that hits me here is the array of reds---very nice. A bit of criticism: if you could have placed the nest along one of the rule of thirds intersections, than this would have been a well balanced image. I am not a huge fan of the ROT but in this instance, i do not see the advantage of having the nest placed where it is. Nice title too :)</td>', 'The first thing that hits me here is the array of reds---very nice. A bit of criticism: if you could have placed the nest along one of the rule of thirds intersections, than this would have been a well balanced image. I am not a huge fan of the ROT but in this instance, i do not see the advantage of having the nest placed where it is. Nice title too :)', '2004-11-03 19:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(989760, 115797, 18191, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  I really like the pose.  With a bit more post-processing, this could have been made into an excellent shot. This is what I would have liked to have seen done. First off all a slight crop on the left to "center" the body. Then I would have cloned the background to make it completely black. I would subsequently play with the levels/contrast and the hue/saturation to lighten up and bring out the feathers of the flamingo. Optionally, I would also dodge the eye slightly. After adding a bit of an Unsharp Mask, this would have been a top shot I believe. Please contact me if you would like me to show you an example of what I am talking about.</td>', 'Good shot.  I really like the pose.  With a bit more post-processing, this could have been made into an excellent shot. This is what I would have liked to have seen done. First off all a slight crop on the left to "center" the body. Then I would have cloned the background to make it completely black. I would subsequently play with the levels/contrast and the hue/saturation to lighten up and bring out the feathers of the flamingo. Optionally, I would also dodge the eye slightly. After adding a bit of an Unsharp Mask, this would have been a top shot I believe. Please contact me if you would like me to show you an example of what I am talking about.', '2004-11-03 19:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(989761, 109482, 26023, '<td valign="top">Absolutely a great shot! The colors and composition  are great. Wish I could tell you what to do make it better but I don''t see a thing to change.</td>', 'Absolutely a great shot! The colors and composition  are great. Wish I could tell you what to do make it better but I don''t see a thing to change.', '2004-11-03 19:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
