(989769, 117292, 26023, '<td valign="top">Great reflection. I really had to look at it for a second to realize it''s not submited upside down</td>', 'Great reflection. I really had to look at it for a second to realize it''s not submited upside down', '2004-11-03 19:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(989770, 116791, 10080, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! Beautiful child. well done!</td>', 'Beautiful shot! Beautiful child. well done!', '2004-11-03 19:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(989771, 112189, 26023, '<td valign="top">I liked the colors in this shot. Wish it had been a larger picture and Trees more in focus</td>', 'I liked the colors in this shot. Wish it had been a larger picture and Trees more in focus', '2004-11-03 19:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(989772, 117003, 18191, '<td valign="top">Good shot and good composition. I like how the grass frames your subject and it is not too distracting. The image seems slightly out of focus, and that might have been helped by an application of Unsharp Mask in Photoshop...one last piece of criticism, one of the stems of the plant behind the squirrel seems to be growing out of his head! Cloning that out would help make that a little bit less distracting :)</td>', 'Good shot and good composition. I like how the grass frames your subject and it is not too distracting. The image seems slightly out of focus, and that might have been helped by an application of Unsharp Mask in Photoshop...one last piece of criticism, one of the stems of the plant behind the squirrel seems to be growing out of his head! Cloning that out would help make that a little bit less distracting :)', '2004-11-03 19:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(989775, 116363, 26023, '<td valign="top">I really can see the story behind the photo even without the title. Great Job!</td>', 'I really can see the story behind the photo even without the title. Great Job!', '2004-11-03 19:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(989777, 117326, 3575, '<td valign="top">Cute picture. It is over exposed. I think it would be better too if it wasn''t cropped so tightly on the right.</td>', 'Cute picture. It is over exposed. I think it would be better too if it wasn''t cropped so tightly on the right.', '2004-11-03 19:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(989781, 117160, 26023, '<td valign="top">Great spot for a photo! I would have liked to see it with a little more light.</td>', 'Great spot for a photo! I would have liked to see it with a little more light.', '2004-11-03 19:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(989784, 116579, 26023, '<td valign="top">Nothing you can say about a beautiful landscape shot. Except Well done!</td>', 'Nothing you can say about a beautiful landscape shot. Except Well done!', '2004-11-03 19:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(989785, 115940, 3575, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful. I love the detail in the rock and especially the ring of clouds.</td>', 'Really beautiful. I love the detail in the rock and especially the ring of clouds.', '2004-11-03 19:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(989788, 116881, 26023, '<td valign="top">Very dark and moody. Nice photo . I would like to see it a little lighter tho</td>', 'Very dark and moody. Nice photo . I would like to see it a little lighter tho', '2004-11-03 19:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(989792, 116312, 10080, '<td valign="top">Nice job! Eyes look great...just a little too centered, and static...but great smiles, nice detail and good lighting! 8</td>', 'Nice job! Eyes look great...just a little too centered, and static...but great smiles, nice detail and good lighting! 8', '2004-11-03 19:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(989793, 111043, 26023, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Makes me feel like i am back on a beach</td>', 'Great shot!  Makes me feel like i am back on a beach', '2004-11-03 19:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(989796, 115482, 10080, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! I LOVE the contrast in colors and lighting! 9</td>', 'Beautiful shot! I LOVE the contrast in colors and lighting! 9', '2004-11-03 19:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(989800, 112238, 10080, '<td valign="top">Great subject, nice lighting, a bit too centered for me. 7</td>', 'Great subject, nice lighting, a bit too centered for me. 7', '2004-11-03 19:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(989803, 117327, 18191, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors in the house here. I really like the subtle and soft blue tone that is resonated throughout the image---splendid! A little bit of criticism: this seems to be a long exposure...There seems a little bit of camera shake on the image which could be avoided by using a shutter release and even with that, to avoid any movement at all--even walking away can disturb the shot! Lastly there are some stray lines in the water in the bottom right of the shot as well in the bottom left that are a little bit distracting, but could easily be cloned out. Cool shot.</td>', 'Very nice colors in the house here. I really like the subtle and soft blue tone that is resonated throughout the image---splendid! A little bit of criticism: this seems to be a long exposure...There seems a little bit of camera shake on the image which could be avoided by using a shutter release and even with that, to avoid any movement at all--even walking away can disturb the shot! Lastly there are some stray lines in the water in the bottom right of the shot as well in the bottom left that are a little bit distracting, but could easily be cloned out. Cool shot.', '2004-11-03 19:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(989806, 114775, 10080, '<td valign="top">great symmatry if thats how ya spell it! Nice lighting, grreat job!8</td>', 'great symmatry if thats how ya spell it! Nice lighting, grreat job!8', '2004-11-03 19:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(989808, 117202, 18191, '<td valign="top">How cute! I like the softness and candid feel of the shot. Very warm tones that really balance out the shot. I can''t think of much that you could really improve the shot by...so...great capture!</td>', 'How cute! I like the softness and candid feel of the shot. Very warm tones that really balance out the shot. I can''t think of much that you could really improve the shot by...so...great capture!', '2004-11-03 19:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(989809, 113838, 3575, '<td valign="top">Beautiful artistry! The lighting is wonderful! I look forward to learning what you used. Again, beautiful and a definate 10!</td>', 'Beautiful artistry! The lighting is wonderful! I look forward to learning what you used. Again, beautiful and a definate 10!', '2004-11-03 19:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(989810, 115130, 18191, '<td valign="top">I think that the colors here are slightly over saturated and possibly too bright. It is a good image in the sense that it is very sharp and well-composed.</td>', 'I think that the colors here are slightly over saturated and possibly too bright. It is a good image in the sense that it is very sharp and well-composed.', '2004-11-03 19:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(989816, 113838, 10080, '<td valign="top">Man....I LOVE your lighting, and subject. Great job...but one nit-pik....the jar needed a bit more lighting for this to be a perfect shot!8</td>', 'Man....I LOVE your lighting, and subject. Great job...but one nit-pik....the jar needed a bit more lighting for this to be a perfect shot!8', '2004-11-03 19:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(989818, 111672, 18191, '<td valign="top">Good shot. It is technically pleasing with the exception of a few blown highlights. When shooting leaves or anything into a bright sky like this i have this method: I get the exposure reading of the sky, then I shoot the whole image with a fill flash to compensate for the underexposed subject (leaves). Lastly, I think that a slight crop on the left to remove some stray leaves is in order here.</td>', 'Good shot. It is technically pleasing with the exception of a few blown highlights. When shooting leaves or anything into a bright sky like this i have this method: I get the exposure reading of the sky, then I shoot the whole image with a fill flash to compensate for the underexposed subject (leaves). Lastly, I think that a slight crop on the left to remove some stray leaves is in order here.', '2004-11-03 19:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(989820, 117019, 18191, '<td valign="top">Good shot---the addition and placement of the human makes it a pleasing image and adds interest. This looks to have slightly fallen victim to the dreaded camera shake, or else it is slightly out of focus. Nothing much that you could do about that---just that darned AF...</td>', 'Good shot---the addition and placement of the human makes it a pleasing image and adds interest. This looks to have slightly fallen victim to the dreaded camera shake, or else it is slightly out of focus. Nothing much that you could do about that---just that darned AF...', '2004-11-03 19:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(989823, 115490, 10080, '<td valign="top">NASTY...but great shot! Love all the colors!8</td>', 'NASTY...but great shot! Love all the colors!8', '2004-11-03 19:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(989829, 109241, 3575, '<td valign="top">OK, this is wonderful. I love it. I love the little pink feet/hands on the cup, I love the look on his face as though he was caught where he wasn''t supposed to be. The crop is perfect, your choice of background and cup are perfect - the blue of the background really sets of the little pink nose and feet. Maybe it''s a hamster? I don''t know my rodents very well. Anyway. I love this one.</td>', 'OK, this is wonderful. I love it. I love the little pink feet/hands on the cup, I love the look on his face as though he was caught where he wasn''t supposed to be. The crop is perfect, your choice of background and cup are perfect - the blue of the background really sets of the little pink nose and feet. Maybe it''s a hamster? I don''t know my rodents very well. Anyway. I love this one.', '2004-11-03 19:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(989837, 117274, 10080, '<td valign="top">WOW that is awesome!!!!! Looks fake to me though?8</td>', 'WOW that is awesome!!!!! Looks fake to me though?8', '2004-11-03 19:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(989845, 115446, 19982, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I wanted to chase a rainbow once ... to get it into position over something of interest.  By the time I could get in the car and get moving it was too far gone.  So you were either in the right spot at the right time, or you really worked for this one.  Great job.  Love the colors, love the composition (subject at bottom with rainbow running across the frame to lead you to it, negative space on the right).  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very nice.  I wanted to chase a rainbow once ... to get it into position over something of interest.  By the time I could get in the car and get moving it was too far gone.  So you were either in the right spot at the right time, or you really worked for this one.  Great job.  Love the colors, love the composition (subject at bottom with rainbow running across the frame to lead you to it, negative space on the right).  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-03 19:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(989846, 115932, 19982, '<td valign="top">Looks like a long exposure with a very small aperture to star the points of light.  Very nice.  Perhaps a tad over sharp and over saturated.  But then, that may be exactly the artistic effect you were going for.  I like it.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Looks like a long exposure with a very small aperture to star the points of light.  Very nice.  Perhaps a tad over sharp and over saturated.  But then, that may be exactly the artistic effect you were going for.  I like it.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-03 19:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(989847, 116139, 19982, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I hope you''ll reveal where this was taken when the challenge is finished.  Good luck!<br/></td>', 'Interesting.  I hope you''ll reveal where this was taken when the challenge is finished.  Good luck!', '2004-11-03 19:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(989851, 116187, 13091, '<td valign="top">Wow!!! nice macro shot</td>', 'Wow!!! nice macro shot', '2004-11-03 19:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(989852, 111744, 19982, '<td valign="top">Hmm....  is it interesting?  Yes.  The negative space makes it interesting.  Is it something I would print and hang on my wall?  Probably not...  does that matter?  I don''t know.  I''m going to score a 5 for now, but come back later and rethink this one.</td>', 'Hmm....  is it interesting?  Yes.  The negative space makes it interesting.  Is it something I would print and hang on my wall?  Probably not...  does that matter?  I don''t know.  I''m going to score a 5 for now, but come back later and rethink this one.', '2004-11-03 19:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(989856, 115678, 3575, '<td valign="top">OMG, I have never, ever seen anything like this! The color just continue layer after layer after layer. Excellent light and excellent exposure. Truly an awe inspiring image. Wow. 10</td>', 'OMG, I have never, ever seen anything like this! The color just continue layer after layer after layer. Excellent light and excellent exposure. Truly an awe inspiring image. Wow. 10', '2004-11-03 19:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(989857, 117003, 22459, '<td valign="top">Good capture with nice lighting. It just needed to be a little sharper around the eye.</td>', 'Good capture with nice lighting. It just needed to be a little sharper around the eye.', '2004-11-03 19:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(989861, 117021, 19982, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I spent several days one vacation trying to get a good pelican picture.  I was never completely satisfied.  This image would have made me very happy.  You got both birds in flight and tack sharp.  And a bunch of youngsters on the water that just tells a whole different story.  I love it.  The framing is good (space on the left for the birds to fly into).  The composition is right (small birds on the bottom third).  The sharpness is good.  Hope you do well in the challenge!<br/></td>', 'Very nice.  I spent several days one vacation trying to get a good pelican picture.  I was never completely satisfied.  This image would have made me very happy.  You got both birds in flight and tack sharp.  And a bunch of youngsters on the water that just tells a whole different story.  I love it.  The framing is good (space on the left for the birds to fly into).  The composition is right (small birds on the bottom third).  The sharpness is good.  Hope you do well in the challenge!', '2004-11-03 19:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(989864, 116340, 19982, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Good luck on the challenge!</td>', 'Very nice!  Good luck on the challenge!', '2004-11-03 19:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(989867, 115927, 19982, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred a cropping more off the top with more of the reflection visible at the bottom.  But otherwise, this is a great shot.  Good luck in the challenge!<br/></td>', 'I think I would have preferred a cropping more off the top with more of the reflection visible at the bottom.  But otherwise, this is a great shot.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-03 19:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(989870, 117209, 3575, '<td valign="top">Really great and fun idea. I like all the different types of leaves in her hair. I have to nit pick a little though, hope it will help. Her chin should not have been cut off and I would have liked a more centered - horizontally - composition. I know it was difficult getting done what was already done and I wouldn''t want to even attempt it. Beautiful and patient model :)</td>', 'Really great and fun idea. I like all the different types of leaves in her hair. I have to nit pick a little though, hope it will help. Her chin should not have been cut off and I would have liked a more centered - horizontally - composition. I know it was difficult getting done what was already done and I wouldn''t want to even attempt it. Beautiful and patient model :)', '2004-11-03 19:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(989871, 117045, 19982, '<td valign="top">Where is the couple?  (just had to ask)<br/> <br/>I like the picture.  The silhouette against the colorful sky works really well.  I even like the frame.  Good luck in the challenge.<br/></td>', 'Where is the couple?  (just had to ask) I like the picture.  The silhouette against the colorful sky works really well.  I even like the frame.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-11-03 19:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(989876, 116699, 19982, '<td valign="top">This might be a bit of a challenge but...  To help separate the dog from his surroundings, I think a shallower depth of field (blurring more of the grass in front and behind the dog) with a better focus right on the dog (right now I think some of the grass is sharper than the dog) would help.  Lighting could also be used to help separate the dog.</td>', 'This might be a bit of a challenge but...  To help separate the dog from his surroundings, I think a shallower depth of field (blurring more of the grass in front and behind the dog) with a better focus right on the dog (right now I think some of the grass is sharper than the dog) would help.  Lighting could also be used to help separate the dog.', '2004-11-03 19:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(989878, 112988, 3575, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous Seattle...Wonderful timing on the light.</td>', 'Gorgeous Seattle...Wonderful timing on the light.', '2004-11-03 19:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(989884, 115846, 19982, '<td valign="top">Stunning!  Absolutely gorgeous.  Love the colors, the highlights (though it''s probably dodge and burn instead of real, it still looks cool).  Composition is good.  Sharpness in detail is good where it counts.  Good luck in the challenge!<br/></td>', 'Stunning!  Absolutely gorgeous.  Love the colors, the highlights (though it''s probably dodge and burn instead of real, it still looks cool).  Composition is good.  Sharpness in detail is good where it counts.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-03 19:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(989888, 115063, 19982, '<td valign="top">What is the subject?  The post, the barbed wire or the shed in the back?  The picture is okay, except that I''m wondering what I''m supposed to look at.  You could also enhance it by saturating the colors a little bit more and perhaps just a slight improvement in sharpness.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What is the subject?  The post, the barbed wire or the shed in the back?  The picture is okay, except that I''m wondering what I''m supposed to look at.  You could also enhance it by saturating the colors a little bit more and perhaps just a slight improvement in sharpness.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-11-03 19:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(989891, 116455, 280, '<td valign="top">Seen similar shots before but this one I can''f fault. Love the movement in the center glass add so much to what would other wise be a static shot. 10</td>', 'Seen similar shots before but this one I can''f fault. Love the movement in the center glass add so much to what would other wise be a static shot. 10', '2004-11-03 19:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(989894, 115073, 19982, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to recommend here... perhaps a different composition that focuses more closely on the ant hill itself?  Or maybe just crop out the bottom part of the picture that is out of focus and keep the line of ants leading up to the ant hill.  The background (which at least is blurred ... good!) is still distracting due to the extreme what on the right.</td>', 'I don''t know what to recommend here... perhaps a different composition that focuses more closely on the ant hill itself?  Or maybe just crop out the bottom part of the picture that is out of focus and keep the line of ants leading up to the ant hill.  The background (which at least is blurred ... good!) is still distracting due to the extreme what on the right.', '2004-11-03 19:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(989902, 109241, 280, '<td valign="top">Focus seems to be on the ears and the paws, I think it should have been on the eyes and nose.</td>', 'Focus seems to be on the ears and the paws, I think it should have been on the eyes and nose.', '2004-11-03 19:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(989906, 114612, 19982, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here...  especially the backlighting of the hair.  Her face seems sharp enough.  But her right shoulder is blurred... perhaps too shallow depth of field?  It just seems odd because it seems like the trees behind her are more in focus than her shoulder.  Another possibility is that her shoulder intruded on the minimum focusing distance of the lens (a real possibility if you used a telephoto/portrait lens).   I love those eyes though...  perhaps a tighter crop to accent the eyes would be just the fix for this image?<br/></td>', 'I like the idea here...  especially the backlighting of the hair.  Her face seems sharp enough.  But her right shoulder is blurred... perhaps too shallow depth of field?  It just seems odd because it seems like the trees behind her are more in focus than her shoulder.  Another possibility is that her shoulder intruded on the minimum focusing distance of the lens (a real possibility if you used a telephoto/portrait lens).   I love those eyes though...  perhaps a tighter crop to accent the eyes would be just the fix for this image?', '2004-11-03 19:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(989907, 116340, 20781, '<td valign="top">Fantatsic tones, the mood is absolutely brilliant in this picture, excellent work.  The whole triptych thing adds an interesting twist also.  This is one of those photos that would look great as a print that takes up an entire wall.</td>', 'Fantatsic tones, the mood is absolutely brilliant in this picture, excellent work.  The whole triptych thing adds an interesting twist also.  This is one of those photos that would look great as a print that takes up an entire wall.', '2004-11-03 19:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(989908, 115199, 280, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and reflections in the water, the ducks almost seem a little dull in comparison!</td>', 'Love the colours and reflections in the water, the ducks almost seem a little dull in comparison!', '2004-11-03 19:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(989910, 115073, 280, '<td valign="top">Would have tried this shot from a different angle to avoid the blown out area in the background.</td>', 'Would have tried this shot from a different angle to avoid the blown out area in the background.', '2004-11-03 20:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(989911, 112326, 19982, '<td valign="top">Good use of shallow depth of field.  Exposure is right.  The kid is certainly cute.  But the picture feels like something is missing ...  like maybe he needs to be put into context.  For example, if this is a hockey stick, then perhaps putting him at the ice rink would finish the picture.  Instead, it looks like a living room or something behind him...  Good luck in the challenge.<br/></td>', 'Good use of shallow depth of field.  Exposure is right.  The kid is certainly cute.  But the picture feels like something is missing ...  like maybe he needs to be put into context.  For example, if this is a hockey stick, then perhaps putting him at the ice rink would finish the picture.  Instead, it looks like a living room or something behind him...  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-11-03 20:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(989912, 109747, 19982, '<td valign="top">Good framing and colors.  I like the picture.  What I think would put it over the top would be a human element ... perhaps someone wearing red casting a fishing line from the water''s edge.  Just a thought.  :-)</td>', 'Good framing and colors.  I like the picture.  What I think would put it over the top would be a human element ... perhaps someone wearing red casting a fishing line from the water''s edge.  Just a thought.  :-)', '2004-11-03 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(989919, 116780, 19982, '<td valign="top">Cute little fella!  Awesome shot!  Love the close-up cropping and the detail in the chipmunk (squirrel?).  Is his nose (and whiskers) out of focus though???</td>', 'Cute little fella!  Awesome shot!  Love the close-up cropping and the detail in the chipmunk (squirrel?).  Is his nose (and whiskers) out of focus though???', '2004-11-03 20:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(989922, 116556, 19982, '<td valign="top">Good timing (on the falling leaf). Nice composition with some really great colors!  Love the lines ... the tree, the fence, the hills, the clouds.  All of them come together nicely.  And some cows in the pasture just to add intrigue...  love it.  Good luck in the challenge!<br/></td>', 'Good timing (on the falling leaf). Nice composition with some really great colors!  Love the lines ... the tree, the fence, the hills, the clouds.  All of them come together nicely.  And some cows in the pasture just to add intrigue...  love it.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-03 20:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(989925, 113914, 19982, '<td valign="top">Looks like fun!  :-)   Love the tack sharpness on the face, especially the eyes, and then the shallow depth of field on the leaves.  It all works quite nicely.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Looks like fun!  :-)   Love the tack sharpness on the face, especially the eyes, and then the shallow depth of field on the leaves.  It all works quite nicely.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-03 20:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(989926, 110365, 19982, '<td valign="top">I hope she''s not a Runaway Bride...   :-)   This is a really nice shot.  I like the lighting.  Good luck in the challenge.<br/></td>', 'I hope she''s not a Runaway Bride...   :-)   This is a really nice shot.  I like the lighting.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-11-03 20:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(989927, 114291, 19982, '<td valign="top">The noise is perhaps on purpose...  for my tastes, there''s just too much of it.  I want to focus on either the intricate parts of the flower or on the bug, but can''t seem to focus on either one.<br/></td>', 'The noise is perhaps on purpose...  for my tastes, there''s just too much of it.  I want to focus on either the intricate parts of the flower or on the bug, but can''t seem to focus on either one.', '2004-11-03 20:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(989928, 117292, 19982, '<td valign="top">Intriguing ... which way is up?  :-)   I like how the plants are down in the water, and the reflection of the trees messes with your mind.  Love the colors!  Good luck with the challenge.<br/></td>', 'Intriguing ... which way is up?  :-)   I like how the plants are down in the water, and the reflection of the trees messes with your mind.  Love the colors!  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-11-03 20:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(989931, 116488, 19982, '<td valign="top">An implied lines challenge outtake?  :-)   Love the lines, the colors, the mountains and the clouds!  Good luck in the challenge!<br/></td>', 'An implied lines challenge outtake?  :-)   Love the lines, the colors, the mountains and the clouds!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-03 20:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(989933, 116915, 19982, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture of birds in flight!  Perfect sharpness with a slight blurring of the tips of the wings to show motion.  Great cropping too.  Good luck in the challenge!<br/></td>', 'Awesome capture of birds in flight!  Perfect sharpness with a slight blurring of the tips of the wings to show motion.  Great cropping too.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-03 20:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(989939, 116832, 19982, '<td valign="top">I think this shot could have been really interesting.  Keep the foreground and background blurred ... but it definitely needs to be much sharper on the bug itself.<br/></td>', 'I think this shot could have been really interesting.  Keep the foreground and background blurred ... but it definitely needs to be much sharper on the bug itself.', '2004-11-03 20:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(989941, 113783, 19982, '<td valign="top">Excellent work.  Good cropping.  Excellent Sharpness in the main subject with some blurring in the legs to reflect motion.  Interresting color on the subject.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Excellent work.  Good cropping.  Excellent Sharpness in the main subject with some blurring in the legs to reflect motion.  Interresting color on the subject.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-03 20:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(989944, 116536, 18985, '<td valign="top">never a fan of ''stock'' like photos but this is very well done.</td>', 'never a fan of ''stock'' like photos but this is very well done.', '2004-11-03 20:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(989945, 116751, 19982, '<td valign="top">Cute little fella!  Interesting shot and lighting.  Good luck in the challenge.<br/></td>', 'Cute little fella!  Interesting shot and lighting.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-11-03 20:18:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(989947, 116780, 18985, '<td valign="top">it looks out of focus but still a nice shot with good colours. next time hit the eye with your focus point!</td>', 'it looks out of focus but still a nice shot with good colours. next time hit the eye with your focus point!', '2004-11-03 20:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(989955, 117051, 19982, '<td valign="top">Is the tree the "subject"?  With it dead center, it makes you wonder - even though it is perhaps the least interesting object in the picture.  Perhaps changing your view point (re-framing the shot) to move the tree over to the 1/3rd line would help.  A long exposure would have made the water interesting.</td>', 'Is the tree the "subject"?  With it dead center, it makes you wonder - even though it is perhaps the least interesting object in the picture.  Perhaps changing your view point (re-framing the shot) to move the tree over to the 1/3rd line would help.  A long exposure would have made the water interesting.', '2004-11-03 20:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(989959, 114023, 19943, '<td valign="top">This is like looking at a picture in National Geographic.  Wonderful color saturation, great composition and title.  This is my only 10.</td>', 'This is like looking at a picture in National Geographic.  Wonderful color saturation, great composition and title.  This is my only 10.', '2004-11-03 20:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(989963, 113913, 19943, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, great capture.  I just love those tree rats; good eatin'' (just kidding).  Great picture, I gave you a 9</td>', 'Nice focus, great capture.  I just love those tree rats; good eatin'' (just kidding).  Great picture, I gave you a 9', '2004-11-03 20:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(989970, 117180, 19943, '<td valign="top">Yowza! ! !  Great color tones: fur, eyes, skin tones, lips.  I liked the subtle shadowing except the one on the right side of her nose, but that''s minor.  A GREAT picture.  I scored a 9</td>', 'Yowza! ! !  Great color tones: fur, eyes, skin tones, lips.  I liked the subtle shadowing except the one on the right side of her nose, but that''s minor.  A GREAT picture.  I scored a 9', '2004-11-03 20:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(989972, 109227, 19943, '<td valign="top">This has to be one of the coolest balloon pics I''ve ever seen.  Great composition. I gave you a 9</td>', 'This has to be one of the coolest balloon pics I''ve ever seen.  Great composition. I gave you a 9', '2004-11-03 20:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(989981, 116696, 19982, '<td valign="top">What a truly wonderfal capture of children and emotion.  I love this picture.  The framing works well.  The colors, the sharpness, the posing (which I''d imagine was not posed at all) work well together.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'What a truly wonderfal capture of children and emotion.  I love this picture.  The framing works well.  The colors, the sharpness, the posing (which I''d imagine was not posed at all) work well together.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-03 20:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(989984, 114045, 19982, '<td valign="top">A great capture with really good framing for the reflection.  I love the colors, but wish you had had a better sky to work with.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'A great capture with really good framing for the reflection.  I love the colors, but wish you had had a better sky to work with.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-03 20:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(989986, 115724, 19982, '<td valign="top">Very interesting!  I don''t care too much for abstracts, but I think this is just beautiful.  Good luck in the challenge!<br/></td>', 'Very interesting!  I don''t care too much for abstracts, but I think this is just beautiful.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-03 20:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(989992, 117136, 19982, '<td valign="top">I would think it would be hard to take this picture and make it look interesting ... yet you have done quite well.  The sharpness, the framing (position of the cows within the picture), the colors, all come together for a great image.  Good luck in the challenge!<br/></td>', 'I would think it would be hard to take this picture and make it look interesting ... yet you have done quite well.  The sharpness, the framing (position of the cows within the picture), the colors, all come together for a great image.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-03 20:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(989995, 110550, 19982, '<td valign="top">Love the image here.  The composition (sea level far down with lots of sky, the boats on the left with room to move to the right), the sharpness in the boats and the bird in the air, and the colors all work very well together.  Good luck in the challenge!<br/></td>', 'Love the image here.  The composition (sea level far down with lots of sky, the boats on the left with room to move to the right), the sharpness in the boats and the bird in the air, and the colors all work very well together.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-03 20:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(989998, 117138, 19982, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Your picture makes me want to go there.  I love the lighting, the colors and the sharpness.  Good luck in the challenge!<br/></td>', 'Awesome!  Your picture makes me want to go there.  I love the lighting, the colors and the sharpness.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-03 20:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(990001, 116643, 19982, '<td valign="top">I love the emotion that has been captured here.  The composition works well as does the background to force you to focus on the people.  Excellent colors and details.  Good luck in the challenge!<br/></td>', 'I love the emotion that has been captured here.  The composition works well as does the background to force you to focus on the people.  Excellent colors and details.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-03 20:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(990003, 116679, 19943, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Not often that you can nail one, but you have with this.</td>', 'Great shot.  Not often that you can nail one, but you have with this.', '2004-11-03 20:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(990004, 117087, 19982, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Love the composition, the placement of the ground and the tree.  Love the colors and the textures.  Great job!  Good luck in the challenge!<br/></td>', 'Love it.  Love the composition, the placement of the ground and the tree.  Love the colors and the textures.  Great job!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-03 20:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(990007, 117128, 19943, '<td valign="top">Very sharp, nice composition, and title.  Not enough feather detail in the lower portion of the shot.  I gave you an 8</td>', 'Very sharp, nice composition, and title.  Not enough feather detail in the lower portion of the shot.  I gave you an 8', '2004-11-03 20:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(990009, 116625, 19943, '<td valign="top">Great skyline.  I wish the sky had been darker than the water, but with a city that big, I bet the clouds are never dark enough.  I gave you an 8</td>', 'Great skyline.  I wish the sky had been darker than the water, but with a city that big, I bet the clouds are never dark enough.  I gave you an 8', '2004-11-03 20:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(990010, 115998, 19982, '<td valign="top">While Michelle is gorgeous... the metal steps with a confused background underneath and behind them just isn''t working for me.  I''d love to see more pictures of her ... she looks very photogenic, so try some different backgrounds and poses and show her off here on the site.<br/></td>', 'While Michelle is gorgeous... the metal steps with a confused background underneath and behind them just isn''t working for me.  I''d love to see more pictures of her ... she looks very photogenic, so try some different backgrounds and poses and show her off here on the site.', '2004-11-03 20:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(990012, 116139, 19943, '<td valign="top">I''m not one to judge artsy photos.  I guess this one really appeals to me.  I like the colors, shapes, lighting, and total effect.  You did a great job.  I gave you an 8</td>', 'I''m not one to judge artsy photos.  I guess this one really appeals to me.  I like the colors, shapes, lighting, and total effect.  You did a great job.  I gave you an 8', '2004-11-03 20:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(990013, 110954, 19982, '<td valign="top">I bet a larger version of this would have been stunning.  (remember you can go up to 640 pixels across)</td>', 'I bet a larger version of this would have been stunning.  (remember you can go up to 640 pixels across)', '2004-11-03 20:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(990015, 116075, 19982, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail in the be and the flower with good blurring (shallow DOF) to the right. Love the colors too.  Good luck in the challenge!<br/></td>', 'Excellent detail in the be and the flower with good blurring (shallow DOF) to the right. Love the colors too.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-03 20:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(990016, 115514, 19943, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I wish that I still lived where there was a Fall season.  I miss everything in your picture.  Great job.</td>', 'Very nice.  I wish that I still lived where there was a Fall season.  I miss everything in your picture.  Great job.', '2004-11-03 20:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(990022, 113172, 19943, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the colors, saturation, and focus.  I really like this; let me know if it goes up for sale.  I gave an 8</td>', 'Nice job with the colors, saturation, and focus.  I really like this; let me know if it goes up for sale.  I gave an 8', '2004-11-03 20:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(990027, 116340, 19943, '<td valign="top">Trying something different might just get this one noticed in a large group of pics.  I like the framing, colors, and composition.</td>', 'Trying something different might just get this one noticed in a large group of pics.  I like the framing, colors, and composition.', '2004-11-03 20:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(990028, 117097, 19982, '<td valign="top">Love it.  I think slightly more dramatic lighting could have made this even better, but I love her eyes.  Good luck in the challenge!<br/></td>', 'Love it.  I think slightly more dramatic lighting could have made this even better, but I love her eyes.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-03 20:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(990034, 113615, 19943, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, Fall.  My favorite season.  Nice blues in the sky to offset the red/orange/browns.</td>', 'Ahhh, Fall.  My favorite season.  Nice blues in the sky to offset the red/orange/browns.', '2004-11-03 20:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(990038, 116643, 19943, '<td valign="top">"Darling" capture.  Maybe Papa needed to select another color for his sweater; it washed out against the backdrop</td>', '"Darling" capture.  Maybe Papa needed to select another color for his sweater; it washed out against the backdrop', '2004-11-03 21:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(990042, 116580, 19943, '<td valign="top">I like this shot''s composition very much.  I might have gotten taller over the leaf to see more of it while still having the trees'' reflection in the water.  Nice job</td>', 'I like this shot''s composition very much.  I might have gotten taller over the leaf to see more of it while still having the trees'' reflection in the water.  Nice job', '2004-11-03 21:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(990045, 116696, 19943, '<td valign="top">I like the frame, composition, colors, and expression of these 2.  Nice balance.  Good job.</td>', 'I like the frame, composition, colors, and expression of these 2.  Nice balance.  Good job.', '2004-11-03 21:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(990049, 116021, 19943, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  I like this kind of action shot</td>', 'Very cool.  I like this kind of action shot', '2004-11-03 21:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(990054, 115715, 19943, '<td valign="top">If only you had captured a water drop on one of the red leaves, but I can appreciate your idea as well.  Nice job</td>', 'If only you had captured a water drop on one of the red leaves, but I can appreciate your idea as well.  Nice job', '2004-11-03 21:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(990057, 116832, 18191, '<td valign="top">The colors here are phenomenal! The neons purples and yellows and theh green--just marvelous...and what an interesting subject matter! I just wish it had been more in focus.</td>', 'The colors here are phenomenal! The neons purples and yellows and theh green--just marvelous...and what an interesting subject matter! I just wish it had been more in focus.', '2004-11-03 21:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(990058, 116926, 19943, '<td valign="top">A little on the dark side, but I like the rule of 1/3''s and location.</td>', 'A little on the dark side, but I like the rule of 1/3''s and location.', '2004-11-03 21:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(990060, 116780, 18191, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...good composition and crop. Just wish that it would be in better focus.</td>', 'Nice shot...good composition and crop. Just wish that it would be in better focus.', '2004-11-03 21:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(990061, 114598, 10413, '<td valign="top">Wow this is awesome!  My husband was in the air force and I showed it to him.  He thought it was great also.  We were curious what you were in taking it?</td>', 'Wow this is awesome!  My husband was in the air force and I showed it to him.  He thought it was great also.  We were curious what you were in taking it?', '2004-11-03 21:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(990062, 115446, 19943, '<td valign="top">I hope that you live at the end of the rainbow, there should be a pot of gold waiting on you.  Great capture.</td>', 'I hope that you live at the end of the rainbow, there should be a pot of gold waiting on you.  Great capture.', '2004-11-03 21:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(990066, 112238, 18191, '<td valign="top">Great shot with great personality. A little bit on the dark side..have you tried a little bit of dodging on him and his clothing and some burning around him? That would improve the image somewhat.</td>', 'Great shot with great personality. A little bit on the dark side..have you tried a little bit of dodging on him and his clothing and some burning around him? That would improve the image somewhat.', '2004-11-03 21:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(990069, 116655, 19943, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome shot.  I have about 300-500 shots of these guys and can appreciate how hard they are to get perfectly.  You''ve done it!! Grreat job.</td>', 'This is an awesome shot.  I have about 300-500 shots of these guys and can appreciate how hard they are to get perfectly.  You''ve done it!! Grreat job.', '2004-11-03 21:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(990070, 117169, 18191, '<td valign="top">Nice play with light...a little bit blown out, but a cool shot.</td>', 'Nice play with light...a little bit blown out, but a cool shot.', '2004-11-03 21:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(990073, 116835, 19943, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape shot.  Vibrant colors, long shadows, and a barn to draw you into the shot.</td>', 'Nice landscape shot.  Vibrant colors, long shadows, and a barn to draw you into the shot.', '2004-11-03 21:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(990075, 116124, 19943, '<td valign="top">Spooky.  I like the vanishing point, leaves on the ground and eerie feel.  Nice job.</td>', 'Spooky.  I like the vanishing point, leaves on the ground and eerie feel.  Nice job.', '2004-11-03 21:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(990077, 116056, 18191, '<td valign="top">Nice clean shot...good conversion...very sharp and rich tones. I think a vertical crop off the top may have helped the image a little bit and the little nail on the pole is a little bit distracting and could easily be cloned out. It may have been impossible at the time but if you could have gotten a catchlight in the cat''s eyes, this would have been top notch. Still a good capture. 7.</td>', 'Nice clean shot...good conversion...very sharp and rich tones. I think a vertical crop off the top may have helped the image a little bit and the little nail on the pole is a little bit distracting and could easily be cloned out. It may have been impossible at the time but if you could have gotten a catchlight in the cat''s eyes, this would have been top notch. Still a good capture. 7.', '2004-11-03 21:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(990082, 112189, 18191, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection and the placement of the horizon is centered which helpes show the sence of tranquility and balance. Unfortuantely, the image is a little bit small.</td>', 'I like the reflection and the placement of the horizon is centered which helpes show the sence of tranquility and balance. Unfortuantely, the image is a little bit small.', '2004-11-03 21:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(990085, 117174, 19943, '<td valign="top">I like all the colors and great focus, but the background green is distracting.</td>', 'I like all the colors and great focus, but the background green is distracting.', '2004-11-03 21:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(990086, 116338, 19943, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape shot, colors are perfect, and you nailed the rule of 1/3''s.</td>', 'Nice landscape shot, colors are perfect, and you nailed the rule of 1/3''s.', '2004-11-03 21:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(990089, 110550, 19943, '<td valign="top">Maybe a tighter focus on the transom with more light could have helped.  I ranked you higher because this is a difficult shot to nail with fading light</td>', 'Maybe a tighter focus on the transom with more light could have helped.  I ranked you higher because this is a difficult shot to nail with fading light', '2004-11-03 21:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(990090, 116833, 19943, '<td valign="top">Cool effect.  I''m curious what it is exactly.</td>', 'Cool effect.  I''m curious what it is exactly.', '2004-11-03 21:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(990095, 116194, 19943, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Waterfalls are great for this time of year.  The foreground needed something; maybe a red/orange leaf on the brown rock at front left?</td>', 'Very nice.  Waterfalls are great for this time of year.  The foreground needed something; maybe a red/orange leaf on the brown rock at front left?', '2004-11-03 21:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
