(990389, 115185, 19943, '<td valign="top">LOL;  tree rats are so full of personality.  nice job.</td>', 'LOL;  tree rats are so full of personality.  nice job.', '2004-11-03 22:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(990392, 112988, 19943, '<td valign="top">Maybe too much sky?  I like the image.</td>', 'Maybe too much sky?  I like the image.', '2004-11-03 22:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(990397, 113913, 23680, '<td valign="top">Made me smile, great shot :)</td>', 'Made me smile, great shot :)', '2004-11-03 22:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(990399, 113799, 19943, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm.  I can''t say that this is the best water shot I''ve seen.  Needs more depth and color.</td>', 'Hmmmm.  I can''t say that this is the best water shot I''ve seen.  Needs more depth and color.', '2004-11-03 22:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(990401, 111102, 28261, '<td valign="top">This is a great photograph that shows off what a digital can do with extremely brilliant colors.  Too bad the window reflections reveal the captivity of the subject.  In a theater that tends to overuse monochome, I find this one very refreshing and well balanced in the cropping too. (8 stars)</td>', 'This is a great photograph that shows off what a digital can do with extremely brilliant colors.  Too bad the window reflections reveal the captivity of the subject.  In a theater that tends to overuse monochome, I find this one very refreshing and well balanced in the cropping too. (8 stars)', '2004-11-03 22:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(990402, 115185, 23680, '<td valign="top">This is just too funny - great title.  Wish foreground was a little clearer, but considering the nature of the shot, it''s not a big deal in my eye</td>', 'This is just too funny - great title.  Wish foreground was a little clearer, but considering the nature of the shot, it''s not a big deal in my eye', '2004-11-03 22:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(990404, 116747, 19943, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the artist Nancy Glazier''s work with Paint horses.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Reminds me of the artist Nancy Glazier''s work with Paint horses.  Nicely done.', '2004-11-03 22:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(990405, 115199, 23680, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous - great colors</td>', 'Gorgeous - great colors', '2004-11-03 22:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(990406, 116744, 19943, '<td valign="top">Nicely focused, good colors</td>', 'Nicely focused, good colors', '2004-11-03 22:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(990407, 117104, 23680, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors</td>', 'Nice composition and colors', '2004-11-03 22:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(990410, 115908, 19943, '<td valign="top">Not going to tell the guy to shave his sideburn, but it is a little distracting to an otherwise "9" or "10" image.</td>', 'Not going to tell the guy to shave his sideburn, but it is a little distracting to an otherwise "9" or "10" image.', '2004-11-03 22:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(990411, 114673, 28261, '<td valign="top">Ewwwww....nasty teeth.  Nice composition. Great use of negative space!</td>', 'Ewwwww....nasty teeth.  Nice composition. Great use of negative space!', '2004-11-03 22:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(990412, 116312, 19943, '<td valign="top">Good portrait work</td>', 'Good portrait work', '2004-11-03 22:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(990414, 115997, 19943, '<td valign="top">Not in B&amp;W.  OK focus, OK DOF, OK appeal.</td>', 'Not in B&W.  OK focus, OK DOF, OK appeal.', '2004-11-03 22:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(990417, 117210, 19943, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, OK focus, good appeal for an image, nice reflection</td>', 'Good DOF, OK focus, good appeal for an image, nice reflection', '2004-11-03 22:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(990418, 109142, 26756, '<td valign="top">You were either lucky or patient to get such a pose.  Either way, great job!</td>', 'You were either lucky or patient to get such a pose.  Either way, great job!', '2004-11-03 22:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(990419, 116546, 23680, '<td valign="top">I like how you filled the entire frame with the seagull (?)</td>', 'I like how you filled the entire frame with the seagull (?)', '2004-11-03 22:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(990420, 116408, 19943, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot (7): great colors, tones, beautiful model, nice focus.  But, the right arm is shadowed and the left side of the image is too dark.</td>', 'I like this one a lot (7): great colors, tones, beautiful model, nice focus.  But, the right arm is shadowed and the left side of the image is too dark.', '2004-11-03 22:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(990422, 110959, 19943, '<td valign="top">Dull colors, OK DOF, soft on focus, OK to look at</td>', 'Dull colors, OK DOF, soft on focus, OK to look at', '2004-11-03 23:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(990423, 117033, 19943, '<td valign="top">Good gosh those eyes are huge.  Very good focus and composition.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Good gosh those eyes are huge.  Very good focus and composition.  Nicely done.', '2004-11-03 23:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(990424, 117010, 28261, '<td valign="top">Very cool staging :) .  I was distracted a lot by the whitened upper right corner tho and your ''human'' subject seemed too saturated for a dead/undead person.  The dry ice on the cauldron is convincing and did a good job at making me not realize that it was plastic until I really thought about it.</td>', 'Very cool staging :) .  I was distracted a lot by the whitened upper right corner tho and your ''human'' subject seemed too saturated for a dead/undead person.  The dry ice on the cauldron is convincing and did a good job at making me not realize that it was plastic until I really thought about it.', '2004-11-03 23:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(990427, 117109, 23680, '<td valign="top">I like this but whatever is in the lower right hand corner behind the leaf is distracting</td>', 'I like this but whatever is in the lower right hand corner behind the leaf is distracting', '2004-11-03 23:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(990428, 111486, 23680, '<td valign="top">This is funny and why are they lifting those guys up by their shorts????</td>', 'This is funny and why are they lifting those guys up by their shorts????', '2004-11-03 23:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(990431, 115909, 28261, '<td valign="top">Wish I could get my dogs to sit still long enough to take a ''look into the lens'' shot with them.  Great color balance and use of thirds.</td>', 'Wish I could get my dogs to sit still long enough to take a ''look into the lens'' shot with them.  Great color balance and use of thirds.', '2004-11-03 23:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(990432, 116744, 23680, '<td valign="top">Just a little too centered maybe, but nice idea and clarity</td>', 'Just a little too centered maybe, but nice idea and clarity', '2004-11-03 23:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(990433, 116338, 28261, '<td valign="top">...stunning...</td>', '...stunning...', '2004-11-03 23:05:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(990434, 117138, 26756, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I was there in 99'' and look forward to going back.  Nice light for these shades of color.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I was there in 99'' and look forward to going back.  Nice light for these shades of color.', '2004-11-03 23:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(990435, 112471, 28261, '<td valign="top">I liked ''they walk perpendicular'' much more, but the contrast with the flat panel is striking too.</td>', 'I liked ''they walk perpendicular'' much more, but the contrast with the flat panel is striking too.', '2004-11-03 23:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(990440, 117097, 28261, '<td valign="top">Nicely balanced, perfect skin and highlights.  The background seems too light (imho) for the shot and the window reflection in her eyes was distracting, but I also know I couldn''t come close to a shot like this.  Very nice.</td>', 'Nicely balanced, perfect skin and highlights.  The background seems too light (imho) for the shot and the window reflection in her eyes was distracting, but I also know I couldn''t come close to a shot like this.  Very nice.', '2004-11-03 23:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(990449, 112366, 17851, '<td valign="top">Great Image, contrast is great...(maybe a little  less of a yellow tone??)..10 and added to my fav.</td>', 'Great Image, contrast is great...(maybe a little  less of a yellow tone??)..10 and added to my fav.', '2004-11-03 23:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(990450, 116696, 28261, '<td valign="top">Even more enticing that you did not b/w this.  Feels NatGeo to me.</td>', 'Even more enticing that you did not b/w this.  Feels NatGeo to me.', '2004-11-03 23:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(990456, 117307, 28261, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasts, but the chin didn''t line up well and detracted a lot from the tearing effect.</td>', 'I like the contrasts, but the chin didn''t line up well and detracted a lot from the tearing effect.', '2004-11-03 23:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(990458, 111102, 22975, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I feel like you should have found a shot that wasn''t so similar to the one you entered into the defining features challenge (I think that was the one).  The angle''s just slightly different, but the photo is essentiallly the same.  Just my opinion.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I feel like you should have found a shot that wasn''t so similar to the one you entered into the defining features challenge (I think that was the one).  The angle''s just slightly different, but the photo is essentiallly the same.  Just my opinion.', '2004-11-03 23:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(990463, 116004, 28261, '<td valign="top">Very emotive.  The low light artifacts and noise actually add to the effect.</td>', 'Very emotive.  The low light artifacts and noise actually add to the effect.', '2004-11-03 23:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(990468, 117207, 22975, '<td valign="top">This looks more like an oil painting... I''m guessing it was neat-imaged heavily... it''s just my opinion, but  this is beginning to stray a little too far from actual photography and crossing more into digital art, which is fine for a genre in itself (and this is a nice example of digital art, if that''s what you''re going for)... but I feel the point of this site is the photography.  I do hope you''ll post the original when the challenge is over, I''d like to see what the real background looks like.  Also, I apologize if I''ve made any assumptions that aren''t correct, and I just want to reiterate that it''s just my opinion.  I hope you''re one that appreciates comments...</td>', 'This looks more like an oil painting... I''m guessing it was neat-imaged heavily... it''s just my opinion, but  this is beginning to stray a little too far from actual photography and crossing more into digital art, which is fine for a genre in itself (and this is a nice example of digital art, if that''s what you''re going for)... but I feel the point of this site is the photography.  I do hope you''ll post the original when the challenge is over, I''d like to see what the real background looks like.  Also, I apologize if I''ve made any assumptions that aren''t correct, and I just want to reiterate that it''s just my opinion.  I hope you''re one that appreciates comments...', '2004-11-03 23:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(990469, 114291, 22975, '<td valign="top">I know you''re going for a stippling effect, but it just looks pixelated to me.  I''m sorry.  I''d be interested to see the original, maybe in color... I just feel like this is lacking something.</td>', 'I know you''re going for a stippling effect, but it just looks pixelated to me.  I''m sorry.  I''d be interested to see the original, maybe in color... I just feel like this is lacking something.', '2004-11-03 23:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(990471, 115212, 28261, '<td valign="top">Looks like you''re giving him a mush needed back scratching.  Never really saw a hippo that looked happy.  Very nice job of muting out the aquarium reflections!!!</td>', 'Looks like you''re giving him a mush needed back scratching.  Never really saw a hippo that looked happy.  Very nice job of muting out the aquarium reflections!!!', '2004-11-03 23:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(990473, 113903, 22975, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure where the visual interest is in this shot, I''m sorry.  I don''t like the pole right in the center, and I wish I could read all of the sign.  A polarizer would have helped with the sky, too.  If you don''t have one of those, I highly recommend one, it''s really helped with my outdoor shots!  These are just my opinions.  If you''re happy, just be happy.  :)</td>', 'I''m not sure where the visual interest is in this shot, I''m sorry.  I don''t like the pole right in the center, and I wish I could read all of the sign.  A polarizer would have helped with the sky, too.  If you don''t have one of those, I highly recommend one, it''s really helped with my outdoor shots!  These are just my opinions.  If you''re happy, just be happy.  :)', '2004-11-03 23:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(990478, 111396, 22975, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but this isn''t one of my favorites in the challenge.  I''m not sure why you chose to keep the grass spriggs in the shot, and it''s taking an awful lot of eye strain to see what that splash subject actually is.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but this isn''t one of my favorites in the challenge.  I''m not sure why you chose to keep the grass spriggs in the shot, and it''s taking an awful lot of eye strain to see what that splash subject actually is.', '2004-11-03 23:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(990481, 115678, 28261, '<td valign="top">I love the balance of the cropping, but the trees look oversaturated and somewhat fake.  Am sure that it was breathtaking to witness in the moment tho.</td>', 'I love the balance of the cropping, but the trees look oversaturated and somewhat fake.  Am sure that it was breathtaking to witness in the moment tho.', '2004-11-03 23:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(990487, 117196, 22975, '<td valign="top">I think this could be improved if it were either centered completely or pushed definitively off-center into one of the power points (in the rule of thirds).  The subject doesn''t wow me, either.  It''s a nice, saturated flame, though.  :)</td>', 'I think this could be improved if it were either centered completely or pushed definitively off-center into one of the power points (in the rule of thirds).  The subject doesn''t wow me, either.  It''s a nice, saturated flame, though.  :)', '2004-11-03 23:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(990488, 117286, 28261, '<td valign="top">please tell me you didn''t superglue that to the end of your finger....</td>', 'please tell me you didn''t superglue that to the end of your finger....', '2004-11-03 23:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(990496, 117327, 28261, '<td valign="top">wow.<br/> Some might say that there is too much of a blue cast on the white house, but I think it draws the whole together very well. Nice rich color.  The trees on the left seem out of focus.</td>', 'wow. Some might say that there is too much of a blue cast on the white house, but I think it draws the whole together very well. Nice rich color.  The trees on the left seem out of focus.', '2004-11-03 23:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(990497, 114432, 22975, '<td valign="top">First, I think you should remove the date from being stamped on the photo... that just screams "snapshot."  I''m not really sure what the title is referring to... is there a person in the background somewhere?  If that''s what that spec is, it really should be focused on more.  Also, I think you should have either cropped out the lamp at the top completely, or included it completely.  Cutting it in half just draws your attention up there and there''s nothing else in the picture that pulls my eye away (except the datestamp).  Lastly, I don''t know if you should have used a tripod or if you were going for some sort of motion look.  To me, and it''s just my silly opinion, this just doesn''t work well.  I think it has potential, though, with a clear, in-focus subject.</td>', 'First, I think you should remove the date from being stamped on the photo... that just screams "snapshot."  I''m not really sure what the title is referring to... is there a person in the background somewhere?  If that''s what that spec is, it really should be focused on more.  Also, I think you should have either cropped out the lamp at the top completely, or included it completely.  Cutting it in half just draws your attention up there and there''s nothing else in the picture that pulls my eye away (except the datestamp).  Lastly, I don''t know if you should have used a tripod or if you were going for some sort of motion look.  To me, and it''s just my silly opinion, this just doesn''t work well.  I think it has potential, though, with a clear, in-focus subject.', '2004-11-03 23:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(990506, 116624, 28261, '<td valign="top">reminds me of a New England postcard.  I want to say a bit unsaturated cuz I like brilliant fall colors, but the levels are perfect with the old mill behind.  Can''t wait to find out where this is....</td>', 'reminds me of a New England postcard.  I want to say a bit unsaturated cuz I like brilliant fall colors, but the levels are perfect with the old mill behind.  Can''t wait to find out where this is....', '2004-11-03 23:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(990507, 117042, 22975, '<td valign="top">This looks a tad out-of-focus to me, and I''m not sure I''m crazy about the crop (although I assume you''re making a statement about Americans and their perceived materialism or focus on money).  I also don''t think the stark white background helps this photo... maybe a shadow would have helped?  Or maybe not, that''s probably just a matter of preference.  :)</td>', 'This looks a tad out-of-focus to me, and I''m not sure I''m crazy about the crop (although I assume you''re making a statement about Americans and their perceived materialism or focus on money).  I also don''t think the stark white background helps this photo... maybe a shadow would have helped?  Or maybe not, that''s probably just a matter of preference.  :)', '2004-11-03 23:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(990511, 114844, 28261, '<td valign="top">Wonder what kind of emotion would have come from reversing the coloration.</td>', 'Wonder what kind of emotion would have come from reversing the coloration.', '2004-11-03 23:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(990540, 114145, 2373, '<td valign="top">very original effect i really like it. 8 Kevin</td>', 'very original effect i really like it. 8 Kevin', '2004-11-04 00:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(990564, 116696, 2373, '<td valign="top">very emational, hits to the heart. 8 Kevin</td>', 'very emational, hits to the heart. 8 Kevin', '2004-11-04 00:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(990567, 113564, 2373, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. Fells like the clouds are closing in on me. Cool. 7 Kevin</td>', 'Great perspective. Fells like the clouds are closing in on me. Cool. 7 Kevin', '2004-11-04 00:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(990572, 109332, 2373, '<td valign="top">I realy like the effect. to be honest i dont like the play on words as its personaly offending, But i will not let that affect you score. 7 Kevin</td>', 'I realy like the effect. to be honest i dont like the play on words as its personaly offending, But i will not let that affect you score. 7 Kevin', '2004-11-04 00:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(990577, 112988, 2373, '<td valign="top">This is a great pisture the way it is, but there seems to be so much more you can get out of it. I E .. sunrise, sunset, cloudy day. etc....  7 Kevin</td>', 'This is a great pisture the way it is, but there seems to be so much more you can get out of it. I E .. sunrise, sunset, cloudy day. etc....  7 Kevin', '2004-11-04 00:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(990578, 117222, 2373, '<td valign="top">I think i know what you were trying for but i dont thing you were able to acheive it. There seems to be the wrong kind of haze in the air and the lighting is not right. 5 Kevin</td>', 'I think i know what you were trying for but i dont thing you were able to acheive it. There seems to be the wrong kind of haze in the air and the lighting is not right. 5 Kevin', '2004-11-04 00:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(990581, 117208, 2373, '<td valign="top">please dont take this negatively, after attempmting many many shots of the moon i have come to the comclusion that all of the really great moon shots have somthing very interesting in the shot with them. i.e...fullmoon sunset going down over a lake with the moons reflection ripp;ling on the water etc....    Just some food for thouth   Kevin</td>', 'please dont take this negatively, after attempmting many many shots of the moon i have come to the comclusion that all of the really great moon shots have somthing very interesting in the shot with them. i.e...fullmoon sunset going down over a lake with the moons reflection ripp;ling on the water etc....    Just some food for thouth   Kevin', '2004-11-04 00:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(990585, 117109, 2373, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice with the desaturated colors. the lower right corner is disrtacting should match the upper right coner that would look cool, try it.   Kevin</td>', 'Interesting choice with the desaturated colors. the lower right corner is disrtacting should match the upper right coner that would look cool, try it.   Kevin', '2004-11-04 00:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(990588, 116816, 2373, '<td valign="top">there seems to be several of us that had the same idea here, I really like the color in the sky and on the top of the trees.  6 Kevin</td>', 'there seems to be several of us that had the same idea here, I really like the color in the sky and on the top of the trees.  6 Kevin', '2004-11-04 00:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(990595, 117169, 24911, '<td valign="top">The light is nice, but the flower itself isn''t a pretty one. the composition is OK, and the background is nicely done. Sorry, but all in all I found it to be an ordinary photo. Nothing exciting about it, and the subject is a little boring. But that''s just me (:</td>', 'The light is nice, but the flower itself isn''t a pretty one. the composition is OK, and the background is nicely done. Sorry, but all in all I found it to be an ordinary photo. Nothing exciting about it, and the subject is a little boring. But that''s just me (:', '2004-11-04 00:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(990635, 115114, 18197, '<td valign="top">IMO this would be better if the image didn''t appear tilted and if you cropped out the pole to the left. What''s left is a really nice image.</td>', 'IMO this would be better if the image didn''t appear tilted and if you cropped out the pole to the left. What''s left is a really nice image.', '2004-11-04 01:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(990637, 115705, 22964, '<td valign="top">should have taken a view without the fence and that light post.<br/></td>', 'should have taken a view without the fence and that light post.', '2004-11-04 01:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(990645, 114797, 22964, '<td valign="top">strong blue cast at the farther landscape. should have removed it and increased red saturation. To show the beautilfulness of this, also some contrast increase would be helpful.<br/></td>', 'strong blue cast at the farther landscape. should have removed it and increased red saturation. To show the beautilfulness of this, also some contrast increase would be helpful.', '2004-11-04 01:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(990647, 116791, 22964, '<td valign="top">I most often dont like babys photos, but the colors and comp of this one are great. 8<br/></td>', 'I most often dont like babys photos, but the colors and comp of this one are great. 8', '2004-11-04 01:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
