(990834, 117051, 16266, '<td valign="top">I think it is a good idea to have the tree in the foreground to creat depth but it is too much ''smack in the middle'' and looks like it just ''got in the way'' of the photograph..  If you moved it to the left perhaps, that might be helpful... put it on the 1/3 line on the left, or a little more over.</td>', 'I think it is a good idea to have the tree in the foreground to creat depth but it is too much ''smack in the middle'' and looks like it just ''got in the way'' of the photograph..  If you moved it to the left perhaps, that might be helpful... put it on the 1/3 line on the left, or a little more over.', '2004-11-04 04:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
