(990838, 117079, 15497, '<td valign="top">Let''s analyze this, then rate it.<br/>Composition = 10<br/>Tonal Range = 10<br/>Model = 10<br/>Light setup = 10+<br/>DOF = 10+<br/> <br/>Let''s sum it up: THE BEST IMAGE I''VE SEEN IN A LONG TIME. ADDING TO FAVORITES! AWESOME AND THANK YOU VERY MUCH. Hope this wins the blue ribbon, and it should! Good luck<br/></td>', 'Let''s analyze this, then rate it.Composition = 10Tonal Range = 10Model = 10Light setup = 10+DOF = 10+ Let''s sum it up: THE BEST IMAGE I''VE SEEN IN A LONG TIME. ADDING TO FAVORITES! AWESOME AND THANK YOU VERY MUCH. Hope this wins the blue ribbon, and it should! Good luck', '2004-11-04 04:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
