(990840, 115482, 16266, '<td valign="top">This image is really great.  I love the simplicity of the deep blue sky and the yellow sand.  It looks quite neatimaged and soft.. and i think it is a bit overdone... but it is still a very nice image, with great abstract shapes.</td>', 'This image is really great.  I love the simplicity of the deep blue sky and the yellow sand.  It looks quite neatimaged and soft.. and i think it is a bit overdone... but it is still a very nice image, with great abstract shapes.', '2004-11-04 04:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
