(991260, 110365, 25873, '<td valign="top">I can''t stop looking at this picture.  My head is immediately filled with questions:  is she hiding?  Is she trying to run away?  Is she trapped?  Or is she just waiting for someone?  The lighting is outstanding, the soft focus is perfect, this is the first 10 I''ve ever given and my favourite picture ever on this site.</td>', 'I can''t stop looking at this picture.  My head is immediately filled with questions:  is she hiding?  Is she trying to run away?  Is she trapped?  Or is she just waiting for someone?  The lighting is outstanding, the soft focus is perfect, this is the first 10 I''ve ever given and my favourite picture ever on this site.', '2004-11-04 10:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(991264, 116312, 3102, '<td valign="top">Super shot!  This reminds me of one of those stock pictures they use when you buy a new picture frame.  I mean this in a nice way!  They always have well-done shots with very photogenic people in them... and this certainly fits the bill.</td>', 'Super shot!  This reminds me of one of those stock pictures they use when you buy a new picture frame.  I mean this in a nice way!  They always have well-done shots with very photogenic people in them... and this certainly fits the bill.', '2004-11-04 10:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
