(991909, 117079, 13602, '<td valign="top">... beautiful! I like this, it''s a nicely done portrait, the only improovement I can suggest to it is to make the blurry bottom part darker with a gradient overlay. I don''t know how much you agree or disagree with postprocessing but that would make that part less distracting and would push the eye more thowards the subject. Good luck!</td>', '... beautiful! I like this, it''s a nicely done portrait, the only improovement I can suggest to it is to make the blurry bottom part darker with a gradient overlay. I don''t know how much you agree or disagree with postprocessing but that would make that part less distracting and would push the eye more thowards the subject. Good luck!', '2004-11-04 15:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(991912, 116384, 22046, '<td valign="top">I like the crop and the lighting. The focus feels just a soft to me.</td>', 'I like the crop and the lighting. The focus feels just a soft to me.', '2004-11-04 15:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(991913, 114484, 13602, '<td valign="top">This is just perfect, can''t say much more other than WOW! great work, best I seen so far in the challenge.</td>', 'This is just perfect, can''t say much more other than WOW! great work, best I seen so far in the challenge.', '2004-11-04 15:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(991917, 115724, 22046, '<td valign="top">Well now! This is very fine. The soft focus background and the sharp focus drops of water and the way the colors interract make this one really stand out. Excellent idea well realized.</td>', 'Well now! This is very fine. The soft focus background and the sharp focus drops of water and the way the colors interract make this one really stand out. Excellent idea well realized.', '2004-11-04 15:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
