(991963, 117209, 22781, '<td valign="top">Another love me or hate me photo, I hate that, it''s difficult to comment on.<br/>This is very different from all other shots in the challenge,, I think it''s takes a lot of guts to send in a photo like this. It''s strange and funny at the same time. I think you might see a lot of high votes and around the same amount of low votes, but by the way this photo is composed I guess you didn''t take it for the score.<br/>I think its good and I like it...</td>', 'Another love me or hate me photo, I hate that, it''s difficult to comment on.This is very different from all other shots in the challenge,, I think it''s takes a lot of guts to send in a photo like this. It''s strange and funny at the same time. I think you might see a lot of high votes and around the same amount of low votes, but by the way this photo is composed I guess you didn''t take it for the score.I think its good and I like it...', '2004-11-04 16:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(991967, 111575, 24846, '<td valign="top">Lovely tranquil study, with the soft creek and red foliage. -8-</td>', 'Lovely tranquil study, with the soft creek and red foliage. -8-', '2004-11-04 16:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
