(992034, 116833, 18191, '<td valign="top">Very cool lioghting. I like how the blue balances out with the bright yellow. Nice exposure and very good idea to include people there, rather than just the ride. It provides a more interesting subject matter. Good job.</td>', 'Very cool lioghting. I like how the blue balances out with the bright yellow. Nice exposure and very good idea to include people there, rather than just the ride. It provides a more interesting subject matter. Good job.', '2004-11-04 16:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(992037, 113375, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and shot.  It looks like this has not had its levels adjusted.  That is, there are no blacks anywhere in the photo, even in the shadow areas.  Also, the stem is overexposed.  A photo with proper or even a little "too much" contrast stands out more and is pleasing to view.</td>', 'Nice composition and shot.  It looks like this has not had its levels adjusted.  That is, there are no blacks anywhere in the photo, even in the shadow areas.  Also, the stem is overexposed.  A photo with proper or even a little "too much" contrast stands out more and is pleasing to view.', '2004-11-04 16:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(992038, 116791, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is one of the most amazing baby portraits I''ve ever seen.   She is too cute to be real!   The longer I look at it, the more perfect it looks.  Really, really REALLY easy 10</td>', 'This is one of the most amazing baby portraits I''ve ever seen.   She is too cute to be real!   The longer I look at it, the more perfect it looks.  Really, really REALLY easy 10', '2004-11-04 16:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(992041, 116364, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good catch, and the water and light look good here.  While the foreground serves to frame the racoon, it is also very distracting (because it''s colorful and bright).  Also using foreground for framing typically works better if it extends to the edge of the photo.</td>', 'Good catch, and the water and light look good here.  While the foreground serves to frame the racoon, it is also very distracting (because it''s colorful and bright).  Also using foreground for framing typically works better if it extends to the edge of the photo.', '2004-11-04 16:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
