(992312, 116338, 18197, '<td valign="top">I have spent quite a bit of time in Morocco and in the Sahara. This reminds me very much of what I saw there. The composition is terrific. I like the zones of the photo (plane, dunes, mountains, clouds and sky) and the way they reinforce each other. I like the dramatic contrast fo the dunes and their perfectly captured color. I like the light falling on the brooding mountains that seem to be watching over the dunes like a parent watching over a child. I''d like to know where you took this. You really nailed it! (10)</td>', 'I have spent quite a bit of time in Morocco and in the Sahara. This reminds me very much of what I saw there. The composition is terrific. I like the zones of the photo (plane, dunes, mountains, clouds and sky) and the way they reinforce each other. I like the dramatic contrast fo the dunes and their perfectly captured color. I like the light falling on the brooding mountains that seem to be watching over the dunes like a parent watching over a child. I''d like to know where you took this. You really nailed it! (10)', '2004-11-04 19:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(992315, 117085, 11756, '<td valign="top">nice shot, love the H2O quality.</td>', 'nice shot, love the H2O quality.', '2004-11-04 19:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(992321, 116579, 11756, '<td valign="top">breathtaking.  NIce depth. Woulda cropped the top a tiny bit.  Great shot</td>', 'breathtaking.  NIce depth. Woulda cropped the top a tiny bit.  Great shot', '2004-11-04 20:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(992323, 114598, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am an airshow buff and have seen many many jets form similar vapor bursts but can never seem to capture them with my camera. Right place, right time for you! Very dramatic. Very action-filled. Outstanding focus. Very good technical capture. My only nit, and it''s a small one, ... I might have tried to fiddle with the sky to create a bit more drama behind the plane. Especially below and to the left. I can see the detail is there, and it would take a subtle hand with PS to pull it off. Might be worth a try for a print. (10)</td>', 'I am an airshow buff and have seen many many jets form similar vapor bursts but can never seem to capture them with my camera. Right place, right time for you! Very dramatic. Very action-filled. Outstanding focus. Very good technical capture. My only nit, and it''s a small one, ... I might have tried to fiddle with the sky to create a bit more drama behind the plane. Especially below and to the left. I can see the detail is there, and it would take a subtle hand with PS to pull it off. Might be worth a try for a print. (10)', '2004-11-04 20:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(992324, 116426, 19943, '<td valign="top">Why no color?  As is, the ruin is OK to look at, but not a WOW.</td>', 'Why no color?  As is, the ruin is OK to look at, but not a WOW.', '2004-11-04 20:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
