(992334, 112981, 19943, '<td valign="top">Although it is a fine image, I''ve seen better ones.  Unfortunately, the rock backdrop doesn''t work for a traditional "jungle" shot.  The gorilla seems overdone (postediting?).  However, I do like the title, his expression and the focus on the eyes.</td>', 'Although it is a fine image, I''ve seen better ones.  Unfortunately, the rock backdrop doesn''t work for a traditional "jungle" shot.  The gorilla seems overdone (postediting?).  However, I do like the title, his expression and the focus on the eyes.', '2004-11-04 20:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
