(992430, 111788, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color contrast of the red and the green.  Because the contrast is so important here, I think it would have a better "gestalt" if you cropped the bottom up to the green.  Then it''s almost an abstract painting!</td>', 'Beautiful color contrast of the red and the green.  Because the contrast is so important here, I think it would have a better "gestalt" if you cropped the bottom up to the green.  Then it''s almost an abstract painting!', '2004-11-04 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
