(992550, 117115, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments.<br/>Very well done with a killer high key look. It is not a piece of cake to photograph and there is a danger when the model goes on their knees. It is always better to have the patela rest on a hard surface so as to mauntain the shape of the lower thigh. The right leg is perfect, the left is sinking into the white and creating a straight lines that from joint all the way across. Regardles the genetal pose is good and the facial expression very nice. Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comments.Very well done with a killer high key look. It is not a piece of cake to photograph and there is a danger when the model goes on their knees. It is always better to have the patela rest on a hard surface so as to mauntain the shape of the lower thigh. The right leg is perfect, the left is sinking into the white and creating a straight lines that from joint all the way across. Regardles the genetal pose is good and the facial expression very nice. Bumping up.', '2004-11-04 22:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
