(992595, 114484, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments.<br/>This is a high quality artistic study of great depth. The sepia adds to the character and the pose is well stated in the classical form with the light playing about in the wisely constrained space which lends intimacy and evokes subtle feelings. The partially veiled face and the distant, yet not so far subject makes this a figure of the imagination. Kudos to your achievement for I have not seen such a beaitiful composition in this site. So lovely that it goes into my favs at once. Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comments.This is a high quality artistic study of great depth. The sepia adds to the character and the pose is well stated in the classical form with the light playing about in the wisely constrained space which lends intimacy and evokes subtle feelings. The partially veiled face and the distant, yet not so far subject makes this a figure of the imagination. Kudos to your achievement for I have not seen such a beaitiful composition in this site. So lovely that it goes into my favs at once. Bumping up.', '2004-11-04 22:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
