(992661, 117328, 19982, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  I love the soft background against the perfectly sharp butterfly and the flower it is on.  And the backlighting adds a lot of life to the butterfly.  I hope to see this picture right up near the top!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This is beautiful.  I love the soft background against the perfectly sharp butterfly and the flower it is on.  And the backlighting adds a lot of life to the butterfly.  I hope to see this picture right up near the top!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-04 23:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(992665, 114388, 22046, '<td valign="top">Great use of color and saturation.</td>', 'Great use of color and saturation.', '2004-11-04 23:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(992666, 117092, 19982, '<td valign="top">Wow... is that for real?  My pictures rarely look as good as the real life scene .. I would love to have seen what you saw here.  Love the colors and the textures!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Wow... is that for real?  My pictures rarely look as good as the real life scene .. I would love to have seen what you saw here.  Love the colors and the textures!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-04 23:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(992667, 109506, 19982, '<td valign="top">I love the depth of field... the sharpness of the monkey against a beautifully blurred background.  The exposure and colors are superb.  The one recommendation I would make (and this might not have been possible) is that animals, like people, are more interesting when you can see their faces.  You''ve got a profile here and that''s great...  had she turned just a little more towards the camera, enough to really see the eyes, I think it would have been perfect.  Great job!  I hope you do well in the challenge!</td>', 'I love the depth of field... the sharpness of the monkey against a beautifully blurred background.  The exposure and colors are superb.  The one recommendation I would make (and this might not have been possible) is that animals, like people, are more interesting when you can see their faces.  You''ve got a profile here and that''s great...  had she turned just a little more towards the camera, enough to really see the eyes, I think it would have been perfect.  Great job!  I hope you do well in the challenge!', '2004-11-04 23:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(992668, 116340, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like the edit.  I think it makes it bolder.</td>', 'I like the edit.  I think it makes it bolder.', '2004-11-04 23:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(992670, 111248, 22046, '<td valign="top">Amazing color here. Love the purple background.</td>', 'Amazing color here. Love the purple background.', '2004-11-04 23:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(992671, 115117, 19982, '<td valign="top">Looks like a lot of dodging and burning... still, I love it.  Great colors, great lighting.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Looks like a lot of dodging and burning... still, I love it.  Great colors, great lighting.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-04 23:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(992673, 115054, 19982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I love how you''ve captured the colors, the softness and the intricate details of the flower and placed it all against a beautifully blurred background.  Great job!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Beautiful.  I love how you''ve captured the colors, the softness and the intricate details of the flower and placed it all against a beautifully blurred background.  Great job!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-04 23:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(992675, 116081, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/>Like the pink floyd album. Great mood shot with solar reflection. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments.Like the pink floyd album. Great mood shot with solar reflection. Bumping up.', '2004-11-04 23:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(992676, 117157, 19982, '<td valign="top">Amazing how a piece of junk, when viewed through the lens of an artist, can become a work of art.  :-)   Great shot.  I love the colors, textures and composition.  It may be a tad oversharpened (leaves tend to look oversharpened even while other parts may need more sharpening).  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Amazing how a piece of junk, when viewed through the lens of an artist, can become a work of art.  :-)   Great shot.  I love the colors, textures and composition.  It may be a tad oversharpened (leaves tend to look oversharpened even while other parts may need more sharpening).  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-04 23:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(992677, 114388, 19982, '<td valign="top">Wow...  Let me say it again:  WOW!  I''m flagging this one for the blue.  I''ll be back later to see if I was right.  :-)</td>', 'Wow...  Let me say it again:  WOW!  I''m flagging this one for the blue.  I''ll be back later to see if I was right.  :-)', '2004-11-05 00:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(992678, 115821, 19982, '<td valign="top">The one thing that would have made this shot better ... is if the fly were facing the other direction.  Animals, insects, people...  they all look better from the front.  We''re naturally drawn to the eyes.  Other than that ... I LOVE THIS SHOT.  Excellent detail in the wings, in the hair on the fly, in the leaves and a beautifully blurred (by DOF) background.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'The one thing that would have made this shot better ... is if the fly were facing the other direction.  Animals, insects, people...  they all look better from the front.  We''re naturally drawn to the eyes.  Other than that ... I LOVE THIS SHOT.  Excellent detail in the wings, in the hair on the fly, in the leaves and a beautifully blurred (by DOF) background.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-05 00:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
