(992886, 117147, 22964, '<td valign="top">beautiful but somewhat overexposed waterfall. To avoid this lower the exposure time. This of course creates not a so softy water, so probalby you''ll need a ND filter with higher grade.</td>', 'beautiful but somewhat overexposed waterfall. To avoid this lower the exposure time. This of course creates not a so softy water, so probalby you''ll need a ND filter with higher grade.', '2004-11-05 05:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(992887, 112037, 22964, '<td valign="top">beautiful combination of sand, wood and leaves.soft colors, 9</td>', 'beautiful combination of sand, wood and leaves.soft colors, 9', '2004-11-05 05:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(992888, 116546, 22964, '<td valign="top">attractive blue sky</td>', 'attractive blue sky', '2004-11-05 05:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(992889, 109199, 22964, '<td valign="top">good exposure, avoiding highlights in the water<br/></td>', 'good exposure, avoiding highlights in the water', '2004-11-05 05:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(992891, 115556, 22964, '<td valign="top">colorfull!</td>', 'colorfull!', '2004-11-05 05:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(992894, 116340, 22964, '<td valign="top">original idea, 3 frames!!</td>', 'original idea, 3 frames!!', '2004-11-05 06:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(992898, 114797, 24486, '<td valign="top">Isnt this the just  most awe inspiring sight? Very hard to capture in a single photograph. Good effort though. Seeing this photograph brings back a lot of good memories for me.</td>', 'Isnt this the just  most awe inspiring sight? Very hard to capture in a single photograph. Good effort though. Seeing this photograph brings back a lot of good memories for me.', '2004-11-05 06:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(992901, 116021, 19982, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done!  You caught the breaking waves at just the right moment.  I love the sharpness in the details, combined with the softness from the breaking waves.  And the colors are awesome.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Beautifully done!  You caught the breaking waves at just the right moment.  I love the sharpness in the details, combined with the softness from the breaking waves.  And the colors are awesome.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-05 06:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(992903, 111102, 19982, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this picture and love the idea of it being so close up.  I have two minor complaints:  1) It doesn''t seem as sharp as it should be ... perhaps the DoF was too shallow, and 2) I like to see a reflection of light in the eyes (it makes them look alive), but in this case, there is too much light in the eyes and it is actually making it hard to see what should be the most compelling part of the image.  In any case, it''s still a great image.  I hope to see this one up in the top 10.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I love the colors in this picture and love the idea of it being so close up.  I have two minor complaints:  1) It doesn''t seem as sharp as it should be ... perhaps the DoF was too shallow, and 2) I like to see a reflection of light in the eyes (it makes them look alive), but in this case, there is too much light in the eyes and it is actually making it hard to see what should be the most compelling part of the image.  In any case, it''s still a great image.  I hope to see this one up in the top 10.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-05 06:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(992905, 111963, 22781, '<td valign="top">Realy fun composition. Duotone conversion works.</td>', 'Realy fun composition. Duotone conversion works.', '2004-11-05 06:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(992906, 117272, 22781, '<td valign="top">Nice all those colors, but I wish there was something exciting going on in this shot.</td>', 'Nice all those colors, but I wish there was something exciting going on in this shot.', '2004-11-05 07:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(992907, 113451, 22781, '<td valign="top">Guess that this is a IR shot?<br/></td>', 'Guess that this is a IR shot?', '2004-11-05 07:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
