(993322, 117207, 18197, '<td valign="top">There is a Spanish contemporary artist (whose work I quite like but whose name I can''t remember)  that does pueblo scenes in the style of your background. For me this is among my top picks in the challenge. The sharp focus on the bird contrasts well with the ultra-soft focus of the background, as do the colors. Composition is wonderful, not just the placement of the bird but also the blurred shapes of the background. Colors are appealing especially during the Fall in N. America. I confess you lost me with the title, but I don''t care. Beautiful photo.</td>', 'There is a Spanish contemporary artist (whose work I quite like but whose name I can''t remember)  that does pueblo scenes in the style of your background. For me this is among my top picks in the challenge. The sharp focus on the bird contrasts well with the ultra-soft focus of the background, as do the colors. Composition is wonderful, not just the placement of the bird but also the blurred shapes of the background. Colors are appealing especially during the Fall in N. America. I confess you lost me with the title, but I don''t care. Beautiful photo.', '2004-11-05 13:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
