(993334, 117021, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is really nice. I like the dynamics of the flight of the Pelicans (?) which contrasts well with the static cluster of birds below. The foggy background is a perfect backdrop, bright enough to set off the birds, translucent enough to see some detail and break up the monotany. Reflections add depth. Among my top picks this challenge.</td>', 'This is really nice. I like the dynamics of the flight of the Pelicans (?) which contrasts well with the static cluster of birds below. The foggy background is a perfect backdrop, bright enough to set off the birds, translucent enough to see some detail and break up the monotany. Reflections add depth. Among my top picks this challenge.', '2004-11-05 13:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(993335, 116753, 17033, '<td valign="top">Hello, my name is Ben and I''m an obsessive cropper. Now that''s out of the way...the lions seem to make a square in the picture: how about cropping down to that shape. Good capture.</td>', 'Hello, my name is Ben and I''m an obsessive cropper. Now that''s out of the way...the lions seem to make a square in the picture: how about cropping down to that shape. Good capture.', '2004-11-05 13:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
