(993340, 112366, 17033, '<td valign="top">Oooh! I was here just a couple of weeks ago (see portfolio for similar shots). Did you try to take a shot from the wooden walkway on the bank? Shakes like trampoline every time someone walks by! Very nice and moody sky and Liffey but the buildings and bridge seem a tad to contrasty. Nice shot overall.</td>', 'Oooh! I was here just a couple of weeks ago (see portfolio for similar shots). Did you try to take a shot from the wooden walkway on the bank? Shakes like trampoline every time someone walks by! Very nice and moody sky and Liffey but the buildings and bridge seem a tad to contrasty. Nice shot overall.', '2004-11-05 13:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(993341, 116340, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is an outstanding photo to start with. Colors are beautiful. Foggy mist well captured with perfect blend of contrast and translucency. Powerful composition with trees and hills. I am not normally a fan of borders but this border treatment really enhances the photo. Among my top picks.</td>', 'This is an outstanding photo to start with. Colors are beautiful. Foggy mist well captured with perfect blend of contrast and translucency. Powerful composition with trees and hills. I am not normally a fan of borders but this border treatment really enhances the photo. Among my top picks.', '2004-11-05 13:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(993344, 117126, 17033, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and tone..very serene image</td>', 'Excellent lighting and tone..very serene image', '2004-11-05 13:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(993346, 109951, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is "National Geographic" quality. Congratulations on a great photo! Composition, colors, focus, DOF, crisp details ... all just spot on. Among my top picks. Hope it ribbons.</td>', 'This is "National Geographic" quality. Congratulations on a great photo! Composition, colors, focus, DOF, crisp details ... all just spot on. Among my top picks. Hope it ribbons.', '2004-11-05 13:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
