(993349, 116621, 18197, '<td valign="top">This abstract appeals to me on a lot of levels. I like the repeated forms. I like the smooth gradients of light and shadow. I like the angled composition. DOF maintained focus throughout. Very well done and among my top picks.</td>', 'This abstract appeals to me on a lot of levels. I like the repeated forms. I like the smooth gradients of light and shadow. I like the angled composition. DOF maintained focus throughout. Very well done and among my top picks.', '2004-11-05 13:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(993354, 117232, 22964, '<td valign="top">good exposure, but the lights are not the most noticeable part of the shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-08 08:30:12.</i></td>', 'good exposure, but the lights are not the most noticeable part of the shot.', '2004-11-05 13:24:35.000000', '2004-11-08 08:30:12.000000', 1),
(993356, 115122, 18197, '<td valign="top">Okay, that does it. I have seen many beautiful pictures of Iceland, including this one. I''ve gotta go.<br/> <br/>I like the composition. The hills under the road with the lines in the field running perpendicular to the road is powerful. Sunlight contrasted with shadow and the darkening sky is very nice. The contrast in scale (foreground and background) is nice. Well done. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Okay, that does it. I have seen many beautiful pictures of Iceland, including this one. I''ve gotta go. I like the composition. The hills under the road with the lines in the field running perpendicular to the road is powerful. Sunlight contrasted with shadow and the darkening sky is very nice. The contrast in scale (foreground and background) is nice. Well done. Among my top picks.', '2004-11-05 13:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(993358, 115846, 18197, '<td valign="top">Among my top picks. Dramatic sky is nice. The composition is arranged to force your eye upwards, no matter where you start makes it an "uplifting" photo. Very nice range in colors and levels. DOF preserves the detail of the whole photo. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Among my top picks. Dramatic sky is nice. The composition is arranged to force your eye upwards, no matter where you start makes it an "uplifting" photo. Very nice range in colors and levels. DOF preserves the detail of the whole photo. Very nicely done.', '2004-11-05 13:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(993361, 115940, 18197, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the Cascade (or possibly Olympic) Mountains the the Pacific Northwest US. Wonderfully captures the first snowfall feel. Crisp. Clear. The clouds add a nice dynamic touch. The whole scene feels fragile, like it will be gone in an hour, and demands that you appreciate it RIGHT NOW or you''ll miss it. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Reminds me of the Cascade (or possibly Olympic) Mountains the the Pacific Northwest US. Wonderfully captures the first snowfall feel. Crisp. Clear. The clouds add a nice dynamic touch. The whole scene feels fragile, like it will be gone in an hour, and demands that you appreciate it RIGHT NOW or you''ll miss it. Among my top picks.', '2004-11-05 13:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(993362, 113172, 22964, '<td valign="top">Wow, a pro shot. 10<br/>into my favs.</td>', 'Wow, a pro shot. 10into my favs.', '2004-11-05 13:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(993363, 115446, 22781, '<td valign="top">Rainvows are always beautifull, and give me a happy feeling.<br/>I realy like how the sun is shining on the field..</td>', 'Rainvows are always beautifull, and give me a happy feeling.I realy like how the sun is shining on the field..', '2004-11-05 13:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(993367, 117021, 1827, '<td valign="top">I have come back to look at this photo at least 20 times.  I like it that much.  This is tied with one other for my top pic and if one of those two doesn''t win I''m staging a protest.<br/> <br/>Bumped to 10.<br/> <br/>Splendid.  Really.  The softness, the yellow, the choice of cropping.  Excellent work. 9, just-married</td>', 'I have come back to look at this photo at least 20 times.  I like it that much.  This is tied with one other for my top pic and if one of those two doesn''t win I''m staging a protest. Bumped to 10. Splendid.  Really.  The softness, the yellow, the choice of cropping.  Excellent work. 9, just-married', '2004-11-05 13:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(993369, 115482, 18197, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the Sahara. Very nicely captured. I like the composition, especially the negative space and the way the flow of the sand guides my eye around. Stark contrast between sand and mountains works well for me. Focus is excellent throughout. I love the detail of the sand in the shadow in the center of the photo. My only nit, and it''s minor really, is that I would have cloned out two spots on the image ... one in the lower left corner and one just below the ridgeline of the sand about 20% in from the left.  This is among my top picks this challenge.</td>', 'Reminds me of the Sahara. Very nicely captured. I like the composition, especially the negative space and the way the flow of the sand guides my eye around. Stark contrast between sand and mountains works well for me. Focus is excellent throughout. I love the detail of the sand in the shadow in the center of the photo. My only nit, and it''s minor really, is that I would have cloned out two spots on the image ... one in the lower left corner and one just below the ridgeline of the sand about 20% in from the left.  This is among my top picks this challenge.', '2004-11-05 13:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(993370, 114082, 1827, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to look at this photo - it''s really just gorgeous.  This is tied with one other for my top pic and if one of those two doesn''t win I''m staging a protest.<br/> <br/>Given a 10 on my first pass through, which I very rarely do.  Just fabulous.  Into my favs it goes.  10, just-married</td>', 'I keep coming back to look at this photo - it''s really just gorgeous.  This is tied with one other for my top pic and if one of those two doesn''t win I''m staging a protest. Given a 10 on my first pass through, which I very rarely do.  Just fabulous.  Into my favs it goes.  10, just-married', '2004-11-05 13:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
