(993736, 115028, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. Light is a bit flat but your composition is great. Looks like a wonderful place.</td>', 'Beautiful scene. Light is a bit flat but your composition is great. Looks like a wonderful place.', '2004-11-05 17:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
