(993739, 116312, 8860, '<td valign="top">Unusually good ''snapshot'' portrait. models look happy and natural - fill flash helps a lot.<br/> <br/>Good to a see another budding boarder too!  : )</td>', 'Unusually good ''snapshot'' portrait. models look happy and natural - fill flash helps a lot. Good to a see another budding boarder too!  : )', '2004-11-05 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(993741, 117222, 7543, '<td valign="top">Very hazy, bottom leaves are distracting since they are the only ones with strong colors. Left side has a distracting stripe...</td>', 'Very hazy, bottom leaves are distracting since they are the only ones with strong colors. Left side has a distracting stripe...', '2004-11-05 17:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(993742, 117115, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice subject. Nice high key capture. There are some distracting artifacts along her left side (right side from our view point). Also there''s a pretty harsh line along her leg that looks like a shadow from something supporting her. These spoil an otherwise worthy entry IMO.</td>', 'Nice subject. Nice high key capture. There are some distracting artifacts along her left side (right side from our view point). Also there''s a pretty harsh line along her leg that looks like a shadow from something supporting her. These spoil an otherwise worthy entry IMO.', '2004-11-05 17:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(993743, 117317, 8860, '<td valign="top">Not your average DPC fayre. I like it. Nicely muted, if a little mundane, ultimately.</td>', 'Not your average DPC fayre. I like it. Nicely muted, if a little mundane, ultimately.', '2004-11-05 17:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(993745, 116307, 7543, '<td valign="top">...this should have gone under rant in forums imho. Nothing there.</td>', '...this should have gone under rant in forums imho. Nothing there.', '2004-11-05 17:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(993747, 117002, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness and colors.</td>', 'Great sharpness and colors.', '2004-11-05 17:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(993748, 115429, 7543, '<td valign="top">Tiny fill flash could have worked to lighten the shadows. Sky looks great</td>', 'Tiny fill flash could have worked to lighten the shadows. Sky looks great', '2004-11-05 17:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(993749, 114848, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice snapshot of the youngster. I like the shape of the fabric pattern and the placement of head and eyes in the frame. Flash seems a bit harsh and the shadows it creates are a bit distracting. If it were me, I''d try shooting with ambient light and see if it softens the harshness. Just my opinion.</td>', 'Nice snapshot of the youngster. I like the shape of the fabric pattern and the placement of head and eyes in the frame. Flash seems a bit harsh and the shadows it creates are a bit distracting. If it were me, I''d try shooting with ambient light and see if it softens the harshness. Just my opinion.', '2004-11-05 17:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(993750, 117274, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very magical and powerful centering helps this to be really special. The streetlamp(?) - normally a real pain in the arse - makes the shot. It looks quite heavily treated, which I''m aware of too much and even has that NeatImage look to it.<br/> <br/>But it''s memorable and should be up there at the top.</td>', 'Very magical and powerful centering helps this to be really special. The streetlamp(?) - normally a real pain in the arse - makes the shot. It looks quite heavily treated, which I''m aware of too much and even has that NeatImage look to it. But it''s memorable and should be up there at the top.', '2004-11-05 17:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(993751, 114388, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, looks like an spotlight on the little bugger at night. Great colors, nice blurred background.</td>', 'Great lighting, looks like an spotlight on the little bugger at night. Great colors, nice blurred background.', '2004-11-05 17:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(993753, 111043, 18197, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t hold my interest. The idea is good, but I would score it higher if I could see more of the context of the shot and if it were all in sharp focus. That may not have been your intent, but it''s my opinion.</td>', 'This doesn''t hold my interest. The idea is good, but I would score it higher if I could see more of the context of the shot and if it were all in sharp focus. That may not have been your intent, but it''s my opinion.', '2004-11-05 17:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(993755, 117176, 8860, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully simple shot. This is a lovely (if barren) place indeed.</td>', 'Wonderfully simple shot. This is a lovely (if barren) place indeed.', '2004-11-05 17:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(993757, 117079, 7543, '<td valign="top">...beautiful</td>', '...beautiful', '2004-11-05 17:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(993759, 116579, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great view. It''s just a shame the light hasn''t picked up some more features in the background.</td>', 'Great view. It''s just a shame the light hasn''t picked up some more features in the background.', '2004-11-05 17:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(993762, 117207, 7543, '<td valign="top">Usually I don''t like over-processed shots, but this one looks super, would like to read about what you did in post processing and see the original. Looks like something from a poetry book or a book cover. Good job</td>', 'Usually I don''t like over-processed shots, but this one looks super, would like to read about what you did in post processing and see the original. Looks like something from a poetry book or a book cover. Good job', '2004-11-05 17:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(993763, 117307, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''ve probably spent more time looking at this photo than any other so far. It is an interesting image, a bit disconcerting. I can imagine a number of magazines that would publish it for a variety of purposes. In the DPC forum, it is a bit risky and I would be surprised if it scores well. But I like the fhat you''re willing to take risks. Good job.</td>', 'I''ve probably spent more time looking at this photo than any other so far. It is an interesting image, a bit disconcerting. I can imagine a number of magazines that would publish it for a variety of purposes. In the DPC forum, it is a bit risky and I would be surprised if it scores well. But I like the fhat you''re willing to take risks. Good job.', '2004-11-05 17:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(993764, 116815, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene. I think this would have more effective if you''d managed to get close to the water for a more dynamic viewpoint. As it is, the shot appears to be from eye level and makes it less potent. Centred comp is also a bit weak.</td>', 'Lovely scene. I think this would have more effective if you''d managed to get close to the water for a more dynamic viewpoint. As it is, the shot appears to be from eye level and makes it less potent. Centred comp is also a bit weak.', '2004-11-05 17:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(993768, 113914, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great autumn shot, super colors and good camera work. You can tell your model it did a great job as well.</td>', 'Great autumn shot, super colors and good camera work. You can tell your model it did a great job as well.', '2004-11-05 17:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(993772, 115724, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured abstract pattern. Good job on the focus and DOF. Colors make my teeth hurt.</td>', 'Nicely captured abstract pattern. Good job on the focus and DOF. Colors make my teeth hurt.', '2004-11-05 17:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(993776, 116820, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great post processing, very dramatic, would like to see the original for comparison.</td>', 'Great post processing, very dramatic, would like to see the original for comparison.', '2004-11-05 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(993777, 114560, 8860, '<td valign="top">Excellent, dynamic shot deserving of a high placing. You''re in the right place for a great composition and there''s some real energy in that hair. Great.</td>', 'Excellent, dynamic shot deserving of a high placing. You''re in the right place for a great composition and there''s some real energy in that hair. Great.', '2004-11-05 17:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(993779, 115998, 8860, '<td valign="top">She''s pretty, it''s clear and crisp, but just a bit too much of a snapshot. But a very good one.</td>', 'She''s pretty, it''s clear and crisp, but just a bit too much of a snapshot. But a very good one.', '2004-11-05 17:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(993780, 117196, 18197, '<td valign="top">On my monitor which I routinely calibrate, I can see none of the detail that would make this a spectacular capture. The flame is blown out and the dark areas have lost all detail. IMO greater subtlty with exposure and/or post processing would have helped. I''m not very good at this so it''s just an opinion but it doesn''t light my fire.</td>', 'On my monitor which I routinely calibrate, I can see none of the detail that would make this a spectacular capture. The flame is blown out and the dark areas have lost all detail. IMO greater subtlty with exposure and/or post processing would have helped. I''m not very good at this so it''s just an opinion but it doesn''t light my fire.', '2004-11-05 17:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(993783, 116338, 8860, '<td valign="top">Stunning scene.</td>', 'Stunning scene.', '2004-11-05 17:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(993790, 112852, 18197, '<td valign="top">I guess I''m lost here from the beginning with the subject. It doesn''t hold my interest. On my monitor, which I routinely calibrate, I can see exactly three colors: Black, White; and a mid tone. These don''t allow for any texture (except in silhouette) which would hold my interest. Sorry, it''s just an opinion. Hope others comment to give you a broader view.</td>', 'I guess I''m lost here from the beginning with the subject. It doesn''t hold my interest. On my monitor, which I routinely calibrate, I can see exactly three colors: Black, White; and a mid tone. These don''t allow for any texture (except in silhouette) which would hold my interest. Sorry, it''s just an opinion. Hope others comment to give you a broader view.', '2004-11-05 17:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(993799, 116016, 7543, '<td valign="top">Bessastaðir? Frábær norðurljósamynd, hlakka til að sjá stillingar og græjur. Speglunin í vatninu gefur þess aðra vídd.</td>', 'Bessastaðir? Frábær norðurljósamynd, hlakka til að sjá stillingar og græjur. Speglunin í vatninu gefur þess aðra vídd.', '2004-11-05 17:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(993801, 109315, 8860, '<td valign="top">Blatantly edited beyond necessity this has become digital art, which is unfortunate because it looks like a lovely scene. I wonder why it needed to be pushes so far? While the voters here go for the over-processed stuff some of the time, I think I''d have forsaken the quest for votes in favour of making this more appropriately ''special''.<br/> <br/>Great compo and subject.</td>', 'Blatantly edited beyond necessity this has become digital art, which is unfortunate because it looks like a lovely scene. I wonder why it needed to be pushes so far? While the voters here go for the over-processed stuff some of the time, I think I''d have forsaken the quest for votes in favour of making this more appropriately ''special''. Great compo and subject.', '2004-11-05 17:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(993807, 116835, 25742, '<td valign="top">this photo grows on you, nothing much at first blush, then you notice the red barn, the cows. Very nice<br/></td>', 'this photo grows on you, nothing much at first blush, then you notice the red barn, the cows. Very nice', '2004-11-05 17:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
