(993811, 112426, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus and choice of DOF. Colors and tones are good. Comp''s okay. Would have done well in implied lines. Where it breaks down for me is the subject. If you are interested inthe subject, the photo will hold your interest. If not, there''s nothing about the photo itself that will grab and hold interest. Just my opinion. Hope others comment so you get a broader view.</td>', 'Very nice focus and choice of DOF. Colors and tones are good. Comp''s okay. Would have done well in implied lines. Where it breaks down for me is the subject. If you are interested inthe subject, the photo will hold your interest. If not, there''s nothing about the photo itself that will grab and hold interest. Just my opinion. Hope others comment so you get a broader view.', '2004-11-05 17:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(993818, 112418, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous autumn shot!    Maybe just the slightest tadd too much sky, but that''s probably just a matter of taste.  I say 9+</td>', 'This is a gorgeous autumn shot!    Maybe just the slightest tadd too much sky, but that''s probably just a matter of taste.  I say 9+', '2004-11-05 17:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(993824, 116410, 24454, '<td valign="top">She looks so fresh and pretty !!   I like the natural look of her pose.</td>', 'She looks so fresh and pretty !!   I like the natural look of her pose.', '2004-11-05 17:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(993830, 111575, 24454, '<td valign="top">The Rockies are my favorite place on earth!    You are so lucky to have such an abundance of great  photography opportunities.   This is beautiful!</td>', 'The Rockies are my favorite place on earth!    You are so lucky to have such an abundance of great  photography opportunities.   This is beautiful!', '2004-11-05 17:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(993834, 115573, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great capture!</td>', 'Great capture!', '2004-11-05 17:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(993836, 114933, 18197, '<td valign="top">I have seen a picture like this before or it reminds me of someone, I''m not sure which. It is an arresting image. When I first looked at it I didn''t score it very highly but when I try to think about what I would change, I can''t really think of much. Either it''s bad in every way or I should bump it up ... okay, bumping.</td>', 'I have seen a picture like this before or it reminds me of someone, I''m not sure which. It is an arresting image. When I first looked at it I didn''t score it very highly but when I try to think about what I would change, I can''t really think of much. Either it''s bad in every way or I should bump it up ... okay, bumping.', '2004-11-05 17:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(993837, 117208, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not much here to hold my interest.</td>', 'Not much here to hold my interest.', '2004-11-05 17:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(993839, 116835, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this one!  The little red barn and the cows on the hillside add such a touch of ambience to this picture.</td>', 'I love this one!  The little red barn and the cows on the hillside add such a touch of ambience to this picture.', '2004-11-05 17:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(993840, 115968, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is very awesome!!   I love animal pictures, and this one is exceptional!</td>', 'This is very awesome!!   I love animal pictures, and this one is exceptional!', '2004-11-05 17:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(993845, 114167, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''ve spent a lot of time looking at this. There''s a lot going on here that conveys emotional impact. Why this partiucular location? Why the camo''s? Hair looks wet, why? Shirt open, why? Attitude inthe eyes, what are they telling me? The whole thing looks like trouble and it''s the unanswered questions that hold my interest.<br/> <br/>Having said all that, it''s propbably a pretty risky image for this forum. In this land of kittens and flowers, I fear this won''t do well. I''m personally glad you took the risk. Keep shooting!</td>', 'I''ve spent a lot of time looking at this. There''s a lot going on here that conveys emotional impact. Why this partiucular location? Why the camo''s? Hair looks wet, why? Shirt open, why? Attitude inthe eyes, what are they telling me? The whole thing looks like trouble and it''s the unanswered questions that hold my interest. Having said all that, it''s propbably a pretty risky image for this forum. In this land of kittens and flowers, I fear this won''t do well. I''m personally glad you took the risk. Keep shooting!', '2004-11-05 17:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(993846, 116627, 18197, '<td valign="top">On my monitor which I routinely calibrate, this is so dark that it loses much of the detail. I think if it were a bit brighter and a bit bigger,I would have scored it more highly.</td>', 'On my monitor which I routinely calibrate, this is so dark that it loses much of the detail. I think if it were a bit brighter and a bit bigger,I would have scored it more highly.', '2004-11-05 18:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(993850, 116711, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great subject (Birmingham?) and beautifully shot.Railing is a nice touch, as is the bird.</td>', 'Great subject (Birmingham?) and beautifully shot.Railing is a nice touch, as is the bird.', '2004-11-05 18:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(993853, 117191, 18197, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the wedding. I have found that when a subject is deeply and personally interesting to me, photos of it seem better to me than to those not as interested in the subject. This photo doesn''t hold my interest and the focus, DOF, comp, and exposure create enough distractions so that I move on rather than linger. Sorry, it''s just an opinion. I hope others comment so you can have a broader view.</td>', 'Congratulations on the wedding. I have found that when a subject is deeply and personally interesting to me, photos of it seem better to me than to those not as interested in the subject. This photo doesn''t hold my interest and the focus, DOF, comp, and exposure create enough distractions so that I move on rather than linger. Sorry, it''s just an opinion. I hope others comment so you can have a broader view.', '2004-11-05 18:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(993862, 112103, 12809, '<td valign="top">Neuferland?<br/> <br/>Very pretty.  I''m obsessed with veiling water.  I like that you caught the stream, the fall, and the bridge.  A circular polarizer would have cut down on the glare in the water and would have made the colors deeper.</td>', 'Neuferland? Very pretty.  I''m obsessed with veiling water.  I like that you caught the stream, the fall, and the bridge.  A circular polarizer would have cut down on the glare in the water and would have made the colors deeper.', '2004-11-05 18:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(993864, 115429, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice sculpture. It would be nice to see it in person. For me though, a photo of a sculpture is two degrees removed from some reality worth capturing. It would be like instrumental music about an essay. There''s nothing particularly bad about this but the subject and the uplifting emotion it was intended to capture don''t make it through two translations: 1) From reality to sculpture; and 2) From sculture to photographic image. I''m probably not clear and I''m new at this so just consider it an opinion. I hope you get other comments to give you a broader view.</td>', 'Nice sculpture. It would be nice to see it in person. For me though, a photo of a sculpture is two degrees removed from some reality worth capturing. It would be like instrumental music about an essay. There''s nothing particularly bad about this but the subject and the uplifting emotion it was intended to capture don''t make it through two translations: 1) From reality to sculpture; and 2) From sculture to photographic image. I''m probably not clear and I''m new at this so just consider it an opinion. I hope you get other comments to give you a broader view.', '2004-11-05 18:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(993866, 116629, 12809, '<td valign="top">Extra point for the Big Dipper.  Cool shot.</td>', 'Extra point for the Big Dipper.  Cool shot.', '2004-11-05 18:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(993870, 117295, 18197, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t look like your model is resonating with the face painting! Great capture of that emotion. This is a perfect example of the expression, "If looks could kill ..." Maybe I''m misinterpreting. I have a friend who would say from time to time, "I sometimes have to remind my face I''m having a good time." Maybe that''s all that''s going on here. Still, nice emotive capture.</td>', 'It doesn''t look like your model is resonating with the face painting! Great capture of that emotion. This is a perfect example of the expression, "If looks could kill ..." Maybe I''m misinterpreting. I have a friend who would say from time to time, "I sometimes have to remind my face I''m having a good time." Maybe that''s all that''s going on here. Still, nice emotive capture.', '2004-11-05 18:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(993872, 117181, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Too dark and softly focused to hold my interest.</td>', 'Great idea. Too dark and softly focused to hold my interest.', '2004-11-05 18:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(993875, 110995, 12809, '<td valign="top">I''m not a snake lover by any means but this is a great shot.  Nice colors, simple background, and good focus.  Looks like his head and some edges of the branch suffer from oversharpening.  It''s not too noticeable but there appears to be bright white specks/pixels.  I''m guessing the ISO was higher than normal and it''s "sharpened noise" that I''m seeing.  Maybe a little less USM would prevent that.  Nice job.</td>', 'I''m not a snake lover by any means but this is a great shot.  Nice colors, simple background, and good focus.  Looks like his head and some edges of the branch suffer from oversharpening.  It''s not too noticeable but there appears to be bright white specks/pixels.  I''m guessing the ISO was higher than normal and it''s "sharpened noise" that I''m seeing.  Maybe a little less USM would prevent that.  Nice job.', '2004-11-05 18:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(993876, 111701, 12809, '<td valign="top">Cute title!  I like the sepia/pink tone.  Excellent focus which is hard to do with these critters.  I like the crop and comp. a lot.  His stance is humorous.  Well shot.</td>', 'Cute title!  I like the sepia/pink tone.  Excellent focus which is hard to do with these critters.  I like the crop and comp. a lot.  His stance is humorous.  Well shot.', '2004-11-05 18:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(993882, 117317, 4226, '<td valign="top">this photo lacks colors. You might like to try saturating the colors a bit.</td>', 'this photo lacks colors. You might like to try saturating the colors a bit.', '2004-11-05 18:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(993883, 116338, 12809, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting on the dunes.  Really beautiful.  Also love the mountains and the low clouds.  Almost wondering if cropping out the blue sky would work, too...?  Nice job.</td>', 'Love the lighting on the dunes.  Really beautiful.  Also love the mountains and the low clouds.  Almost wondering if cropping out the blue sky would work, too...?  Nice job.', '2004-11-05 18:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(993884, 115997, 4226, '<td valign="top">Well looks like you rotated the image by 2-3 degrees, but  I would recommend you crop the unwanted black background from this picture. Also you might like to use channel mixer to produce more contrast in the b/w</td>', 'Well looks like you rotated the image by 2-3 degrees, but  I would recommend you crop the unwanted black background from this picture. Also you might like to use channel mixer to produce more contrast in the b/w', '2004-11-05 18:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(993887, 114082, 12809, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot!  Has a great feel to it.</td>', 'Terrific shot!  Has a great feel to it.', '2004-11-05 18:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
