(993985, 117115, 12809, '<td valign="top">If I were male you''d get a 9 for subject matter alone, but I''m not. :-)  I would prefer that her nipple was covered.  The netting is practically invisible here - the only reason I noticed it was because I thought her ''skin'' looked funny (her left side) and I had my face to the screen trying to figure out what it is.  In fact, I believe it''s a ripple in the netting that I see.  I like the selective color or burning that you did do the contraption. :-)  After all that, I still gave you a 9 for being daring with the subject matter and the use of highkey.  Nice job.</td>', 'If I were male you''d get a 9 for subject matter alone, but I''m not. :-)  I would prefer that her nipple was covered.  The netting is practically invisible here - the only reason I noticed it was because I thought her ''skin'' looked funny (her left side) and I had my face to the screen trying to figure out what it is.  In fact, I believe it''s a ripple in the netting that I see.  I like the selective color or burning that you did do the contraption. :-)  After all that, I still gave you a 9 for being daring with the subject matter and the use of highkey.  Nice job.', '2004-11-05 19:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
