INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(994114, 115507, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very nice B &amp; W portrait.<br/>Thanks for adding the human element to this challenge. <br/>Bumping up to ((8))</td>', 'Very nice B & W portrait.Thanks for adding the human element to this challenge. Bumping up to ((8))', '2004-11-05 20:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(994116, 116755, 19708, '<td valign="top">Beautiful point of view captured here.<br/>Natural framing works well. ((8))</td>', 'Beautiful point of view captured here.Natural framing works well. ((8))', '2004-11-05 20:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(994118, 117326, 3080, '<td valign="top">Looks like maybe the white balance is off.  The background has a strange pinkish color and the shadow behind the dog is distracting.  Focus is alright on the pumpkin, but looks a little soft on the doggie.  Black fur is something hard to photograph well.  You cropped the photo a bit to close to the dog in my opinion and I''d like to see the whole dog in the photo.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Looks like maybe the white balance is off.  The background has a strange pinkish color and the shadow behind the dog is distracting.  Focus is alright on the pumpkin, but looks a little soft on the doggie.  Black fur is something hard to photograph well.  You cropped the photo a bit to close to the dog in my opinion and I''d like to see the whole dog in the photo.  ~Heather~', '2004-11-05 20:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(994124, 116695, 3080, '<td valign="top">Hose?  More like mansion.  This ''house'' is the size of my whole village.  It is a lovely view.  I do wish I could see more detail in the house, but that would probably require a really big pic. lol.  Focus and clarity are good, and the lighting looks to have been cooperating with you this day.  My favorite part of the photo I think is the bottom left corner where the rock mountain meets the water.  Very nice crisp line there.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Hose?  More like mansion.  This ''house'' is the size of my whole village.  It is a lovely view.  I do wish I could see more detail in the house, but that would probably require a really big pic. lol.  Focus and clarity are good, and the lighting looks to have been cooperating with you this day.  My favorite part of the photo I think is the bottom left corner where the rock mountain meets the water.  Very nice crisp line there.  ~Heather~', '2004-11-05 20:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(994127, 114851, 3080, '<td valign="top">The focus on Burt seems a little soft to me.  I think Burt is a very interesting character, and would love to have seen a close up of that face. Maybe in black and white.  What a lovely portrait he would make close up.  A face full of stories.  Lighting seems ok, I may suggest to play with brightness/contrast a bit to maybe make it really punch.  Burt looks like a great guy.</td>', 'The focus on Burt seems a little soft to me.  I think Burt is a very interesting character, and would love to have seen a close up of that face. Maybe in black and white.  What a lovely portrait he would make close up.  A face full of stories.  Lighting seems ok, I may suggest to play with brightness/contrast a bit to maybe make it really punch.  Burt looks like a great guy.', '2004-11-05 20:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(994132, 117051, 3080, '<td valign="top">My eyes are finding it hard to rest on just one place.  There''s a strong vertical line (tree) running through the middle of the photo, and no real subject.  The first thing I look at is the tree trunk, but there really is no interest there.  Maybe if you could get a shot looking up the river or something, you would have a stronger focal point and might add interest to the photo.  The colors are nice.  Maybe play with the saturation a bit to see if you can boost the color even more!</td>', 'My eyes are finding it hard to rest on just one place.  There''s a strong vertical line (tree) running through the middle of the photo, and no real subject.  The first thing I look at is the tree trunk, but there really is no interest there.  Maybe if you could get a shot looking up the river or something, you would have a stronger focal point and might add interest to the photo.  The colors are nice.  Maybe play with the saturation a bit to see if you can boost the color even more!', '2004-11-05 20:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(994133, 112426, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like it!  I wonder if there would be some way to take this so that we couldn''t see the shelf?  Maybe move the bottles all the way to the edge of the shelf and place something black over the shelf?  The bright color of the shelf kind of contrasts with the bottles creating somewhat of a distraction for me.  Love the focus, lighting is good too.</td>', 'I like it!  I wonder if there would be some way to take this so that we couldn''t see the shelf?  Maybe move the bottles all the way to the edge of the shelf and place something black over the shelf?  The bright color of the shelf kind of contrasts with the bottles creating somewhat of a distraction for me.  Love the focus, lighting is good too.', '2004-11-05 20:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(994135, 112370, 3080, '<td valign="top">While I love the colors, I''m not really drawn into the image.  Too much ''blank'' space with not much in between.  The birds are interesting, but with the one so close to the right frame, it almost seems like an accident.  I do like the clouds and the color, and also like how the birds are silhouetted against the background.  ~Heather~</td>', 'While I love the colors, I''m not really drawn into the image.  Too much ''blank'' space with not much in between.  The birds are interesting, but with the one so close to the right frame, it almost seems like an accident.  I do like the clouds and the color, and also like how the birds are silhouetted against the background.  ~Heather~', '2004-11-05 21:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(994136, 116696, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  Would have possibly worked well in the poverty challenge as well.  It is very sad really.  I don''t like to see dirty children.  Makes me think they are lonely.  Focus and clarity are great, lighting is great, and I love the framing/cropping you chose.  Nothing to complain about here. 10. ~Heather~</td>', 'Very nice capture.  Would have possibly worked well in the poverty challenge as well.  It is very sad really.  I don''t like to see dirty children.  Makes me think they are lonely.  Focus and clarity are great, lighting is great, and I love the framing/cropping you chose.  Nothing to complain about here. 10. ~Heather~', '2004-11-05 21:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(994138, 116876, 3080, '<td valign="top">LOL at how you caught the bird with his leg out like that.  I even like this with the legs cropped off the top.  Maybe a crop right under the top set of legs.  That gives nice negative space, and a very simplistic comp.  I like how it''s silhouetted.  Focus and clarity are nice. ~Heather~</td>', 'LOL at how you caught the bird with his leg out like that.  I even like this with the legs cropped off the top.  Maybe a crop right under the top set of legs.  That gives nice negative space, and a very simplistic comp.  I like how it''s silhouetted.  Focus and clarity are nice. ~Heather~', '2004-11-05 21:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(994140, 111725, 3080, '<td valign="top">love the seperation of green/blue.  I''m wondering though if it might have higher visual impact had the horizon line not been almost dead center of the photo.  Did you try this as a vertical crop?  Might make for something interesting too.  Focus seems a bit soft, but hard to tell, might just be the pattern that makes it look that way.  Overall nice. ~Heather~</td>', 'love the seperation of green/blue.  I''m wondering though if it might have higher visual impact had the horizon line not been almost dead center of the photo.  Did you try this as a vertical crop?  Might make for something interesting too.  Focus seems a bit soft, but hard to tell, might just be the pattern that makes it look that way.  Overall nice. ~Heather~', '2004-11-05 21:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(994142, 116307, 3080, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I guess I don''t find this to be a very interesting photo.  Garbage has never been something I was real fascinated with, and definately wouldn''t hang this on my wall.  Focus seems a bit soft, but lighting is ok.  Background works, nothing distracting there.  Just not my cup of tea.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Without the title, I guess I don''t find this to be a very interesting photo.  Garbage has never been something I was real fascinated with, and definately wouldn''t hang this on my wall.  Focus seems a bit soft, but lighting is ok.  Background works, nothing distracting there.  Just not my cup of tea.  ~Heather~', '2004-11-05 21:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(994144, 114428, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Love the blue/white.  The addition of the mountains adds just enough contrast to make this a very visually appealing image.  Focus and clarity are great, and lighting conditions were definatley on your side. Wish there were some way to not have the right side of the mountains in shadow, but unavoidable, I guess.  maybe some lightening of that area?</td>', 'Very nice.  Love the blue/white.  The addition of the mountains adds just enough contrast to make this a very visually appealing image.  Focus and clarity are great, and lighting conditions were definatley on your side. Wish there were some way to not have the right side of the mountains in shadow, but unavoidable, I guess.  maybe some lightening of that area?', '2004-11-05 21:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(994148, 109315, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very lovely!  I love the colors and the light coming through the clouds really makes for a nice pic.  Focus and clarity are excellent and lighting is what really makes this photo.  Love the weeds in the forground as well.  Guess I have nothing to complain about here. 10. ~Heather~</td>', 'Very lovely!  I love the colors and the light coming through the clouds really makes for a nice pic.  Focus and clarity are excellent and lighting is what really makes this photo.  Love the weeds in the forground as well.  Guess I have nothing to complain about here. 10. ~Heather~', '2004-11-05 21:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(994160, 115556, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/>The lovely colors and tranquil waters makes this a superb study. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments.The lovely colors and tranquil waters makes this a superb study. Bumping up.', '2004-11-05 21:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(994163, 117157, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/>certainly seen better days. It blend in great with the foliage. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments.certainly seen better days. It blend in great with the foliage. Bumping up.', '2004-11-05 21:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(994166, 116629, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/>Like most people, I have a weakness for light houses. Great capture and very well presented. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments.Like most people, I have a weakness for light houses. Great capture and very well presented. Bumping up.', '2004-11-05 21:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(994167, 117115, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definatley very interesting.  I like the lighting very much.  I also like the softness of the photo.  This is very tastefully done.  I love the expression on her face.  Love the focus on her face.  Nice detail.  I like how the photo is so light, and the restraints are darker, adds a bit of contrast to the photo.  Very nice. ~Heather~</td>', 'Definatley very interesting.  I like the lighting very much.  I also like the softness of the photo.  This is very tastefully done.  I love the expression on her face.  Love the focus on her face.  Nice detail.  I like how the photo is so light, and the restraints are darker, adds a bit of contrast to the photo.  Very nice. ~Heather~', '2004-11-05 21:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(994168, 116503, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/>Great capture with that sweeping movement. Would have loved a better dof, but I too would have been happy to have captured this moment as is. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments.Great capture with that sweeping movement. Would have loved a better dof, but I too would have been happy to have captured this moment as is. Bumping up.', '2004-11-05 21:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(994170, 111725, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/>A rather unique image with these stripes. What produces them? Regardless, a wonderful image with that pastoral feel. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments.A rather unique image with these stripes. What produces them? Regardless, a wonderful image with that pastoral feel. Bumping up.', '2004-11-05 21:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(994172, 116545, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/>This is just so pretty.........very smart cropping to show the breath and scope of this image. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments.This is just so pretty.........very smart cropping to show the breath and scope of this image. Bumping up.', '2004-11-05 21:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(994175, 115199, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Very nice.  Simple.  I love the colrs.  Nice focus on the ducks and the ripples are very nice as well.  Only thing that I notice is that the photo is almost divided between the yellow reflection, and the plain green on the right.  Not a big deal, but almost wish the yellow were all the way across.  Still a very lovely photo. ~Heather~</td>', 'Wow.  Very nice.  Simple.  I love the colrs.  Nice focus on the ducks and the ripples are very nice as well.  Only thing that I notice is that the photo is almost divided between the yellow reflection, and the plain green on the right.  Not a big deal, but almost wish the yellow were all the way across.  Still a very lovely photo. ~Heather~', '2004-11-05 21:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(994176, 117214, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/>What a beautiful image! You certainly have a winner here with great delicasy. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments.What a beautiful image! You certainly have a winner here with great delicasy. Bumping up.', '2004-11-05 21:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(994178, 116556, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/>This is just lovely and so soothing. The colors are great, the lighting so pleasant and the  colors are a knockout. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments.This is just lovely and so soothing. The colors are great, the lighting so pleasant and the  colors are a knockout. Bumping up.', '2004-11-05 21:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(994179, 117079, 3080, '<td valign="top">...very beautiful!  This is a very nice color portrait.  Focus and clarity are awesome.  The look on her face is wonderful.  Have I seen her before?  Love the angle and framin/cropping.  DOF is perfect.  Nothing to complain about here.  Great shot! ~Heather~</td>', '...very beautiful!  This is a very nice color portrait.  Focus and clarity are awesome.  The look on her face is wonderful.  Have I seen her before?  Love the angle and framin/cropping.  DOF is perfect.  Nothing to complain about here.  Great shot! ~Heather~', '2004-11-05 21:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(994181, 111183, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/>hate to walk this bridge even after they fix it. Bumping up on the scary factor.lol</td>', 'returning for comments.hate to walk this bridge even after they fix it. Bumping up on the scary factor.lol', '2004-11-05 21:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
