(994185, 114559, 13602, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2004-11-05 21:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(994186, 115821, 26756, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro.  Light is just a little bit harsh but it picks up some very nice colors.</td>', 'Very nice macro.  Light is just a little bit harsh but it picks up some very nice colors.', '2004-11-05 21:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(994189, 112025, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/>The oversharpenning is immediately visible atop the roof. However, everything else in this image is lovely along with the subdued reddish tint of the barn. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments.The oversharpenning is immediately visible atop the roof. However, everything else in this image is lovely along with the subdued reddish tint of the barn. Bumping up.', '2004-11-05 21:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(994192, 117283, 3080, '<td valign="top">Is that a lobster in his pants, or is he just happy to see me?  hehe.  Very nice focus and clarity.  This shows some personality for sure.  Love the lack of color.  Background is good, nothing distracting there.  Overall a very nice shot. 10 ~Heather~</td>', 'Is that a lobster in his pants, or is he just happy to see me?  hehe.  Very nice focus and clarity.  This shows some personality for sure.  Love the lack of color.  Background is good, nothing distracting there.  Overall a very nice shot. 10 ~Heather~', '2004-11-05 21:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(994193, 116999, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/>great effect of these clouds. The eyes do not tire of studying their patterns. great b/w spectacle. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments.great effect of these clouds. The eyes do not tire of studying their patterns. great b/w spectacle. Bumping up.', '2004-11-05 21:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(994199, 114876, 26756, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image.  I really would have loved to see the whole thing in sharp focus.  The plants in the foreground are a bit soft and I think would look better if they were sharp.  The colors are just fantastic and you can almost sense how crisp the air is just from the picture.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image.  I really would have loved to see the whole thing in sharp focus.  The plants in the foreground are a bit soft and I think would look better if they were sharp.  The colors are just fantastic and you can almost sense how crisp the air is just from the picture.', '2004-11-05 21:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(994200, 113369, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/>This image is greatly moving with those warm colors which entrain the mind as it goes from light to shadows. A good and superior capture with soothing rests in the immediate foreground and the dark clouds. bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments.This image is greatly moving with those warm colors which entrain the mind as it goes from light to shadows. A good and superior capture with soothing rests in the immediate foreground and the dark clouds. bumping up.', '2004-11-05 21:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(994202, 109227, 10275, '<td valign="top">I know you had to cover the sun so the balloon probably had to be where it is, otherwise I would say in this case too bad it is right in the middle. Very powerful photo. Catches your eye right away. Great silluette and background colours.</td>', 'I know you had to cover the sun so the balloon probably had to be where it is, otherwise I would say in this case too bad it is right in the middle. Very powerful photo. Catches your eye right away. Great silluette and background colours.', '2004-11-05 21:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(994203, 110995, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/>She has that green vegatable color. A very good find and capture. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for comments.She has that green vegatable color. A very good find and capture. Bumping up.', '2004-11-05 21:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(994208, 116363, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is one of those one-in-a-million shots that is so spontanious. I just love the joy captured in this photo. The sign perfictly fitting with the theme. Nice composition and great colour treatment. This one is a keeper.</td>', 'This is one of those one-in-a-million shots that is so spontanious. I just love the joy captured in this photo. The sign perfictly fitting with the theme. Nice composition and great colour treatment. This one is a keeper.', '2004-11-05 21:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(994211, 117093, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great silluette on a perfect background. I like that the bird is swimming into the image. The ripples are very nice touch. I wish I could see a catch light in the eye. Very well captured.</td>', 'Great silluette on a perfect background. I like that the bird is swimming into the image. The ripples are very nice touch. I wish I could see a catch light in the eye. Very well captured.', '2004-11-05 21:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(994213, 109340, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, smooth, abstract. Just my kind of cup-a-tee... Love the composition and the simplicity. One of my top picks.</td>', 'Beautiful, smooth, abstract. Just my kind of cup-a-tee... Love the composition and the simplicity. One of my top picks.', '2004-11-05 21:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(994218, 116791, 10275, '<td valign="top">Precious innocence. Great blue lagoons. This looks like a professional studio photo. Very well done. the texture detail is amazing, yet it is nice and soft. I would hire you to photograph my kids no problem.</td>', 'Precious innocence. Great blue lagoons. This looks like a professional studio photo. Very well done. the texture detail is amazing, yet it is nice and soft. I would hire you to photograph my kids no problem.', '2004-11-05 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(994219, 115482, 10275, '<td valign="top">One of the best photos in this challenge. Love the shapes and lines. The abstractness and colour of the image are just superb. It almost looks unrealistic dreamscape. Love it.</td>', 'One of the best photos in this challenge. Love the shapes and lines. The abstractness and colour of the image are just superb. It almost looks unrealistic dreamscape. Love it.', '2004-11-05 21:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(994221, 114776, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I don''t know what more to say, just beautiful. I am a leaf freak. I love them. This one is soooo perfect.</td>', 'Beautiful. I don''t know what more to say, just beautiful. I am a leaf freak. I love them. This one is soooo perfect.', '2004-11-05 21:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(994223, 117240, 10275, '<td valign="top">The title says it all. The colours make the image. Nice abstract take. Would make great desktop image.</td>', 'The title says it all. The colours make the image. Nice abstract take. Would make great desktop image.', '2004-11-05 21:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(994225, 116876, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favourites in this challenge. It''s so humorous. The feet so stationary and the bird just marching on. One of those one-in-a-million captures.</td>', 'This is one of my favourites in this challenge. It''s so humorous. The feet so stationary and the bird just marching on. One of those one-in-a-million captures.', '2004-11-05 21:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(994226, 116621, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great flow of light and shapes. Very nice abstract. Could have used a bit of burning around some of the edges in shadow areas to balance the dark upper right and bottom left corners.</td>', 'Great flow of light and shapes. Very nice abstract. Could have used a bit of burning around some of the edges in shadow areas to balance the dark upper right and bottom left corners.', '2004-11-05 21:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(994227, 115199, 10170, '<td valign="top">The light on the water here is absolutely stunning.</td>', 'The light on the water here is absolutely stunning.', '2004-11-05 21:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(994229, 112280, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great capture of colour and shapes. I wish I could see more of the bottom of the building.</td>', 'Great capture of colour and shapes. I wish I could see more of the bottom of the building.', '2004-11-05 21:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(994230, 114791, 4482, '<td valign="top">This looks like a moodville photo!! Awsome! It had strong emotion and the slight sepia tone gicves it nostalgia. Great crop. 10 all the way!! Thanks for sharing!!</td>', 'This looks like a moodville photo!! Awsome! It had strong emotion and the slight sepia tone gicves it nostalgia. Great crop. 10 all the way!! Thanks for sharing!!', '2004-11-05 21:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(994233, 116751, 10275, '<td valign="top">Oh, I love this one. It gave me a good laugh. I didn''t know ferrets could stand up like that. It looks like a mirkat mini-me. The shadow looks a bit fake, but I like the way it recedes into the dark background.</td>', 'Oh, I love this one. It gave me a good laugh. I didn''t know ferrets could stand up like that. It looks like a mirkat mini-me. The shadow looks a bit fake, but I like the way it recedes into the dark background.', '2004-11-05 21:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(994234, 116580, 10170, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning</td>', 'Simply stunning', '2004-11-05 21:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(994235, 111476, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great composition of lines and triangles. Nice colour. Very magically looking picture.</td>', 'Great composition of lines and triangles. Nice colour. Very magically looking picture.', '2004-11-05 21:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(994239, 117214, 10275, '<td valign="top">Oh, wow. I love fog and mist. This image is almost magical. I love the way it is framed by the two trees on the sides. Very well composed with the middle tree off-centre and the road leading you into the misty unknown. Beautiful.</td>', 'Oh, wow. I love fog and mist. This image is almost magical. I love the way it is framed by the two trees on the sides. Very well composed with the middle tree off-centre and the road leading you into the misty unknown. Beautiful.', '2004-11-05 22:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(994241, 115705, 10170, '<td valign="top">The lamp post spoils this, sorry.  If you''d walked to the other side of it I think this would be a lot better, as it breaks up the edge of the mountian.</td>', 'The lamp post spoils this, sorry.  If you''d walked to the other side of it I think this would be a lot better, as it breaks up the edge of the mountian.', '2004-11-05 22:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(994243, 116372, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful composition. Great colours. It is a tiny bit overexposed (especially at the upper right), as you are starting to get some purple fringe in contrasting darker areas. The red leaves are great colour compliment to the green trees. The reflection is magical.</td>', 'Very beautiful composition. Great colours. It is a tiny bit overexposed (especially at the upper right), as you are starting to get some purple fringe in contrasting darker areas. The red leaves are great colour compliment to the green trees. The reflection is magical.', '2004-11-05 22:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(994245, 115122, 10275, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo. I can''t find anything wrong with it. Just really like it. The colour are so nice and natural. Great detail in the mountain. The road is like a ribbon. Very well done.</td>', 'Gorgeous photo. I can''t find anything wrong with it. Just really like it. The colour are so nice and natural. Great detail in the mountain. The road is like a ribbon. Very well done.', '2004-11-05 22:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(994248, 115724, 10275, '<td valign="top">The colour makes this photo. Nice abstract. Some of the edges look a bit over shapened in contrast to the overly smooth surface of the drops. But very nice to look at.</td>', 'The colour makes this photo. Nice abstract. Some of the edges look a bit over shapened in contrast to the overly smooth surface of the drops. But very nice to look at.', '2004-11-05 22:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(994251, 115199, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful water ripples and the colours is just superb. I love the green - yellow colour split. The birds are really nicely exposed (good deail in feathers). the only thing that throws me off is the blurr bottom part. If cropped off could lead to more dinamic composition.</td>', 'Beautiful water ripples and the colours is just superb. I love the green - yellow colour split. The birds are really nicely exposed (good deail in feathers). the only thing that throws me off is the blurr bottom part. If cropped off could lead to more dinamic composition.', '2004-11-05 22:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(994254, 116801, 10275, '<td valign="top">Nice scenery and great colour.</td>', 'Nice scenery and great colour.', '2004-11-05 22:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(994257, 116672, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very nice reflection. Great colour and detail. It is nicely abstract and I like the softness of it. The bottom right corner is a bit overpowering the rest of the image.</td>', 'Very nice reflection. Great colour and detail. It is nicely abstract and I like the softness of it. The bottom right corner is a bit overpowering the rest of the image.', '2004-11-05 22:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(994260, 116580, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed and great exposure for accurate colour. Perfect DOF on the leaf and blurred background. Really great photo.</td>', 'Beautifully composed and great exposure for accurate colour. Perfect DOF on the leaf and blurred background. Really great photo.', '2004-11-05 22:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(994264, 117083, 10275, '<td valign="top">One of the best in this challenge (IMHO). Great composition, interesting colour, presence of moovement. You almost wonder what they are going towards.  Great photo.</td>', 'One of the best in this challenge (IMHO). Great composition, interesting colour, presence of moovement. You almost wonder what they are going towards.  Great photo.', '2004-11-05 22:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(994266, 109315, 10275, '<td valign="top">Magical photo with fairytale-like feeling. Great light - which makes this shot. Nice composition. I love the grass movement. It ads feeling of impending storm. Great photo.</td>', 'Magical photo with fairytale-like feeling. Great light - which makes this shot. Nice composition. I love the grass movement. It ads feeling of impending storm. Great photo.', '2004-11-05 22:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(994269, 115885, 6008, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait. Wonderful depth of field to give it a 3d feel. Great texture an detail in the face. Subject is full of character and that comes across clearly. Not so sure about the yellow flecks that seem to be in the image, mainly around his hat brim. Some catchlights in the eyes would have been nice too.</td>', 'Excellent portrait. Wonderful depth of field to give it a 3d feel. Great texture an detail in the face. Subject is full of character and that comes across clearly. Not so sure about the yellow flecks that seem to be in the image, mainly around his hat brim. Some catchlights in the eyes would have been nice too.', '2004-11-05 22:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(994270, 115310, 10275, '<td valign="top">This should win the award of the best "stock" photo. Honestly, this would qualify for Masterfile image. I can see it on a big billiboard with some great advertisement. You could sell this to "Aboslute" company for their Vodka ads. Just love it. It''s so clean and crisp. Perfectly composed. Great study!</td>', 'This should win the award of the best "stock" photo. Honestly, this would qualify for Masterfile image. I can see it on a big billiboard with some great advertisement. You could sell this to "Aboslute" company for their Vodka ads. Just love it. It''s so clean and crisp. Perfectly composed. Great study!', '2004-11-05 22:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(994272, 111248, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great front lighting on the rusty grasses with beautifully contrasting blue water and mountains. Too bad you had to chopp of the trees to block the bright sky? I would also cropped a bit more on the left side (just a tiny bit).</td>', 'Great front lighting on the rusty grasses with beautifully contrasting blue water and mountains. Too bad you had to chopp of the trees to block the bright sky? I would also cropped a bit more on the left side (just a tiny bit).', '2004-11-05 22:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(994275, 117209, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution. Very creative! Love the green smooth background. This is like a collage painting. It would have been nice to have one of the leafs just pale green.</td>', 'Great idea and execution. Very creative! Love the green smooth background. This is like a collage painting. It would have been nice to have one of the leafs just pale green.', '2004-11-05 22:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(994276, 117210, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the simple colors in the shot - blue, white, and red. It compliments the simple setup wonderfully. It seems to be more about the lines and shapes and the dash of colors. it is this simplicity that gives it a calming, serene feeling. Can I say simple any more times? :P I like it!</td>', 'I like the simple colors in the shot - blue, white, and red. It compliments the simple setup wonderfully. It seems to be more about the lines and shapes and the dash of colors. it is this simplicity that gives it a calming, serene feeling. Can I say simple any more times? :P I like it!', '2004-11-05 22:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(994278, 115932, 12809, '<td valign="top">If I''m being completely honest, I think this would be a much better image without the whacked out colors.  I like the longer exposure and the comp.  Gave you an 8.</td>', 'If I''m being completely honest, I think this would be a much better image without the whacked out colors.  I like the longer exposure and the comp.  Gave you an 8.', '2004-11-05 22:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(994279, 116206, 26756, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, nice due-tone and great focus.</td>', 'Nice macro, nice due-tone and great focus.', '2004-11-05 22:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(994280, 117158, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great reflection image. Nice colours. Could have been a bit enhanced - especially the top portion in terms of saturation of colours. Also have you thought of cropping out the grey sky and zooming in on portion of this scene. Sometimes minimizing can help improve composition.</td>', 'Great reflection image. Nice colours. Could have been a bit enhanced - especially the top portion in terms of saturation of colours. Also have you thought of cropping out the grey sky and zooming in on portion of this scene. Sometimes minimizing can help improve composition.', '2004-11-05 22:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(994282, 116643, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great moment and beautifully captured emotion. Love the simple white background. It is a bit high-key photo which makes their skin a bit yellowish (could be easily fixed with colour balance). It is nice and sharp. A family keeper!</td>', 'Great moment and beautifully captured emotion. Love the simple white background. It is a bit high-key photo which makes their skin a bit yellowish (could be easily fixed with colour balance). It is nice and sharp. A family keeper!', '2004-11-05 22:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(994288, 116930, 10275, '<td valign="top">Nice colour and sharp foreground, but the background looks too flat and fake. It does make the tree jump out, but the background looks overdone. It almost looks like one of those 3D laser pictures.</td>', 'Nice colour and sharp foreground, but the background looks too flat and fake. It does make the tree jump out, but the background looks overdone. It almost looks like one of those 3D laser pictures.', '2004-11-05 22:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(994293, 117097, 10275, '<td valign="top">Inspired by National Geographic? Very beautiful portrait photo. Her eyes just captivate me. The only suggestion is for the intial setup of the scarf. The edging looks too rough. Perhaps wrapping it inwards and having a folded soft edge would have helped. It doesn''t take away from the photo, I am just being picky I guess.</td>', 'Inspired by National Geographic? Very beautiful portrait photo. Her eyes just captivate me. The only suggestion is for the intial setup of the scarf. The edging looks too rough. Perhaps wrapping it inwards and having a folded soft edge would have helped. It doesn''t take away from the photo, I am just being picky I guess.', '2004-11-05 22:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(994296, 109241, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very cute and beautiful photo. Suggestion: deeper DOF to make the nose and mouth in focus. Even the eyes aren''t the shapest - which they should be. The ears in this case are sharp. <br/> <br/>Nice soft background and reflections-free glass - well done.</td>', 'Very cute and beautiful photo. Suggestion: deeper DOF to make the nose and mouth in focus. Even the eyes aren''t the shapest - which they should be. The ears in this case are sharp.  Nice soft background and reflections-free glass - well done.', '2004-11-05 22:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(994298, 109482, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very precious shot. Great lighting (a bit on the high-key note), but just enough tone to pull it off. Good texture on the bear and the jeans, nice smooth skin. Love the eyelash detail. I would have liked to see a bit more of the surface on the bottom right side. As it is now, the baby appears as it is floating. Great overall photo.<br/> <br/>Jacko?</td>', 'Very precious shot. Great lighting (a bit on the high-key note), but just enough tone to pull it off. Good texture on the bear and the jeans, nice smooth skin. Love the eyelash detail. I would have liked to see a bit more of the surface on the bottom right side. As it is now, the baby appears as it is floating. Great overall photo. Jacko?', '2004-11-05 22:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(994303, 117139, 10275, '<td valign="top">Oh, my god. This just cracks me up. I almost peed myself when I saw this. It''s like an animated movie character. What a cutie.  I wish you have shown some hairy leggs as well.</td>', 'Oh, my god. This just cracks me up. I almost peed myself when I saw this. It''s like an animated movie character. What a cutie.  I wish you have shown some hairy leggs as well.', '2004-11-05 22:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
