(994751, 115931, 27482, '<td valign="top">One thing bothers me about this shot, the fact that it slants to the right, it´s like you werent in the exact middle of the tracs and also leaned a little bit down on the right side.  It´s very distracting to me and just plain ruins it.  However the shot is pretty decent, nothing spectacular but not bad either, you got some good colours here and a nice sky.</td>', 'One thing bothers me about this shot, the fact that it slants to the right, it´s like you werent in the exact middle of the tracs and also leaned a little bit down on the right side.  It´s very distracting to me and just plain ruins it.  However the shot is pretty decent, nothing spectacular but not bad either, you got some good colours here and a nice sky.', '2004-11-06 05:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(994752, 116580, 27482, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, however if I may nitpick the leave itself looks a bit overexposed, a little burning would put this shot up in the "aweseome" category.</td>', 'Excellent shot, however if I may nitpick the leave itself looks a bit overexposed, a little burning would put this shot up in the "aweseome" category.', '2004-11-06 05:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(994753, 114199, 27482, '<td valign="top">Good duotone and nice use of a big aperture but the hand in front of the face isn´t working here, IMO.</td>', 'Good duotone and nice use of a big aperture but the hand in front of the face isn´t working here, IMO.', '2004-11-06 05:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(994754, 115429, 27482, '<td valign="top">The sky looks very oversaturated, it´s pretty close to being purple so I think you overdid it but other than that it´s only an average shot in this competition, I am afraid that this just blends in with a lot of other "good shots but not extraordinary".  Keep it up.</td>', 'The sky looks very oversaturated, it´s pretty close to being purple so I think you overdid it but other than that it´s only an average shot in this competition, I am afraid that this just blends in with a lot of other "good shots but not extraordinary".  Keep it up.', '2004-11-06 05:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(994758, 109340, 16004, '<td valign="top">what a lovely simple effective study in light.  it''s a good clean image - the only slight reservation i have is with regards to the tight cropping and narrow presentation of the shot.  something a bit squarer might more naturally sut the shape of the cup.  that aside, spiffing stuff - 8</td>', 'what a lovely simple effective study in light.  it''s a good clean image - the only slight reservation i have is with regards to the tight cropping and narrow presentation of the shot.  something a bit squarer might more naturally sut the shape of the cup.  that aside, spiffing stuff - 8', '2004-11-06 05:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(994763, 116155, 16004, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely scenery shot, though it doesn''t feel, erm, full enough.  the colours, shades, contrast feels just a bit too muted.  i realise it''s because of the mist, and the mist does add that kind of ambience, but i feel a little more contrast would bring it more alive.  still very very nice though, bumping up to 6.</td>', 'This is a lovely scenery shot, though it doesn''t feel, erm, full enough.  the colours, shades, contrast feels just a bit too muted.  i realise it''s because of the mist, and the mist does add that kind of ambience, but i feel a little more contrast would bring it more alive.  still very very nice though, bumping up to 6.', '2004-11-06 06:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
