(994769, 109332, 12611, '<td valign="top">disturbing. It makes you think, I''ll give it that. And gratuitous coochy shots are always welcome, even in a semi-religious creepy sort of way.</td>', 'disturbing. It makes you think, I''ll give it that. And gratuitous coochy shots are always welcome, even in a semi-religious creepy sort of way.', '2004-11-06 06:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(994772, 117323, 12611, '<td valign="top">I think this is great. The look is almost sincere, but the stuff she''s got in her hand- (or the fluffiness of the dress) is distracting.  I like the green and red dots and the getting dark/raining outside- you captured the mood perfectly.</td>', 'I think this is great. The look is almost sincere, but the stuff she''s got in her hand- (or the fluffiness of the dress) is distracting.  I like the green and red dots and the getting dark/raining outside- you captured the mood perfectly.', '2004-11-06 06:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(994773, 117214, 21714, '<td valign="top">Very nice exposure. Looks almost like if was generated with 3D software.  Like the way the trees and colours are seen in the background.</td>', 'Very nice exposure. Looks almost like if was generated with 3D software.  Like the way the trees and colours are seen in the background.', '2004-11-06 06:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(994774, 114806, 21714, '<td valign="top">Very strong composition and I love the dramatic sky. Looks a bit smudged though.  Great balance in the picture, with shapes and tones. Works wonders. Excellent capture.</td>', 'Very strong composition and I love the dramatic sky. Looks a bit smudged though.  Great balance in the picture, with shapes and tones. Works wonders. Excellent capture.', '2004-11-06 06:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(994775, 116837, 21714, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait. Love your compotistion and use of colour. Superb detail and balance.  Excellent work. All the best.</td>', 'Very nice portrait. Love your compotistion and use of colour. Superb detail and balance.  Excellent work. All the best.', '2004-11-06 06:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(994780, 114560, 21714, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Love the way you have captured the motion and atmosphere. Framing is great and B&amp;W conversion works really well for the shot. Great job.</td>', 'Cool shot. Love the way you have captured the motion and atmosphere. Framing is great and B&W conversion works really well for the shot. Great job.', '2004-11-06 06:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(994782, 117021, 21714, '<td valign="top">It''s like 3 shots in one. Great capture.  I love all the elements in this image. The fog, background and the 2 birds in the foreground create a rather surreal, beautiful image. Very well done.</td>', 'It''s like 3 shots in one. Great capture.  I love all the elements in this image. The fog, background and the 2 birds in the foreground create a rather surreal, beautiful image. Very well done.', '2004-11-06 06:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(994784, 111365, 21714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image with excellent processing. Elements in the distance combined with rather dense looking clouds with subtle reflections create this absolutely wonderful image.  It''s a stunning piece of work.</td>', 'Beautiful image with excellent processing. Elements in the distance combined with rather dense looking clouds with subtle reflections create this absolutely wonderful image.  It''s a stunning piece of work.', '2004-11-06 06:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(994785, 116667, 11800, '<td valign="top">Great update on an old theme. Really masterful control of the light.</td>', 'Great update on an old theme. Really masterful control of the light.', '2004-11-06 06:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(994788, 117214, 25486, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot, one I''ve tried to capture many times without sucess.  I lioke the way there is colour in the leaves yet most of the shot seems to be mono.  Not sure if its selective desat or just the high contrast that makes it seem that way?  Thats the way an effect should be subtle but still create the effect.  The dappled light gives depth and the 3D effect, the road leads you into the shot, its a pity it bends off to the left so much but I guess the light wasn''t going to hang around for too long and wait for you to better compose the shot? Excellent, a 10 from me.</td>', 'Amazing shot, one I''ve tried to capture many times without sucess.  I lioke the way there is colour in the leaves yet most of the shot seems to be mono.  Not sure if its selective desat or just the high contrast that makes it seem that way?  Thats the way an effect should be subtle but still create the effect.  The dappled light gives depth and the 3D effect, the road leads you into the shot, its a pity it bends off to the left so much but I guess the light wasn''t going to hang around for too long and wait for you to better compose the shot? Excellent, a 10 from me.', '2004-11-06 06:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(994791, 112844, 26756, '<td valign="top">The subject matter, lighting and mood are all brilliant.  Love the color of the smoke and the whole feel of the shot.</td>', 'The subject matter, lighting and mood are all brilliant.  Love the color of the smoke and the whole feel of the shot.', '2004-11-06 07:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(994799, 116815, 22781, '<td valign="top">Nice but it could do wuth a little more sharpness</td>', 'Nice but it could do wuth a little more sharpness', '2004-11-06 07:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(994801, 117093, 25486, '<td valign="top">A simplistic looking shot but works well.  The colurs reflected in the water are wonderful.  You''ve done right I think by not centralising the bird but, I''m still not sure that the composition is right?  Somehow it seems to be lacking, like there is something more to see, I''m not sure how it could be improved because of the lack of other elements in the shot.<br/> <br/>I would try, (if you haven''t already) moving the bird around in the frame.  That''s assuming you have a wider image to play with.  Maybee more detail in the bird would improve it?<br/> <br/>Well done though a striking image.</td>', 'A simplistic looking shot but works well.  The colurs reflected in the water are wonderful.  You''ve done right I think by not centralising the bird but, I''m still not sure that the composition is right?  Somehow it seems to be lacking, like there is something more to see, I''m not sure how it could be improved because of the lack of other elements in the shot. I would try, (if you haven''t already) moving the bird around in the frame.  That''s assuming you have a wider image to play with.  Maybee more detail in the bird would improve it? Well done though a striking image.', '2004-11-06 07:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
