(994881, 117272, 25486, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like people in my shots but in this case I thing one of more figures could have impoved it.  I think its because of the large area of empty middle ground?<br/> <br/>The colours are very good and the exposure I imaging would have been a bit tricky.  The wall of the frist arch on the left is a little burn out but that''s where the light is hitting from the source around the corner.  The detail of the brickwork is nice and the cracks add atmosphere.  There seems to be a lot of sharpening but I don''t think is overdone.<br/> <br/>The series of arches leads you into the shot but then cuts you off without something to focus attention on.  I know that''s not within your control but I''m just pointing out things that would lift the image a bit higher.<br/> <br/>Its possible the shot might work better by darkening it and giving it a moody mysterious feel?  At the moment its quite light and airy.  Just an idea?<br/> <br/>Its very nice I like it, well done a six from me.</td>', 'I don''t usually like people in my shots but in this case I thing one of more figures could have impoved it.  I think its because of the large area of empty middle ground? The colours are very good and the exposure I imaging would have been a bit tricky.  The wall of the frist arch on the left is a little burn out but that''s where the light is hitting from the source around the corner.  The detail of the brickwork is nice and the cracks add atmosphere.  There seems to be a lot of sharpening but I don''t think is overdone. The series of arches leads you into the shot but then cuts you off without something to focus attention on.  I know that''s not within your control but I''m just pointing out things that would lift the image a bit higher. Its possible the shot might work better by darkening it and giving it a moody mysterious feel?  At the moment its quite light and airy.  Just an idea? Its very nice I like it, well done a six from me.', '2004-11-06 08:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(994882, 112988, 22781, '<td valign="top">You said it in your title: Cliché, there are more then one in this challenge.<br/>Still a nice image...</td>', 'You said it in your title: Cliché, there are more then one in this challenge.Still a nice image...', '2004-11-06 08:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
