(994884, 116801, 22781, '<td valign="top">I could have written that there are too many fall colors photos in this challenge (there are too many) but this one is more special, I realy like the bringe in this landscape.<br/>Good luck</td>', 'I could have written that there are too many fall colors photos in this challenge (there are too many) but this one is more special, I realy like the bringe in this landscape.Good luck', '2004-11-06 08:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
