(994887, 112870, 22781, '<td valign="top">I especialy like the background of this photo.<br/>Normaly the background is distracting in a photo like this. Here it helps because of all the colors.</td>', 'I especialy like the background of this photo.Normaly the background is distracting in a photo like this. Here it helps because of all the colors.', '2004-11-06 08:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(994891, 117157, 25486, '<td valign="top">A very nice discovery, if its still accessable there''s the potential for a range of shots here.<br/> <br/>The image seems a bit bright and light to convey the feeling of old and abandoned.  I think I would have tried to darken it and not so much sharpening.  Also a closer crop might work better, I understand wanting to show the surroundings and were the old truck is but sometimes just a hint of it and letting the viewer use their imagination works better.<br/> <br/>I wish I could visit ans shoot some myself, well done a six from me.</td>', 'A very nice discovery, if its still accessable there''s the potential for a range of shots here. The image seems a bit bright and light to convey the feeling of old and abandoned.  I think I would have tried to darken it and not so much sharpening.  Also a closer crop might work better, I understand wanting to show the surroundings and were the old truck is but sometimes just a hint of it and letting the viewer use their imagination works better. I wish I could visit ans shoot some myself, well done a six from me.', '2004-11-06 08:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
