(994993, 116340, 19978, '<td valign="top">I like this shot alot, but I''m ambivalent about the tryp border. It''s tastefully done, but my eye is continually drawn to the vertical bars and away from your very compelling and well-lit subject. For your landscape, you''ve captured that golden moment perfectly, with just the right combo of low-angle light and shadow, and the fog is, of course, awesome. Bumped from 6 to 7.</td>', 'I like this shot alot, but I''m ambivalent about the tryp border. It''s tastefully done, but my eye is continually drawn to the vertical bars and away from your very compelling and well-lit subject. For your landscape, you''ve captured that golden moment perfectly, with just the right combo of low-angle light and shadow, and the fog is, of course, awesome. Bumped from 6 to 7.', '2004-11-06 09:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(994995, 113173, 19978, '<td valign="top">Nice minimalist composition. With only three primary elements, placement is everything. Something about the arrangement of the elements doesn''t seem to jive into a coherent whole. It''s a very nice photo, but somehow lacks that final punch. Bumped from 5 to 6 though.</td>', 'Nice minimalist composition. With only three primary elements, placement is everything. Something about the arrangement of the elements doesn''t seem to jive into a coherent whole. It''s a very nice photo, but somehow lacks that final punch. Bumped from 5 to 6 though.', '2004-11-06 09:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(994996, 114755, 19978, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. It raises lots of questions for me and kept me looking for several minutes. It''s apparently a cloudy night with the nearly full moon obscured. What are the people doing and why do so many of them apparently have flashlights? The photo lacks the "wow" factor but is intriguing nonetheless.</td>', 'Interesting shot. It raises lots of questions for me and kept me looking for several minutes. It''s apparently a cloudy night with the nearly full moon obscured. What are the people doing and why do so many of them apparently have flashlights? The photo lacks the "wow" factor but is intriguing nonetheless.', '2004-11-06 09:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(994997, 116455, 19978, '<td valign="top">Nice twist on a time-tested DPC theme. Perfect setup, perfect execution.</td>', 'Nice twist on a time-tested DPC theme. Perfect setup, perfect execution.', '2004-11-06 09:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(995004, 117083, 16493, '<td valign="top">high light a bit too bright - takes all attansion from the nice smooth feel of the left side.</td>', 'high light a bit too bright - takes all attansion from the nice smooth feel of the left side.', '2004-11-06 09:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
