(995248, 117137, 14043, '<td valign="top">Nice and crisp, but boring.  I like the contrast of the blue and gold, but there needs to be a focus point because right now it''s just a bunch of leaves on  a branch.  Perhaps try cropping it to a certain area of the photo or even retaking it to get more depth of field to make the background less distracting.</td>', 'Nice and crisp, but boring.  I like the contrast of the blue and gold, but there needs to be a focus point because right now it''s just a bunch of leaves on  a branch.  Perhaps try cropping it to a certain area of the photo or even retaking it to get more depth of field to make the background less distracting.', '2004-11-06 13:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(995254, 117079, 10390, '<td valign="top">Very good image, this will end up very high in this challenge, a top 10 image imo.  Good use of dof and good placement of the focus point.</td>', 'Very good image, this will end up very high in this challenge, a top 10 image imo.  Good use of dof and good placement of the focus point.', '2004-11-06 13:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(995267, 116876, 10390, '<td valign="top">Great photo, I really like it, but it wouldn''t surprise me that it will end in a lower than the top 30 although I would like to see it in top 10.</td>', 'Great photo, I really like it, but it wouldn''t surprise me that it will end in a lower than the top 30 although I would like to see it in top 10.', '2004-11-06 13:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(995272, 109482, 10390, '<td valign="top">Great emotive photo, it will surprise me if this will not be in top 10.</td>', 'Great emotive photo, it will surprise me if this will not be in top 10.', '2004-11-06 13:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(995288, 115063, 10432, '<td valign="top">I like the fence and rusty barbed wire.  I think it would be better with a shallower DoF.</td>', 'I like the fence and rusty barbed wire.  I think it would be better with a shallower DoF.', '2004-11-06 13:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
