(995315, 109241, 25150, '<td valign="top">hello there! It''s so cute, but the focus is on his ears and not on his eyes/face. A higher aperture would have worked better for this  excellent shot though :)</td>', 'hello there! It''s so cute, but the focus is on his ears and not on his eyes/face. A higher aperture would have worked better for this  excellent shot though :)', '2004-11-06 14:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
