(995389, 114849, 27524, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lights...i like when sun gets through in dusk... then colors are real amazing. Good capture.</td>', 'Beautiful lights...i like when sun gets through in dusk... then colors are real amazing. Good capture.', '2004-11-06 15:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
