(995432, 115429, 27375, '<td valign="top">it seems like i have seen this in a thread or something, the sky color seems a little funny to me but still an interesting subject angle and comp</td>', 'it seems like i have seen this in a thread or something, the sky color seems a little funny to me but still an interesting subject angle and comp', '2004-11-06 15:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
