(995555, 114835, 16301, '<td valign="top">Maybe boost the colors a bit?</td>', 'Maybe boost the colors a bit?', '2004-11-06 16:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(995556, 111365, 20433, '<td valign="top">I really like the mystic in this one. Excellent work !<br/>I usually don''t give out 10 very easy but this one deserves a 10.<br/>Congrats on a job well done !</td>', 'I really like the mystic in this one. Excellent work !I usually don''t give out 10 very easy but this one deserves a 10.Congrats on a job well done !', '2004-11-06 16:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(995565, 116335, 27524, '<td valign="top">Very interesting focus...like transparency and reflections. Good job.</td>', 'Very interesting focus...like transparency and reflections. Good job.', '2004-11-06 16:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(995568, 116702, 16301, '<td valign="top">Maybe play with the RGB channel levels to make the colors more interesting...?</td>', 'Maybe play with the RGB channel levels to make the colors more interesting...?', '2004-11-06 16:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(995574, 109266, 20433, '<td valign="top">The bakground is a litle distracting but nevertheless a good job.</td>', 'The bakground is a litle distracting but nevertheless a good job.', '2004-11-06 16:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(995576, 117021, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent sense of light, a great capture, and all round a well executed shot. If it lacks anything, it may be a sense of real sharpness, which would add just that extra bit of impact, but that is probably a subjective thing.</td>', 'Excellent sense of light, a great capture, and all round a well executed shot. If it lacks anything, it may be a sense of real sharpness, which would add just that extra bit of impact, but that is probably a subjective thing.', '2004-11-06 16:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(995577, 115034, 16301, '<td valign="top">Would have looked better in B&amp;W, the colors are a bit washed out...</td>', 'Would have looked better in B&W, the colors are a bit washed out...', '2004-11-06 16:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(995579, 113173, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like the spare-ness of this composition, although the palm tree feels a little crowded by the edge of the frame - would have adored it with the leaves placed/cropped just as far from the edge as the flag and the ball - that would add balance in my eyes. Nevertheless, a marvellous image, excellently executed. Bravo.</td>', 'Like the spare-ness of this composition, although the palm tree feels a little crowded by the edge of the frame - would have adored it with the leaves placed/cropped just as far from the edge as the flag and the ball - that would add balance in my eyes. Nevertheless, a marvellous image, excellently executed. Bravo.', '2004-11-06 16:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(995584, 111308, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent stuff. Love the sense of texture, the sense of balance in this. The fact that the tonal range of the wall matches the money''s own colouring adds a bizarre edge, something somehow threatening, but I love the use of shadow here too.</td>', 'Excellent stuff. Love the sense of texture, the sense of balance in this. The fact that the tonal range of the wall matches the money''s own colouring adds a bizarre edge, something somehow threatening, but I love the use of shadow here too.', '2004-11-06 16:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(995591, 110959, 20433, '<td valign="top">What are you trying to capture here. The birds, the fog, the trees ???<br/>I just can''t see anything to this photo ... sorry !</td>', 'What are you trying to capture here. The birds, the fog, the trees ???I just can''t see anything to this photo ... sorry !', '2004-11-06 16:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(995595, 117207, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice artistic and abstract work. Wonder how to mix such up.</td>', 'Nice artistic and abstract work. Wonder how to mix such up.', '2004-11-06 16:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(995596, 116372, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very well done here. Like the pushing of he light to achieve the effect very much, for all there will probably be those who gripe about burnt-out areas - ignore them. This is just an excellent photo.</td>', 'Very well done here. Like the pushing of he light to achieve the effect very much, for all there will probably be those who gripe about burnt-out areas - ignore them. This is just an excellent photo.', '2004-11-06 16:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(995597, 112061, 20433, '<td valign="top">I really like the dark and the bright spots in this composition. Very simular to my OFS submission.<br/>Excellent work !</td>', 'I really like the dark and the bright spots in this composition. Very simular to my OFS submission.Excellent work !', '2004-11-06 16:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(995610, 111672, 6999, '<td valign="top">I kind of get your point, though it seems to me there are a couple of areas that you haven''t quite got. Those leaf colours just aren''t puncky enough for real impact - they seem prettty bland - I think folks want to see big bright oranges and reda, rather than these quite pale yellows. Also there''s quite cleear digital noise n the blue areas of the sky - the blotchiness there. It isn''t necessarily a problem in itself, but it is distracting in such an otherwise clean composition - basically, it doesn''t fit the type of shot you''ve taken, in my eyes.</td>', 'I kind of get your point, though it seems to me there are a couple of areas that you haven''t quite got. Those leaf colours just aren''t puncky enough for real impact - they seem prettty bland - I think folks want to see big bright oranges and reda, rather than these quite pale yellows. Also there''s quite cleear digital noise n the blue areas of the sky - the blotchiness there. It isn''t necessarily a problem in itself, but it is distracting in such an otherwise clean composition - basically, it doesn''t fit the type of shot you''ve taken, in my eyes.', '2004-11-06 16:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(995614, 114394, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nicely detailed guide-book-like shot. Highly competent. I can''t say that it does a lot for me photographically, artistically, if you like, but I can appreciate the technical prowess here.</td>', 'Nicely detailed guide-book-like shot. Highly competent. I can''t say that it does a lot for me photographically, artistically, if you like, but I can appreciate the technical prowess here.', '2004-11-06 16:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
