(995779, 116806, 19978, '<td valign="top">The composition is fine, the use of leading lines is OK, but the photo seems to lack some umpf-factor. I think it may have worked better if the horses were more prominently featured. At this distance, they''re a bit underemphasized, where it feels as though they should be your primary subject. The colors also lack punch.</td>', 'The composition is fine, the use of leading lines is OK, but the photo seems to lack some umpf-factor. I think it may have worked better if the horses were more prominently featured. At this distance, they''re a bit underemphasized, where it feels as though they should be your primary subject. The colors also lack punch.', '2004-11-06 18:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(995783, 116801, 19978, '<td valign="top">Amazing pic. My only complaint would be the exposure details. I''d love to see this scene at different times of the day with various sun angles. As it is though, the picture has a wonderful feel. Very nicely done!</td>', 'Amazing pic. My only complaint would be the exposure details. I''d love to see this scene at different times of the day with various sun angles. As it is though, the picture has a wonderful feel. Very nicely done!', '2004-11-06 18:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
