(996216, 109340, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice shot with a couple of issues.  You have color bandings in the mug (from jpeg?).  Not sure if you can do much about this.  Try compressing at different levels?  Different sizes?  Also you have an ugly gray frame around the shot that really detracts (IMO).  Main part of shot is very nice though.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice shot with a couple of issues.  You have color bandings in the mug (from jpeg?).  Not sure if you can do much about this.  Try compressing at different levels?  Different sizes?  Also you have an ugly gray frame around the shot that really detracts (IMO).  Main part of shot is very nice though.TC', '2004-11-07 01:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
