(996241, 117214, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is just plain gorgeous.  I can''t wait to see what the conditions behind the shot were.  I can hear the silence, smell the late autumn aromas of decay, feel the chill in the air and the foggy mist on my face and  wonder what is over the hill.  Kudos on the simplicity and elegance of this.<br/>TC</td>', 'This is just plain gorgeous.  I can''t wait to see what the conditions behind the shot were.  I can hear the silence, smell the late autumn aromas of decay, feel the chill in the air and the foggy mist on my face and  wonder what is over the hill.  Kudos on the simplicity and elegance of this.TC', '2004-11-07 01:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
