(996335, 113903, 8860, '<td valign="top">Looks like you were in a gloomy mood then! <br/> <br/>I can''t tell what you wanted from this - humour, irony, a wind-up? Whatever it is, this doesn''t really work on any level for me. I''ll treat it as a serious shot and say that the flue iin the foreground is obstructive, too centred and dominates the shot, while the background elements are not very intriguing and do not play a strong part in the composition. Image is washed out by the sky.<br/> <br/>I do like the curtains in the building and the texture on the piping though.</td>', 'Looks like you were in a gloomy mood then!  I can''t tell what you wanted from this - humour, irony, a wind-up? Whatever it is, this doesn''t really work on any level for me. I''ll treat it as a serious shot and say that the flue iin the foreground is obstructive, too centred and dominates the shot, while the background elements are not very intriguing and do not play a strong part in the composition. Image is washed out by the sky. I do like the curtains in the building and the texture on the piping though.', '2004-11-07 04:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
