(996404, 117307, 20364, '<td valign="top">Since the</td>', 'Since the', '2004-11-07 06:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(996406, 114302, 6999, '<td valign="top">I find it difficult here to get a sense of subject, or of what your primary interest in the scene is. I like it as a documentary photograph - I like the juxtaposition of all those elements - the houses, the un-cut whatever in that field, the cows. The tree by the little bridge, the colours in the trees. But it seems disorganised - i get little sense of being directed, it seems just an everyday scene shot in a most naive style. Obviously, that may be deliberate, and there is a certain element of the naive that I like here, in the style, but in the end i don''t think it does much for me.</td>', 'I find it difficult here to get a sense of subject, or of what your primary interest in the scene is. I like it as a documentary photograph - I like the juxtaposition of all those elements - the houses, the un-cut whatever in that field, the cows. The tree by the little bridge, the colours in the trees. But it seems disorganised - i get little sense of being directed, it seems just an everyday scene shot in a most naive style. Obviously, that may be deliberate, and there is a certain element of the naive that I like here, in the style, but in the end i don''t think it does much for me.', '2004-11-07 06:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(996407, 116933, 6999, '<td valign="top">An interesting thing, shot in an only moderately interesting way, IMO. I would certainly have worked on the foreground more - it''s really quite blank and lacking punch, certainly when compared to the sky and the trees. The light is harsh, too - you might also have worked to bring out more shadow detail, as I don''t think there''s much interest in the graphic shapes of the roofs alone.</td>', 'An interesting thing, shot in an only moderately interesting way, IMO. I would certainly have worked on the foreground more - it''s really quite blank and lacking punch, certainly when compared to the sky and the trees. The light is harsh, too - you might also have worked to bring out more shadow detail, as I don''t think there''s much interest in the graphic shapes of the roofs alone.', '2004-11-07 06:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(996409, 113451, 6999, '<td valign="top">IR now ... I think it depends for so much of its impact on never having seen it before, and for me I don''t find enough other interrest here: the composition is strong, effective, and the quality of light you''ve caught is nice, but not really a winner for me.</td>', 'IR now ... I think it depends for so much of its impact on never having seen it before, and for me I don''t find enough other interrest here: the composition is strong, effective, and the quality of light you''ve caught is nice, but not really a winner for me.', '2004-11-07 06:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(996410, 114989, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good quality of light, though I can''t escape the feeling that it would have been more effective without the framing of the wing-mirror - surely the real effect of these shots depends on the contrast between the reflected world and the direct world, and you''ve allowed us to see none of that ''direct'' world.</td>', 'Good quality of light, though I can''t escape the feeling that it would have been more effective without the framing of the wing-mirror - surely the real effect of these shots depends on the contrast between the reflected world and the direct world, and you''ve allowed us to see none of that ''direct'' world.', '2004-11-07 06:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(996411, 109506, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good capture, good detail, effective compositionally. I like the posed feeling here (obviously it isn''t actually posed, but it has that feeling). You could absolutely sell this to whatever zoo you took it in, I would think. Not sure why I don''t rate it as a top shot - it''s obviously done with great care, patience, expertise, and the rest - I guess I''ll just have to say I don''t like it much, despite appreciating all that ... sorry. 6</td>', 'Good capture, good detail, effective compositionally. I like the posed feeling here (obviously it isn''t actually posed, but it has that feeling). You could absolutely sell this to whatever zoo you took it in, I would think. Not sure why I don''t rate it as a top shot - it''s obviously done with great care, patience, expertise, and the rest - I guess I''ll just have to say I don''t like it much, despite appreciating all that ... sorry. 6', '2004-11-07 06:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(996412, 112382, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not convinced about the extreme shallow dof here - a misplaced trick from trendy portrait photography just adds a sense of confusion to my eye, and I really want to see every detail of the fantastic light and subject you have here. And wisdom? She looks more scared or worried to death, to me. It has a lot to say about age, this shot, were it not for those two elements.</td>', 'Not convinced about the extreme shallow dof here - a misplaced trick from trendy portrait photography just adds a sense of confusion to my eye, and I really want to see every detail of the fantastic light and subject you have here. And wisdom? She looks more scared or worried to death, to me. It has a lot to say about age, this shot, were it not for those two elements.', '2004-11-07 07:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(996413, 114432, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like this very much - great sense of late night road-trip, the strange emotions of travelling, the strange and enhancing views one sees from trains, busses, and the like, that never seem to present themselves at any other time. Pity about the text though, and the inevitable disqualification you''ll get for that. Might you not have cloned it out, or are you making a point?</td>', 'Like this very much - great sense of late night road-trip, the strange emotions of travelling, the strange and enhancing views one sees from trains, busses, and the like, that never seem to present themselves at any other time. Pity about the text though, and the inevitable disqualification you''ll get for that. Might you not have cloned it out, or are you making a point?', '2004-11-07 07:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(996414, 114876, 19952, '<td valign="top">Everything about this photo is absolutely masterful. I hope you win a ribbon because this is a stunningly beautiful picture in every way. Great job.</td>', 'Everything about this photo is absolutely masterful. I hope you win a ribbon because this is a stunningly beautiful picture in every way. Great job.', '2004-11-07 07:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(996415, 116625, 6999, '<td valign="top">High quality shot, but so very common it''s difficult to see any great appeal or difference in this one. Sellable no doubt.</td>', 'High quality shot, but so very common it''s difficult to see any great appeal or difference in this one. Sellable no doubt.', '2004-11-07 07:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(996418, 116655, 6999, '<td valign="top">Any real sense of texture seems lost here, quite possibly because of your sharpening, which has also produced those halos around the legs and antennae. I find tthe cropping alos to be a bit heavy-handed - more consideration might have been lavished on just what parts of the flowers you were going tto include/exclude - heree you seem to have concentrated entirely on the butterfly.</td>', 'Any real sense of texture seems lost here, quite possibly because of your sharpening, which has also produced those halos around the legs and antennae. I find tthe cropping alos to be a bit heavy-handed - more consideration might have been lavished on just what parts of the flowers you were going tto include/exclude - heree you seem to have concentrated entirely on the butterfly.', '2004-11-07 07:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(996419, 113334, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good work. Woudl like to see a larger version, as i suspect the detail really tells, so it''s a shame about the site limitations - but that also is what has to be worked with here. 7</td>', 'Good work. Woudl like to see a larger version, as i suspect the detail really tells, so it''s a shame about the site limitations - but that also is what has to be worked with here. 7', '2004-11-07 07:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
