(996806, 112493, 11843, '<td valign="top">Man, I love this photo! I''m bummed to only give you an 8 for this. But, I am having a problem with the lack of space between the girls feet and the bottom of the photo. I think it is way too obvious and hurts this playful and fun pic. Great work and a pleasure to view!</td>', 'Man, I love this photo! I''m bummed to only give you an 8 for this. But, I am having a problem with the lack of space between the girls feet and the bottom of the photo. I think it is way too obvious and hurts this playful and fun pic. Great work and a pleasure to view!', '2004-11-07 12:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(996807, 117214, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''ve been trying to get some shots like this lately; well-done under what looks like tricky exposure conditions.</td>', 'I''ve been trying to get some shots like this lately; well-done under what looks like tricky exposure conditions.', '2004-11-07 12:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(996809, 113451, 25150, '<td valign="top">not quite winter, but definately infra-red during the day. nice shot.</td>', 'not quite winter, but definately infra-red during the day. nice shot.', '2004-11-07 12:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(996810, 114484, 11248, '<td valign="top">Lighting ... just perfect. Wonderful.</td>', 'Lighting ... just perfect. Wonderful.', '2004-11-07 12:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(996811, 115678, 11248, '<td valign="top">Wonderful landscape. Contrast a bit high but nice to see.</td>', 'Wonderful landscape. Contrast a bit high but nice to see.', '2004-11-07 12:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(996812, 114849, 11248, '<td valign="top">Sun under a dark sky creates great atmosphere. Well done.</td>', 'Sun under a dark sky creates great atmosphere. Well done.', '2004-11-07 12:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(996814, 114918, 11248, '<td valign="top">A classic picture ... always welcome. Nice.</td>', 'A classic picture ... always welcome. Nice.', '2004-11-07 12:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(996815, 116871, 11248, '<td valign="top">Great landacape ... would like to see with a in color with a blue sky.</td>', 'Great landacape ... would like to see with a in color with a blue sky.', '2004-11-07 12:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(996821, 116999, 1031, '<td valign="top">Great clouds and lighting -- I think I''d lighten the lightest tones a teensy bit more so long as it maintains the stormy mood.</td>', 'Great clouds and lighting -- I think I''d lighten the lightest tones a teensy bit more so long as it maintains the stormy mood.', '2004-11-07 12:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(996822, 114844, 1031, '<td valign="top">One of the best-ever uses of partial desaturation I''ve seen; turns the background into a photograph of the scene rather than the scene itself (or maybe it is a photo -- no matter), and virtually forces the viewer into empathy with the subject, off in a separate reality from the remainder of the party.</td>', 'One of the best-ever uses of partial desaturation I''ve seen; turns the background into a photograph of the scene rather than the scene itself (or maybe it is a photo -- no matter), and virtually forces the viewer into empathy with the subject, off in a separate reality from the remainder of the party.', '2004-11-07 12:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(996823, 116536, 1031, '<td valign="top">Exquisitely gross : )</td>', 'Exquisitely gross : )', '2004-11-07 12:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(996827, 117085, 26756, '<td valign="top">Very nice light on the foreground and of course a dramatic and powerful background.  Framed very nicely and really pleasing to the eye.  Great work.</td>', 'Very nice light on the foreground and of course a dramatic and powerful background.  Framed very nicely and really pleasing to the eye.  Great work.', '2004-11-07 13:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(996830, 117097, 26756, '<td valign="top">Very familiar photo, hopefully from the same photographer.  The lighting on the black robe is perfect.  Just enough highlights.  Great expression and very engaging eyes. Contact lenses are plainly visible but who really cares?</td>', 'Very familiar photo, hopefully from the same photographer.  The lighting on the black robe is perfect.  Just enough highlights.  Great expression and very engaging eyes. Contact lenses are plainly visible but who really cares?', '2004-11-07 13:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(996836, 116696, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is hard to look at and yet it keeps drawing me. It screams its message and hurts my heart. <br/> <br/> I think "Tweety Bird" on the little boys vest has the most emotional impact for me.  It points out the reality that these are children... no different from my own grandchildren, but that life has handed them such a different road to travel. <br/> <br/>Thanks for the awareness... 10, of course</td>', 'This is hard to look at and yet it keeps drawing me. It screams its message and hurts my heart.   I think "Tweety Bird" on the little boys vest has the most emotional impact for me.  It points out the reality that these are children... no different from my own grandchildren, but that life has handed them such a different road to travel.  Thanks for the awareness... 10, of course', '2004-11-07 13:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(996838, 116372, 22975, '<td valign="top">This is stunning.  I love the smooth look of the trunk against the textured leaves... really some great contrast.  Wonderful composition, too.  9</td>', 'This is stunning.  I love the smooth look of the trunk against the textured leaves... really some great contrast.  Wonderful composition, too.  9', '2004-11-07 13:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
