(997219, 116340, 93, '<td valign="top">I''d like to know how you did the borders legally.. (I''ll assume they have been since this photo is still around :)<br/> <br/>It''s a beautiful shot, and the borders really add another dimension.</td>', 'I''d like to know how you did the borders legally.. (I''ll assume they have been since this photo is still around :) It''s a beautiful shot, and the borders really add another dimension.', '2004-11-07 17:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(997221, 116621, 93, '<td valign="top">stunning.  This is a great find, and a very nice capture.</td>', 'stunning.  This is a great find, and a very nice capture.', '2004-11-07 17:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(997222, 116696, 25150, '<td valign="top">beautiful. one of the best, and I''m sure you will do very good with this stunning shot! It looks like you might have done some background blur, and it works well with this image.</td>', 'beautiful. one of the best, and I''m sure you will do very good with this stunning shot! It looks like you might have done some background blur, and it works well with this image.', '2004-11-07 17:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(997223, 116408, 26361, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait.  Great pose and lighting.</td>', 'Lovely portrait.  Great pose and lighting.', '2004-11-07 17:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(997224, 117021, 93, '<td valign="top">Much like "Misty Morning Maestro" in the Masters'' Challenge, this is a fantastic shot with a rare crop that really puts it apart.  The lighting is stunning and the capture of the pelicans in flight is incredible.</td>', 'Much like "Misty Morning Maestro" in the Masters'' Challenge, this is a fantastic shot with a rare crop that really puts it apart.  The lighting is stunning and the capture of the pelicans in flight is incredible.', '2004-11-07 17:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(997225, 116624, 22970, '<td valign="top">I love this photo with its great autumn colors and I love the slow shutter creating the smooth water flow. The lighting is good and I love the shadows under the rocks. The only thing that distracts me is the wheel and its components seems to be blur on top but not enough to keep this from being a great shot.</td>', 'I love this photo with its great autumn colors and I love the slow shutter creating the smooth water flow. The lighting is good and I love the shadows under the rocks. The only thing that distracts me is the wheel and its components seems to be blur on top but not enough to keep this from being a great shot.', '2004-11-07 17:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(997227, 112471, 26361, '<td valign="top">Very disconcerting photo.  Nice tonal range.</td>', 'Very disconcerting photo.  Nice tonal range.', '2004-11-07 17:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
