(997241, 116791, 93, '<td valign="top">This would also have been a fantastic shot for the calender challenge.<br/> <br/>Fantastic lighting, and what an expression on the child''s face.  I love this shot.</td>', 'This would also have been a fantastic shot for the calender challenge. Fantastic lighting, and what an expression on the child''s face.  I love this shot.', '2004-11-07 17:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
