(997255, 115507, 26361, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait.  Border is a bit detracting.  Makes you want to give him a big hug.</td>', 'Lovely portrait.  Border is a bit detracting.  Makes you want to give him a big hug.', '2004-11-07 17:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
