(997272, 116455, 8891, '<td valign="top">Fascinating....great take on a subject that has been done. Hope to see a how to on this.   10</td>', 'Fascinating....great take on a subject that has been done. Hope to see a how to on this.   10', '2004-11-07 17:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(997273, 111583, 8891, '<td valign="top">Like the perspective, exposure and forboding skies. Nice work, very good composition.</td>', 'Like the perspective, exposure and forboding skies. Nice work, very good composition.', '2004-11-07 17:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(997275, 117097, 8891, '<td valign="top">lovely model and portrait. I like it as is but wonder if the shawl was necessary.?</td>', 'lovely model and portrait. I like it as is but wonder if the shawl was necessary.?', '2004-11-07 17:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(997278, 115724, 8891, '<td valign="top">One of the things that made another version of this work so well was the inclusion of drops that had not been distorted. It really made the picture. I do like the abstractness of this but some of the reflections have just gotten too large and out of proportion to the smaller drops. The reflections in the larkge drops are too blurry and only slightly so in the smaller. The focus is nice and sharp on the edge of the all the drops. I guess you were going for something different. I like the attempt and the colors.</td>', 'One of the things that made another version of this work so well was the inclusion of drops that had not been distorted. It really made the picture. I do like the abstractness of this but some of the reflections have just gotten too large and out of proportion to the smaller drops. The reflections in the larkge drops are too blurry and only slightly so in the smaller. The focus is nice and sharp on the edge of the all the drops. I guess you were going for something different. I like the attempt and the colors.', '2004-11-07 18:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(997280, 114755, 8891, '<td valign="top">interesting....reminds me of a scene from Close Encounters of the Third Kind.</td>', 'interesting....reminds me of a scene from Close Encounters of the Third Kind.', '2004-11-07 18:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
