(997335, 117180, 15648, '<td valign="top">Love those brown eyes. She is Beautiful, Nice Comp.</td>', 'Love those brown eyes. She is Beautiful, Nice Comp.', '2004-11-07 18:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(997336, 114560, 15648, '<td valign="top">Love this shot. 9  Who is it. Looks like a young Zak Wylde. I love shooting concerts. If interested, check out my webshots webpage. ALOT of concert photo''s in there. I think you will like it. If you haven''t seen it, I shot the Joe Satriani photo called "Surfing with the Alien."<br/>See website:<br/> <br/>//community.webshots.com/user/legatomuzic<br/></td>', 'Love this shot. 9  Who is it. Looks like a young Zak Wylde. I love shooting concerts. If interested, check out my webshots webpage. ALOT of concert photo''s in there. I think you will like it. If you haven''t seen it, I shot the Joe Satriani photo called "Surfing with the Alien."See website: //community.webshots.com/user/legatomuzic', '2004-11-07 18:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(997337, 116490, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice capture with the three banditos, but slightly overexposd.</td>', 'Nice capture with the three banditos, but slightly overexposd.', '2004-11-07 18:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(997340, 116627, 11738, '<td valign="top">I know you were trying to set a mood, but it''s way, way too dark.</td>', 'I know you were trying to set a mood, but it''s way, way too dark.', '2004-11-07 18:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(997344, 116372, 11738, '<td valign="top">Excellent soft treatment image for this image.  I hope you didn''t get too many "too soft" or "out of focus" comments.</td>', 'Excellent soft treatment image for this image.  I hope you didn''t get too many "too soft" or "out of focus" comments.', '2004-11-07 18:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(997345, 117256, 11738, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!  Looks like they just heard the funniest horse joke ever heard.  Greatr dutone and excellent timing on the hutter release.</td>', 'Awesome shot!  Looks like they just heard the funniest horse joke ever heard.  Greatr dutone and excellent timing on the hutter release.', '2004-11-07 18:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(997347, 113913, 11738, '<td valign="top">The best squirrel shot I''ve seen on this site in a long, long time.</td>', 'The best squirrel shot I''ve seen on this site in a long, long time.', '2004-11-07 18:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(997355, 116751, 26361, '<td valign="top">This is just too amusing for words.  Nicely done ferret portrait!</td>', 'This is just too amusing for words.  Nicely done ferret portrait!', '2004-11-07 19:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(997358, 114560, 2553, '<td valign="top">This image totally blows me away!  From the black and white to the composition to the brilliant use of negative space, this is a winner.  I''d give you a 12 if I could.  <br/> <br/>Back again, sorry, I just can''t stop looking at it, I LOVE it!</td>', 'This image totally blows me away!  From the black and white to the composition to the brilliant use of negative space, this is a winner.  I''d give you a 12 if I could.   Back again, sorry, I just can''t stop looking at it, I LOVE it!', '2004-11-07 19:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(997373, 110550, 26361, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and colors to this.</td>', 'Lovely lighting and colors to this.', '2004-11-07 19:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(997384, 116428, 6999, '<td valign="top">This, to my eye, borders on being a very fine photograph but doesn''t quite make it. I like some of the compositional quality, though I would perhaps have found a greater dissociation between the near-ground and distance more effective - I''m not sure the anchor links the two areas convincingly enough. The metallic quality of the water is well caught, but then the far bank lets things down for me - neither silhouetted nor defined, it somehow isn''t anything at all. Without that far bank - perhaps just the jetty and the anchor, especially the wetness of the jetty, perhaps you might have achieved that rare thing of making a heavily overcast day visually interesting. Nice attempt. 7</td>', 'This, to my eye, borders on being a very fine photograph but doesn''t quite make it. I like some of the compositional quality, though I would perhaps have found a greater dissociation between the near-ground and distance more effective - I''m not sure the anchor links the two areas convincingly enough. The metallic quality of the water is well caught, but then the far bank lets things down for me - neither silhouetted nor defined, it somehow isn''t anything at all. Without that far bank - perhaps just the jetty and the anchor, especially the wetness of the jetty, perhaps you might have achieved that rare thing of making a heavily overcast day visually interesting. Nice attempt. 7', '2004-11-07 19:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(997387, 111744, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very pure, very stark - but perhaps more impact from those leaves is needed? I get, I think, your point; but find the lack of real definition (largely due to size) more of a stumbling block than an enhancement. One of the perils of the limits on image size, I fear.</td>', 'Very pure, very stark - but perhaps more impact from those leaves is needed? I get, I think, your point; but find the lack of real definition (largely due to size) more of a stumbling block than an enhancement. One of the perils of the limits on image size, I fear.', '2004-11-07 19:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(997392, 115846, 24065, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in the challenge.  10</td>', 'One of my favorites in the challenge.  10', '2004-11-07 19:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(997394, 116882, 24065, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this photo!  It''s one of my favorite and highest rated in the challenge.</td>', 'I LOVE this photo!  It''s one of my favorite and highest rated in the challenge.', '2004-11-07 19:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(997395, 116408, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good tonality, great light ... and the kind of portrait photography i loath, I''m afraid. For me, overly posed, unnatural, aspiring to some kind of Beaton-esque nostalgia. The execution is impeccable of course, but I just don''t like this kind of thing.</td>', 'Good tonality, great light ... and the kind of portrait photography i loath, I''m afraid. For me, overly posed, unnatural, aspiring to some kind of Beaton-esque nostalgia. The execution is impeccable of course, but I just don''t like this kind of thing.', '2004-11-07 19:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(997397, 109315, 24065, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in the challenge.  10</td>', 'One of my favorites in the challenge.  10', '2004-11-07 19:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(997398, 113172, 24065, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'One of my favorites in the challenge.', '2004-11-07 19:31:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(997399, 117288, 24065, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'One of my favorites in the challenge.', '2004-11-07 19:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(997401, 116124, 24065, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites</td>', 'One of my favorites', '2004-11-07 19:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(997404, 117061, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait - great sense of power and speed, for all he''s so still. Real tension in his physicality, too. The waves make the location more important than perhaps would be ideal, and I don''t find anything in that location or contrast to aid the image, but nice work all the same.</td>', 'Excellent portrait - great sense of power and speed, for all he''s so still. Real tension in his physicality, too. The waves make the location more important than perhaps would be ideal, and I don''t find anything in that location or contrast to aid the image, but nice work all the same.', '2004-11-07 19:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(997413, 115507, 6999, '<td valign="top">There''s another shot like this which seems equally mis-titled. Excellent portrait, great sense of feeling to it, but that feeling, for me, is most certainly not innocence. It could be the moment of the loss of innocence, perhaps, and would be the more powerful for that being the case. It speaks to me of that moment when the realisation dawns that maybe all one''s dreams are not achievable ... amybe there just isn''t the time, maybe one has to learn to live a life unfulfilled, or of constant struggle against the hand one has been dealt. Titles ... the only words you get to offer us.</td>', 'There''s another shot like this which seems equally mis-titled. Excellent portrait, great sense of feeling to it, but that feeling, for me, is most certainly not innocence. It could be the moment of the loss of innocence, perhaps, and would be the more powerful for that being the case. It speaks to me of that moment when the realisation dawns that maybe all one''s dreams are not achievable ... amybe there just isn''t the time, maybe one has to learn to live a life unfulfilled, or of constant struggle against the hand one has been dealt. Titles ... the only words you get to offer us.', '2004-11-07 19:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(997419, 109482, 2337, '<td valign="top">Congrats :) ~10 ~</td>', 'Congrats :) ~10 ~', '2004-11-07 19:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(997425, 117158, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great colours, butt that very poor and over-exposed sky lets things down, and an overall lack of punch to the shot - look how much more dramatic the colours are in the reflection than in what is necessarily the obvious subject - the real trees - simply because of a little under-exposure. The light seems wrong to me - so very blank, undefined. Waiting for a moment of great light can be as much a part of this kind of photography as anything else at all.</td>', 'Great colours, butt that very poor and over-exposed sky lets things down, and an overall lack of punch to the shot - look how much more dramatic the colours are in the reflection than in what is necessarily the obvious subject - the real trees - simply because of a little under-exposure. The light seems wrong to me - so very blank, undefined. Waiting for a moment of great light can be as much a part of this kind of photography as anything else at all.', '2004-11-07 19:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(997439, 115310, 26361, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and colors. The bubbles in the glass are a nice touch.</td>', 'Lovely lighting and colors. The bubbles in the glass are a nice touch.', '2004-11-07 19:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
