(997506, 110602, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great use of background and lighting.  The highlight on the lower right is a bit too strong, but this is a uniquely composed image.  I know I wouldn''t hang it on my walls, yet its one of the few so far that made me stop and study it.  This *is* very good work.</td>', 'Great use of background and lighting.  The highlight on the lower right is a bit too strong, but this is a uniquely composed image.  I know I wouldn''t hang it on my walls, yet its one of the few so far that made me stop and study it.  This *is* very good work.', '2004-11-07 20:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
