(997714, 117061, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great animal portraiture, and what better a scene for an ex-racer.  I bet he loves to race the waves now that he''s running for himself and his friend...  Might not appeak to everyone, but I have a greyhound mix, so this picture makes me imagine this dog stretching his legs - I''m sure it''s a regal sight.  My only feedback is that image is a bit soft - maybe some more sharpening, or a faster shutter next time.</td>', 'Great animal portraiture, and what better a scene for an ex-racer.  I bet he loves to race the waves now that he''s running for himself and his friend...  Might not appeak to everyone, but I have a greyhound mix, so this picture makes me imagine this dog stretching his legs - I''m sure it''s a regal sight.  My only feedback is that image is a bit soft - maybe some more sharpening, or a faster shutter next time.', '2004-11-07 21:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(997720, 116628, 19982, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.  I love the idea...  but it just seems weird for the face to be more covered up than the pants.  It''s focusing my attention in the wrong place, I want to see the eyes...<br/></td>', 'Interesting concept.  I love the idea...  but it just seems weird for the face to be more covered up than the pants.  It''s focusing my attention in the wrong place, I want to see the eyes...', '2004-11-07 21:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
