(997857, 116372, 9906, '<td valign="top">IMHO This is a tad bit oversaturated.  This is my taste only and have a feeling that this will do very well in the challenge if I know voting trends at all.  Not saying this is a bad thing, just a thing...<br/>TC</td>', 'IMHO This is a tad bit oversaturated.  This is my taste only and have a feeling that this will do very well in the challenge if I know voting trends at all.  Not saying this is a bad thing, just a thing...TC', '2004-11-07 22:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(997862, 114851, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  Your subject seems a little soft.  Did you do this on purpose?  IMHO you need to seperate your subject from the background.  If you move him away from the trees more and use a more open aperature you can blur out the background and put the emphasis on the gentleman.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice lighting.  Your subject seems a little soft.  Did you do this on purpose?  IMHO you need to seperate your subject from the background.  If you move him away from the trees more and use a more open aperature you can blur out the background and put the emphasis on the gentleman.TC', '2004-11-07 22:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(997864, 111672, 9906, '<td valign="top">I personally like the backlilt leaves here.  Don''t know how it will do in this forum though so I will be looking for it in the rankings.  I guess to truly appreciate this, you have to walk along the edge of the woods during the prime fall color season!<br/>TC</td>', 'I personally like the backlilt leaves here.  Don''t know how it will do in this forum though so I will be looking for it in the rankings.  I guess to truly appreciate this, you have to walk along the edge of the woods during the prime fall color season!TC', '2004-11-07 22:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(997867, 115260, 9906, '<td valign="top">This IMHO would make an awesome b/w shot!  You should play with this concept and post up any good results in the forums for all to see!!!!<br/>TC</td>', 'This IMHO would make an awesome b/w shot!  You should play with this concept and post up any good results in the forums for all to see!!!!TC', '2004-11-07 22:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(997869, 110602, 9906, '<td valign="top">The face looks digitally enhanced antd turns me off from an otherwise adequte silhouette shot...<br/>TC</td>', 'The face looks digitally enhanced antd turns me off from an otherwise adequte silhouette shot...TC', '2004-11-07 22:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(997871, 110995, 19982, '<td valign="top">Love how sharp the snake is!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Love how sharp the snake is!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-07 22:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(997879, 116629, 19982, '<td valign="top">Are you serious?  The big dipper was really right there above the lighthouse?  What a perfect setup!  Love the long exposure, the effects of the small aperture on the light of the lighthouse, and the colors in the sky.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Are you serious?  The big dipper was really right there above the lighthouse?  What a perfect setup!  Love the long exposure, the effects of the small aperture on the light of the lighthouse, and the colors in the sky.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-11-07 22:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(997881, 116753, 22748, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture. Sharp shot. I can see a tiny bit of grain but it''s really even, smoth grain. Great crop, perfect even balanced spacing around the subjects.</td>', 'Awesome capture. Sharp shot. I can see a tiny bit of grain but it''s really even, smoth grain. Great crop, perfect even balanced spacing around the subjects.', '2004-11-07 22:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(997883, 114479, 22748, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!! I love the sky, the mist, the reflections in the water.</td>', 'Gorgeous!! I love the sky, the mist, the reflections in the water.', '2004-11-07 22:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(997884, 117223, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp image. Good color and DOF. Feels very real.</td>', 'Nice sharp image. Good color and DOF. Feels very real.', '2004-11-07 22:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(997886, 117207, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! This is really interesting. The background puzzles me as to how it''s done. Looks like maybe a big brush was used in Photoshop to paint the bright areas?? Either way, it''s a great angle on the bird.</td>', 'Nice shot! This is really interesting. The background puzzles me as to how it''s done. Looks like maybe a big brush was used in Photoshop to paint the bright areas?? Either way, it''s a great angle on the bird.', '2004-11-07 22:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(997888, 114844, 22748, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus and the desat. (Though I''m sure you''ll get *lots* of cranky voters who don''t... I know my current image is being said to be too soft even though I wanted the ''glow'' effect. boo hoo.)  Nice warm colors.</td>', 'I like the soft focus and the desat. (Though I''m sure you''ll get *lots* of cranky voters who don''t... I know my current image is being said to be too soft even though I wanted the ''glow'' effect. boo hoo.)  Nice warm colors.', '2004-11-07 22:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(997890, 110954, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great looking image, too bad it''s so small. The colors seem nice, and I love the lines formed by the trees and the mountain, but still, it''s too small to be a truly fabulous image. Try using a size closer to the 640x640 max size.</td>', 'Great looking image, too bad it''s so small. The colors seem nice, and I love the lines formed by the trees and the mountain, but still, it''s too small to be a truly fabulous image. Try using a size closer to the 640x640 max size.', '2004-11-07 22:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(997893, 117326, 2337, '<td valign="top">Cute kid... wonderful costume :)</td>', 'Cute kid... wonderful costume :)', '2004-11-07 22:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(997894, 116643, 22748, '<td valign="top">GREAT lighting! Great dynamic image. The expressions on their faces are natural and engaging. Very sharp. The guy''s sweater is a bit overexposed, however. That''s the only complaint I have.</td>', 'GREAT lighting! Great dynamic image. The expressions on their faces are natural and engaging. Very sharp. The guy''s sweater is a bit overexposed, however. That''s the only complaint I have.', '2004-11-07 22:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(997895, 116338, 22748, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! The textures and patterns of light and shadow are amazing. The sand, mountains, and stormy, then blue, sky make an incredibly varied image. The best so far!</td>', 'Beautiful! The textures and patterns of light and shadow are amazing. The sand, mountains, and stormy, then blue, sky make an incredibly varied image. The best so far!', '2004-11-07 22:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
