(998167, 116536, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is one of your best ones, Sally. I didn''t get to it during the challenge. It was overwhelming to leave so many comments.<br/> <br/>The detail and colours are very good. This would qualify for a very successful stock photo as well (that is a compliment).<br/> <br/>My only suggestion was to either adjust the exposure or clone out some of the harsh highlights on the bottom left of the strawberry. Since that is the brightest part, my eye jumps to it. It should be staying on the snail.<br/> <br/>Well done. Congrats on the finish.</td>', 'This is one of your best ones, Sally. I didn''t get to it during the challenge. It was overwhelming to leave so many comments. The detail and colours are very good. This would qualify for a very successful stock photo as well (that is a compliment). My only suggestion was to either adjust the exposure or clone out some of the harsh highlights on the bottom left of the strawberry. Since that is the brightest part, my eye jumps to it. It should be staying on the snail. Well done. Congrats on the finish.', '2004-11-08 01:02:06.000000', NULL, 0),
