(998200, 114484, 22734, '<td valign="top">Julia: this is the best artistic effort in this contest. In concept and execution nothing comes near it. I do not say this to flatter you. Indeed I knew that at this time it would not get a ribbon and the reason is simple. It is a very complex image with many subleties which are missed by the average viewer due to the nature of the site and the high amount of entries where tired eyes lazily lean towards the color and that which is stated openly. However, you know, that you are happy with this image. I am more than pleased and can not find one improvement. Congratulations because your creative talent took care of every detail and your discerning eye has presented for all who wish to look at conceptual masterpiece. My kudos go out to you.</td>', 'Julia: this is the best artistic effort in this contest. In concept and execution nothing comes near it. I do not say this to flatter you. Indeed I knew that at this time it would not get a ribbon and the reason is simple. It is a very complex image with many subleties which are missed by the average viewer due to the nature of the site and the high amount of entries where tired eyes lazily lean towards the color and that which is stated openly. However, you know, that you are happy with this image. I am more than pleased and can not find one improvement. Congratulations because your creative talent took care of every detail and your discerning eye has presented for all who wish to look at conceptual masterpiece. My kudos go out to you.', '2004-11-08 01:15:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(998208, 110365, 22734, '<td valign="top">Another image which remained under rated. This is simply lovely to look at. The concept and execution are superb. Keep up the nice work, the awards will come your way.</td>', 'Another image which remained under rated. This is simply lovely to look at. The concept and execution are superb. Keep up the nice work, the awards will come your way.', '2004-11-08 01:19:15.000000', NULL, 0),
