(998313, 116340, 25571, '<td valign="top">The frame work is outstanding. It would not have been the same for me, without it. Not only is the picture amazing in its colours and tone, but the framing gives it a very nostalgic effect, very close to Japanese art, where they often use the same framing effect. <br/> <br/>One thing i tried here, was to change the stroke''s colour to a golden/orange instead of the gray. Found it gave the artwork a little more punch. 9 on me mate.</td>', 'The frame work is outstanding. It would not have been the same for me, without it. Not only is the picture amazing in its colours and tone, but the framing gives it a very nostalgic effect, very close to Japanese art, where they often use the same framing effect.  One thing i tried here, was to change the stroke''s colour to a golden/orange instead of the gray. Found it gave the artwork a little more punch. 9 on me mate.', '2004-11-08 03:47:10.000000', NULL, 0),
