(998402, 117033, 27482, '<td valign="top">Thanx for all the comments, I value those way more than ratings.  Someone said that it was misspelled, well sorry bout that but english is only my third language after Icelandic and Swedish so I don´t really care that much but next time I will probably look it up in a dictionary if I am not 100% sure (wich I wasn´t)<br/> <br/>Just to be clear though, this cute little girl is not my own, I was doing a shoot for the mother on some christmas cards and this was the best one IMO.</td>', 'Thanx for all the comments, I value those way more than ratings.  Someone said that it was misspelled, well sorry bout that but english is only my third language after Icelandic and Swedish so I don´t really care that much but next time I will probably look it up in a dictionary if I am not 100% sure (wich I wasn´t) Just to be clear though, this cute little girl is not my own, I was doing a shoot for the mother on some christmas cards and this was the best one IMO.', '2004-11-08 05:05:41.000000', NULL, 0),
