(998578, 117115, 25150, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite of the challenge, and I gave it a 10. I would have given it a 15 if I could. The quality of the photo is amazing, it''s a perfect shot in every way. It''s too bad so many people have these ideals that tell them to vote nudity down. It''s stupid and destructive to DPC and photography as a whole. Instead of voting on the quality, effort, uniqueness, it''s voted down because it contains nudity. Those people abviously don''t have sex, and probably don''t even shower (cause then they would be nude)<br/> <br/>This is the top photo in this challenge in my eyes.<br/> <br/>Keep up the good work, and don''t let the BS get you down!<br/>Peace,<br/>E</td>', 'This was my favorite of the challenge, and I gave it a 10. I would have given it a 15 if I could. The quality of the photo is amazing, it''s a perfect shot in every way. It''s too bad so many people have these ideals that tell them to vote nudity down. It''s stupid and destructive to DPC and photography as a whole. Instead of voting on the quality, effort, uniqueness, it''s voted down because it contains nudity. Those people abviously don''t have sex, and probably don''t even shower (cause then they would be nude) This is the top photo in this challenge in my eyes. Keep up the good work, and don''t let the BS get you down!Peace,E', '2004-11-08 08:08:06.000000', NULL, 0),
