(998699, 114082, 17103, '<td valign="top">Hey, thanks everyone!  Wasn''t expecting so many kind comments on this, especially after the competition has ended!  I''m happy to have done as well as I have in such a tough field of excellent photos, and thanks for all the "favorites" votes, too!  :)</td>', 'Hey, thanks everyone!  Wasn''t expecting so many kind comments on this, especially after the competition has ended!  I''m happy to have done as well as I have in such a tough field of excellent photos, and thanks for all the "favorites" votes, too!  :)', '2004-11-08 09:42:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(998713, 116340, 18748, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on beautiful shot!! And yes, you right,your image did create a long-going thread about borders :)</td>', 'Congratulations on beautiful shot!! And yes, you right,your image did create a long-going thread about borders :)', '2004-11-08 09:51:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(998718, 116016, 10390, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by siggi:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations with 6th place, well deserved.<br/> <br/>Don''t understand the four 1s though, very strange! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Even the photos #1, 4 &amp; 5 got one and two 1.  My photo got four 1 and no 2 :-o  I think there must be some people that think that the aurora is some kind of a myth that only belongs in fairy tales and Coca Cola ads, and they must think that this green light is added in Photoshop!  Ofcourse is this just done in PS, do you really believe that there can be some kind of ridiculous green lights in the skies like this!!?  <br/> <br/>hahahaaaa, aurora is something that you just have to believe, it''s very real and priceless sight to experience! <br/> <br/>Anyway, I didn''t expect to be in the top 10 after the score dropped from 7.17 down to 6.8 on the second day of voting.  The photo was between 6.8-6.99 most of the week, on the last day the score finally got above 7, so, I''m very happy with this result!<br/> <br/>Many thanks for all of the comments and votings.<br/> <br/>Check out my OFS outtakes in my portfolio, there are more aurora shots from this scene and other stuff.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-08 09:57:19.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by siggi: Congratulations with 6th place, well deserved. Don''t understand the four 1s though, very strange!   Even the photos #1, 4 & 5 got one and two 1.  My photo got four 1 and no 2 :-o  I think there must be some people that think that the aurora is some kind of a myth that only belongs in fairy tales and Coca Cola ads, and they must think that this green light is added in Photoshop!  Ofcourse is this just done in PS, do you really believe that there can be some kind of ridiculous green lights in the skies like this!!?   hahahaaaa, aurora is something that you just have to believe, it''s very real and priceless sight to experience!  Anyway, I didn''t expect to be in the top 10 after the score dropped from 7.17 down to 6.8 on the second day of voting.  The photo was between 6.8-6.99 most of the week, on the last day the score finally got above 7, so, I''m very happy with this result! Many thanks for all of the comments and votings. Check out my OFS outtakes in my portfolio, there are more aurora shots from this scene and other stuff.', '2004-11-08 09:54:45.000000', '2004-11-08 09:57:19.000000', 0),
(998732, 115122, 16493, '<td valign="top">Great capture, like the texture and color of the road.<br/>Congrats on your personal best.</td>', 'Great capture, like the texture and color of the road.Congrats on your personal best.', '2004-11-08 10:00:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(998735, 116814, 14603, '<td valign="top">Probably my favourite shot from the challenge and I can`t understand how it didn`t beat mine!</td>', 'Probably my favourite shot from the challenge and I can`t understand how it didn`t beat mine!', '2004-11-08 10:02:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(998741, 115482, 4482, '<td valign="top">WOW! Well deserved Bluey! Where was this taken? The blue mountains almost look rendered!<br/> <br/>Great job!</td>', 'WOW! Well deserved Bluey! Where was this taken? The blue mountains almost look rendered! Great job!', '2004-11-08 10:05:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(998742, 116820, 21862, '<td valign="top">Oh wow!  This is gorgeous!  No doubt you deserved a ribbon with this!!!  It''s so ethereal...  are you sure you didn''t go to Africa or someplace more exotic for this shot? *grin*</td>', 'Oh wow!  This is gorgeous!  No doubt you deserved a ribbon with this!!!  It''s so ethereal...  are you sure you didn''t go to Africa or someplace more exotic for this shot? *grin*', '2004-11-08 10:05:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(998764, 116206, 26045, '<td valign="top"><br/>Thanks for the comments!<br/> <br/>I guess I should''ve kept the original title of Roscoe''s NOSE to prevent any comments about his eyes/face being out of focus...but oh well! I appreciate all the comments no matter what!<br/> <br/>And yes, to those that asked, that is his name and he''s a serious hazardous Duke...you should see him full speed thru the apartment, fishtailin'' and everything :)<br/> <br/>Thanks everyone!<br/> <br/>Katy<br/></td>', 'Thanks for the comments! I guess I should''ve kept the original title of Roscoe''s NOSE to prevent any comments about his eyes/face being out of focus...but oh well! I appreciate all the comments no matter what! And yes, to those that asked, that is his name and he''s a serious hazardous Duke...you should see him full speed thru the apartment, fishtailin'' and everything :) Thanks everyone! Katy', '2004-11-08 10:22:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(998776, 112844, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice work Kylie. Hey, placing 100 out of 488, that''s what? Top 20 percent. Keep them coming...;-)</td>', 'Nice work Kylie. Hey, placing 100 out of 488, that''s what? Top 20 percent. Keep them coming...;-)', '2004-11-08 10:32:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(998789, 117079, 27482, '<td valign="top">Alveg þrusu mynd.  Ég gaf henni reyndar bara 7 enda slær hún mann ekkert rosalega fyrst og ég hafði aldrei tíma til að fara yfir myndirnar aftur en ég hefði gefið henni 8 eða 9, allavega er þetta mjöööööööög flott portrett mynd þó að ég hafi séð aðrar betri.<br/> <br/>Einhvernvegin man ég þó að þegar ég sá þessa mynd í einkunnagjöfinni að ég hugsaði "þetta hlýtur að vera íslensk stelpa"<br/> <br/>Til hamingju með 21 sætið, hefði hæglega getað endað hærra.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Alveg þrusu mynd.  Ég gaf henni reyndar bara 7 enda slær hún mann ekkert rosalega fyrst og ég hafði aldrei tíma til að fara yfir myndirnar aftur en ég hefði gefið henni 8 eða 9, allavega er þetta mjöööööööög flott portrett mynd þó að ég hafi séð aðrar betri. Einhvernvegin man ég þó að þegar ég sá þessa mynd í einkunnagjöfinni að ég hugsaði "þetta hlýtur að vera íslensk stelpa" Til hamingju með 21 sætið, hefði hæglega getað endað hærra. ', '2004-11-08 10:43:26.000000', NULL, 0),
