(998859, 109315, 25150, '<td valign="top">It does looked heavily processed, but so what? do people really think Ansel Adams wasn''t called the master of the darkroom for nothing? he worked his photos so much in the darkroom, that the originals are barely reconizable. He wrote the book (literally) on post processing.<br/> <br/>Good job.<br/>and you totally deserve 4th if not higher.</td>', 'It does looked heavily processed, but so what? do people really think Ansel Adams wasn''t called the master of the darkroom for nothing? he worked his photos so much in the darkroom, that the originals are barely reconizable. He wrote the book (literally) on post processing. Good job.and you totally deserve 4th if not higher.', '2004-11-08 11:27:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(998879, 114484, 3724, '<td valign="top">Spectacular wedding album photo...... I know it is new but is aged, ageless, almost faded in traditional sepia, just plain beautiful.</td>', 'Spectacular wedding album photo...... I know it is new but is aged, ageless, almost faded in traditional sepia, just plain beautiful.', '2004-11-08 11:39:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(998903, 114484, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, masterful use of light. Great mixture of traditional wedding photography and high art.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, masterful use of light. Great mixture of traditional wedding photography and high art.', '2004-11-08 11:56:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(998907, 116791, 13602, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, verry underrated, clearly a victim of closed mind baby shots haters. Ofcourse some may not like it as much as I do but to give this shot 3-1''s 2-2''s and 4-3''s they must be blind. It is atleast tehnicaly perfect and that alone deserves a few points from anyone with a healthy mind. But this site is unfortunately full of people who developed hate for certain subjects such as baby, cats, dogs, flags... and they can''t see further than that. Well 25 is not a bad place after all so congratulations!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-08 11:58:34.</i></td>', 'Wonderful image, verry underrated, clearly a victim of closed mind baby shots haters. Ofcourse some may not like it as much as I do but to give this shot 3-1''s 2-2''s and 4-3''s they must be blind. It is atleast tehnicaly perfect and that alone deserves a few points from anyone with a healthy mind. But this site is unfortunately full of people who developed hate for certain subjects such as baby, cats, dogs, flags... and they can''t see further than that. Well 25 is not a bad place after all so congratulations!', '2004-11-08 11:58:11.000000', '2004-11-08 11:58:34.000000', 0),
(998912, 113914, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very inspiring shot... as soon as I saw it, I was contemplating how I could copy it!</td>', 'Very inspiring shot... as soon as I saw it, I was contemplating how I could copy it!', '2004-11-08 11:59:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(998913, 115976, 6202, '<td valign="top">Critique Club<br/> <br/>I really do like this...it has a very mysterious feeling to it.  It grabs your attention and you find yourself searching it for details and yet they are very few and limited.<br/> <br/>The lighting is extremely good and adds to the entire composition.  It really is a very strong entry and I feel it should have done better.</td>', 'Critique Club I really do like this...it has a very mysterious feeling to it.  It grabs your attention and you find yourself searching it for details and yet they are very few and limited. The lighting is extremely good and adds to the entire composition.  It really is a very strong entry and I feel it should have done better.', '2004-11-08 11:59:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(998971, 115482, 10390, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the blue ribbon, It''s a very good photo. I see that you got two ones, I got 4 ones and I don''t understand why many of the top photos in this challenge got one!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-08 12:33:50.</i></td>', 'Congratulations on the blue ribbon, It''s a very good photo. I see that you got two ones, I got 4 ones and I don''t understand why many of the top photos in this challenge got one!', '2004-11-08 12:33:33.000000', '2004-11-08 12:33:50.000000', 0),
(998976, 115482, 19608, '<td valign="top">Thanks all for your kind comments!<br/> <br/>The image was made at sunrise at the dunes located just east of Stovepipe Wells in Death Valley.  Death Valley is about a 7-hour drive for me - I try to get there at least once every winter.  I went early this year - returning from a longer trip to the national parks of Utah.<br/> <br/>NOTE:  The request for proof page would not work for some reason, apparently related to the image size.  When I tried to send the original, I kept getting "This Page is Not Available" error.  The original image was only 2.34 meg - so that should have been ok.  Ben (Konador) suggested I e-mail the original to him and he would notify the rest of the SC.  Then, also at Ben''s suggestion, I submitted a smaller version as the proof file.</td>', 'Thanks all for your kind comments! The image was made at sunrise at the dunes located just east of Stovepipe Wells in Death Valley.  Death Valley is about a 7-hour drive for me - I try to get there at least once every winter.  I went early this year - returning from a longer trip to the national parks of Utah. NOTE:  The request for proof page would not work for some reason, apparently related to the image size.  When I tried to send the original, I kept getting "This Page is Not Available" error.  The original image was only 2.34 meg - so that should have been ok.  Ben (Konador) suggested I e-mail the original to him and he would notify the rest of the SC.  Then, also at Ben''s suggestion, I submitted a smaller version as the proof file.', '2004-11-08 12:34:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(998991, 116340, 28261, '<td valign="top">BTW: I loved the framing you added here, it was one of the reasons I gave this a 10.</td>', 'BTW: I loved the framing you added here, it was one of the reasons I gave this a 10.', '2004-11-08 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(999001, 115482, 19708, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Blue!<br/> <br/>CA deserts are a thing of beauty, and you captured it well!</td>', 'Congrats on the Blue! CA deserts are a thing of beauty, and you captured it well!', '2004-11-08 12:48:28.000000', NULL, 0),
