(999221, 117138, 9932, '<td valign="top">I would just like to say thanks for all the great votes and comments. <br/> <br/>This shot was taken at "Dawn" at the Bryce Canyon lookout, just before the sun broke over the horizon. The winds were "very" strong that morning and it was one of the few shots I took that morning that I was happy with.<br/> <br/>With all the shots I took on our vacation to the Canyons/Desert I had a very hard time trying to decide which one I was going to enter in the October Free Study.<br/> <br/>Thanks again.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-08 15:28:08.</i></td>', 'I would just like to say thanks for all the great votes and comments.  This shot was taken at "Dawn" at the Bryce Canyon lookout, just before the sun broke over the horizon. The winds were "very" strong that morning and it was one of the few shots I took that morning that I was happy with. With all the shots I took on our vacation to the Canyons/Desert I had a very hard time trying to decide which one I was going to enter in the October Free Study. Thanks again.', '2004-11-08 15:25:54.000000', '2004-11-08 15:28:08.000000', 0),
