(999887, 117079, 1531, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by toddhead:</b></div><hr/><i> Are you kidding me? 21st? It''s not even my picture and I''m disappointed. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Disappointed... not really. Most of the photos above me are very good. 21st place of 488 photographs. I can live with that. But I still like you''re comment very much. Gonna get my self together and do better next time =)<br/> <br/>Thanks to all of you who voted and specially those who commented as well. I appreciate it very much when people spend their time viewing and commenting on my work.<br/> <br/>Thanks again,<br/>Steinar Hugi</td>', 'Originally posted by toddhead: Are you kidding me? 21st? It''s not even my picture and I''m disappointed.   Disappointed... not really. Most of the photos above me are very good. 21st place of 488 photographs. I can live with that. But I still like you''re comment very much. Gonna get my self together and do better next time =) Thanks to all of you who voted and specially those who commented as well. I appreciate it very much when people spend their time viewing and commenting on my work. Thanks again,Steinar Hugi', '2004-11-08 20:32:35.000000', NULL, 0),
