(1000601, 113172, 14614, '<td valign="top">A big thanks to all of you who took the time to comment -- 35 is an all time high for me -- this shot is also a personal best score wise so thanks to the voters!<br/> <br/>Big thank you to elsapo for his leaf shot in Parts as a model.  <br/> <br/>To those of you who added this to their favorites -- so great!  That''s like winning to me.<br/> <br/>Thanks to sailingduck for the idea to put it up for sail.  :)<br/> <br/>So many great photos -- an honor to be on the front page.</td>', 'A big thanks to all of you who took the time to comment -- 35 is an all time high for me -- this shot is also a personal best score wise so thanks to the voters! Big thank you to elsapo for his leaf shot in Parts as a model.   To those of you who added this to their favorites -- so great!  That''s like winning to me. Thanks to sailingduck for the idea to put it up for sail.  :) So many great photos -- an honor to be on the front page.', '2004-11-09 08:44:19.000000', NULL, 0),
