(1002242, 117328, 22970, '<td valign="top">A thank you goes out to everyone that voted and commented on this photograph. I was very please with this picture because the only editing done was [auto level, auto contrast, and resize to 640x530. NO other editing done and it showed me that my camera [and I ] have the possibilities to take imo Great Pictures without having to do a lot of editing. The F2.8 lens really did a good job with a small DOF. Im very happy with my score; it is my best so far.  Again thank to everyone!</td>', 'A thank you goes out to everyone that voted and commented on this photograph. I was very please with this picture because the only editing done was [auto level, auto contrast, and resize to 640x530. NO other editing done and it showed me that my camera [and I ] have the possibilities to take imo Great Pictures without having to do a lot of editing. The F2.8 lens really did a good job with a small DOF. Im very happy with my score; it is my best so far.  Again thank to everyone!', '2004-11-09 23:45:01.000000', NULL, 0),
