(1021913, 115114, 27161, '<td valign="top">This was my first entry.  I didn''t put much thought into it.  I didn''t want the flag in it, but I was reaching out over a balcony to get this shot, and didn''t have much choice.  I didn''t think about the shot enough to crop the flag.  And yeah, it is crooked.  Won''t happen again though.  Thanks for the comments.</td>', 'This was my first entry.  I didn''t put much thought into it.  I didn''t want the flag in it, but I was reaching out over a balcony to get this shot, and didn''t have much choice.  I didn''t think about the shot enough to crop the flag.  And yeah, it is crooked.  Won''t happen again though.  Thanks for the comments.', '2004-11-19 10:16:38.000000', NULL, 0),
