(1522826, 115490, 39221, '<td valign="top">I prefer the original crop, although needs some USM - IMO it would have done better (but what do I know :-)<br/> <br/>Great capture, stunning colours too - seems like your subject liked their photo being taken :-)<br/> <br/>The only thing I could downscore this for is that the focal point seems to be just off the head, and the fangs look a little out of focus (maybe they were moving?) but if this general area had been in focus i think this would have been an easy 9 for me, and perhaps a 10 for the original crop ;-)</td>', 'I prefer the original crop, although needs some USM - IMO it would have done better (but what do I know :-) Great capture, stunning colours too - seems like your subject liked their photo being taken :-) The only thing I could downscore this for is that the focal point seems to be just off the head, and the fangs look a little out of focus (maybe they were moving?) but if this general area had been in focus i think this would have been an easy 9 for me, and perhaps a 10 for the original crop ;-)', '2005-07-10 06:14:24.000000', NULL, 0),
