(2013003, 109315, 43671, '<td valign="top">"A Magical Land" <br/> <br/>I dream of a journey <br/>to a magical land <br/>where windmills dwell <br/>as giants grand <br/>I look beyond the grass <br/>with astonished eyes <br/>these giants are gentle <br/>to my surprise <br/>their blades were still <br/>as though they slept <br/>but spring to life <br/>when the land is swept <br/>swoosh, swoosh, <br/>like a deep baritone <br/>the blades come alive <br/>as the wind is blown <br/>the clouds stir <br/>with a silent wake <br/>they clear the way <br/>for the sun to break <br/>shining through <br/>what a glorious light <br/>amazing beauty <br/>that thrills my sight <br/>this is why I dream <br/>for my mind to trace <br/>and recall the scene <br/>of the power and grace. <br/>so each night I journey <br/>to this magical land <br/>to delight in the beauty <br/>where the giants stand. <br/> <br/>Jeff Sasek <br/> <br/>Hope you like it Peter.</td>', '"A Magical Land"  I dream of a journey to a magical land where windmills dwell as giants grand I look beyond the grass with astonished eyes these giants are gentle to my surprise their blades were still as though they slept but spring to life when the land is swept swoosh, swoosh, like a deep baritone the blades come alive as the wind is blown the clouds stir with a silent wake they clear the way for the sun to break shining through what a glorious light amazing beauty that thrills my sight this is why I dream for my mind to trace and recall the scene of the power and grace. so each night I journey to this magical land to delight in the beauty where the giants stand.  Jeff Sasek  Hope you like it Peter.', '2006-01-07 15:15:55.000000', NULL, 0),
